window.FWN_LONG_AWAITED_MR_HAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LONG_AWAITED_MR_HAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3501,"title":"Chapter 3501 Sounded Familiar","paragraphs":["3501 Sounded Familiar","“I...” Xie Jiling’s face was even redder now.","“Don’t try to be polite with us. You’re Zhuofeng’s girlfriend, so we are family.” Old Mrs. Han held Xie Jiling’s hand.","“To be honest, ever since I saw you yesterday, I have been thinking about connecting you to our Zhuofeng. I don’t want to miss such a good girl like you.”","“Luckily, our Zhuofeng works pretty hard, and he knows to fight for what he likes,” Old Mrs. Han smiled and said, “Don’t be embarrassed. I know that you and Zhuofeng have known each other for quite a while now.”","!!","Old Mrs. Han was secretly hinting that she did not think that Xie Jiling suddenly becoming Han Zhuofeng’s girlfriend after staying here for a night was a bad thing.","Old Mrs. Han did not think of it in a negative way.","She was doing this so that Xie Jiling would not overthink.","Xie Jiling understood it as well.","She looked at Old Mrs. Han with gratitude.","How could the elders of the Han Family be so good?","Xie Jiling felt that she was really lucky.","Her boyfriend was pure and sweet, and the elders were so nice and considerate.","“So you should come here often. It’s not far from your school, so you must come here to eat often. I heard that the canteen of B University is pretty good, but it can’t be better than food cooked at home, right?” said Old Mrs. Han.","“When your classes are not too hectic, come over. We have a chauffeur, so don’t come here by yourself on the subway. It’s troublesome to take so many trips. Just let the chauffeur pick you up!” instructed Old Mrs. Han.","“Alright,” Xie Jiling agreed obediently.","Old Mrs. Han exclaimed inside. This young lady was too well-behaved.","“Oh, yes, I asked Auntie Sun to prepare some snacks. Bring it back to your dormitory and share it with your classmates.” Old Mrs. Han was adapting very well to the change in their relationship.","She was treating Xie Jiling like her granddaughter-in-law now.","Bringing more good food and sharing with dorm mates would improve their relationship.","Xie Jiling could be more comfortable in school, too.","Auntie Sun had already prepared it.","There was a massive snack box. “Get Xiao Liang to carry it to the car. When you reach the school, get him to bring it to your dormitory as well. Don’t carry it yourself.”","Xiao Liang was the chauffeur of the family home.","“It’s okay; I’m pretty strong,” said Xie Jiling.","“That won’t do. You’re a girl, so how can you carry heavy things? If you’re alone and have no other choice, it’s fine. But now that our family is here, you won’t have to do a single thing yourself,” said Old Mrs. Han.","When Xie Jiling heard this, she felt that it sounded familiar, so she laughed.","“Why? What are you laughing at?” asked Old Mrs. Han, curious.","“I thought of Zhuofeng,” Xie Jiling smiled and said, “I finally know whom he learned it from. It’s because you have always educated him that way.”","Thinking about it, Old Mrs. Han had always educated her own grandsons this way.","When they were here, they would not let their wives do a single thing.","“He was bringing the production crew to Ta City to shoot a film, so he asked me to see if there were anything weird with the shooting venue, and I followed the production crew. When we were taking our luggage at the airport, I wanted to carry it myself, but Zhuofeng did not let me,” explained Xie Jiling.","“Back then, he said the same thing. I said I was used to carrying luggage on my own. He said that I can do that when I am alone, but if he were there, he would not let me carry it myself,” said Xie Jiling.","“It’s exactly the same as what you just said.”","“That’s right!” Old Mrs. Han applauded in satisfaction.","It seemed like educating her grandsons hadn’t been a waste of time.","Han Zhuofeng learned it well. Aside from listening and memorizing it, he actually did it.","This was because she taught them well.","And that was why her grandson found a wife this early.","In the blink of an eye, Han Zhuofeng’s place among the three brothers rose again.","At this moment, the chauffeur Xiao Liang entered the room.","“Old Mrs. Han, the car is ready,” said Xiao Liang.","“Aiyo, you have to go now. I can’t stop you anymore.” Old Mrs. Han looked at the time.","Xiao Liang came over and carried the box of snacks.","Old Mrs. Han instructed, “When you reach the school, help Jiling carry it to the lobby of her dormitory.”","“You can’t enter the girls’ dormitory, and you can’t enter her dorm room as well,” instructed Old Mrs. Han.","“Alright,” answered Xiao Liang.","“There’s a bit of trouble. If Xiao Liang can’t enter the dormitory, how can you carry this back?” Old Mrs. Han was a little worried.","Auntie Sun said, “Should I follow along?”","“No, no.” Xie Jiling waved her hands immediately.","Auntie Sun was already so old, so how could Xie Jiling let her carry this?","“Our dormitory has an elevator, so I won’t need to climb the stairs. When we reach the dormitory, I will ask my dorm mates to come down and help me carry it into the elevator,” said Xie Jiling.","Actually, she could carry it herself.","However, she was scared that Old Mrs. Han would be worried about her, so she simply said that she would ask her dorm mates to help her.","“There’s an elevator. That’s good. That’s good.” Old Mrs. Han was finally at peace.","“Oh right, let’s add each other on WeChat,” said Old Mrs. Han, “When you reach the dormitory, let me know, so I can be at ease.”","“Okay.” Xie Jiling found her own WeChat QR code and let Old Mrs. Han scan it to add her.","The two elders even sent Xie Jiling to the car, which made Xie Jiling feel embarrassed.","She rested her head on the car window and said, “Grandpa, Grandma, Auntie Sun, Butler Wang, you should go back.”","“It’s alright, we’ll watch you leave,” said Old Mrs. Han, “Come back if there are no classes on the weekend. Your home is too far, so our house is your home now.”","“Mmhm!” Xie Jiling nodded vigorously. “Ah, right.”","“I have something to give you.” Xie Jiling retrieved four pieces of jade pendants. She came out of the car and gave it to the four of them.","“This is more useful than an amulet. It can be used multiple times,” said Xie Jiling, “I even gave Zhuofeng and the others. They all have it. Bring this along with you as well.”","“The location of the family home is good, and I even added an array of protection, so there won’t be any evil spirits near it,” said Xie Jiling, “But you can’t always be in the family home; you have to go out someday. Evil spirits aren’t common but just in case.”","“It’s safer to have this with you. This can protect you multiple times. I will come here often anyway, so if the energy was used up, I’ll know when and where you encountered the evil spirits, and I can replenish the energy as well,” said Xie Jiling.","Xie Jiling saying that she would come often made Old Mrs. Han overjoyed.","The rest wasn’t that important.","“Okay, okay...” Old Mrs. Han immediately wore it around her neck.","Old Mr. Han, Butler Wang, and Auntie Sun also put their own pendants on.","They weren’t sure whether it was just their minds, but after wearing it, they immediately felt safer.","Afterward, Xie Jiling went back into the car."]},{"number":3502,"title":"Chapter 3502 What Else Is She Good At?","paragraphs":["3502 What Else Is She Good At?","After Xie Jiling bade farewell, she went on her way.","When they reached the school, Xie Jiling wanted to carry the snacks herself.","However, Xiao Liang did not allow it.","“Old Mrs. Han has instructed me carefully. I have to carry it right to the lobby of your dormitory,” Xiao Liang smiled and said, “I must do it. Stop fighting me for it.”","Having no choice, Xie Jiling had to let Xiao Liang carry it.","Xiao Liang carried the big box of snacks. The box was so big it almost covered his whole face.","He followed Xie Jiling through the school to the female dormitory building.","This trip was extremely ostentatious.","When they reached the school, it was already too late to hide from the people’s eyes.","There were already plenty of students in the school already.","So many gazes gathered on Xie Jiling and Xiao Liang.","There were quite a few people who saw Han Zhuofeng coming to Xie Jiling.","Because of this, there were curious whispers. “Isn’t it Han Zhuofeng who came last time? Why is it different this time?”","“Yeah, this man looks pretty ordinary.”","“He’s probably rich. I saw the car that he parked at the entrance just now. It’s a luxury car. It’s expensive.”","They whispered, so naturally, Xie Jiling and Xiao Liang couldn’t hear them.","However, Xiao Liang’s observation skills were extraordinary.","Even if he could not hear their soft discussions, he could make an accurate guess from the gazes of the people around them.","However, it was unsure if Xie Jiling noticed them or if she just didn’t care about what those people were saying.","Despite that, the way she kept her cool was pretty good.","Xiao Liang carried the box of snacks as he followed Xie Jiling and finally reached the dormitory.","“Sorry for troubling you,” said Xie Jiling.","“It’s fine; it’s not troublesome at all,” Xiao Liang smiled and said, “Do you want me to wait until your dorm mates came down and helped?”","“There’s no need.” Xie Jiling took the box of snacks from Xiao Liang. “See, I can totally carry it.”","Xie Jiling wasn’t weak at all.","This box of snacks was a piece of cake for her.","Xiao Liang did not expect Xie Jiling to be so strong despite her tiny figure.","“I’m going up. Thank you for sending me back.” Xie Jiling smiled as she thanked him.","“You’re too polite,” said Xiao Liang instantly as he took out his business card, “Oh, right, this is my number; whenever you want to return to the family home, contact me anytime.”","Xie Jiling took it. “Okay.”","Then, Xie Jiling carried the snacks upstairs.","Xiao Liang wasn’t in a rush to leave.","He wanted to wait and see if there were any impatient people who would come to ask about the relationship between him and Xie Jiling.","He could use this chance to make it clear and prove them wrong.","As such, Xiao Liang wasn’t in a rush. He turned around and walked slowly.","Surprisingly, nobody came to ask.","Xiao Liang pouted.","These cowards liked to gossip in the dark, but when they were given the chance to ask, they would not say anything.","Since they did not come and ask, Xiao Liang had to think of a solution himself.","He took out his phone and gave Old Mrs. Han a call.","“Old Mrs. Han!” said Xiao Liang loudly.","Old Mrs. Han got scared by him. “Aiyo, Xiao Liang, why are you being so loud all of a sudden? My ears are still pretty good; you don’t need to shout.”","“Old Mrs. Han, I have already sent the third granddaughter-in-law back to the school, and I watched her carry the snacks up!” Xiao Liang continued shouting.","Old Mrs. Han was satisfied with Xiao Liang addressing Xie Jiling as ‘third granddaughter-in-law,’ so she did not care about why he was being so loud.","“Aiyo, she carried the snacks herself?” asked Old Mrs. Han.","“Old Mrs. Han, I didn’t expect her to be so strong. She carried it like nothing. I asked her if I should wait until her dorm mates came down and helped her, but she said no and carried it up herself.”","“The third granddaughter-in-law has a good personality. She’s strong, and she’s not pretentious,” complimented Xiao Liang.","“That’s right!” Old Mrs. Han nodded in agreement. “Tell me more; what else is she good at?”","Xiao Liang was speechless. “...”","He had just interacted with Xie Jiling today while they were on the way from the family home to the school today.","Their first interaction was short.","Old Mrs. Han was putting him in a spot by asking him to list Xie Jiling’s strengths down.","“The third granddaughter-in-law is very polite!” added Xiao Liang, “I gave my business card to her, telling her that she can tell me whenever she wants to return to the family home, and I will come and pick her up.”","“Yup, yup.” Old Mrs. Han nodded. “Continue...”","Xiao Liang didn’t know what to say “...”","Xiao Liang had no choice but to keep talking to Old Mrs. Han. He kept talking until he reached the school gate, where there weren’t so many people around.","Then, Xiao Liang returned to his normal volume of voice. “Old Mrs. Han, I was talking so loud so that other people would hear me.”","“Hmmm? Why?” asked Old Mrs. Han. She immediately felt that something was wrong.","Xiao Liang told her what he had seen in school.","“Although I didn’t hear what they said, I felt that there was something wrong with their gaze. Even after I sent the third granddaughter-in-law back and walked out, the gazes did not stop.”","“However, they had the audacity to gossip without the courage to ask me straight away, so I talked louder to let them know,” said Xiao Liang.","“Haih! Kids nowadays. Why are there so many of them with such bad thoughts?” Old Mrs. Han was displeased, “If they were like Jiling, how nice it would be to live in such a world?.”","Immediately afterward, Old Mrs. Han added, “You did the right thing. Luckily, you reacted fast.”","***","Xie Jiling carried the snacks into the dormitory.","Ren Linna and the others were shocked to see her carrying such a huge box.","They immediately walked forward to help her.","After putting the box of snacks on the table, Kuang Xiaorou said in a surprised tone, “Why did you bring so many things back?”","“They’re all snacks. The Grandma of the Han Family asked me to bring it back for us to eat together,” said Xie Jiling.","“My God, there’s so much.” Feng Yaqing looked up and down at Xie Jiling.","Xie Jiling shrunk away. “What are you looking at?”","“You finished your work in Han Family’s house, ate there, and even stayed there,” said Feng Yaqing slowly, “Then you came back today with such a huge box.”","“Why do I feel like you went back home?” said Feng Yaqing.","“That’s right!” Ren Linna also added.","“This is like us when we go back home every time. My mom would pack me all kinds of delicious food for me to bring back to share with you guys,” said Ren Linna, “The Han Family... is treating you like their own?”","Kuang Xiaorou’s eyes glowed. “You used this chance given by work to meet the parents?”","Feng Yaqing immediately asked, “How is it? What do the Han Family’s elders think of you?”","Xie Jiling was speechless.","“Wait, you guys didn’t forget what Jiling asked us yesterday, right?” Ren Linna’s shock died down as her memories came back to her.","Upon being reminded, Feng Yaqing and Kuang Xiaorou also recalled it.","As such, they stared straight at Xie Jiling."]},{"number":3503,"title":"Chapter 3503 What Are You Hiding?","paragraphs":["3503 What Are You Hiding?","“Spill the beans!” said Ren Linna, “We already guessed it. You must be talking about Han Zhuofeng last night..”","Feng Yaqing squeezed her cheeks in a weird way.","She was squeezing them so hard that her cheeks were changing shape. Kuang Xiaorou put her hands down and complained, “Can you not do that? How it looks is less of a worry; more importantly, you’re going to create more wrinkles.”","The moment Feng Yaqing heard that there would be more wrinkles, she immediately put her hands down.","After Kuang Xiaorou reprimanded Feng Yaqing, she put all her attention on Xie Jiling.","“Have you confessed to Han Zhuofeng?” asked Kuang Xiaorou.","“It can’t be that fast.” Feng Yaqing took out her phone and looked at the time they chatted last night.","“Jiling talked to us late at night yesterday. She definitely won’t confess at midnight, right? According to her school schedule, she should have left pretty early,” said Feng Yaqing.","“It’s not good to confess in such a rush,” said Feng Yaqing.","“Indeed.” Ren Linna thought about it for a moment and said, “Han Zhuofeng returned to the production crew, right? Then, isn’t there no way to confess recently?”","“You guys...” Xie Jiling thought about why they were so certain that she was the one who confessed first.","However, before she could say anything, she kept it in.","Her gaze darted around in guilt so much that her eyeballs looked like they would flip over.","She was silently trying to brainwash herself, telling herself that she was invisible and they could not see her.","The three of them knew Xie Jiling too well.","Seeing Xie Jiling’s reaction, they instantly knew that something was wrong.","“What are you hiding?” Feng Yaqing squinted her eyes and stared at Xie Jiling.","“Be honest!” said Kuang Xiaorou.","“It’s just... I’m already together with him,” Xie Jiling, who did not know how to lie, said honestly, “But he confessed first!”","“I asked you guys last night to confirm my feelings because I didn’t know if I really liked him,” said Xie Jiling, “But after listening to you guys, I became certain.”","“So, I accepted him.”","“Wow, you guys are quick,” Ren Linna was so in awe that she could not close her mouth.","“As he had to go to the production crew today, he woke up at four in the morning. I was asleep, so I couldn’t tell him face-to-face,” said Xie Jiling.","“Besides, I’m too shy to say it face-to-face as well.”","“So I sent him a WeChat message at midnight. When he woke up in the morning, he saw it,” said Xie Jiling, embarrassed.","“Oh my god! Little Jiling is the fastest among us!” Kuang Xiaorou’s expression was blank.","Feng Yaqing said with great difficulty, “We have so much experience in terms of theory, but where’s the chance to put it into practice?”","“Jiling got together with her boyfriend in the latter’s own house at that. You’re too impressive,” said Ren Linna.","“So the Han Family’s Matriarch even gave you a big box of snacks to bring back?” asked Kuang Xiaorou.","Xie Jiling nodded like a well-behaved baby.","“How did you come back with such a huge box?” asked Feng Yaqing.","“Grandma asked the chauffeur to send me back,” said Xie Jiling.","When she thought about it, she complained to her dorm mates. “Grandma even specially instructed Brother Xiao Liang, the chauffeur, to help me bring this box to the lobby of the dormitory. It was inappropriate for him to enter the female dormitory.”","“However, on our way here, the gazes of the other students were strange.” She noticed it, too.","She noticed it, but she was too lazy to make a fuss.","Those gazes would not affect her anyway.","Besides, there was nothing bad about Brother Xiao Liang, so it was not embarrassing to walk with him.","She had nothing to fuss about.","She just felt that the gazes were too hurtful and rude.","“Don’t pay them any attention,” said Ren Linna angrily, “Those people are boring and snobbish.”","“They think that they are prodigies just because they managed to enroll at B University, so they look down on other students who aren’t from B University. They also think that once the students of B University graduate, they will become the top figures in the society. They think that they will have positions with a high salary waiting for them once they graduate. They look down on everything.”","“I want to see what they will become in the future. Even after graduating, I will keep an eye on them and watch their development. I will see how impressive they are in work or if they even found the beautiful, rich partners of their dreams.”","“Yeah, I will keep an eye, too,” said Kuang Xiaorou, “They think they’re hotshots. The way they look at others is so creepy.”","Xie Jiling looked at her phone and said, “We need to go to class. It’s almost time.”","They still needed some time to head to class.","Then, the four quickly went downstairs and rode their bikes toward the academic building.","There was no other choice. The school was too big, and the classroom was too far.","They could have walked, but they were in a rush.","They hurriedly rode their bicycles. There was no time to chat on the way.","They arrived right before the class started.","The class ended at noon.","Rather than returning to the dormitory, they went to the canteen straight away.","Xie Jiling and the others lined up in front of the window.","They had nothing to do and were bored, so they looked around.","Ren Linna saw that there were a few windows where the guys were lining up for their girlfriends, so she couldn’t help but express her thoughts. “Jiling is not single anymore, but Han Zhuofeng is working. Even though she’s in a relationship, she doesn’t have a boyfriend to help her line up.”","Kuang Xiaorou said, “That’s true...”","Feng Yaqing responded, “That’s good. At least Jiling won’t be able to show off in front of us. Our single life in the school will not be affected as well. We can still go to class and eat together. The three of us won’t be left out just because Jiling is already in a relationship.”","“That’s true.” Ren Linna agreed. “Jiling’s love life is so suitable for us.”","Xie Jiling was speechless.","The four of them bought their lunch and found an empty table to sit down at.","Xie Jiling was just about to eat when she received a phone call from Han Zhuofeng.","This time, when she saw Han Zhuofeng’s name appear on her phone, Xie Jiling could not be calm like she was in the past.","She looked at her phone anxiously.","This was their first time talking after they confessed to each other.","This was completely different from texting on WeChat.","Xie Jiling even felt that it was more nerve-wracking than talking face-to-face.","“Why don’t you pick it up?” Kuang Xiaorou leaned over and took a glance. When she saw that it was from Han Zhuofeng, she immediately laughed.","“We... we only texted using WeChat today. I’m a little nervous to be on a phone call with him,” said Xie Jiling anxiously.","“That’s your boyfriend. You have to pick up even if you’re nervous.” Kuang Xiaorou was quick; she extended her arm and helped Xie Jiling press the answer button.","That way, even if Xie Jiling wanted to dilly-dally, she couldn’t afford to do so.","Han Zhuofeng’s voice came from Xie Jiling’s phone next. “Jiling?”"]},{"number":3504,"title":"Chapter 3504 You Are Just a Newbie","paragraphs":["3504 You Are Just a Newbie","Xie Jiling immediately put the phone next to her ear so that Han Zhuofeng’s voice wouldn’t be heard by the others.","“Yes?” Xie Jiling immediately said.","She blushed as she looked at her dorm mates, who were around her, then she lowered her head.","“You’re done with the morning classes, right?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","“Mmhm. I’m at the canteen, about to eat,” said Xie Jiling, “You’re done shooting for the morning?”","“Yeah, just now. I’m also calling you while eating.” Han Zhuofeng’s voice did not sound as nervous as Xie Jiling’s at all.","He was so natural that it was as though today wasn’t the first day of their relationship.","And Han Zhuofeng’s natural behavior calmed Xie Jiling down...","She became more relaxed.","However, Xie Jiling was still too embarrassed to talk to him while eating.","Since their relationship had changed, Xie Jiling unconsciously cared about her image.","She was worried that the sound of her chewing wouldn’t be nice.","“I remember you told me that you’ll finish classes at three in the afternoon today?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","“Mmhmm.”","“And you don’t have class in the morning tomorrow but have one at ten past three in the afternoon, right? asked Han Zhuofeng again.","“Yeah, why?” asked Xie Jiling, curious.","“Just wanted to ask if you wanna come to the production crew,” said Han Zhuofeng, “I still have four days till my one-day break. For the rest of the time, I have to be with the production crew, busy with work, so I can’t go back to the city to see you.”","The production crew was far away from the city. Usually, when he was done working, it would already be seven or eight at night. If he went back to the city, it would be ten at night.","He would not be able to spend a lot of time with Xie Jiling.","“But today is our first day. I feel strange not seeing you for so many days,” said Han Zhuofeng.","He had no prior dating experience.","However, a relationship required two people to spend time their time together.","How they used that time depended on them.","However, they couldn’t just date using their phones, right?","That would be no different from a long-distance relationship.","Especially when it was the first time for both of them, and it was their first day.","He was worried that if they did not meet each other, Xie Jiling wouldn’t feel that it was practical.","It would feel like the two weren’t dating.","If things went wrong, where could he go to cry?","So Han Zhuofeng thought of all kinds of ways to improve his relationship with Xie Jiling.","“So I’m thinking that after you’re done with your class in the afternoon today, I’ll ask someone to pick you up to come to the production crew. After our lunch together tomorrow at noon, I’ll ask someone to send you back again. I promise it won’t hold you up from your class.”","“And I can also book an extra room at the hotel for you,” said Han Zhuofeng, “I won’t do anything inappropriate.”","Xie Jiling pondered for a while. She wanted to see Han Zhuofeng as well.","It was exactly like what Han Zhuofeng said. They couldn’t just start dating without seeing each other.","Especially on the first day, it felt strange not to see each other.","Besides, it wasn’t like she hadn’t been to the production crew or stayed there before.","So Xie Jiling did not think that there was anything wrong with going to the production crew to see him.","It wasn’t like the two of them were going to some place far alone.","There were so many people there, so Xie Jiling had never even considered anything strange.","“Okay.” Xie Jiling nodded.","“Then I’ll ask Brother Xiao Liang to pick you up. He will arrive at three o’clock. You don’t have to rush even when you’re done with your class. He won’t have to wait for long as well,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“Alright.” Xie Jiling nodded.","Han Zhuofeng paused for a while without hanging up.","Xie Jiling thought that he had nothing else to say anymore and felt helpless.","Was it because there hadn’t been many chances for the both of them to spend time together, so it felt uncomfortable now that they were talking?","Xie Jiling was just about to open her mouth when Han Zhuofeng said, “Jiling, it’s our first day together.”","“Mmhm.” Xie Jiling nodded.","“I know that you have never had a boyfriend before. Otherwise, you won’t be so unsure about what it feels like to like someone.”","“Mmhmm.” Xie Jiling nodded.","“Such a coincidence. I’m the same,” Han Zhuofeng immediately said.","Xie Jiling was surprised. Han Zhuofeng was pretty young compared to his older brothers in the eight great families.","But to her, Han Zhuofeng wasn’t too young.","Did Han Zhuofeng not date anyone while he was studying?","Han Zhuofeng did not know about Xie Jiling’s confusion, so he continued, “I have no experience as well. Let’s fumble together. If I ever did anything you don’t like, tell me straight away. Don’t let me guess.”","He wouldn’t be able to guess it no matter how hard he tried.","It would be troublesome to do so as well.","Xie Jiling was also straightforward. “I will definitely tell you, so you should tell me straight away, too.”","“Okay, it’s a deal,” said Han Zhuofeng.","He still wanted to talk to Xie Jiling for a while more, but he thought about how she still hadn’t eaten.","As such, Han Zhuofeng said, “Eat first. Let’s chat on WeChat after eating. Come to the production crew in the afternoon. I’ll be waiting for you.”","“Okay, focus on your meal too.”","When Ren Linna and the others listened to their conversation, they noticed that it was strange.","You eat. I eat. You tell me straight away. I tell you straight away.","They sounded like newbies in dating.","“What did he ask you to do?” asked Kuang Xiaorou.","“He can’t come back because he’s busy filming, but he felt that we should see each other often because we’re in a relationship,” said Xie Jiling.","The other three nodded vigorously.","“I didn’t expect Han Zhuofeng’s sense of awareness to be pretty good,” said Feng Yaqing, smiling.","“I didn’t expect that as well,” said Xie Jiling.","“So, he asked Brother Xiao Liang to pick me up to go to the production crew. We will talk in the production crew,” said Xie Jiling.","“A date in the production crew; you got this!” Ren Linna gave her a thumbs up.","“But you’re going alone, so you should watch out. In this day and age, people aren’t so reserved anymore. We get together if our feelings are mutual. We also don’t care about keeping our own purity that much anymore,” reminded Kuang Xiaorou, “But it’s your first day, after all. No matter how much of a modern lady you are, you guys shouldn’t be sleeping together on the first day!”","“I know.” Xie Jiling puffed her cheeks. “Do I look that stupid?”","“You’re a little girl who has to ask us about how it feels to like someone, and you think you’re smart?” Feng Yaqing smiled as she roasted Xie Jiling, “In other aspects, you may be smart, but in terms of relationships, you’re a newbie.”","Xie Jiling was speechless.","Alright, it was her fault.","“Be rest assured. He said that he would book an extra room. He won’t do anything inappropriate,” Xie Jiling smiled and said.","“Good thing he’s a gentleman. If he’s too impatient, just let him go! No matter how outstanding he is, you have to let him go,” said Ren Linna.","“Mmhmm.” Xie Jiling nodded obediently.","“Aiyo, our Jiling is such a good girl. All of a sudden, I’m worried about giving you to Han Zhuofeng.” Feng Yaqing was like a worried old mother.","Xie Jiling smiled so wide her eyes squinted. “When he’s free, let’s eat with him. I will introduce him to you guys.”"]},{"number":3505,"title":"Chapter 3505 Call Me Sister-in-Law","paragraphs":["3505 Call Me Sister-in-Law","Right after Xie Jiling finished her meal, she received a friend request on WeChat.","She looked at it and found it was from Xiao Liang, so she accepted the request.","Xiao Liang: “Third Young Master’s Wife!”","“...” This form of address made Xie Jiling’s heart tremble along with her body. “Just call me ‘Xie Jiling.’”","Xiao Liang: “Will do, Third Young Master’s Wife.”","Xie Jiling was speechless.","“Third Young Master’s Wife, I’m afraid of disturbing you while you’re in class, so I won’t give you a call when I arrive at your school. I’ll send you a message via WeChat instead,” Xiao Liang said.","“Okay.” Xie Jiling gave up trying to correct Xiao Liang’s way of addressing her.","After their meal, they returned to the dormitory. Xie Jiling had a short nap before heading to class.","The class ended precisely at 3 p.m.","Xie Jiling hurriedly packed up her things and said goodbye to Ren Linna and the others. Then she rushed off campus.","She got into Xiao Liang’s car, and they drove off.","Xie Jiling had no idea that people at school were still having discussions about her.","“Is Xie Jiling in a relationship with someone who is the second generation of a wealthy family?”","“In the morning, I happened to overhear that man on the phone. It seemed like he was that family’s chauffeur who came here to pick up and drop off Xie Jiling,” someone said. “He even addressed her as ‘Third Young Master’s Wife’.”","“Is that true?”","“The car outside now doesn’t look the same as the one from this morning.”","“This car’s even bigger and more expensive.”","“It seems she really is dating someone wealthy.”","Xie Jiling had no idea about these discussions.","Right now, she was sitting comfortably in the car.","This time, Old Mrs. Han had Xiao Liang drive a bigger and more luxurious car.","It was spacious, and a small fridge was embedded in between the back seats. There were even snacks on top of it.","Xiao Liang then said, “Old Mrs. Han had me change to this car before coming over. She said that since those people love gossiping so much, just let them look all they want.”","“Grandma knows about it?” Xie Jiling was surprised.","“Of course. I noticed there was something off about the gazes of those people. I didn’t know if you had noticed, so I didn’t mention it. However, I was afraid they would misunderstand, so when I called up Old Mrs. Han, I took the chance to clarify the situation to them loudly.”","“I noticed, but it didn’t bother me. You don’t need to feel bothered by their gazes either,” Xie Jiling said.","“I’m fine. I was just afraid that Third Young Master would get revenge on me later when he finds out,” Xiao Liang said with a chuckle.","The three Han brothers all had extremely jealous natures.","As such, Xiao Liang couldn’t say that the matter had nothing to do with him. He cherished his life after all.","Xie Jiling felt really embarrassed when Xiao Liang made fun of the situation.","Xiao Liang then said, “There are drinks in the fridge. Take whatever you want. Additionally, the cabinet above it is filled with snacks. Old Mrs. Han had Auntie Sun put them all in there. She said the journey to the set is quite long and was afraid you’d get bored.”","“Ah, also, there’s a stand on the back of the front seats that you can use to place your tablet or phone on. It will make for a much more comfortable viewing experience when you watch videos,” he added.","To begin with, the car was spacious, so it was extremely comfortable to sit in it.","Moreover, the ride was very smooth.","There wasn’t even much of a shock even when the car went over a speed hump.","Xie Jiling took out her tablet and Bluetooth earphones, then she placed the tablet onto the stand, fixing it in place. She was very comfortable throughout the whole journey as she ate and drank as she wished.","Sure enough, the journey was completed before she knew it.","In fact, when they arrived at the set, Xie Jiling was a bit reluctant to get out of the car.","She was still in the middle of watching an episode of a romance drama.","Nevertheless, she got out of the car, and Xiao Liang accompanied Xie Jiling to the set entrance.","Obviously, Han Zhuofeng had already informed the security guard in advance.","Additionally, Xie Jiling had been to the set before, so the security guard recognized her.","So, the moment he saw her, he didn’t stop her from entering the set.","The security guard exchanged greetings with her and let her in.","Xie Jiling was also pretty familiar with the set.","After all, when Han Zhuofeng was afraid there was something in the set previously, he had taken Xie Jiling to every part of the set, and they visited even the unremarkable corners.","So, Xie Jiling didn’t need someone to guide her, as she easily found the filming area on her own.","Shi Xiaoya usually sat under the shade of an umbrella.","Once the filming of a scene was completed, she would go touch up the cast’s makeup.","She didn’t have much to do while the cast members were filming.","It was actually pretty boring to watch the filming process.","It was different from watching the finished product that aired on television.","This was especially so when there were bad takes, and they had to film the same scene again. It was truly quite boring.","So, Shi Xiaoya would normally be playing with her phone.","However, she couldn’t always keep staring at her phone; it was bad for her eyes.","From time to time, she would lift her gaze and look around her. Looking at greenery was good for the eyes.","It just so happened that when Shi Xiaoya turned her head to look around this time, she saw Xie Jiling walking over.","Pleasantly surprised, Shi Xiaoya stood up and ran over to Xie Jiling.","“Are you here to see Zhuofeng?” Shi Xiaoya asked with a smile.","“Mmhm.” Xie Jiling nodded. “My classes are done for the day, so I came over. I’ll go back to school tomorrow.”","“You just started dating him. Oh, how sweet,” Shi Xiaoya said. “Let’s go. I’ll take you to him.”","“He’s just over there. Do you see him?” Shi Xiaoya pointed at somewhere nearby to show Xie Jiling.","Xie Jiling saw him. Han Zhuofeng was sitting behind the monitor for the film camera, watching the cast members’ performance.","“Cut!” Han Zhuofeng yelled out. Then he said to the actor, “Pay attention to where you’re walking!”","After that, he went over to the actor and spoke to the latter again.","Han Zhuofeng wasn’t satisfied with the actor’s mood earlier either.","“All right, continue.” Han Zhuofeng clapped his hands. “Lift your spirits, cast. Just work hard for a bit more. We need to get through this scene!”","Han Zhuofeng then returned to the monitor.","He was so absorbed in his work that he didn’t notice Xie Jiling.","Xie Jiling didn’t disturb him. She stopped some distance away from him and said to Shi Xiaoya, “He’s still working, so I’ll wait for this scene to finish filming before going over.”","“Okay.” Shi Xiaoya stayed there to accompany her. “Oh, right. Are you thirsty? Do you want to eat anything?”","Xie Jiling shook her head. “Grandma prepared a lot of food and drinks. My mouth never had time to rest the whole journey here.”","As such, the two people simply waited in silence.","Fortunately, the actor was feeling a lot of pressure.","It was particularly because there were many people present, and Yan Zhiqing had been with him through the many bad takes he had caused.","As such, they finally got through the scene.","“Good. Prepare for the next scene!” Han Zhuofeng said.","Yan Zhiqing went back to prepare and found that Shi Xiaoya wasn’t there.","Shi Xiaoya immediately said to Xie Jiling, “I’ll go touch up Zhiqing’s makeup.”","“Go ahead,” Xie Jiling said.","Unexpectedly, Shi Xiaoya didn’t leave in a hurry and instead stopped to look at Xie Jiling.","“Seems like you haven’t greeted me since you got here,” Shi Xiaoya said.","“Ah, Miss Xiaoya.” Xie Jiling obediently made up for her mistake at once.","“Call me ‘Sister-in-Law’,” Shi Xiaoya said immediately.","Xie Jiling was speechless.","“Are you too shy to call me that?” Shi Xiaoya asked with a mischievous grin.","Xie Jiling didn’t know what to say.","“You’ll have to change the way you address me sooner or later anyway,” Shi Xiaoya said. “Start now, and you’ll get used to it sooner!”","Xie Jiling did not expect Shi Xiaoya to be this mischievous.","“I’m going to look for Han Zhuofeng!” Xie Jiling said and rushed off.","She was really afraid that Shi Xiaoya would chase after her and insist that she called her ‘Sister-in-Law’.","Fortunately, Shi Xiaoya peacefully went over to patch Yan Zhiqing’s makeup."]},{"number":3506,"title":"Chapter 3506 Rather Complacent When Making Public Displays of Affection","paragraphs":["3506 Rather Complacent When Making Public Displays of Affection","Yan Zhiqing didn’t see Xie Jiling. So when she saw Shi Xiaoya return, she asked, “Where did you go?”","“Jiling’s here,” Shi Xiaoya said softly and pointed out Xie Jiling for Yan Zhiqing.","Yan Zhiqing covered her mouth in delight. “As expected of a couple that just started dating. Their relationship is doing great. I bet they will be in the honeymoon phase for a while.”","“Is our relationship not doing great? Do we not spend every day together? Or are you getting bored with me?” Wei Wucai’s voice rang out coldly above Yan Zhiqing’s head.","Yan Zhiqing froze. She raised her head and found Wei Wucai, who had appeared behind her at some point unbeknownst to her.","Moreover, he had done so without making any noise at all.","“Hahaha...” Yan Zhiqing dryly laughed. “Oh, no. I’m just making fun of Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling.”","Yan Zhiqing hurriedly held Wei Wucai’s hand. “We see each other every day, but I miss you during the times when I don’t see you. Moreover, we still have an extremely passionate relationship even now.”","Wei Wucai gave her two cool laughs.","Shi Xiaoya was speechless. “...”","What wrongs had she committed that she had to be punished with this public display of affection?","Feeling annoyed, Shi Xiaoya turned Yan Zhiqing’s face toward her. “It’s time to touch up your makeup! Your eye makeup got smudged!”","After that, she grabbed a cotton swab and cleaned up some of Yan Zhiqing’s eyeliner that was smudged and wiped off the oil from Yan Zhiqing’s face. Then, she patched up the foundation a bit before using pressed cosmetic powder to fix the makeup.","The eye makeup wasn’t in a good state either, so she touched that up as well.","Someone else came over and fixed Yan Zhiqing’s hairstyle.","Wei Wucai continued to hang around. However, it didn’t matter since Yan Zhiqing wasn’t delaying the work by chatting with him.","When Shi Xiaoya was done touching Yan Zhiqing up, she told the latter, “I’m going to go watch what’s happening with Zhuofeng and Jiling.”","“I’ll go, too,” Yan Zhiqing said immediately.","“You’d better not. Your hair will become a mess with just one movement,” Shi Xiaoya said, taking joy in Yan Zhiqing’s misery. “Just be good and stay here.”","Yan Zhiqing was speechless.","Xie Jiling had just fled from Shi Xiaoya and was now behind Han Zhuofeng.","This was because there were way too many people by his side.","Additionally, the actor from earlier was right beside Han Zhuofeng, looking at the results of the scene he had just filmed.","Xiao Fengqing’s wound had already recovered by the time the matter from last time was resolved.","However, she was likely traumatized by that incident because she didn’t dare to approach Han Zhuofeng even now.","She was extremely quiet and well aware of her place in the set.","The next scene was hers.","Thus, Xiao Fengqing was currently sitting in her chair while deeply focused on refining her performance for the next scene.","There were many people around Han Zhuofeng, so Han Zhuofeng didn’t notice Xie Jiling.","Right now, he was expressing his opinion to the actor on how the latter should act in the next scene.","The actor expressed his opinion as well, and the two got into a rather lively discussion.","Consequently, Xie Jiling didn’t interrupt them and simply stood docilely behind Han Zhuofeng.","Everyone was busy with their own work. Nevertheless, it was unexpected that no one else noticed her either.","At last, the actor finished his discussion with Han Zhuofeng and left.","This was when Xie Jiling finally reached out with a finger and gently poked Han Zhuofeng’s shoulder.","Han Zhuofeng thought it was someone accidentally bumping into him because there were so many people around.","So, he didn’t pay any attention to it.","Seeing no response from Han Zhuofeng, Xie Jiling poked him another two times.","Initially, she was pretty nervous.","Their relationship had changed, so she couldn’t use her previously natural way of approaching him to face him.","She didn’t know how she should behave when she interacted with him.","As a result, Han Zhuofeng continued to ignore her.","This wore down Xie Jiling’s nervousness.","Upon seeing that there was still no response from Han Zhuofeng, Xie Jiling poked him three more times.","That actor who had been about to leave ended up noticing Xie Jiling.","The cast and crew knew Xie Jiling.","The actor had also joined them on the trip to Tacheng, so of course, he knew Xie Jiling.","At that time, Han Zhuofeng said that they were just friends.","However, everyone in the cast and crew already took the initiative to think of Xie Jiling as Han Zhuofeng’s girlfriend.","So, when this actor saw Xie Jiling, he grinned at her.","He even winked.","Obviously, this actor probably thought that Xie Jiling was here to see her boyfriend at his workplace.","And that she was playing a prank on Han Zhuofeng right now.","Of course, Xie Jiling’s current appearance certainly seemed like she was doing that.","Before Xie Jiling could even say anything, the actor already raised a finger to his lips, gesturing that he would stay quiet.","Then he made an ‘OK’ sign with his hand and quietly slipped away.","Xie Jiling was speechless.","Why were these people so good at understanding others?","However, this actor wanted to watch the action as well.","So, he didn’t actually leave.","Instead, he watched from a distance of a few steps away.","Shi Xiaoya walked over at this moment and saw the actor staying behind to watch.","She also stopped at around the same distance away from the couple.","The actor glanced at her and thought to himself, ‘Isn’t Shi Xiaoya an in-law of Han Zhuofeng?’","As such, he immediately asked her in a low voice, “Xiaoya, are Director Han and this young lady actually dating for real?”","In the past, Han Zhuofeng said he and Xie Jiling were just friends, and the cast and crew believed him.","However, their belief only lasted for a short time.","After all, Han Zhuofeng treated Xie Jiling genuinely well.","They hadn’t seen Han Zhuofeng treat anyone else as well as he treated Xie Jiling, even if they were just friends.","The people Han Zhuofeng normally interacted with the most were Shi Xiaoya and Yan Zhiqing.","Shi Xiaoya was Han Zhuofeng’s sister-in-law as well, so their relationship didn’t need to be mentioned.","Yan Zhiqing was someone Han Zhuofeng had great affection for as a long-time family friend, so she naturally couldn’t be compared to a normal friend.","Aside from those two, the only person Han Zhuofeng treated differently was Xie Jiling.","Back then, the cast and crew thought that even though Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling were just friends.","It was only a matter of time before they became a couple.","However, this wasn’t the case now.","The way Xie Jiling poked Han Zhuofeng earlier clearly seemed to have a sense of intimacy.","It didn’t give off the same vibe as their interactions in the past.","Shi Xiaoya gave the actor a thumbs up. “You’re extremely observant!”","“Wow, so it’s true!” The actor was pleasantly surprised. “In that case, we must congratulate him properly. No, we have to treat him to dinner tonight.”","“You should tell him. He’ll definitely be happy,” Shi Xiaoya said with a smile.","At this moment, Han Zhuofeng finally realized that something wasn’t quite right.","One poke could just be an accidental bump.","However, if the pokes were repeated, that couldn’t be an accident.","Han Zhuofeng took off his headphones and turned back to find Xie Jiling standing behind him.","Pleasantly surprised, he stood up and didn’t even care that his headphones had just fallen to the floor.","Seeing Xie Jiling, Han Zhuofeng blushed first.","“You’re here?” Han Zhuofeng asked with a flushed face while scratching his head.","Shi Xiaoya was speechless. “...”","Han Zhuofeng had been rather complacent when he made public displays of affection early this morning.","So why was he reacting like this now that he was seeing Xie Jiling in person?","Had he always been so pure and innocent?","“Mm.” Xie Jiling blushed as well, and she placed her hands behind her.","She unconsciously intertwined her fingers out of nervousness.","“It has actually been quite a while since I arrived. I left for the set right after my class ended,” Xie Jiling explained. “But I saw that you were working, and I didn’t want to disturb you.”"]},{"number":3507,"title":"Chapter 3507 It Would Not Be Wrong To Learn From His Elder Brothers","paragraphs":["3507 It Would Not Be Wrong To Learn From His Elder Brothers","“Haih! Next time, you don’t have to care about what I’m doing, and just call for me straight away. It’s fine even if I’m in the middle of working.”","After Han Zhuofeng was done saying that, his face blushed even more.","Shi Xiaoya did not understand why he was blushing; Han Zhuofeng’s topic was pretty normal.","He was blushing while talking to his own girlfriend?","At this moment, Han Zhuofeng whispered, “You’re more important than work.”","He lowered his voice, so Shi Xiaoya didn’t hear that.","Anyway, after Han Zhuofeng finished, not only was he blushing, even Xie Jiling was blushing.","Shi Xiaoya blinked.","What were these two doing?","What did Han Zhuofeng say?","The actors were practicing their lines with each other now, so it wasn’t busy.","Someone came to join the fun. “Director Han, you guys were friends before, but what about now?”","Han Zhuofeng raised his head, straightened his back and turned around. He stood next to Xie Jiling as he faced everyone.","His smile was extremely proud. He said to everyone, “Let me officially introduce her to you guys. This is my girlfriend, Xie Jiling.”","Although Xie Jiling was still blushing. she greeted everyone naturally, “Hello, everyone.”","It was as though they were meeting for the first time.","Someone said, “Haih, we’re old friends!”","The actor from before took this chance to say, “Director Han, congratulations on leaving the single life. I assume tonight’s meal will be on your tab?”","“Okay!” It was exactly like what Shi Xiaoya said. Han Zhuofeng easily agreed. “Everyone, let’s work hard today and finish today’s shoot earlier. We’ll finish early as possible, and I will treat everyone to a meal.”","“Hooray!” Everyone was suddenly filled with energy.","Xie Jiling was worried that she would disturb his work, so she said, “I will go look for Sister Xiaoya and Sister Zhiqing. You do your work. You don’t need to care about me.”","“Okay.” Now, Han Zhuofeng truly didn’t have time to be with Xie Jiling.","He had to explain the scenes to the actors, talk about the positions, talk to the videographers about the shooting angles and many more.","“Oh yeah, give me your phone,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling passed her phone to him.","Han Zhuofeng signed out of Xie Jiling’s Alipay.","Xie Jiling was surprised. Before she could say anything, Han Zhuofeng signed into his own account.","Then, he reset Xie Jiling’s face ID.","“This is my account. If you’re bored and don’t know what to do, you can play games, watch videos or order food delivery service. You can use my Alipay to recharge in games, purchase VIP in video platforms, and pay for delivery service.”","“Oh, yeah, WeChat doesn’t let you sign into your account. You can use Alipay to pay first. I will bind my bank card and credit card to your WeChat tonight. Then, you can choose whatever payment methods you like.”","Xie Jiling had never dated anyone before but were all relationships like this?","People would spend their partners’ money straight away?","“I have money,” said Xie Jiling.","“I know. Every time you exorcise or sell a charm, you earn hundreds of thousands,” Han Zhuofeng smiled and said, “You’re even richer than me right now.”","Han Zhuofeng still hadn’t earned any money as a director.","His earnings were all from the dividends of his family’s businesses.","However, he had no plans of joining the family business.","So, the dividends given to him weren’t as much as his two older brothers.","His two elder brothers had earned those shares with their own skills.","Han Zhuofeng’s shares would only increase upon inheriting Han Dongping’s shares in the future.","Right now, his annual earnings might not be even more than Xie Jiling’s.","Of course, that was just compared to Xie Jiling.","Actually, he was earning quite a lot already.","However, he wanted to shoot this film and kept it from his family back then.","As such, Han Zhuofeng invested all the money he had earned and saved over the years into the movie.","Some of there were still locked up in various investments, so he couldn’t take them out.","However, those investments had all made some money.","“But I want to let you spend my money. I want to pay for you to buy whatever you like.” Han Zhuofeng scratched his head. “I... I want to spoil you, so I’ll be happy to see you spend my money.”","Xie Jiling smiled shyly, but the smile had a hint of sweetness that couldn’t be hidden.","It felt pretty good to be spoiled by Han Zhuofeng.","She would spend his money. At worst, she would spend a lot of money to buy tons of gifts for him.","“Anyway, you can use mine when you go out with your dorm mates or whatever, not just here.”","“Okay.” Xie Jiling nodded obediently.","Han Zhuofeng chuckled for a while.","Anyway, that was what his elder brothers did.","His elder brothers had such good relationships with their wives.","No matter what, nothing could go wrong with learning from his elder brothers.","“Then, I’m going to discuss the next scenes with the others,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“Mmmhmm.” Xie Jiling nodded and decided to look for Shi Xiaoya.","She turned around and saw Shi Xiaoya standing a few steps away.","She was watching from the side happily.","Xie Jiling ran over quickly. “You saw everything?”","“Mmhmm, I saw everything,” said Shi Xiaoya, “Zhuofeng is dumb, but he isn’t careless at important moments.”","Binding his own account and bank card was a good move.","“Let’s go, let’s go, let’s go. The next one isn’t Zhiqing’s scene, so we can talk to her for a while.” Shi Xiaoya dragged Xie Jiling and went to Yan Zhiqing.","Wei Wucai had already returned to work.","He was busier than Yan Zhiqing.","Throughout the day, not every scene was Yan Zhiqing’s, so she could rest for a while.","However, all the special effects were done by Wei Wucai’s team. Furthermore, there were a lot of requirements this time, so even Wei Wucai could barely leave.","Upon seeing them, Yan Zhiqing complained, “Xiao Cai talked nonstop to me, so I ended up missing the fun. It’s his fault.”","Xie Jiling’s mouth twitched. “Sister Zhiqing, you’re so straightforward, saying that you wanted to watch the fun in front of me.”","After all, she was part of the fun.","“Hahaha!” Zhiqing could not stop laughing. “Don’t mind the details!”","“Oh yeah, I have to start shooting later, so I won’t be able to leave. Xiaoya also has to be ready to do our makeup at any time, so she won’t be able to leave as well. Zhuofeng is busier than us, and he can’t be with you,” said Yan Zhiqing.","“When we’re not here, don’t sit around here. You can go to my camper van to have fun. My camper van has WiFi, which is super fast,” said Yan Zhiqing, “And it’s also comfy inside.”","“It’s fine; you guys don’t have to stay with me deliberately, but let’s talk when you guys don’t have work to do! Otherwise, I’ll still be bored even if I play with my phone,” said Xie Jiling.","Shi Xiaoya immediately reacted, “Bored? Didn’t Zhuofeng bind his account to yours? You can play games, watch videos, and order some snacks with his money. There are so many ways for you to have fun!”"]},{"number":3508,"title":"Chapter 3508 Greetings to Sister-in-law As Well","paragraphs":["3508 Greetings to Sister-in-law As Well","Xie Jiling asked in shame, “You heard it all?”","Han Zhuofeng had spoken so loudly. Of course, Shi Xiaoya heard it.","She had reasons to suspect that Han Zhuofeng had done it deliberately.","“Quickly come sit here.” Shi Xiaoya pulled Xie Jiling over. “Wait a moment.”","!!","Shi Xiaoya then went to Yan Zhiqing’s camper van.","Her backpack was in Yan Zhiqing’s van as well.","After a while, Shi Xiaoya emerged with a lot of snacks in her arms.","“We bought a lot of snacks. They’re all in Zhiqing’s van. Normally, we’ll just go back to the van to get more when we’re done eating whatever we had taken out,” Shi Xiaoya said.","There was a folding table in front of them, which could be used to place the snacks on.","There was even a small pot of coffee on the table. It was currently on keep warm, so they could conveniently drink it whenever they wanted.","Yan Zhiqing and Shi Xiaoya had been the ones who brought all these things here.","They had been with the crew for a long time, so they had some experience now.","They were able to make their environment much more comfortable as much as possible within the confines of their circumstances.","It was only at this moment that Xie Jiling knew it was possible to do such things.","After that, Xie Jiling took out her tablet and placed it in standing mode on the table.","Then, the three people ate snacks and drank coffee while watching a TV series.","They were extremely content.","After watching for a while, Yan Zhiqing noticed that it was almost time. She said, “I should go prepare for my next scene.”","Shi Xiaoya left to touch up someone else’s makeup.","Yan Zhiqing dragged Xie Jiling along to help her rehearse her scene.","Xie Jiling didn’t know how to act, so she could only take read the script earnestly.","Fortunately, she was able to help Yan Zhiqing quite a lot due to her earnestness.","Yan Zhiqing went to film the scene. Xie Jiling watched Han Zhuofeng move about busily so much that he was sweating.","Seeing this, she thought he was having a much harder time than her whenever she was out exorcising spirits.","Since Han Zhuofeng had found himself a girlfriend...","The cast and crew were in great harmony.","They were working very efficiently today.","Since they completed today’s film schedule at around 6 pm...","Han Zhuofeng suggested that someone should make a reservation at a restaurant in the nearby business district.","While everyone else was packing up the equipment, Han Zhuofeng went to look for Xie Jiling.","Shi Xiaoya went to one side and called up Han Zhuoling and told him the restaurant’s location.","Seeing as there were so many people attending the dinner today, Shi Xiaoya guessed that it wouldn’t end early. In fact, they might even still be at the restaurant by the time Han Zhuoling had made his way over.","“Zhuofeng got a girlfriend today, so he invited the whole cast and crew for dinner,” Shi Xiaoya said.","Hearing that, Han Zhuoling laughed. “That rascal’s actually that happy.”","Han Zhuofeng hadn’t been single for that long, yet he was already that happy to find a girlfriend.","Had Wei Zhiqing said something about it yet?","“All right. I won’t bother you anymore. Take care when you drive over here this evening,” Shi Xiaoya said.","“Alright...”","They had to wake up early to film tomorrow, so everyone was very restrained.","Even when they drank alcohol, they only drank a little, and they also didn’t force Han Zhuofeng to drink.","Before long, Han Zhuoling eventually arrived.","Unexpectedly, Han Zhuoli and Lu Man had come along with him.","Han Zhuoli had wanted to continue staying on paternity leave, but he was dragged back to work by Han Zhuoling who had reached the limits of his patience.","Even if they were brothers, Han Zhuoling shouldn’t be pressuring Han Zhuoli so much, right?","When Shi Xiaoya called Han Zhuoling earlier in the day, Han Zhuoling was still at the company.","So, Han Zhuoli overheard the conversation.","He immediately tossed his child over to the family home. He took Lu Man along with him as he followed Han Zhuoling to the restaurant.","They had dinner at the family home yesterday evening.","However, Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling had yet to become an official couple.","At that time, the two of them were still just friends.","So, Han Zhuoli and Lu Man rushed over this evening.","Today was Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling’s first day officially as a couple.","A few seats had been reserved for Han Zhuoling and the others at Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling’s table.","When they went over and sat down at the couple’s table, Lu Man said with a beaming smile, “Congratulations.”","“Before, Jiling kept addressing me as ‘Sister.’ I didn’t expect that after calling me Sister all this time, she would actually become my younger sister.”","Shi Xiaoya said as well, “However, she can no longer call you ‘Sister’ in the future. She’ll have to call you ‘Sister-in-Law’ instead.”","Xie Jiling looked around at the people seated at the table. Aside from her, everyone else belonged to the Han family.","If they weren’t of the surname ‘Han,’ they were a wife of a man with the surname Han.","Xie Jiling suddenly felt as if she were small, weak, pitiful, and helpless.","“Right, right.” Lu Man nodded and looked at Xie Jiling with an ardent gaze.","Delighted by Xie Jiling’s misery, Han Zhuoli said, “I’ll let you call me ‘Uncle’ one more time. You’ll have to address me as ‘Brother’ in the future, right?”","Xie Jiling was speechless.","Han Zhuoli raised his chin and said smugly, “Quickly. Let me hear you call me ‘Brother’.”","At this moment, not only did Han Zhuofeng not help Xie Jiling, but he even joined in on the fun. “That’s right. Just call him ‘Brother’ as I do. You’ll have to change how you address him sooner or later.”","With so many gazes on her, Xie Jiling almost shrank into the size of a quail.","Under all that pressure, she could only force herself to call out, “Greetings to Brother.”","“What about ‘Sister-in-Law’ then? Is there no greetings for the ‘Sister-in-Law’?” Lu Man said immediately afterward.","“...” Xie Jiling discovered for the first time that Lu Man was very mischievous as well. “Greetings to Sister-in-Law... as well.”","Shi Xiaoya shook her phone. “I recorded it and sent it to Grandmother for her to listen.”","Shi Xiaoya had sent it straight to Old Mrs. Han.","Xie Jiling didn’t know what to say.","Han Zhuofeng immediately said to Shi Xiaoya, “Eldest Sister-in-Law, hurry up and take a photo of Jiling and me.”","Han Zhuofeng reached out and grabbed Xie Jiling’s shoulder, pulling her toward him.","He had no confidence in the photography skills of straight men like Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli.","Lu Man was sitting in a position that wasn’t very convenient for taking photos.","Meanwhile, Shi Xiaoya had the best angle to take photos.","She Xiaoya took a photo for them and even edited it.","Afterward, she sent it over to Han Zhuofeng.","Han Zhuofeng immediately showed it to Xie Jiling.","Xie Jiling had never taken a photograph with Han Zhuofeng before, let alone stand in front of a mirror with him.","So, she never knew they looked so harmonious when they stood together.","However, she would be quite brazen if she said it herself.","Nevertheless, it was truly the case.","In any case, the more she looked at the photograph of the two of them, the more she liked it.","Xie Jiling nodded and commented, “Excellent harmony!”","Han Zhuofeng was extremely happy as well. “I think so, too.”","Han Zhuofeng saved the photo without delay and said, “We look very good together, but this background is no good. It can’t be used as a screensaver. What a pity.”","There were other tables behind them. The staff members of the production team were seated at those tables, and they were all having a big drinking party.","It made for a lively scene, but it didn’t look high-end enough for a screensaver.","Xie Jiling nodded. “Tomorrow morning, we’ll take one together at the set. I saw that there were many great backdrops on set. There was even a space capsule. We don’t need anything else, though. We just need a white wall as our background. Just that will look really good.”","This way, they wouldn’t need to worry about leaking anything from the set.","Han Zhuofeng immediately nodded in approval. “Right, that works.”","After that, Han Zhuofeng posted the photo on his Weibo and Moments.","He posted the same line on both posts: “My girlfriend came to visit my workplace.”","This time, Han Zhuofeng didn’t block it from the view of Old Mrs. Han and the others on Moments.","Old Mrs. Han was the first to comment: “My grandson and granddaughter-in-law look so good together. Well-matched! [Thumbs up]”","Old Mrs. Qi: “Zhuofeng got a girlfriend so early. He has truly grown up!”"]},{"number":3509,"title":"Chapter 3509 Aren’t You Ashamed?","paragraphs":["3509 Aren’t You Ashamed?","Old Mrs. Chu said, “@Old Mrs. Wei.”","Xie Jiling was not friends with these grandmas on WeChat, so she looked at Han Zhuofeng’s WeChat.","Seeing Old Mrs. Chu’s comment, Xie Jiling could not help but say, “Chu Zhaoyang is truly her grandson.”","In the morning, Chu Zhaoyang tagged Wei Zhiqian, and at night Old Mrs. Chu tagged Old Mrs. Wei.","Old Mrs. Wei said, “@Wei Zhiqian, where are you? Don’t you feel ashamed?”","Han Zhuofeng’s classmates also commented.","“Wow, the school hunk left the single life so quickly.”","“Pain. School hunk Han left the single life too.”","“The girl looks very young.”","“What a good match. Congratulations!”","There were naturally more comments on Weibo, and they weren’t necessary to be discussed.","The three brothers of the Han Family were pretty famous in the country.","After the meal at night, everyone returned to the hotel.","Han Zhuofeng did not go in Yan Zhiqing’s car. He drove his own car.","He drove back with Xie Jiling alone.","Today he couldn’t get the chance to spend time with Xie Jiling alone.","He could only use this little bit of time while they were on the way back.","He did not dare to enter Xie Jiling’s room when they went back to the hotel as he was afraid that he would not make a good impression on Xie Jiling.","On the way, Han Zhuofeng asked Xie Jiling, “When should I go back with you to meet your parents?”","Xie Jiling did not care. She was young, and her family wasn’t rushing her when it came to that department.","However, they were a little worried that she would delay her love life because of her job as an exorcist.","They were also worried that her love life would not be smooth due to her job as an exorcist.","As such, her family was still a little worried.","They were also worried that she would be tricked by people because she was young and naive.","After all, since young, other than exorcism, she did nothing but study, or else she wouldn’t have been able to enter University of B City.","Other than those two things, she hadn’t done other things in her life, so she was really naive.","Xie Jiling thought that it would be pretty good to bring Han Zhuofeng back.","This would reassure her family.","“When are you free?” said Xie Jiling, “I don’t mind; I can apply for a leave of absence any time. My house is in Lingnan, and it’s pretty far. The trip there will take a day. We have to take a flight and then drive to reach my house.”","The location of the Xie Family’s house couldn’t conveniently be reached using public transport. It wouldn’t be an understatement to say that it was located deep in the mountains.","“Now that you’re shooting a film, a day’s rest would definitely not be enough,” said Xie Jiling.","She could not ask Han Zhuofeng to free up a few more days.","After all, it would be a waste of filming money.","Han Zhuofeng thought about it and agreed. “We’re almost done shooting the entire film. After that, I can rest for a few days. Everyone has been working for so long, and we have to take a little break before going back to edit the film.”","“Approximately how long more do you have to shoot for?” asked Xie Jiling.","“Not long,” said Han Zhuofeng, “It will be almost done after half a month.”","If it was calculated starting from the preparation to shooting, Han Zhuofeng’s movie was taking a long time to complete.","He was already doing the preparations for the early stages five months before the New Year.","During those five months until the New Year, he had to use all his savings.","Luckily, every single Han Family member invested tens of millions so he could continue.","Now, it was already late Fall, and the filming would be complete after half a month, then the late stages would commence.","It was really tough.","“Can it make it in time for the Spring Festival box office?” asked Xie Jiling.","“It should be able to make it for the Spring Festival box office. The foundations of the early stages were well-done. From modeling it to shooting the film, we did it step by step. This would get rid of a lot of troubles in the late stages of the production.”","“And Brother Xiao Cai’s team is very professional. They have a lot of production experience in this area, so they avoided a lot of trial and error steps. Other than that, the submission for review would not need to wait till the whole late stages are complete. We can submit the director’s cut version first. Mainly we have to ensure that there are no areas breaking the rules and no violent or gory scenes.”","“This is a thought-provoking Sci-Fi film, so there is no violence or gore; there should be no problem with the review. Then, we just have to take a number. After all these, the cinema can show the film.”","“The Spring Festival box office is pretty competitive. There are a lot of films waiting to be released during the Spring Festival,” said Han Zhuofeng, “Actually, I’m a little worried about whether this film can compete with others or not if I were to put it under the New Year’s box office.”","“It can.” Xie Jiling had more faith in the movie than Han Zhuofeng, who was directly involved. “You shot the film with all your heart. Movies that are shot with heart, the audience will show support those motives no matter what as long as the quality is decent.”","“It’s not like the past now, when you can earn money by simply shooting a film,” said Xie Jiling, “The audience has higher expectations. The audience can differentiate between films that are made with heart and films that are made to earn money.”","“I also paid attention to movies made in the country in these two years. Movies that weren’t favored became the dark horse in the end. It was because they audience thought they were good after watching and spreading it around. They even surpassed the movies that were favored prior to their release.”","Xie Jiling looked at Han Zhuofeng sincerely. “So you have to have more faith in your own production! This is not a literary film, so it’s not hard to understand. This is a commercial film. The most important thing is to have a good plot and pacing. If it’s a special effects film, then excellent special effects should be included as well.”","“In the area of movie production, I’m an outsider. However, when it comes to watching movies, as a part of the audience, I know what I like. What I like does not represent what everyone likes, but I know what kind of movies most people would think are good.”","“Anyway, from an audience’s perspective, as long as you fulfill those three points, I think it’s a film made with sincerity,” said Xie Jiling.","“How is the plot of your movie?” Xie Jiling didn’t wait for Han Zhuofeng to answer and helped him answer. “If the plot is good and the production is excellent, how about the pacing? That I don’t know. It will depend on your videographing and editing skills.”","Han Zhuofeng smiled and said, “I think it’s good.”","“Are the special effects good? With Wei Wucai’s team here and you spending so much money focusing on the special effects, it will be hard for it not to be good.” Xie Jiling was full of faith. “So the results will definitely be good.”","“You’re right.” Han Zhuofeng nodded. “I was just too worried about gains and losses.”","“That’s because you value it too much,” said Xie Jiling.","“Indeed.” Han Zhuofeng smiled after pondering. “After listening to you, I have more faith in it now. I will fight for the New Year’s box office.”","“If it can make it and there is enough time, you can give it a try. If it can’t, don’t rush it,” said Xie Jiling.","“I won’t rush it. If it can make it, I will go for it. If not, I will change the time.” Han Zhuofeng knew that he had to be more strong-minded, especially in these times.","“Then, after about half a month, when we’re done shooting every scene, should I follow you back to the Xie Family’s home to meet your parents?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","“You’re young, alone in B City, and you’ve just started dating.”"]},{"number":3510,"title":"Chapter 3510 Smiled Like Idiots","paragraphs":["3510 Smiled Like Idiots","“With your work nature and what happened to your cousin, your family should be worried about you. If I go back with you, they will rest assured.” Han Zhuofeng stated the reasons.","Xie Jiling had just realized that he still remembered what she said about her cousin.","It was because he remembered clearly that he knew her family would care and be worried about her.","That was why he wanted to go there. It was all to reassure her family.","She would not be taken advantage of in B City.","Nobody would hurt her.","“Alright.” Xie Jiling nodded.","There was only one thing that she was unsure about.","If Han Zhuofeng were to go, she would definitely have to tell her family beforehand.","However, wouldn’t her family think it was too early for her to be dating at nineteen years old?","But she had to tell her family anyway.","After giving it a thought, Xie Jiling decided not to care about this problem.","She had already started dating anyway, and there was nothing her family could do about it.","She would leave all the tests to Han Zhuofeng.","As they talked on the way, they arrived at the hotel without realizing it.","“I used my ID to get you a room. You can just go there straight away,” said Han Zhuofeng, as he took out a new room card from his bag and passed it to Xie Jiling.","“When did you get a new room?” Xie Jiling was surprised.","She came in the afternoon, and she hadn’t seen Han Zhuofeng leave the production crew.","After the shooting was done, the two had been together the whole time.","“At noon,” explained Han Zhuofeng, smiling, “After calling you at noon and when you agreed to come, I immediately returned to the hotel and got a room.”","“Isn’t that a lot of work? It would have been if you had gotten it after I arrived,” said Xie Jiling.","“It’s fine.” Han Zhuofeng didn’t mind it.","The two walked into the elevator.","There were so many people on the production crew.","Everyone left the restaurant together.","However, when they returned to the hotel, they didn’t meet a single person from the production crew.","It was unclear whether everyone came back first or they were still out.","But they should at least see one person, right?","Only the two of them were in the elevator.","Xie Jiling had no idea what was going on, but Han Zhuofeng knew.","Back in the restaurant, the assistant director sent him a WeChat message secretly.","Everyone created a chance for him and Xie Jiling to spend some alone time.","As such, everyone came back slower than them.","If a big group of people entered the hotel, it would be fun.","But the mood would be ruined.","There were only two of them in the lift. Han Zhuofeng lowered his head slightly and looked at Xie Jiling beside him.","She was tiny, and she looked well-behaved.","Han Zhuofeng looked down slightly, and he extended his hand slowly toward Xie Jiling’s hand.","Back when they were in the ghost town, Han Zhuofeng could hold Xie Jiling’s hand calmly without hesitation.","But now, he did not have the courage.","Han Zhuofeng’s throat was dry, and his face was burning.","He was so nervous that the air around him seemed like it was burning.","His fingers slowly inched toward Xie Jiling.","The distance between the two was not great, but why could he not reach it no matter how far he moved toward her?","Han Zhuofeng did not know that although he felt that he was moving, in reality, he was just moving his hand around in place.","Han Zhuofeng lowered his head and looked at Xie Jiling’s fair hand.","It wasn’t like they had not held hands before.","He gritted his teeth and held Xie Jiling’s hand straight away.","Xie Jiling turned around in surprise and looked at him.","Han Zhuofeng blushed as he said, “We’re already dating, so it’s fine if we hold hands, right?”","Xie Jiling laughed secretly, and she held Han Zhuofeng’s hand as well.","This time, it felt different from the last time.","Last time, all Xie Jiling could think about was exorcising, and because Han Zhuofeng was afraid, she didn’t think of other things when they held hands.","But this time, it was different.","She was holding her boyfriend’s hand.","Xie Jiling’s palm felt itchy, and her heart was racing.","When they exited the elevator, Han Zhuofeng walked her to the door of her room.","Han Zhuofeng hadn’t spent enough time with her yet.","He stood at the door, saying, “We’re leaving at 5 to shoot with the production crew. If you think it’s too early, just stay in the hotel. I’ll come back to see you at noon when you’re awake.”","“I will follow you tomorrow,” said Xie Jiling immediately, “I don’t have anything to do anyway. If I wake up early, I can just sleep at the production site. You don’t have to come back, and it’s too tiring, so I can watch you shoot the film tomorrow at the production site. If you’re not busy in between scenes, you can spend some time with me.”","Xie Jiling’s voice was soft and delicate, especially when she said to spend time with her when he was not busy. Han Zhuofeng felt as if his heart had just been struck.","Han Zhuofeng felt that he would satisfy every single one of her requests.","She was so well-behaved that he could not stop himself from pampering her.","“Mmhmm.” Han Zhuofeng’s smile was so sweet it was as though there were stars in his eyes.","His long fingers linked with hers.","“I’ll call you in the morning, then,” said Han Zhuofeng, “I didn’t manage to get the room next to mine because it was occupied.”","Han Zhuofeng found it unfortunate.","Even though they wouldn’t be sleeping in the same room, if they were next to each other, he would be able to feel her.","“But I’m not that far from you; there are just about three rooms in between us,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“Okay.” Xie Jiling answered, and she had no idea why she said okay.","It wasn’t like she would go to his room, so why did she say okay?","“Goodnight, sleep early,” said Han Zhuofeng. But he did not let go of her hand.","It seemed like Xie Jiling didn’t realize it as well. “You, too.”","Han Zhuofeng looked at Xie Jiling without saying anything.","“Why?” asked Xie Jiling, curious.","“Can... can I... kiss you?” Han Zhuofeng explained immediately, “A goodnight kiss!”","Although Xie Jiling had never been in a relationship before, she had watched movies before.","In the movies, whenever a guy kissed a girl, the guy would never ask prior to doing it.","So. how should she answer?","However, Han Zhuofeng wasn’t that helpless.","Xie Jiling didn’t answer, so he assumed that Xie Jiling was fine with it.","He lowered his head and got closer. Then, he quickly pecked her lips.","He sucked his own lips, thinking that it was sweet.","The intimate physical interaction turned on a switch, and they didn’t feel that uneasy with each other anymore.","They felt a lot closer to each other, and they felt more comfortable being together.","“Because this is your first relationship, is this also your first kiss?” asked Xie Jiling.","Han Zhuofeng denied it in his heart. He had already secretly kissed her in Tacheng.","But he could not let Xie Jiling know about that.","So Han Zhuofeng went against his conscience and nodded. “Mmhmm.”","Luckily, Xie Jiling was also feeling nervous, so she didn’t notice Han Zhuofeng’s guilt.","She smiled, full of satisfaction. “Me, too.”","“I know.” Han Zhuofeng was also smiling.","The two smiled like idiots.","“Then, I’m going in. Rest early, too. You woke up even earlier than me today,” said Xie Jiling."]},{"number":3511,"title":"Chapter 3511 My Elder Brother’s Mouth Is So Quick","paragraphs":["3511 My Elder Brother’s Mouth Is So Quick","“Mmhmm, goodnight,” said Xie Jiling softly.","No matter how reluctant Han Zhuofeng was, he had to leave, so he said, “I’ll text you on WeChat later.”","“Okay.” Xie Jiling nodded obediently.","Finally, she was separated from Han Zhuofeng.","When Xie Jiling returned to her room, she could not help but think about the time when they were in Tacheng, where their rooms were right next to each other.","Xie Jiling went to take a shower.","It was their first day together, but she didn’t get to spend a lot of time with him today.","But now that they were separated and she was alone, she started missing him.","While she was together with him, she was so nervous that she would often be at a loss for words.","But now that they were separated, she started missing him.","Xie Jiling sat on the bed comfortably, leaning on the pillow.","She opened WeChat and saw Han Zhuofeng’s message.","It was sent half an hour ago. That should be when he had just entered his room.","Han Zhuofeng said, “I’m going to take a shower first. I’ll talk to you after showering.”","At that time, Xie Jiling had already prepared her pajamas and had gone to the bathroom, so she did not see it.","Then, after fifteen minutes, Han Zhuofeng’s text came again. “I am done showering.”","Seeing that Xie Jiling did not reply, Han Zhuofeng knew that she was probably washing up, so he did not rush her.","Since Han Zhuofeng’s first text, half an hour had already passed.","Xie Jiling immediately replied, “I just came out from the shower. You shower so quickly.”","Han Zhuofeng replied instantly, “Haha, I’m a guy. My hair is short, so it’s quick.”","Xie Jiling said, “I’m thinking about whether I should let my family know about our relationship right now.”","When Han Zhuofeng saw Xie Jiling say the phrase ‘our relationship’, he hugged his phone and started dumbly smiling at the screen.","While smiling stupidly, Han Zhuofeng replied to her, “Let them know, so your family can prepare themselves.”","If she told them at the last minute, or if she didn’t tell them at all.","Her family would definitely be shocked if they went there without their knowledge.","“Mmhmm,” answered Xie Jiling, “Then I’ll give them a call right now.”","At that, Han Zhuofeng felt a little nervous as well. “After you’re done calling, tell me how your family feels about it.”","Xie Jiling agreed and left the chat.","Xie Jiling was feeling very nervous. She had no plans about how she would tell her family.","She went to look at the picture of Han Zhuofeng and hers to motivate herself.","Unexpectedly, among the comments of Han Zhuofeng’s friends, Xie Jiwen appeared.","Xie Jiwen said, “What’s going on? Explain!”","Xie Jiling was speechless.","When did the both of them become friends?","Xie Jiling went to Han Zhuofeng immediately. “You added my brother as your friend?”","Han Zhuofeng said, “Yeah. After we returned from Tacheng last time, I did not know how he got my phone number, but he added me through my phone number. I thought he got it from you.”","“No,” said Xie Jiling, “I didn’t even know that you guys added each other as friends. Did you see his comment in your WeChat moments?”","“What? I have been chatting with you the whole time, so I didn’t have time to look at it. Wait.” Han Zhuofeng immediately went to his WeChat moments.","He saw the comment that Xie Jiwen left for him.","Han Zhuofeng went back to Xie Jiling and said, “Why do I feel like brother’s comment has a hint of killing intent?”","Xie Jiling gloated and laughed. “It’s probably the same as what Yan Beicheng feels towards Wei Wucai. Who told you guys to take away their adorable little sisters?”","Xie Jiling wasn’t even worried about Han Zhuofeng.","Anyway, although Xie Jiwen was harsh in his words, he couldn’t really do anything to Han Zhuofeng.","“Let’s stop talking for now. I’m going to call back home first,” said Xie Jiling.","Han Zhuofeng begged her to do it quickly.","After thinking about it, Xie Jiling decided to call her dad Xie Tongyun first.","Because of what happened with her cousin, her mom had always been worried that she would meet a bad partner.","Her mom would never trust her other half at first.","Back then, when her cousin divorced and was hurt, it was her aunt and her mom who took care of her cousin.","Men were careless, so they should focus on exorcism.","Of course, it wasn’t like the Xie Family’s men did not do anything.","The female elders were responsible for comforting her cousin. As for the males of the Xie Family, they were responsible for creating trouble for that ex-brother-in-law.","So that ex-brother-in-law never did well after the divorce.","His business was ruined.","After all, the Xie Family was in charge of exorcism. Looking at the Xie Family’s fees, those who did not have some wealth would be too embarrassed to go to the Xie Family.","Because of this, the Xie Family’s customers were all people of high standing.","From rich people to celebrities.","As such, when the Xie Family went to say a word to those people, that ex-brother-in-law couldn’t even think of being successful.","Back when he was with her cousin, he was considered a successful man.","However, his success depended on the Xie Family’s connections.","Now that the Xie Family was unwilling to give him any connections and even destroyed the business of a small figure like him, things were bound to be difficult for him.","Even if he used his savings to do some business, it would not work.","In the end, it was heard that he was selling fruits on the streets to survive.","These were all done by the Xie Family’s men.","As for the women, they did not care about those things; they only looked after her cousin.","As such, they had seen how her cousin went from being sad to cold-hearted. She would never get into a relationship again.","Once her mother learned that she was in a relationship, her reaction would definitely be bigger than her father’s. As such, Xie Jiling had to be more careful.","After a while, Xie Tongyun picked up. “I heard from Wen that you’re dating someone. What’s going on?”","Xie Jiling did not expect her father to know about it already.","“Brother’s mouth is really quick,” said Xie Jiling, “Does Mom know about it?”","“Of course, she knows. Your brother told us together. Your mom was about to call you, but you called first,” said Xie Tongyun.","Immediately afterward, Xie Jiling heard her mother’s frantic voice from the other side of the phone. “Turn on the speaker mode; I want to listen too.”","“Okay, okay, okay,” answered Xie Tongyun, frustrated. He turned on the speaker.","“Mom,” Xie Jiling called out.","“Your elder brother said that you’re dating someone, and he even showed me a picture. That guy in the picture is really your boyfriend?” asked Gu Yingsu straight away without caring about others.","“Yeah,” said Xie Jiling.","“What does he do? How old is he?” asked Gu Yingsu.","“Mom, relax. Let me tell you one by one,” said Xie Jiling, “I also called to tell you guys about it. Who could have known that my brother’s mouth is so quick?”","Xie Jiling was a little displeased.","It should have been her own matter to handle, so how could her brother say it without her permission?","“His name is Han Zhuoling, a direct descendant of the Han Family of the eight great families. He is Han Zhuoling’s and Han Zhuoli’s younger brother, and he is the third one right now,” said Xie Jiling.","Without needing Xie Jiling to say the rest, when Han Zhuofeng’s name was mentioned, Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu already knew Han Zhuofeng’s identity."]},{"number":3512,"title":"Chapter 3512 Untitled","paragraphs":["3512 Untitled","The two looked at each other. This ruled out the possibility of him being like that man, who only wanted to use the Xie Family to succeed.","“It’s him.” Xie Tongyun was surprised.","“Didn’t you guys see the picture? Did you not recognize him?” said Xie Jiling, “Did my brother not tell you guys?”","“Cough, we were too shocked at that time, so we didn’t take a close look. As for your brother, before he could tell us, you called us. We would rather ask you directly,” explained Xie Tongyun.","“He is a director and is currently shooting a movie with the production crew right now, so he can’t visit you guys immediately. However, he said that it will be finished in about half a month. Once the movie is done shooting, he will follow me back home immediately.”","“So fast? Didn’t you guys just get together?” Gu Yingsu was shocked.","She even forgot that she was supposed to be concerned.","“I have already seen the two elders of the Han Family, but we weren’t together yesterday. He... confessed to me yesterday.” Xie Jiling did not know how to explain, so she just briefly went through it.","She hoped that they would not ask for the details.","“Then, Han Zhuofeng felt that it was considered to be meeting the parents. Since I’ve already seen his parents, he should see mine as well,” said Xie Jiling.","Gu Yingsu was speechless. “...”","Xie Tongyun was speechless. “...”","Was everyone so keen to meet the parents?","“Besides, he also knew about my cousin. He was worried that you guys would be concerned, so he wanted to come as early as possible to let you guys have a look at him,” said Xie Jiling.","Since the person was Han Zhuofeng, they suddenly did not know what to say.","The Han Family was famous for having good family traditions and character.","From the two elders of the Han Family to Han Xijin, then to Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuofeng.","They did not know what Han Dongping had done.","After all, that was a confidential matter of the Han Family.","However, had never hurt Lin Liye.","As for Han Zhuofeng, since there were Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli, they were not really worried.","In addition, the Han Family had such a good background.","Their family really did not have anything that Han Zhuofeng would covet.","The Han Family had already reached the top.","What else could he want?","There were things that would have to be analyzed in detail if it were someone else.","But when it came to Han Zhuofeng, there was nothing to be analyzed.","Without waiting for Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu to say anything, Xie Jiling said, “The elders of the Han Family also knew about my job. I went to the family home yesterday because Han Family’s Grandma asked me to see if there was anything wrong there.”","Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu were not as naive as Xie Jiling.","When they heard that, the two instantly realized that Old Mrs. Han didn’t really ask Xie Jiling to look at the house. It was just an excuse for her to come and visit the family house.","It was just that Xie Jiling was naive and unsuspecting.","“Now that you said that, we don’t have any reason to oppose,” said Xie Tongyun.","After he was done speaking, she was pushed away by Gu Yingsu.","Xie Tongyun said to Gu Yingsu, “I’m not wrong. Look, Han Zhuofeng has his own business already. As a director, our family’s influence can’t even compare to the Han Family’s influence. His Han Corporation is enough to help him; he doesn’t even need us.”","“And his family already knows about Jiling’s job. This...” Xie Tongyun felt that their family already knew and clearly did not mind their family business.","Gu Yingsu asked softly, “Jiling, they know about your job but do they really know what you do? Does Han Zhuofeng know what he has to face by being together with you?”","“He knows,” said Xie Jiling, “Did my brother not tell you? He exorcised with us before.”","Xie Jiwen hadn’t told them that.","“Before?” Gu Yingsu was surprised.","“The first time was because there was an actress in his production crew who invited a fox spirit and something went wrong. I went to deal with it while he stood at the side watching. The second time was when he went to shoot a film in Tacheng. He was afraid that there would be something evil there, so he asked me to have a look.”","Gu Yingsu was speechless. “...”","She did not expect Han Zhuofeng to be so adaptive and accepting.","He even took the initiative to ask Xie Jiling to have a look.","“In the end, something did go wrong. It happened in Ghost Town. I wanted to stay there alone at night to wait, but Han Zhuofeng was worried, so he insisted on staying and waiting with me. Back then, he already knew what he would face.”","“So now, he’s even clearer about what he will face if he were together with me. He is not just all talk; he does what he says as well,” said Xie Jiling.","“He’s not the man who hurt cousin. That man is good at talking, but he has never really seen it before. When Cousin was exorcizing, he had never been there. Whatever he knew came from what Cousin told him.”","“And because Cousin was worried that he would be scared, she told him in a not-so-terrifying way. As such, he never really understood what she was doing. But after facing it once, he broke down and couldn’t take it.”","“He enjoyed the benefits that the Xie Family had brought him while he hated Cousin for making his normal life disappear,” said Xie Jiling, “But Han Zhuofeng is not like that.”","“He does not need to depend on the Xie Family. As for what I need to face, he is very clear about it,” said Xie Jiling.","“Mom, if you still have doubts about him, it’s fine. When he’s done with his work, I’ll bring him back for you to have look yourself,” said Xie Jiling.","Gu Yingsu suddenly had a thought. “You’re alone in B City, and after some time of not seeing you, I feel like you’ve grown up.”","Xie Jiling pouted. “My dorm mates always say that I’m dumb, though.”","When Gu Yingsu heard this, she laughed. “Your dorm mates are all very nice.”","“Fine, we’ll listen to you. When Han Zhuofeng is done with his work, bring him back to let us see him,” said Gu Yingsu, “You have said so many good things about him, so I hope he doesn’t disappoint us.”","“It won’t happen.” Xie Jiling had a lot of faith in Han Zhuofeng.","After hanging up, Xie Jiling told Han Zhuofeng about how her parents felt. “Don’t worry, my parents think that you’re pretty good. It’s just that my mom is still a little worried. It’s not that she’s worried about you; it’s just that she can’t be completely at ease until she sees you in person.”","“But they’re not against our relationship,” Xie Jiling told Han Zhuofeng.","Without waiting for him to answer, she immediately contacted Xie Jiwen in fury.","Xie Jiling said, “Xie Jiwen! What’s wrong with you? My love life is my private matter, and I should have told Mom and Dad myself. How can you tell them first without my permission? It’s almost like you’ve snitched on me!”","Upon seeing that message, Xie Jiwen knew that little Jiling was really angry, so he could only apologize to her.","Xie Jiwen also felt that he was at fault.","He even wanted to talk to Han Zhuofeng in the beginning.","Now, he didn’t have the courage and confidence to go to Han Zhuofeng.","“It’s my bad this time,” Xie Jiwen apologized."]},{"number":3513,"title":"Chapter 3513 Untitled","paragraphs":["3513 Untitled","Xie Jiwen said, “When I saw you guys together, I was shocked. When I think about how that brat Han Zhuofeng had bad intentions for you since the beginning, I—”","“Xie Jiwen!” Xie Jiling called his name furiously.","Xie Jiwen was speechless.","This little girl would not even let him insult Han Zhuofeng a little now?","She was actually so protective of him?","“Then you should have gone to Han Zhuofeng directly! Why did you tell Mom and Dad without telling me first?! Luckily, Han Zhuofeng told me tonight to tell Mom and Dad so that they can be prepared, or else I won’t even know!”","“If I did not make this call tonight, Mom and Dad would have had a bad impression of Han Zhuofeng!” said Xie Jiling angrily.","Xie Jiwen felt that he was at fault, so he backed down. “It’s my fault this time.”","“Hmph, I haven’t even said anything about you and Sister Kaiyin,” said Xie Jiling angrily, “You betrayed me first.”","“You don’t have to say it; I brought Kaiyin back home anyway.” Xie Jiwen was not scared at all.","Xie Jiling was speechless.","“I’m not going to talk to you anymore,” said Xie Jiling, “Anyway, in the future, you can’t just talk about my personal matters without my permission.”","“Okay, okay, I got it.” Xie Jiwen promised.","“Don’t bother Han Zhuofeng, too,” said Xie Jiling.","Although she thought about letting Han Zhuofeng face it himself.","But at the key moments, Xie Jiling still spoke for Han Zhuofeng.","“Look at how worried you are.” Since when was this little girl so worried about someone?","Xie Jiwen even felt a little jealous.","“Anyway, he’s good. Don’t you dare bully him,” warned Xie Jiling.","Xie Jiwen said, “...Fine. I’m scared of you. I won’t bother him.”","Xie Jiling was finally satisfied.","Xie Jiwen said, “But if he bullies you and makes you sad, you must tell me. I will deal with him. You can’t hide it for him.”","“You’re so good to him; if he dares to take advantage of you, that means you were deceived. I will make sure he gets punished!” said Xie Jiwen, gritting his teeth.","Xie Jiling thought about how Xie Jiwen would deal with Han Zhuofeng if the latter really took advantage of her.","Most importantly, could he even deal with it?","Han Zhuofeng was a member of the Han Family.","Xie Jiling did not speak this obvious truth.","Xie Jiling still was still very touched by Xie Jiwen’s protection.","After she was finally done talking to Xie Jiwen, she realized that Han Zhuofeng had sent her a few messages.","Xie Jiling said, “I dealt with my brother. How dare he tell my parents about us before me?”","Once again, Han Zhuofeng’s eyes only had the word ‘us’ as he rolled around his bed.","“So I told him off just now,” said Xie Jiling, “And don’t you worry, he won’t bother you anymore.”","From Xie Jiling’s words, Han Zhuofeng could figure out that Xie Jiling was spoiled by her parents since she was young.","As such, she could act like an overlord in front of Xie Jiwen, and Xie Jiwen still wouldn’t be able to do anything about her.","It wasn’t like he really couldn’t do anything; he simply pampered her.","Han Zhuofeng said unconsciously, “Jiling, I will treat you well, just like how your family pampers you. I’ll make sure you can get mad at me for little things, too.”","Xie Jiling stared at his message and felt that something was wrong. “You think that I get mad for little things?”","Han Zhuofeng immediately felt happy.","This was the start of Xie Jiling getting mad at him for little things.","“Nope, you have always been good,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Now he knew why his elder brothers liked to humor his sisters-in-law.","He did feel pretty good humoring his girlfriend like this.","The two talked back and forth like this for a while.","When they were sleepy, they went to sleep.","After talking to each other as partners, the distance between them narrowed.","Whenever Xie Jiling wasn’t so busy, she would go to the production crew for Han Zhuofeng.","But whenever she was busy, she would go to the family home.","When Han Zhuofeng’s production crew was resting, Xie Jiling would go there sometimes, while Han Zhuofeng would often return to the city as well.","Today, the production crew was on a break.","Yan Zhiqing received a message from Yan Beicheng. “I know that your production crew is taking a break, so I suggest you hurry up and return to the family home.”","Yan Zhiqing was speechless.","There were too many eyes on the production crew.","Han Zhuofeng, Shi Xiaoya and Xie Jiling...","They weren’t part of the production crew, like Han Zhuoli and Lu Man, who would definitely know when Han Zhuofeng went home.","Yan Beicheng would get a positive answer no matter who he asked.","So Yan Zhiqing and Wei Wucai returned to the family home.","This was different from the previous times. This time, he was going to marry Yan Zhiqing.","As such, he had to take things seriously when going there.","On the way, Wei Wucai took a detour to the market to buy some gifts.","Then, he went to the family home with Yan Zhiqing.","Yan Beicheng was already waiting in the family home.","This time, Wei Wucai was a little nervous.","“My brother talks harshly, but he won’t really stop us from getting married.” Yan Zhiqing wasn’t worried at all.","Her brother wouldn’t want to keep her until she was old.","“I know, but I’m still nervous,” said Wei Wucai, “This is probably my punishment for not having a sincere proposal.”","If he had a more serious proposal, he would have more confidence rather than be this nervous right now.","“Anyway, it shouldn’t be that bad,” said Yan Zhiqing as she pressed the doorbell.","Soon, the door opened.","The two entered and saw Yan Beicheng sitting on the couch like a parent, filled with an intimidating aura.","Yan Zhiqing decided to make the first move. “Brother, look at your posture; you seem more imposing than our grandfather.”","Old Mr. Yan did not fall into the trap. “Don’t drag me in. Let Xiao Cai deal with your brother.”","“The two of you, sit.” Yan Beicheng pointed at the couch opposite of him.","Yan Zhiqing said, “Grandpa, Grandma, Brother, these are gifts that Xiao Cai bought.”","Yan Beicheng let out a humph in response. “Do you really think that he can marry the one and only girl of our family with just these things?”","“...” Yan Zhiqing couldn’t help but remind her brother, “Brother, these are gifts, not dowry.”","It seemed that Yan Beicheng really wanted to make things difficult for Wei Wucai.","Yan Beicheng glared at Yan Zhiqing angrily.","After having a man, she was undermining her brother now.","Lin Chu and her aunty brought the fruits and tea over together.","Then, Lin Chu sat beside Yan Beicheng.","Yan Zhiqing let out a small sigh of relief.","It was good to have Lin Chu here.","That way, even if her brother wanted to make things difficult, he shouldn’t cross the line.","Why?","He wanted to protect his reputation in front of Lin Chu.","Yan Beicheng complained about her.","He was the same!","“Brother, I think that it’s not about the ceremony but about the sincerity. I could see Xiao Cai’s sincerity,” said Yan Zhiqing.","Yan Beicheng immediately rolled his eyes. “The fact that his proposal isn’t sincere enough means that he just thought of proposing at the last minute.”"]},{"number":3514,"title":"Chapter 3514 Untitled","paragraphs":["3514 Untitled","“That’s sincerity?” said Yan Beicheng furiously.","“It was pretty good. It was natural as well. We felt that the time was right, and we were talking about it, so we brought it up. It was the same as discussing other things.”","“I feel that it’s even more sincere than those carefully planned. Proposals that are carefully planned and done in public, the girl won’t be able to choose otherwise if she says no, even though she isn’t really willing. And if she says no, she will be worried about your reputation as there are so many people watching.”","“I think that private discussions are pretty good. If both parties think it’s good, and they agreed, then they should go and get the rings together,” said Yan Zhiqing.","Yan Beicheng couldn’t say anything.","Everything that he wanted to say was blocked off by this little girl.","Did she want to marry so badly?","Yan Zhiqing was feeling impatient. “Brother, do you accept or not?! Otherwise, are you going to keep me here until I’m old?”","“Go, go, go.” Yan Beicheng was frustrated. “Look at how badly you want to marry. Watch out when Xiao Cai controls you in the future.”","Wei Wucai knew that Yan Beicheng said it to him on purpose.","Wei Wucai said, “No, why would I control her? Would I even remain human if I do that?”","“I have wronged Zhiqing by not having a proper proposal. However, I will always remember that even so, Zhiqing was willing to marry me. Even if I didn’t give her a proposal that others would be jealous of, she did not mind.”","“I feel regretful as well. When others talk about their proposal, they can talk about all kinds of wonderful things, but when it’s Zhiqing’s turn, whether it’s brought up by friends or when she’s being interviewed, what can she say? Can she say that it’s when I asked her all of a sudden while I was driving?”","“But even then, she said yes to me. She didn’t show even a hint of unhappiness. She even told me repeatedly that it was a really good proposal and that she didn’t like a too ceremonial proposal. I don’t know whether she was trying to comfort me or she really thought so.”","“If she really thought so, I think about whether she would be happy if I gave her a grand proposal, and the answer is no, she won’t be happy,” said Wei Wucai.","Yan Zhiqing opened her mouth, but she didn’t say anything in the end.","Wei Wucai then said, “But even then, she still accepted my proposal without any dissatisfaction. She did not say even a word against me.”","“She’s so nice, so why would I want to control her? Just because of what I had done, I don’t think that our status in our relationship has changed. It’s still the same with both sides equal.”","“I will only treat her better. I will constantly think about how badly I treated her and treat her even better.” Wei Wucai looked at Yan Beicheng in a serious and solemn way. “You don’t have to worry about these things.”","“If I go against the promise that I made today and treated Zhiqing badly, I will allow you to deal with me, and I won’t fight back,” said Wei Wucai.","Yan Beicheng looked at Wei Wucai in silence for a while, and then he said, “What you said today makes sense.”","“However, promises are all empty. I’ll just look at your actions,” said Yan Beicheng, “We can support Zhiqing. If you don’t do well, Wei Zhiqian won’t help you as well.”","“Of course.” Wei Wucai chuckled.","“In our family, other than my daughter, she’s the only lady. My daughter is still young, so she doesn’t need to worry about all these things. Zhiqing wasn’t really with us when she was still young, and back then, our relationship wasn’t as close as well. I’m pretty sure you already know about her past.”","“I know.” Wei Wucai nodded. “There were times when she was stubborn and made others unhappy, but even then, in terms of right and wrong, she has never been vague about it.”","“I am not asking you to dig out her bad past,” said Yan Beicheng, “I’m just telling you that she had always been stubborn. When Zhiqing became close to us, her stubborn nature is still there.”","“Of course, we have already gotten used to her stubbornness. After all, she’s the only young lady in the family,” said Yan Beicheng.","Yan Zhiqing pouted as she sat opposite Yan Beicheng.","Yan Beicheng said, “So after you guys are married, and she’s still stubborn, send her back here. If she doesn’t go with your plan and argues with you, or when she’s being unreasonable, send her back here as well.”","“We can teach her, but you can’t. You won’t allow you to scold her after all, let alone hurt her,” said Yan Beicheng.","Wei Wucai immediately frowned. “I think you’re insulting me.”","Yan Beicheng laughed and said, “I know you’re not the type to do that but let’s be candid here...”","“If she does not make you happy anymore, or if you don’t like her anymore, send her back. She’s a lady of our Yan Family,” said Yan Beicheng.","“Brother.” Tears welled up in Yan Zhiqing’s eyes. She was touched by what Yan Beicheng said.","“What?” Yan Beicheng smiled. “Actually, you don’t need to be in such a rush to marry. Even if you don’t marry for your whole life, you really think that I can’t afford to take care of you?”","“What are you saying?!” Wei Wucai was anxious.","He was afraid that his wife would vanish.","Since the intended effect had already appeared, Yan Beicheng stopped talking.","“Alright, I said everything that I needed to say. You guys should get started on the wedding preparations,” said Yan Beicheng.","“We plan to return to the family home in the afternoon again to tell my mom and Old Mrs. Wei. Then, we’ll discuss the wedding with them.”","The groom’s side was in charge of the wedding.","Yan Beicheng wasn’t worried about it.","“Then, how about you stay here for lunch?” said Old Mrs. Yan.","“That’s what we had in mind,” Yan Zhiqing said with a smile.","Wei Wucai finally passed Yan Beicheng’s test, which made Yan Zhiqing let out a sigh of relief.","In the afternoon, the two went to the family home.","Wei Wucai’s parents also went there as well.","Old Mrs. Wei was overjoyed. “I didn’t think that our family and the Yan Family had an affinity.”","After that, she and Old Mrs. Yan would be official sisters.","Yan Zhiqing did not care about the day on which they would get their marriage certificate sorted out.","However, for the wedding, Old Mrs. Wei still looked at the Lunar Almanac.","After deciding on a good day, they immediately contacted Yan Beicheng and asked Sheng Yue to reserve the best banquet hall on that day.","Old Mrs. Wei gave it a thought and called Old Mrs. Yan.","Upon answering Old Mrs. Wei’s call, Old Mrs. Yan asked, “What happened?”","“Xiao Cai and Zhiqing are here,” said Old Mrs. Wei.","“I know...” Old Mrs. Yan thought that Old Mrs. Wei was trying to show off to her.","Unexpectedly, Old Mrs. Wei sighed and said, “My family’s Qian Zi is a good-for-nothing. After knowing that Zhuofeng got into a relationship and that Xiao Cai’s proposal was successful, he escaped to Europe straight away.”","Old Mrs. Wei was the first one to know about such a thing.","After knowing that Wei Wucai’s proposal was successful and Han Zhuofeng had gotten into a relationship...","Old Mrs. Wei immediately went to look for Wei Zhiqian."]},{"number":3515,"title":"Chapter 3515 Untitled","paragraphs":["3515 Untitled","Unexpectedly, she could not get through to Wei Zhiqian’s phone.","However, Old Mrs. Wei was not someone who gave up easily.","She immediately called Wei Zhiqian’s assistant, Mu Chengfeng.","It was such a coincidence!","She could not get through to Mu Chengfeng’s phone as well!","Old Mrs. Wei persevered and called the company.","Obviously, nobody picked up Wei Zhiqian’s and Mu Chengfeng’s landline phones.","So it was transferred to the secretarial office’s landline.","It was only now that Old Mrs. Wei realized that Wei Zhiqian had gone to Europe early in the morning.","He said he was going on a business trip.","But how could Old Mrs. Wei not guess the truth?","That good-for-nothing! In addition to being ignorant about self-improvement, he even ran away!","However, it seemed that he hadn’t calculated how long he could hide.","He still had to return one day!","Could he really hide outside for a few years?","However, it was impossible for him to hide for a few years.","Even if he was really hiding outside.","When the time for Wei Wucai to get married arrived, he still had to come back.","As expected, after Old Mrs. Wei said this, Old Mrs. Yan also knew Wei Zhiqian very well.","She immediately said, “He went into hiding?”","Old Mrs. Wei was furious, obviously not at Old Mrs. Yan, but at Wei Zhiqian.","“Let’s not say anything. Xiao Cai getting married is our Wei Family’s joyful event. I can finally walk with confidence when I go out. I won’t be scared even if I face the Han Family and the others,” said Old Mrs. Wei.","“However, Zhuofeng is so good at such a young age. My family still has one left.” Old Mrs. Wei let out a deep sigh.","“I don’t have enough confidence to face the Han Family!” Old Mrs. Wei humphed. “The Han Family will definitely show off to me.”","“If she comes to me alone, I’ll let it go. Since my Qian Zi is so disappointing, I have to endure it,” said Old Mrs. Wei.","“But when we are together, you have to help me.” Old Mrs. Wei finally spoke her true intentions. “We’re family now, so we’re the closest pals.”","Great!","Old Mrs. Wei also tried her best.","Because of Wei Zhiqian, not only was she worried, she had to make alliances.","Old Mrs. Yan smiled and said, “Fine, we’re family now, so I’ll definitely help you.”","As for how Old Mrs. Wei would face Old Mrs. Han’s cruel bragging later, it shouldn’t be discussed.","***","After half a month, Han Zhuofeng’s production crew was finally done filming.","This was his first time experiencing such a long shooting. It was rare for the others in the production crew to experience a project as long as this.","The moment they were done, everyone’s strings of tension broke. Everyone was exhausted.","The shooting took more than a year.","From the studying, preparation, and trial and error in the early stages...","For the actual shooting, when they looked for good scenic views in various locations.","The more natural and spectacular a place was, the harder it was to film there.","And they had to prevent some modern buildings from affecting the filming.","So they tried to choose places that were more remote without a lot of people.","In some places, it wasn’t convenient to travel back and forth from the hotel, so they had to set up tents at the shooting location.","By the time they were done, everyone had gotten skinnier.","They felt like they were going to break down.","Now that they could finally relax, they wouldn’t be able to return to their peak state within two to three days.","Han Zhuofeng had to go to the Xie Family.","The others were completely done with their work.","They still had to make the cuts and edits in the late stages, so Han Zhuofeng gave them a seven-day holiday.","He could also use this time to go to the Xie Family’s home with Xie Jiling.","At night, the production crew organized a wrap party.","Han Zhuofeng gave the production crew red packets.","For this shooting that lasted for more than a year, everyone had put in a lot of effort.","Although he did not know what would be the results when the movie was released, he still had to give out red packets.","The wrap party was conducted at Sheng Yue.","Xie Jiling also joined the party.","She did not want to join the fun at first...","After all, she hadn’t sacrificed anything for the shooting.","However, Han Zhuofeng insisted that she joined as a family member.","What else could Xie Jiling say?","At night, the wrap party ended pretty late.","The intense and difficult shooting was finally done.","Everyone relaxed...","During the shooting, they would have to work from dawn to dusk.","To ensure that their condition wouldn’t get affected, they didn’t dare to drink any alcohol.","Even on the day Han Zhuofeng got into a relationship, everyone had a maximum of one bottle only.","Now, the pressure from work had disappeared.","They didn’t have to wake up early to prepare for work the next day. As such, everyone completely relaxed.","They drank until they got drunk.","As the director, Han Zhuofeng couldn’t be absent, let alone leave early.","“I booked a ticket for the day after tomorrow. We’ll leave in the morning, and including the time on the road, we’ll reach your house at night,” said Han Zhuofeng to Xie Jiling during the party.","“Actually, I want to leave tomorrow, but looking at how we’re drinking tonight, I’m worried that I’ll have a hangover and won’t be in a good condition. If I went to your house in such a condition, I’ll leave a bad impression on the elders,” said Han Zhuofeng.","He was already controlling himself tonight.","However, he couldn’t stop the production crew from giving him a toast. He couldn’t refuse to drink as well.","“Mmhmm. I actually think that tomorrow would be too much of a rush. After shooting this film for so long, you haven’t had the time to rest,” said Xie Jiling, “You can take the time to rest for a while tomorrow.”","“Oh yeah, it’s eight o’clock now. Your dormitory locks the door at ten, right?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling nodded. Han Zhuofeng then said, “Then let me send you back to school first. after that, I’ll come back to accompany them.”","“That’s so troublesome. I can just go back myself,” said Xie Jiling.","Eight o’clock was still early.","“Listen to me. With me here, how can I rest assured to let you go back alone?” He couldn’t even ask someone else to send her back.","“Wait,” said Han Zhuofeng, “Let me call a taxi.”","Han Zhuofeng didn’t call the chauffeur from home.","It was all because he had no idea when he would get to stop drinking.","It wouldn’t be nice to make the chauffeur wait for a long time.","Anyway, it was very convenient to get a taxi nowadays. A chauffeur wasn’t necessary to come here.","As he was saying this, Han Zhuofeng opened an app and hailed a taxi.","Moments after, a driver accepted it and called back, saying that he would arrive in four minutes.","Han Zhuofeng told everyone.","“Director Han, you must return.”","“Don’t worry,” said Han Zhuofeng, “You guys better not be passed out when I return.”","“Hahaha! Don’t worry, we’ll wait for you,” said everyone.","Han Zhuofeng left with Xie Jiling.","Right after they went out, the taxi arrived.","After sending Xie Jiling to the school entrance, Han Zhuofeng got out together.","Han Zhuofeng told the driver, “Can you wait for a while? You charge me. I’ll just send her in.”","“Yo, your girlfriend is so young?” The driver gave Han Zhuofeng a thumbs up.","This brother had skills!"]},{"number":3516,"title":"Chapter 3516 Untitled","paragraphs":["3516 Untitled","“Sure. I will be waiting here,” said the driver.","Han Zhuofeng then walked with Xie Jiling inside.","They arrived at the school at 8:45 PM, so it was still early.","The weather this season was cold rather than cold.","Many couples could be seen together on campus.","Xie Jiling and Han Zhuofeng stepped into the campus and saw young couples everywhere.","Han Zhuofeng let out a sigh of relief as he said, “Thank goodness I sent you back.”","“Why?” Xie Jiling was confused.","Han Zhuofeng didn’t answer right away. He held Xie Jiling’s hand before saying, “Otherwise, I wouldn’t have the chance to walk around here with you.”","“We’re just like these classmates.” Han Zhuofeng lowered his head as he stared at Xie Jiling and said, “I can hold your hand and walk around on campus as well.”","Xie Jiling thought about it and agreed that it felt good.","She wouldn’t have to be jealous if she saw so many couples while she was walking here.","After all, her boyfriend was with her.","After walking for a while, Xie Jiling suddenly realized an issue. “If you walked me back to my dormitory building, will you be fine walking by yourself? It’s already dark.”","When Han Zhuofeng heard that, he realized something wrong.","He felt that things weren’t as simple as what Xie Jiling had said.","After a few seconds, Han Zhuofeng finally had a moment of enlightenment. He immediately said, “Although I’m scared of vengeful ghosts, I’m not scared of the dark.”","Han Zhuofeng paused immediately after finishing the sentence. He asked with uncertainty, “There isn’t anything... weird on your campus, right?” ”","“No...” Xie Jiling shook her head.","Of course, a vengeful ghost could still invade this region.","However, Xie Jiling decided not to scare Han Zhuofeng.","He had the protective jade with him, so he wouldn’t have to be scared if he encountered anything.","Han Zhuofeng walked Xie Jiling to the ground floor of the dormitory building.","He couldn’t go inside the girl’s dormitory building.","“I’m going back. Go back to the hotel. I know you’re happy tonight, but you should avoid drinking too much.” Xie Jiling instructed.","“Alright,” Han Zhuofeng said, If I’m still awake by the time we’re done, I’ll send you a WeChat message. I won’t be able to message you if I get too drunk anyway.”","Considering the members of the production crew, Xie Jiling had a feeling that her instruction for Han Zhuofeng to drink less would be useless.","“By the way, where are you going to stay today?” Xie Jiling asked.","“I’m going back to the house my brother gave me.” Han Zhuofeng said, “I’m worried that I will disturb my grandparents if I go home too late.”","Han Zhuofeng suddenly thought of something and asked, “Are you thinking about visiting me?”","“I don’t have anything to do tomorrow, so I can come to visit you.” Xie Jiling didn’t think much.","She had no idea what it meant to go to her boyfriend’s house by herself.","However, Han Zhuofeng wouldn’t really do anything to her.","However, it didn’t stop him from imagining things out of boredom.","“Alright.” Han Zhuofeng thought about it and said, “Pass me your phone.”","Xie Jiling gave him her phone and saw Han Zhuofeng write down six numbers on her phone’s notepad.","“This is the password. If I’m still asleep tomorrow, you can just head inside.” Han Zhuofeng said, “I will register your fingerprint tomorrow. This way, you can just scan your fingerprint when you visit again in the future.”","“Alright.” Xie Jiling nodded and said, “I’m going upstairs now.”","“Alright.” Han Zhuofeng watched as she moved farther away.","But then, Xie Jiling suddenly rushed back after she had turned away and walked a few steps toward her.","She tiptoed and quickly pecked Han Zhuofeng on the lips. She blushed as she said, “Goodnight kiss. Goodbye.”","Xie Jiling didn’t wait for Han Zhuofeng’s response. She seemed to be worried that he might pull her back because she quickly ran away.","Han Zhuofeng froze. He stretched his hand up and touched his lips.","He barely drank any before he came here. But why did he already feel drunk?","Han Zhuofeng’s brain was blank as he made his way out of campus. He got into the taxi and was driven back to Sheng Yue.","The moment Xie Jiling stepped into her room, she saw Ren Linna and the others dashing back into the room from the balcony.","“We all saw it!” Ren Linna showed a flirtatious expression as she proceeded to wink at Xie Jiling.","“A certain someone walked away and ran back to give someone a kiss!” Kuang Xiaorou was so excited that she rolled her eyes.","“He walked you back while holding your hand. You must have bumped into a lot of couples, right? Does it feel good to be among the couples with your boyfriend?” Feng Yaqing said. As she thought about the scene, she felt so embarrassed and started shuddering as she covered her face.","Xie Jiling was speechless.","Xie Jiling decided to counter their jokes with an open mind. “It felt great. I’m going to wash up now and get in bed. I’m going to wait for his message.”","With that, she took her pajamas out and went to the bathroom.","***","Han Zhuofeng had truly drunk a little too much.","He felt dizzy as he went back to his house.","He was still thinking about Xie Jiling. No matter how drunk he was, he couldn’t forget about Xie Jiling.","He was so drunk that he barely had the energy to wash up, but he kept thinking about when Xie Jiling might arrive tomorrow.","If she were to come early and he was still asleep.","It wouldn’t be good if Xie Jiling saw how smelly and dirty he looked.","As such, he pulled himself up and went to the bathroom.","He couldn’t shower, but he washed his face and brushed his teeth.","He then crashed on the bed.","He took his phone and found Xie Jiling’s WeChat. “I’m home. I drank a little too much. I’m going to sleep. Good night.”","Xie Jiling felt assured after receiving the WeChat message. She replied, “Good night,” and slept as well.","The next morning, Xie Jiling headed to Han Zhuofeng’s house after she had eaten breakfast.","With the passcode that Han Zhuofeng had saved on her phone, she successfully opened the door.","The house was really quiet.","She could hear someone’s faint snoring.","The door to Han Zhuofeng’s room was ajar. It wasn’t closed.","Xie Jiling popped her head through the ajar door and saw that Han Zhuofeng was still sleeping.","Xie Jiling decided not to disturb him.","She didn’t know when he would wake up.","And so, she left the house.","She walked around the places nearby and found a restaurant that specialized in breakfast.","She bought buns and soymilk. Even if such food and drinks turned cold, they could heat it up, and it wouldn’t taste horrible.","She didn’t know how much Han Zhuofeng could eat. She pondered and decided to buy three drawers of dumplings.","Each drawer of dumplings was of a different flavor.","When she went back to Han Zhuofeng’s house, Han Zhuofeng was still asleep.","Xie Jiling left the breakfast in the kitchen.","She then went to the living room and sat on the sofa. She wore her headphones and watched a show.","She waited until almost noon.","Yet, Han Zhuofeng still showed no signs of waking up. Xie Jiling felt really bored.","She wanted to take a look at Han Zhuofeng again.","She leaned on the doorframe and hesitated as she popped her head through the ajar door. Like a cat that had confirmed that the surroundings were safe, she stepped into Han Zhuofeng’s room.","The window to Han Zhuofeng’s room was slightly opened.","Therefore, the room barely smelled of alcohol. The smell of the alcohol had already disappeared, thanks to the ventilation.","When Xie Jiling sat on the carpet next to the bed and leaned closer to Han Zhuofeng, she noticed the smell of alcohol.","But it was just the smell of alcohol. There were no other smells.","“Are you not going to wake up?” Xie Jiling stared at Han Zhuofeng for a moment."]},{"number":3517,"title":"Chapter 3517 Untitled","paragraphs":["3517 Untitled","Han Zhuofeng did not seem like he was going to wake up anytime soon.","Xie Jiling used her index finger to press on Han Zhuofeng’s nose tip. She pressed it down and then lifted it up.","All of a sudden, Han Zhuofeng’s high-bridged nose became a pig’s nose.","Xie Jiling was dumbfounded.","!!","She immediately took her phone and took a picture.","Then, she poked Han Zhuofeng’s cheeks.","She extended her hand and swiped her fingertip lightly along his eyebrows. She thought that it was fun, so she kept doing it until his eyebrows became messy.","Then, she did the same to his eyelashes.","Han Zhuofeng was asleep, but it was not like he lost his senses.","Finally, he was awakened by her. He reached out his hand suddenly and grabbed Xie Jiling’s wrist.","His movement was too quick that Xie Jiling could not even react to it.","Her wrist was grabbed by Han Zhuofeng.","Instinctively, Xie Jiling wanted to withdraw her hand.","Han Zhuofeng was even quicker. Without even opening her eyes, he applied force and pulled Xie Jiling onto the bed.","Han Zhuofeng turned to his side and pulled her into his arms. “Naughty.”","Xie Jiling was speechless.","When they were at Tacheng, Han Zhuofeng said he was afraid and insisted to sleep with her.","The second time that Han Zhuofeng was so scared that he had to sleep on the same bed as her, the two divided it clearly.","Neither of them crossed the line.","But it was different this time...","Xie Jiling was tightly embraced by Han Zhuofeng.","She was unsure if Han Zhuofeng was really awake. He lowered his head and kissed her on the lips.","Then, he kissed her forehead before he continued sleeping.","He left Xie Jiling blushing and her heart racing.","She could not stay calm in Han Zhuofeng’s arms.","Han Zhuofeng, on the other hand, fell asleep comfortably, and nobody knew when he would wake up.","Xie Jiling thought that she shouldn’t have entered this room.","Now that she was embraced by him, she could not do anything.","She would rather watch TV shows in the living room.","Xie Jiling had a mindset of having nothing to live for in her life as she closed her eyes, but she couldn’t sleep.","She could only wait until Han Zhuofeng woke up.","Fortunately, Xie Jiling had disturbed him.","As such, Han Zhuofeng’s sleep wasn’t that deep.","After around one hour, he woke up on his own.","He saw that Xie Jiling was in his arms. It was no wonder he felt so comfortable hugging her.","“You’re finally awake.” Xie Jiling let out a sigh of relief.","Just when she was about to get up, she was embraced tightly by Han Zhuofeng.","Even if Han Zhuofeng was awake, she could not get up!","“Get up!” Xie Jiling rushed him. “I even bought you breakfast. I didn’t think you would sleep until this late.”","“Just heat it up later.” Han Zhuofeng was not picky about food.","He had already been through such tough times in the production crew, so if he remained picky, he would be pretentious.","“Why did you come in?” Han Zhuofeng was happy as he rubbed his cheek against Xie Jiling’s cheek.","Xie Jiling’s face seemed like it would change shape from the way he was squeezing it.","“Haih, your beard!” shouted Xie Jiling.","Han Zhuofeng immediately moved his face away. He saw that Xie Jiling’s cheek was red after being rubbed by his stubble.","Xie Jiling reached out her hand and touched his chin. “It’s so sharp.”","Han Zhuofeng also touched it himself.","It was indeed a little sharp.","Xie Jiling took this chance to get up.","“Wash up; you smell like alcohol,” complained Xie Jiling.","Han Zhuofeng immediately smelled himself and asked Xie Jiling anxiously, “Are you going to hate me because I smell bad?”","What would he do if he lost the girlfriend that he had just gotten?","Xie Jiling was dumbfounded. Why would he think about that?","“No, why do you ask?” Xie Jiling was surprised.","Han Zhuofeng let out a sigh of relief. “That’s good. I was scared that you’ll hate me.”","Han Zhuofeng made a promise immediately. “This is a special occasion. I don’t usually drink, don’t worry.”","“Actually, I don’t really like people who drink. It’s not like they can’t drink at all; I just don’t like people who have no self-control when drinking and would get very drunk every time they drink,” said Xie Jiling.","Han Zhuofeng immediately said, “I don’t like people like them, too.”","“Our family doesn’t really like drinking,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling could not hold back her laughter. How could Han Zhuofeng be so cute?","When Han Zhuofeng confessed to her, she already liked him.","But as she spent more time with Han Zhuofeng, she realized that she was liking him more and more.","The more she spent time with him, the more she knew him better, and the more she thought that he was cute.","He was so cute, so how could people not like him?","“I’m going out first. Tidy up,” Xie Jiling said as she ran out of the room.","Han Zhuofeng also went to take a shower, wanting to wash the smell of alcohol off of him.","He was determined to erase the image of himself from before in Xie Jiling’s eyes.","After washing himself clean, he exhaled two times against his palm to ensure that there was no smell of alcohol in his mouth anymore.","Then, he went to open the windows fully so that there would be ventilation.","Although the window was opened a little before, the room still had a stuffy smell of alcohol from last night.","Xie Jiling went to the kitchen. The kitchen utensils here were complete.","Since Lin Liye stayed here before, the place was complete with everything.","When Lin Liye left, Han Zhuofeng stayed with the production crew most of the time, so he did not get his aunt to come here.","Although his aunt was not here, everything was complete.","Xie Jiling put the soy milk and steamed buns in the microwave to heat them up.","She... only knew how to use the microwave.","Back at home, other than studying, she just exorcized. She did not need to cook.","In the university, she ate at the school canteen and at the food stalls on the streets, so she had never gotten the chance to cook.","Because of this, Xie Jiling was also a newbie in the kitchen.","Luckily, she just needed to heat the food up, and she did not make any mistakes.","Xie Jiling carried the soy milk and steamed buns to the dining table.","After a short while, Han Zhuofeng also came out.","When he reappeared, he looked fresh.","He even smelled like shampoo.","He saw the breakfast on the dining table. Obviously, to Han Zhuofeng, it was considered lunch.","Han Zhuofeng sat down and dragged Xie Jiling to sit down together as well. He praised her, saying, “Wow, my girlfriend is so thoughtful.”","“If I’m home alone and without an appetite because of the hangover, I will probably not eat anything. When I feel hungry, I’ll just have food delivered to me,” said Han Zhuofeng miserably.","“It’s because you’re here that I can have a hot breakfast upon waking up,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling’s heart became soft from his words, thinking about how sad his usual days were.","Although she did not know how to cook at school, she was at least eating three meals a day.","She could go to the canteen and eat a hot breakfast, and she even had a lot of options to choose from.","If she felt lazy, she could even ask her dorm mates to bring food back for her.","Let alone lunch and dinner.,,"]},{"number":3518,"title":"Chapter 3518 Untitled","paragraphs":["3518 Untitled","But it made sense...","Han Zhuofeng was previously single, and he spent most of his time on the production crew.","After working with the production crew for so long, he would naturally be exhausted after coming back home.","Xie Jiling almost wanted to say that she would come over and help him every day.","!!","“Oh yeah, I forgot to ask you last night if you have class tomorrow.” Han Zhuofeng took a sip of the soy milk to wet his whistles.","“Nope, I don’t have class today too. It’s the weekend, so there are no classes,” said Xie Jiling.","Because of her job, the Xie Family had already talked to the school.","The school did not know where she would go or what she would do every time she asked for leave.","However, the Xie Family was able to make a few demands in school.","As such, as long as her exam results wouldn’t be affected, the school would not stop her from applying for leave halfway.","As a result, Xie Jiling would always be pretty successful every time she asked for leave.","“Then why don’t you... stay here tonight? We can go to the airport together in the morning tomorrow,” said Han Zhuofeng, “Don’t worry, there’s a guest room. I won’t do anything inappropriate.”","Besides, tomorrow was the important day of meeting her parents, so Han Zhuofeng would not dare to do anything.","“I know, but I didn’t bring anything to change. Usually, when I go home, my daily essentials will be at home as well, so I won’t need to bring any luggage back,” said Xie Jiling, “But there’s nothing here that I can use.”","“You’re right.” Han Zhuofeng took a bite of the dumplings. “I wasn’t being thoughtful.”","“How about we go back to the family home to stay a night?” suggested Han Zhuofeng again, “You don’t have to bring any luggage home anyway. I’ll pack my luggage in a bit, and let’s go to the family home.”","“While I was in the production crew, didn’t you go to the family home often? You even stayed there sometimes, so the family home has your clothes and daily essentials. You won’t have to return to the school to pack up.”","Han Zhuofeng thought that perhaps Xie Jiling did not really dare to stay with him alone.","Honestly, Han Zhuofeng was also worried about whether he could even control himself or not.","As such, returning to the family home was the safest option.","The two elders, Butler Wang and Auntie Sun, were there.","There were so many people, so Xie Jiling could also be at ease.","“I’m thinking that we can go to the airport directly tomorrow, and I won’t need to go to your school first before going to the airport,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling thought about it and felt that it was more troublesome for Han Zhuofeng to make a detour to the school.","It would waste a lot of time.,,","But Han Zhuofeng would definitely not allow her to go to the airport herself.","As such, going to the family home was the best choice.","“Okay.” Xie Jiling nodded. “Then let’s go to the family home.”","“Let’s go at night. We can eat dinner there,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling thought in her heart that if Old Mrs. Han knew that Han Zhuofeng was treating the family home like a restaurant, she would kill him.","“It’s rare that we have time to be with each other. We’re going on a date for the whole afternoon,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Otherwise, if they went to the family home early, he would not get the chance to spend time with Xie Jiling alone.","As such, after Han Zhuofeng finished his meal.","The two left to watch a movie.","There was a movie with good reviews that had just been released.","Han Zhuofeng was also going there with the mindset of learning.","It would be dinner by the time the two were done watching the movie.","Han Zhuofeng calculated the time perfectly.","Unexpectedly, when they returned to the family home, they realized that the whole family was there!","Han Dongping was very happy with Shi Xiaoya back then. Now, he was happy with Xie Jiling.","Actually, the fact that Han Dongping always valued family backgrounds had never changed.","But it was just that nobody cared about his opinion now.","Besides, although he valued family backgrounds, he would only keep it to himself.","He was smart not to voice out his opinion.","Anyway, if he did voice out, the two elders would reprimand him, and Lin Liye would ignore him.","Why should he suffer like that?","So Han Dongping learned not to voice out his opinions.","If they liked it, they would let him go.","He was just lucky that Shi Xiaoya and Xie Jiling had good family backgrounds.","Han Dongping was even happier.","Han Dongping also knew about the Xie Family, but he hadn’t met them before.","The Xie Family was so secretive.","In their social circle, a secretive family meant it was full of masters.","He did not expect his daughter-in-law to be from the Xie Family.","Furthermore, she was from the direct lineage of the Xie Family.","He did not expect Han Zhuofeng to be so capable at such a young age!","As such, when Han Zhuofeng brought Xie Jiling back, everyone was overjoyed, including Han Dongping.","“I heard that you’re meeting the Xie Family’s parents tomorrow?” asked Han Zhuoling.","Han Zhuofeng nodded.","Han Zhuoli smiled and said, “You’re so quick.”","“I learned from my brothers.” Han Zhuofeng did not show any weakness at all.","“Are you nervous?” asked Lu Man, curious.","Shi Xiaoya said, “Zhuoling didn’t look nervous before, but maybe he was hiding it.”","“I was nervous,” Han Zhuoling said to Shi Xiaoya seriously, “How could I not be nervous?”","“I’m old and was a divorcee, while you’re young and never had a partner before. You have a successful career with a good family background. You could definitely find any outstanding man, so why did you choose me? Why should your family let you marry me?” said Han Zhuoling.","“So I was very nervous and scared that father-in-law and mother-in-law won’t allow it.” Han Zhuoling smiled as if he was letting out a sigh of relief. “Luckily, they were open-minded. Since you liked me, they accepted me.”","“My parents really like you. Even before we knew each other, they always praised you. After we started dating, they also felt at ease. They did not think that there was anything bad about you,” said Shi Xiaoya.","Han Zhuofeng had an expression full of envy.","It was so good that his brother passed the test like that.","“Second Brother, what about you?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","“Your Second Brother is steadfast. The moment I met the parents, I let mother-in-law know that I’m a very dependable man. I would definitely treat Man Man well and protect her, not allowing anyone to bully her. I chased after her so that she would marry me. It’s all because of my excellent character that mother-in-law liked me from the moment we met,” said Han Zhuoli.","Lu Man tried to remember. Han Zhuoli really didn’t seem nervous back then.","“Back then, before we dated, he has met my mom already, which made my mom misunderstand our relationship. When we started dating afterward, the first time he came to visit, he called her Mom straight away.” Now that Lu Man thought about it, it was interesting.","It was from a few years ago.","They had a pair of twins now.","But when they recalled those scenes, it felt like they happened recently.","Time had flown so far, but their memories were still there.","When Lu Man thought about it, she could not help but hold on to Han Zhuoli’s arm.","She felt extremely happy that Han Zhuoli had found her.","Even though she rejected him at first, Han Zhuoli persisted and did not let her go."]},{"number":3519,"title":"Chapter 3519 Untitled","paragraphs":["3519 Untitled","Thanks to what he had done, she had the happiness that she had right now.","She loved that she could reminisce about the past.","“My Second Brother is so ahead.” Even Han Zhuofeng was surprised.","Before they started dating, he could already make her partner feel that they were dating.","!!","When they just started dating, he already called her partner’s mother as Mom.","No matter what, he was always one step ahead.","Han Zhuofeng felt that he should learn from Han Zhuoli.","Han Zhuofeng could not help but sit forward. He leaned forward and asked, “Second Brother, how did you hone your mindset so well?”","“That’s because it’s easy to talk to my mother-in-law; she’s kind, and she likes me,” said Han Zhuoli, “Don’t you know your father-in-law and mother-in-law?”","Han Zhuofeng was speechless. “...”","“I think it’s a little hard for me,” said Han Zhuofeng, “You guys also know about what happened to Jiling’s cousin.”","That day, when Xie Jiling talked about it, everyone was there.","“My mother-in-law is very concerned that Jiling will also be hurt like her cousin, so when she’s facing a son-in-law, she’s bound to be even more careful. It won’t be as easy as the mothers of my sisters-in-law,” said Han Zhuofeng, troubled.","Xie Jiling did not even know what to say.","Han Zhuofeng learned fast.","He hadn’t even met her parents yet, but he was already calling her mother as Mother-in-law. He was really treating himself like the son-in-law.","Han Zhuoli also noticed it.","The brat learned quickly in this area.","“Fine, just continue being shameless like how you are right now. Even if your mother-in-law doesn’t trust you and doesn’t like you, nothing is impossible as long as you’re shameless enough,” said Han Zhuoli.","Xie Jiling was speechless.","She was a little concerned for her mom.","For the whole night, Xie Jiling listened as Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli came up with plans for Han Zhuofeng.","How to deal with... no... how to please Han Zhuofeng’s in-laws.","Xie Jiling whispered to Han Zhuofeng, “You really don’t need to worry. When I called back home last time, my parents have actually given their consent.”","“But I’m still nervous. I have to behave well,” said Han Zhuofeng, “I’ll sleep early tonight to make sure I have energy. No, I have to sleep early tonight, then sleep even more on the plane tomorrow, so I can be fully energized when I meet the parents.”","Xie Jiling did not know if Han Zhuofeng could truly fall asleep.","Anyway, he went to his bedroom early.","It was an early flight, and they had to reach the airport ninety minutes before.","Han Zhuofeng bought first-class tickets so they did not need to queue up for security checks.","Otherwise, looking at the number of people in B City’s airport every day, just queuing up for the security checks would take at least half an hour.","Han Zhuofeng left with Xie Jiling to the airport early in the morning.","After they landed and went through twists and turns, they finally arrived at the Xie Family’s home. The sky was already dark. It was already seven o’clock.","The Xie Family really lived deep in the mountains. It was not an exaggeration at all.","If they did not know the roads and there was nobody leading them, it would be difficult to find the location of the Xie Family.","The jungle was lush. From outside, only densely packed trees could be seen; no buildings could be seen.","But after driving through it, surprisingly, there was a huge manor hidden inside.","The Chinese manor looked stylish, but as it was built in the mountains and it was already dark, it looked terrifying.","The good thing was although the manor looked ancient, the facilities inside were pretty modern.","From the entrance, it was filled with lights, reducing the scary atmosphere.","While on the way, Han Zhuofeng whispered to Xie Jiling, “Luckily you brought me here; if it were someone else, I would suspect whether they would kill me halfway.”","Xie Jiling was speechless.","It was only when Han Zhuofeng saw the illuminated Xie Family’s manor that he let out a sigh of relief.","This brightness made people rest assured.","“Luckily, they aren’t lanterns,” whispered Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling laughed because of what he said. She explained, “Our manor was passed down from ancient times, so it’s probably a few hundred years old. But don’t worry here; we’re a family of exorcists, so there’s no safer place than here.”","“It’s pretty big here, so why can’t we see anything from outside?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","“Because there’s a barrier,” explained Xie Jiling, “Since the Xie Family’s first exorcist, we have been setting up barriers outside the Xie Family’s manor. Originally, there weren’t as many exorcists here, so the barrier was not as strong as today.”","“However, generations of exorcists kept improving and strengthening the barrier, so it became bigger and covered a wider area. And as the number of Xie Family’s exorcists increased, so the Xie Family’s manor also increased in size as it was passed down from generation to generation.”","“Finally, it became what it is now. The barrier was officially formed, and we don’t even need to improve anything anymore. We just need to strengthen the barrier once every ten years.”","“This barrier, how should I put it... It’s like an invisibility hood, making the Xie Family invisible after covering it.”","“No matter how outsiders look at it, they can only see a lush forest,” said Xie Jiling.","“The road to the Xie Family is designed according to the Eight Trigrams,” explained Xie Jiling, “Together with the course, if you walk the right way, the flat road to the Xie Family will appear. However, if you walk the wrong way, the barrier will expel you immediately.”","“You will notice that you’ll suddenly appear deep in the mountains, without any roads built,” said Xie Jiling, “So without anyone leading you inside, no one will be able to find the Xie Family, let alone see it.”","“It’s so magical,” praised Han Zhuofeng, “Then, when we don’t have anything to do during these few days, come with me, and let’s try it.”","Seeing that Xie Jiling was confused, Han Zhuofeng explained, “Let’s walk the wrong way on purpose with me, I want to see the effect.”","Han Zhuofeng’s expression said that he really wanted to try. Suddenly, he thought of something and asked, “If we went the wrong way, it won’t activate any trap, right? There won’t be any danger, right?”","“You’re overthinking.” Xie Jiling laughed. Directors truly tended to overthink. “If you go the wrong way, it will just expel you, it won’t hurt anyone.”","As the two talked, they met a few people on the way.","They were all from the Xie Family.","They greeted Xie Jiling and Han Zhuofeng happily.","“Jiling, we heard about it. You’re bringing back your boyfriend!”","“Haha, your boyfriend looks pretty handsome.”","“Not bad, not bad. I told you to explore the world as well other than studying and exorcizing.”","The attitudes of these people from the Xie Family made Han Zhuofeng feel relieved.","Everyone was pretty friendly. They did not think that it was bad that he and Xie Jiling were together.","When they walked further in, a group of kids rushed out and surrounded them.","“What are you guys doing?” asked Xie Jiling, smiling, “Are you guys done with your homework? Are you done training today? How come you guys have the time to come here?”"]},{"number":3520,"title":"Chapter 3520 Untitled","paragraphs":["3520 Untitled","“We’re here to see your boyfriend!”","“We heard you got a boyfriend, so we came to see what he’s like as a person!”","A boy crossed his arms together and said, “Aside from his good looks, he seems ordinary!”","“Can you exorcise?” asked a kid.","Han Zhuofeng shook his head in an honest manner.","“Are you scared of ghosts?” asked another kid.","Han Zhuofeng nodded honestly without any hesitation.","And he was immediately despised by all the kids.","“We aren’t scared of ghosts!”","“We have all seen an exorcism.”","“I have helped stick talisman papers.”","“I have helped summon the soul reapers.”","“I have helped recite the chants.”","“I have helped serve the soul reapers.”","Han Zhuofeng was speechless. “...”","What did serving the soul reapers mean?","“I can’t exorcize, and I’m scared of ghosts, but I accompanied Jiling to exorcize before. I have greeted the soul reapers before, and I have helped burn offerings for the soul reapers,” Han Zhuofeng said, refusing to admit defeat.","In addition, he didn’t think that those words were trivial because they were said by kids.","Instead, he answered the kids in a serious manner.","Xie Jiling then said, “Alright. Don’t bully people. You have been learning to exorcise since young. Can he compete with you guys? He has only started dealing with it this year. He followed along while shouting that he was scared. How is that bad?”","The kids made a face at Han Zhuofeng and left.","Xie Jiling then said, “Don’t take it to heart. They’re just a little naughty.”","“Sure.” Han Zhuofeng was very expressive as he said, “It turns out that you’re very popular here!”","The elders, middle-aged uncles and aunties, as well as the kids were all very interested in Xie Jiling.","“Back then, when there weren’t any kids, I was the youngest. They all watched me grow up. When these kids were born, I was the one who played with them.” Xie Jiling said with a smile.","“When I had to leave for B City for school, these kids cried a lot, and they were really sad that I had to leave,” Xie Jiling said with a smile.","Han Zhuofeng held Xie Jiling’s hand. He was really curious as to what Xie Jiling looked like when she was playing with the kids.","The kids who left didn’t go back to their houses and back to their parents.","They went to see Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu.","Like a bunch of chatterboxes, they told the two what happened.","The kids were young, but they had exceptional memories.","They copied Han Zhuofeng’s expression and tone and repeated ad verbatim every word he said to Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu.","“Alright. Go and get food. It’s getting late.” Gu Suying gave them some chocolates and candies. “Make sure to eat the sweets after the meal. Don’t eat them before your meal. If you do, you won’t be able to eat properly.”","All the kids left, overjoyed.","Xie Tongyun could hear them chatting with each other.","“I’m going to save the sweets and eat them in front of the soul reaper uncles when we exorcize tonight. We’ll make them feel hungry.”","“Good idea. I will save mine as well.”","“I don’t have a practical class for exorcism tonight. I can’t eat in front of them.”","“It’s alright. Just do it next time!”","“I will eat a lollipop in front of them next time!”","Xie Tongyun was speechless. “...”","He felt as though the soul reapers were being played by these kids.","After Xie Tongyun sent these kids away, he came back.","He sat down and said to Gu Yingsu, “Zhuofeng is a good boy. At least the kids like him.”","If those kids didn’t like him, they wouldn’t have repeated Han Zhuofeng’s words ad verbatim to them.","“And he didn’t lie to the kids because they’re young. He’s quite honest and sincere,” Xie Tongyun thought that it was a positive trait.","Even though his conversation partner were kids, he remained very honest.","It seemed Han Zhuofeng was a very principled man.","“You haven’t even met him, but you’re only saying good things about him. You even keep repeating his name.” Gu Yingsu said with contempt. Even so, she still couldn’t help but smile.","Because of Han Zhuofeng’s attitude toward the kids, Gu Yingsu started to have a better impression of him.","She still remembered when Xie Jiling’s cousin, Xie Jiyun, brought that man back.","Back then, Xie Jiling was just a kid. She led a bunch of other kids and surrounded the man.","She asked similar questions to what the kids asked tonight.","But that man thought that kids didn’t know anything and could be fooled by some sweet-sounding words.","The man had no idea that the kids of the Xie Family weren’t that easily fooled.","The man’s behavior was completely different from Han Zhuofeng’s.","Han Zhuofeng was very honest. He didn’t know how to exorcize, and he was very scared of ghosts. However, he still had the desire to overcome things, and he even said that he followed along even though he had no skills and was afraid.","Therefore, Xie Jiling actually told them the truth. She hadn’t been exaggerating Han Zhuofeng’s image.","Gu Yingsu couldn’t help but be excited to meet Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiwen pulled Hu Kaiyin over.","“Are they not here yet? Why is Han Zhuofeng so slow!” Xie Jiwen said with contempt.","Hu Kaiyin secretly rolled her eyes.","After that trip, she went to Yunlin Mountain with Xie Jiwen.","But for some reason, she was dragged here by Xie Jiwen again.","Xie Jiwen told her that she could enjoy her vacation at the house of the Xie Family.","The house of the Xie Family was located in the forest. This place was full of fresh air. It was away from the hustle and bustle of the world and was considered a modern-day paradise.","In addition, no one could discover the location of the Xie Family’s house, and no one could disturb her.","The members of the Xie Family were always busy exorcizing, and the kids were always busy studying.","There would always be very few people around, and she would rarely be disturbed.","Moreover, the Xie Family’s architecture was ancient, and the southern climate was warm and humid.","A forested mountain was right out the door. Going back to the house of the Xie Family was like going back to Jiangnan town.","When one woke up in the morning, one would hear the chirps of the insects and birds as well as the rumbling noises of the valley river.","It depicted an extremely beautiful image. The scenery was like the legendary Peach Blossom Spring.","People who were too busy in the city often wished to live a life like this.","Otherwise, those ancient cities wouldn’t be so popular.","The videos of cooking done in the wild couldn’t have become so popular as well.","Not to mention the peculiarity of Hu Kaiyin’s job. Whenever she was at work, she would always be risking her life.","As such, she naturally loved a secluded and quiet life.","Obviously, she was convinced by Xie Jiwen’s words, and she followed him here.","Xie Jiwen gave her a cottage and allowed her to stay there by herself.","He even prepared a Guqin for her. It didn’t matter whether she could play the instrument or not. She could pluck it once or twice whenever she felt bored.","The courtyard was designed to be a garden.","There were streams, small waterfalls, and flowers.","There was a table and chair in the center.","Hu Kaiyin could decide how she wanted to set things up.","She could design the courtyard like it was her own house.","Hu Kaiyin fell in love with a life like this.","The place had all the amenities of the modern world, but it still had the charm and beauty of antiquity.","Whenever one woke up early in the morning, one would catch a whiff of the crisp and revitalizing scent of the nearby mountains and forests."]},{"number":3521,"title":"Chapter 3521 Untitled","paragraphs":["3521 Untitled","There was also the fresh scent of grass and the smell of earth.","The sound of a gurgling stream in the courtyard could be heard.","Birds could be seen landing on the stream to drink water.","Hu Kaiyin noticed that there was a lack of dogs and cats.","!!","If she had everything, it would be perfect.","So that was how she settled down in the house of the Xie Family.","It felt so good to stay here.","Hu Kaiyin even thought of retiring from the Mount Lan Compound.","She was close to the age of retirement anyway.","If she chose to retire, the Mount Lan Compound wouldn’t stop her.","Thanks to the income she had earned, she had enough money that she wouldn’t have to worry about running out of money, even if she didn’t work at all.","Unexpectedly, the Xie Family warmly welcomed her into their territory.","They didn’t think that there was anything wrong with her staying here.","No matter what events the Xie family had, big or small, Xie Jiwen always made sure to include Hu Kaiyin, dragging her along to every single one.","For example, Xie Jiling started dating Han Zhuofeng and brought Han Zhuofeng back to meet her parents.","This was a family meal, but Xie Jiwen brought her along.","Xie Jiwen’s parents, who were Xie Jiling’s Eldest Uncle and Aunt named Xie Tongyùn and Xu Jialin, were both here.","Xu Jialin was basically looking at Hu Kaiyin as though she was looking at her daughter-in-law.","Xu Jialin knew that Hu Kaiyin came from the Mount Lan Compound.","After all, the Xie Family had a very good relationship with the Mount Lan Compound.","They were familiar with Hu Kaiyin’s job.","In fact, they were very satisfied with her.","Hu Kaiyin was very capable and with an impressive record in battle.","She could remind steadfast during Xie Jiwen’s exorcisms.","After all, there were very few people in the world of exorcists, and there were even fewer people of suitable age.","It was almost impossible to find a partner in the world of exorcists.","It was truly rare to find someone with a big heart who was able to withstand the high stress.","They became convinced that they had to do everything to help Xie Jiwen keep Hu Kaiyin here!","Upon hearing the impatient tone in Xie Jiwen’s words, Xu Jialin smiled coldly and said, “You’re making things difficult for Han Zhuofeng. Have you thought about the future when you go home with Hu Kaiyin and meet with her parents? What if they don’t approve of you?”","Xie Jiwen didn’t know what to say.","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Xie Jiwen was the one being naughty. How did she get involved here?","While the elders weren’t watching, Hu Kaiyin glared at Xie Jiwen.","Xie Jiwen looked back at Hu Kaiyin innocently.","His mother’s words made sense. Why did she glare at him?","After a while, Xie Jiling came in with Han Zhuofeng.","Han Zhuofeng carried big and small bags of gifts.","When he came in and saw Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu, he called out sweetly, “Dad! Mom!”","Han Zhuofeng’s second elder brother had told him that he had to be as shameless as possible!","Han Zhuofeng remembered it well.","Before Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu could show any animosity, he had to be shameless!","Such actions would stun them!","Han Zhuofeng thought that his strategy was very effective.","Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu were truly stunned.","While Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu were so shocked that they couldn’t utter a single word...","Han Zhuofeng then redirected his attack on Xie Tongyùn and Xu Jialin.","“You two must be Eldest Uncle and Eldest Aunt!” Han Zhuofeng greeted enthusiastically.","Xie Tongyùn was indeed someone who had experienced a lot of things in life.","While Han Zhuofeng was being really shameless, Xie Tongyùn turned around and said to Xie Jiwen, “Did you see that? You should copy that shamelessness! And do the same to your father-in-law and mother-in-law!”","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Was it really appropriate to discuss how to handle her parents in front of her?","Pfft!","No!","She should have asked what they meant by Xie Jiwen’s father-in-law and mother-in-law.","Hu Kayin was at a loss for words.","Han Zhuofeng was speechless. “...”","He felt as though Xie Tongyùn was criticizing him.","But then, Xie Tongyùn also said that Xie Jiwen should learn from him.","Was Xie Tongyùn complimenting him or criticizing him?","Han Zhuofeng decided to continue being shameless as he placed the gift down.","Gu Yingsu recovered from her shock and asked politely, “Why did you bring so many things with you?”","“I should.” Han Zhuofeng said.","“I asked Xie Jiling about your preferences and bought some items based on her recommendations. I wasn’t sure if you would like them, but I didn’t know the preferences of Xie Jiling’s future sister-in-law either. So, I asked my two sisters-in-law what girls generally like as gifts,” Han Zhuofeng explained.","“I purchased these items at the suggestion of my sisters-in-law, so I’m not sure if Xie Jiling’s future sister-in-law will like them,” Han Zhuofeng said.","Xie Jiwen was stupefied.","Han Zhuofeng smiled confidently.","Noob. Someone who didn’t even dare to confess wanted to compete with me?","Immediately, Xie Jiwen came back to his senses and thought that Han Zhuofeng had done a good job.","This boy knew the right thing to do!","He wouldn’t stop him from dating Xie Jiling anymore.","Xie Jiling didn’t expect Xie Jiwen to abandon her for the sake of his future wife!","The corner of Hu Kaiyin’s eyes kept twitching.","Han Zhuofeng was so shameless.","He was pleasing everyone and wasn’t scared of offending her!","What sister-in-law?","Xu Jilin made a face at Gu Yingsu.","You have a very capable son-in-law!","Gu Yingsu was speechless. “...”","She didn’t know what to say.","She could no longer ask questions.","Then, Han Zhuofeng said, “Dad, Mom, Uncle, and Aunt, I’m sorry for arriving so late and for making you all wait this long.”","“It’s alright. It’s alright.” Xie Tongyun chuckled like a good old man and said, “I checked Jiling’s social media. You left early in the morning. Our house is just too far away. It’s already considered early for you all to get here at this hour.”","“Sit. Sit.” Xie Tongyun said, “You traveled far, so you must be very tired.”","“Zhuofeng is more tired than me. He carried all the luggage,” Xie Jiling said.","Han Zhuofeng was shocked as he looked at Xie Jiling and asked, “Is that something to be praised?”","Xie Jiling felt speechless.","It was no surprise that the director’s acting skills had also improved from watching his actors.","Xie Tongyun laughed and said, “Our Jiling is very used to traveling by herself whenever she’s on the job. She normally carries her own luggage, but now, she has someone helping her.”","“As long as I am here, Jiling will never have to move a finger,” Han Zhuofeng said, “I have thought about it carefully. Unless I’m in the middle of filming, I will follow her around whenever she has to travel and be on the job..”","Gu Yingsu was very curious as she asked, “I heard you’re scared of those things?”","“I’m scared. But with Jiling, I’m safe. It’s the same as watching a horror movie. You know it’s fake and that nothing will happen to you, but you still can’t help but feel afraid. Therefore, I will be fine if I’m with Jiling.”","“Although I can’t help with anything, I can still stay with her. In addition, I’m being protected by the jade she gave me, so I won’t be a burden to her.” Han Zhuofeng said.","“So you’ve seen those things many times already?” Xie Tongyun asked.","“Not many times. Only a total of two times.” Han Zhuofeng scratched his head and said, “But I should get used to those things down the road, so I won’t be afraid of them anymore in the future.”"]},{"number":3522,"title":"Chapter 3522 Untitled","paragraphs":["3522 Untitled","“Staying with Jiling meant this will happen often and unexpectedly. Vengeful spirits could appear in front of you two at any time. And it could happen when you aren’t mentally prepared, which means you’ll be scared,” Gu Yingsu said.","“It’s fine if it happened once or twice. But if it happened frequently? Will you have the patience to continue on?” Gu Yingsu asked worriedly.","“You must be talking about her cousin’s ex-husband, right?” Han Zhuofeng asked.","Gu Yingsu looked over at Xie Jiling in surprise.","!!","She didn’t expect that Xie Jiling had already told Han Zhuofeng about it.","“I already told him,” Xie Jiling said.","“Actually, before we started dating, Grandma knew that I liked Jiling, and she intentionally used an excuse to get Jiling to visit the family home. Her actual intention was to chat with Jiling.” Han Zhuofeng explained with a smile.","Xie Jiling said in surprise, “Grandma... she wasn’t asking me to see if there’s anything dirty in the house?”","“You’re still going to do it when you arrive at the house anyway,” Han Zhuofeng explained. He then turned and said to Xie Tongyun and the others, “Xie Jiling is so innocent. It’s great.”","Xie Tongyun and the others were speechless.","What was the point of us being here if you took every chance to compliment her?","“At that time, our family already knew about Jiling’s job. Grandma just wanted to ask if Jiling liked anyone. If she had no one she liked, then Grandma will get Jiling to like me.”","“What if she did have someone else she likes?” Xu Jialin couldn’t help but ask.","“Well, I would try my best to kick that person away and get Jiling to like me,” Han Zhuofeng said.","Xu Jialin was speechless.","Xu Jialin felt as though words couldn’t express how she felt right now as she turned around and looked at Xie Jiwen.","He’s younger than you but look at the tricks up his sleeve!","Xu Jialin suddenly didn’t want to look at this son of hers.","Xie Jiwen was speechless.","Xie Jiling’s eyes widened as she looked at Han Zhuofeng in shock.","Was that really what he thought?","“My family loves Jiling, and they know about her situation. They aren’t worried about me,” Han Zhuofeng said.","The Xie Family had never interacted with the members of the Han Family before, so they wouldn’t know how the Han Family usually behaved.","Han Zhuofeng then said, “Dad. Mom. If you’re free, would you like to set up a meeting with my family?”","Han Zhuofeng immediately wanted to put in the work for it. “I’ll be staying here for a few days. If you’re free these few days, why don’t you come with us when Jiling and I leave?”","“The elders of the two families can take the chance to sit down and chat with each other. You can get to know the Han Family and me more. This way, you will feel less concerned about Jiling’s relationship with me, right?” Han Zhuofeng said.","Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu exchanged glances.","And they had been set up just like that?","Xu Jialin was so envious as she looked at Han Zhuofeng.","Han Zhuofeng’s reactions were great and fast. He was consistently pulling tricks out of his sleeves.","Remarkable.","Were all the kids of the Han Family this remarkable?","She instantly saw Han Zhuofeng as the remarkable child of another family.","She then turned around and looked at her son Xie Jiwen.","Comparing Xie Jiwen to Han Zhuofeng, she should disown Xie Jiwen.","Xie Jiwen couldn’t handle it anymore.","Ever since Han Zhuofeng’s visit today, the way his mom looked at him changed.","There was contempt.","There was dislike.","Had he not brought her future daughter-in-law back for her?","Xie Jiwen was so angry that he wanted to lash out at Han Zhuofeng.","But before Xie Jiwen could say anything, Xu Jialin pulled him and whispered, “I’m telling you. Don’t make things difficult for him.”","Xie Jiwen was speechless.","Mom. Who was your son?","This kid had only been here for about an hour!","Xu Jialin continued whispering, “Look at how smart and quick-witted he is! And look at how good he is at tricking your uncle and aunt!”","They were blinded by his tricks!","“I think your uncle and aunt are definitely considering leaving with them to B City. Look at his skills at tricking people! As expected of a director.”","Xie Jiwen had no idea of the conversation Xu Jialin was having with herself.","If not, he would have asked how the ability to trick someone could be related to being a director.","“This is why you should learn from him. You should learn from him while Zhuofeng is still here. Get more knowledge. It would be best if Zhuofeng can teach you a few tricks,” Xu Jialin said with contempt, “Don’t offend him, or he may not teach you.”","“No matter how much you dislike him, he’s your future brother-in-law. Your struggle is futile.” Xu Jialin said, “You might as well stop struggling and learn from him so that you can get a wife sooner than later.”","“You’re already old,” Xu Jialin grumbled, “Zhuofeng is younger than you, and he’s already at the meeting with the parents’ phase. What about you?”","Xie Jiwen finally surrendered. “Mom. Stop it. I will do as you say.”","“Jiling will bring Han Zhuofeng back to meet the parents today. Stop scolding me,” Xie Jiwen said, “You said that uncle and aunt have been blinded by Han Zhuofeng’s tricks. Shouldn’t you help keep an eye out?”","Xie Jiwen was right.","Xu Jialin finally stopped paying attention to Xie Jiwen.","She then heard Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu speak, “Why don’t... we go to B City with Zhuofeng and Jiling?”","“True. Zhuofeng came all the way here to our house. We should visit the elders of the Han Family as well,” Xie Tongyun said.","Gu Yingsu hesitated slightly before she nodded and said, “That’s good.”","After meeting Han Zhuofeng tonight, she now had a positive opinion of Han Zhuofeng.","The young fellow was very sincere.","However, this was their first time meeting, and they didn’t know each other well.","Gu Yingsu thought that they could go to B City with Xie Jiling and Han Zhuofeng.","While they were on the way there, they could get to know Han Zhuofeng more. Then, they could have a good chat with the elders of the Han Family and personally confirm the Han Family’s intention.","They could also get to know Han Zhuofeng’s family.","If Xie Jiling and Han Zhuofeng really got married in the future...","They would be far away in Lingnan while Xie Jiling would live with Han Zhuofeng in B City. In this case, it would be very important to know more about the people in Han Zhuofeng’s family.","“How long do you plan to stay here? We can start preparing early to go to B City with you,” Gu Yingsu asked.","Xie Jiling then said, “Zhuofeng has just finished a film. He granted his colleagues working on post-production a week of vacation, and he’s here with me during his week off. When he goes back, he will resume overseeing the post-production of the film.”","“Therefore, we intend to stay here for four days before going back to B City,” Xie Jiling said, “When we go back, Zhuofeng will have two remaining days of vacation before he has to resume work.”","“The timing is good. You can go back with us, and I can use keep you all accompanied on my remaining days of leave,” Han Zhuofeng added.","Gu Yingsu nodded and said, “Sure. Let us prepare ourselves then.”","“The kids are tired today. You should drink less and let them get a good rest.” Gu Yingsu instructed Xie Tongyun.","In Xie Jiwen’s opinion, Gu Yingsu’s attitude clearly showed that she was very satisfied with Han Zhuofeng."]},{"number":3523,"title":"Chapter 3523 Untitled","paragraphs":["3523 Untitled","After considering Xu Jialin’s words, Xie Jiwen thought it would be beneficial for him to learn from Han Zhuofeng.","Everyone drank a little bit and became tipsy.","After the meal, Gu Yingsu said, “We prepared a place for you to stay. It’s nearby. You won’t be afraid to stay at it by yourself, right?”","Han Zhuofeng was speechless. “...”","!!","What did Xie Jiling tell her parents?","Did everyone know that he was a coward?","Han Zhuofeng smiled and said, “It’s fine. I won’t be scared by myself. Our house should be very safe, so I know vengeful spirits won’t dare to come inside.”","Not only had he started calling Xie Jiling’s parents Dad and Mom, but he had also referred to this house as ‘our house.’","Xie Jiwen thought that Han Zhuofeng was very capable.","Xie Jialin smiled quietly. She didn’t know how to feel.","She couldn’t take Han Zhuofeng seriously.","If she corrected him, it would seem as though she was unsatisfied with him. This would cause the atmosphere to feel awkward.","However, she felt bitter without correcting him.","She started feeling worried for Xie Jiling.","Han Zhuofeng managed to date her young daughter because he had too many tricks up his sleeves!","Gu Yingsu and Xie Tongyun were too simple-minded. Gu Yingsu actually asked Han Zhuofeng if he was scared.","Was she not scared that Han Zhuofeng might take this chance and ask to stay in the same room as Xie Jiling?","Xie Jiwen knew well that the members of the Han Family were very shameless.","Before Gu Yingsu could say anything that would make her regretful, Xie Jiwen said, “Yes. As long as the house is located within the boundaries of the Xie Family’s territory, whether inside or outside the main estate, no vengeful spirit would dare to come near the mountain forest.”","“All vengeful spirits knew that the Xie Family lives, so none of them should dare to provoke us,” Xie Jiwen said, “Therefore, you don’t have to worry about staying in a room by yourself. It will be fine.”","Han Zhuofeng was speechless. “...”","Elder brothers-in-law were the worst existence in the world.","“Where is Jiling going to stay then?” Han Zhuofeng asked. He immediately explained, “I will come and hang out with Jiling during the day.”","He had no other motives. They shouldn’t get the wrong idea.","“I’ll be staying at my old place, which is very close to here. When I take you back to your courtyard later, I’ll first show you the way to my place so that you can remember it,” Xie Jiling said.","Hearing that, Xie Jiwen immediately wondered whether Xie Jiling intended to bring Han Zhuofeng to her place and if he would eventually stay there.","Xie Jiling was a very naive and sincere girl. Xie Jiwen couldn’t allow that to happen!","Everything that came out of a guy’s mouth should never be trusted!","If they said that they wouldn’t do anything, that would be impossible!","All men were bad!","“I will go with you and show Zhuofeng the way,” Xie Jiwen immediately said.","Xu Jialin rolled her eyes. Her son exhausted her.","This was the territory of the Xie Family. Even if Han Zhuofeng had bad intentions, he wouldn’t dare to do it in front of Xie Jiling’s parents.","If he didn’t want her future in-laws to kick him out of this place, he wouldn’t demand to stay in Xie Jiling’s place.","In Xu Jialin’s opinion, Han Zhuofeng wasn’t dumb, so he wouldn’t do anything stupid.","As such, she couldn’t help but question how her son became the person he was at his age.","It wasn’t surprising that he still hadn’t succeeded in courting Hu Kaiyin.","This was too disappointing!","Why would he get involved in this?","Wasn’t he basically annoying Han Zhuofeng?","If Han Zhuofeng thought Xie Jiwen was annoying, would he still help brainstorm ideas?","Xu Jialin was so angry that she didn’t hesitate to kick Xie Jiwen under the table.","Xie Jiwen looked at Xu Jialin in shock.","Why did you kick me?","Xu Jialin ignored Xie Jiwen and forced herself to smile at Han Zhuofeng.","She had no choice. It was really difficult to have a son like him.","“Jiwen forgot that he’s too tired tonight and that he has to sleep early, so he can’t go with you guys.” Xu Jialin was too lazy to even come up with a more believable excuse for Xie Jiwen.","She felt too mentally exhausted.","Han Zhuofeng didn’t care about the excuse.","As long as Xie Jiwen wouldn’t cause any trouble for him, he would be fine with it.","Therefore, Han Zhuofeng took the lie seriously.","He even cooperated with Xu Jialin and said, “I see. My older brother really needs to get a good rest.”","Men shouldn’t be this weak!","Xu Jialin looked at Xie Jiwen again.","Look at Han Zhuofeng’s ability to craft convincing lies with such a straight face.","Xie Jiwen rolled his eyes dramatically in response.","He was really struggling to partake in this meal.","“There are a lot of elders in our house.” When Han Zhuofeng said ‘our house,’ Xie Tongyun follow suit.","When Xie Tongyun said it, he realized that it didn’t sound wrong.","Han Zhuofeng’s smile became more and more genuine.","He finally understood where Xie Jiling inherited her naivety.","She was just like her father!","“However, the elders are old, and they rest early. Some are out and about exorcising. You can see some of them during the day. Some of them are not in the village, so you won’t see them.”","“But there’s no rush. There is plenty of time in the future for you to get to know all of them,” Xie Tongyun said.","And so, they finished dinner.","Xie Tongyun then urged both of them to rest.","Xie Jiling stepped out of the door with Han Zhuofeng and led him to her house.","One just had to walk out of the dining room and turn left to see a small house.","“Let’s go. I will take you to your house,” Xie Jiling said.","Han Zhuofeng’s house was on the other side. Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu’s house was in between his house and Xie Jiling’s house.","This way, Gu Yingsu and Xie Tongyun would know if Han Zhuofeng went looking for Xie Jiling.","Han Zhuofeng suspected that Gu Yingsu could have arranged for someone to keep tabs on the door.","“Our houses are very close to each other. They’re easily found, Xie Jiling said as she walked him to his house.","“Then I will walk you back to your place and come back here myself,” Han Zhuofeng said.","Xie Jiling nodded.","If she were with him, she would simply never get tired.","Even if she could barely keep her eyes open, she still wanted to be around him.","The two walked slowly and strolled around after the meal.","However, they still eventually arrived in front of Xie Jiling’s yard.","“Rest well.” Han Zhuofeng said, “I will come to see you tomorrow morning.”","“You don’t have to wake up that early tomorrow. It’s fine.” Today was too tiring.","“It’s fine. This is your house. I have to perform well. I can’t let the parents-in-law think that I’m too lazy,” Han Zhuofeng said, “I have to eat breakfast with them tomorrow morning and keep their good impression on me up.”","Thankfully, Xu Jialin wasn’t here. If she knew about Han Zhuofeng’s plan, she would have scolded Xie Jiwen again.","“Okay.” Xie Jiling knew that he had been doing all these things for her.","He wanted to create a better impression in front of her parents.","If it wasn’t because he cared and was nervous, why would he bother to be this respectful?","At this moment, Han Zhuofeng looked around and asked Xie Jiling softly, “Did your parents arrange for someone to keep an eye out on us?”","“No. Why did you ask?” Xie Jiling was surprised.","“I really want to kiss you. But if someone else is around, I won’t be able to do it,” Han Zhuofeng whispered.","Xie Jiling blushed. She responded softly, “Actually... actually, it’s normal to kiss. We’re dating. How could we not kiss?”","“My parents aren’t that old-fashioned, so I’m sure they won’t complain about such a thing.”"]},{"number":3524,"title":"Chapter 3524 Untitled","paragraphs":["3524 Untitled","Han Zhuofeng looked around and said, “Then... should we kiss?”","The way Han Zhuofeng looked around made him look like a thief, which amused Xie Jiling.","Was he that scared?","Anyway, this was her house. If Han Zhuofeng didn’t dare to do it, then she would do it.","If her parents weren’t happy, they wouldn’t be mad at Han Zhuofeng because she was the one who initiated it.","And so, she didn’t even wait for Han Zhuofeng to initiate the kiss.","Xie Jiling tiptoed and pecked Han Zhuofeng on the lips.","“Alright. I initiated it. You won’t be blamed for it,” Xie Jiling whispered.","Before Han Zhuofeng could react, she stepped into her house.","Han Zhuofeng froze outside the door. He suddenly thought that this was unacceptable!","How could he let a girl initiate?","He was a man! He had to be the one to initiate!","Therefore, Han Zhuofeng started knocking on the courtyard door while shouting, “Jiling! Come out, and let’s do this again! I will initiate it.”","Inside, Xie Jiling could hear him, but she didn’t open the door.","She thought to herself about how he wasn’t actually scared that her parents might hear him.","Xie Jiling quickly sent him a WeChat message. “Stop shouting. My parents might actually come.”","When Han Zhuofeng saw the WeChat message, he didn’t dare to shout anymore.","He lowered his volume and said pitifully, “I’m leaving.”","Xie Jiling replied to him with a voice message. “Yes. Go back and rest early. Aren’t you going to wake up early tomorrow?”","“Yes. I’m leaving.” Han Zhuofeng said reluctantly.","He waved at the closed door. He acted really dumb and didn’t even think about the fact that Xie Jiling wouldn’t be able to see him.","He then left, his head hanging low and looking pitiful.","Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu were indeed watching.","“This kid looks really pitiful,” Xie Tongyun said.","“Why don’t you let him stay in your daughter’s house, then?” Gu Yingsu said angrily.","Xie Tongyun immediately shook his head and said, “I was just saying. He looks pitiful, but we can’t let him do that no matter what.”","Xu Jialin smiled and said nothing.","She felt as though Han Zhuofeng was just intentionally acting in front of them.","Han Zhuofeng went back to his house.","This was a house with its own yard, and he felt a little lonely by himself here.","He couldn’t even talk to anyone.","However, Han Zhuofeng wasn’t afraid.","Perhaps it was because the territory of the Xie Family exuded good energy. Han Zhuofeng felt very safe here.","It could also be because Han Zhuofeng slept really well after traveling all day.","Fortunately, he set an alarm before he fell asleep. If not, he would have overslept.","He slept really well tonight and didn’t even dream.","When the alarm on his phone rang this morning, he was taken aback by it.","It woke him up from a good sleep.","Han Zhuofeng turned off the alarm and checked the time. He had set the alarm at 6:30 a.m.","He was stunned.","Before he opened his eyes, he was greeted by the invigorating scent of nature.","There was also a faint smell of incense.","Upon waking up and checking the time, he looked up and noticed the ancient beams of the house above him.","Han Zhuofeng then remembered that he was in the village of the Xie Family.","Han Zhuofeng then stood up quickly.","He tidied himself and left the house.","Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu’s house was right on the corner.","When Han Zhuofeng came out of his house, it was about 15 minutes to 7 a.m. There was still some time.","He first went to Xie Jiling’s house.","There was a doorbell at the gate of Xie Jiling’s courtyard.","But Han Zhuofeng didn’t ring the doorbell. He didn’t want to make Xie Jiling feel anxious.","He first sent her a WeChat message. “Jiling, are you ready?”","“Give me five more minutes,” Xie Jiling immediately responded.","“Alright.” Han Zhuofeng sent a smiling emoji.","Han Zhuofeng didn’t tell her that he was at the door.","He waited at the door for five minutes, and the courtyard door finally opened.","When Xie Jiling step out of the courtyard, he saw Han Zhuofeng and immediately said, “How long have you been waiting outside the courtyard? Why didn’t you tell me?”","“I didn’t want to make you rush, so I didn’t tell you,” Han Zhuofeng said, “But I didn’t wait for a long time. I arrived when I sent you the WeChat message.”","When Xie Jiling said five minutes, she really did come out within five minutes.","When she knew that he didn’t wait long, she let out a sigh of relief.","She went with Han Zhuofeng to Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu’s house.","When the two arrived, Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu had just stepped into the dining hall.","When Xie Tongyun saw them, he was shocked and said, “Why did you two wake up so early?”","Young people were better sleepers and could really sleep late if they were allowed to wake up naturally.","They had spent the entire day traveling yesterday. They went on a flight and continued the journey by car.","And they had to walk a long way after the car ride.","Xie Tongyun thought that they wouldn’t wake up this early today. As such, he didn’t expect them to be able to join them for breakfast.","Xie Jiling took this opportunity to say good things about Han Zhuofeng. “He wanted to wake up early. He said that it’s rare for him to visit, so he wanted to spend more time with you all.”","Han Zhuofeng immediately said, “I know it’s difficult to get to know me well since I’ll only be staying here for a few days. However, I still want to spend as much time as I can with you guys so that you can get to know me more.”","Xie Tongyun nodded. Han Zhuofeng was very thoughtful.","It was rare to find a young man with the initiative to be considerate.","Gu Yingsu was really happy to hear that as well. She asked the people to serve more breakfast and added two sets of bowls and utensils to the table.","Han Zhuofeng didn’t stay idle while eating breakfast.","He told Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu more about himself and the Han Family so that they could know him better.","Soon after breakfast, Xie Jiyun developed a very good impression of Han Zhuofeng.","He no longer worried about Xie Jiling and Han Zhuofeng being together by themselves.","But even if he felt worried, it would be useless.","Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu wouldn’t be able to do anything when Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling were away in B City.","Xie Tongyun then asked Xie Jiling to bring Han Zhuofeng around the village and take a good look at this place.","The Xie Family’s village was close to the public. If not, it would have been a scenic spot.","The village was huge as well, and it would take more than a day to check out the entire village.","As Xie Jiling walked out of the courtyard with Han Zhuofeng, they bumped into Xie Jiwen.","Xie Jiling immediately became alert.","Was Xie Jiwen here to cause more trouble for Han Zhuofeng?","When Xie Jiwen stepped in front of them, he saw Xie Jiling’s reaction.","Immediately, he clicked his tongue and said, “What is with your reaction? You make it seem like I’m a bad person.”","“Don’t bully him,” Xie Jiling said.","Xie Jiwen had no choice.","This little sister of his was completely on Han Zhuofeng’s side.","Xie Jiwen didn’t even know how Han Zhuofeng tricked Xie Jiling.","“I won’t bully him. I won’t bully him. Am I even capable of bullying him?” Xie Jiwen said.","Han Zhuofeng was a trickster.","“I just have things to...” Xie Jiwen paused and said, “Ask him to teach me.”","“What?” Xie Jiling asked in surprise.","Xie Jiwen actually wanted to seek Han Zhuofeng’s counsel?"]},{"number":3525,"title":"Chapter 3525 Untitled","paragraphs":["3525 Untitled","“It’s just...” Xie Jiwen thought about it and said, “Let’s keep walking while talking about it.”","“Where are you two going?” Xie Jiwen asked.","“We’ll just stroll around. I’m teaching him the ways here,” Xie Jiling said.","“Sure. Let’s go together.”","!!","While the three were walking together, Xie Jiling asked impatiently, “Elder Brother, what do you want to ask?”","Just ask your question and leave. Stop disturbing her date with Han Zhuofeng.","It was hard for them to be on a date.","Xie Jiwen felt hurt by his sister’s contemptuous attitude, so he had no choice but to say, “I just wanted to ask Zhuofeng how he had managed to win your affection and become your boyfriend.”","Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling both felt dumbfounded.","“How did it happen?” Xie Jiling blinked and said, “He confessed, and I agreed.”","“Is it that simple?” Xie Jiwen asked, “Did you not make things difficult for him?”","“Why should I make things difficult for him if I have feelings for him? At first, I was unsure if my feelings for him were love or not, so I considered making things difficult for him.”","Xie Jiling smiled with satisfaction, “Now, I know. Thankfully, I was able to figure it out quickly back then, and I didn’t end up making any regretful decision.”","Hearing what Xie Jiling said, Han Zhuofeng felt really happy.","She was already holding Xie Jiling’s hand. However, since Xie Jiwen was here...","It would be impossible for Han Zhuofeng to do anything more than hold hands.","Han Zhuofeng immediately began to despise Han Zhuofeng.","“Elder Brother, don’t be afraid to ask any other questions you may have. We are family, and no one will laugh at you,” Han Zhuofeng spoke in a way that made him sound like he was already a part of the family.","Xie Jiwen had already felt numb to his shamelessness.","He didn’t have the energy to argue with Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Tongyun must have felt the same last night.","He was not unwilling to argue, but rather he simply did not have the energy to argue right now.","“It’s just... You all know about Kaiyin,” Xie Jiwen said.","“Oh, I see. You’re curious about our love story, right? Since falling in love, Han Zhuofeng has gained a lot of insight and understanding in this area.”","Xie Jiwen nodded quickly.","“She’s already staying here with you. What is the problem?” Han Zhuofeng asked.","“But Kaiyin still treats me like an outsider. Although she’s staying here, she keeps insisting on giving me rent,” Xie Jiwen said, “And she keeps ignoring me.”","Han Zhuofeng thought it was weird. “What did you tell Sis Kaiyin?”","“Tell her?” Xie Jiwen felt perplexed as he asked, “Tell her what?”","“No, I mean...” Han Zhuofeng said, “How did you bring her back here? Sis Kaiyin doesn’t seem like the kind of person who would simply follow another person home. If you didn’t confess, why would she come back with you?”","This didn’t make sense.","Xie Jiwen blinked and said, “Confess?”","Xie Jiling’s mouth twitched slightly as she asked, “Big Brother, have you not yet told Sis Kaiyin how you feel about her yet?”","Xie Jiwen blushed and replied, “Even though I haven’t actually confessed, my feelings for her should be clear.”","He clearly liked her. If not, why would he act this way?","Han Zhuofeng grabbed Xie Jiling’s hand and commented emotionally, “I didn’t expect your big brother to have the potential to be a f*ckboy.”","“What are you saying! Who the heck are you calling a f*ckboy?!” Xie Jiwen responded angrily.","He wasn’t a f*ckboy!","Such nonsense shouldn’t be said!","Xie Jiling explained, “If you like her, why don’t you just tell her? If she has to try and guess your feelings, she’ll just be confused. Unless you tell her your feelings, she won’t know what she should do..”","“What do you think you’re doing, bringing someone back like this without clearly expressing your feelings? Big Brother, this isn’t fair to Sister Kayin. If you want her to be your girlfriend, you have to be clear about it,” Xie Jiling criticized.","Han Zhuofeng was right.","Xie Jiwen was acting like a f*ckboy.","He liked her, but he didn’t express it clearly.","Hu Kaiyin was the only one who could tolerate Xie Jiwen.","Otherwise, Xie Jiwen probably wouldn’t have survived this long, given Hu Kaiyin’s fighting skills.","Xie Jiling kept her final thought to herself because Xie Jiwen was her older brother.","Han Zhuofeng earnestly advised, “Brother, if you have feelings for her, you should be honest and tell her.”","“Yes,” Xie Jiling nodded in agreement. “When he expressed his feelings for me, he was very serious and sincere, and he had a lot to say.”","“Yes,” Han Zhuofeng replied. “At that time, my family asked Jiling if she had any romantic feelings for anyone, and she said yes. I had no idea back then that I was the person she was talking about.”","Han Zhuofeng felt really happy upon saying that.","“I thought she liked someone else, so I did everything I could to try to ruin that person’s reputation and make myself look better by comparison.” Since he was already dating Xie Jiling, he didn’t see any point in keeping those tricks a secret anymore.","Xie Jiling was speechless.","Since last night, she had been learning about one surprising truth after another.","Xie Jiling had a newfound appreciation for her ability to comprehend and understand things.","“Ultimately, you need to be genuine and sincere when you confess your feelings to her. Tell her everything about how much you like her and your feelings for her. Make sure you touch her heart and move her emotionally!” Han Zhuofeng advised.","“Got it.” Xie Jiwen nodded and said, “I will go tell her right now. I will come looking for you again when I have to meet her parents.”","Han Zhuofeng was speechless. “...”","Before he could say anything, Xie Jiwen had already run away.","Han Zhuofeng then said to Xie Jiling, “Don’t you think he’s thinking a little too ahead? He hasn’t even confessed, and he’s already thinking about meeting her parents?”","Xie Jiling nodded and said, “I think it’s a little difficult. If he had confessed in the beginning, Sis Kaiyin would have agreed. But he hasn’t said anything for a very long time. If he suddenly confesses, I wonder if Sis Kaiyin would accept his confession without any hesitation?”","Currently, Xie Jiwen was rushing to Hu Kaiyin’s courtyard.","Thankfully, he was still aware that he should ring the doorbell.","When Hu Kaiyin came out to open the door, she saw that it was Xie Jiwen outside the door. The latter looked impatient and was acting a little weird.","“What’s going on with you?” Hu Kaiyin asked.","They had eaten breakfast this morning. He seemed normal earlier.","As a gentleman, Xie Jiwen did not enter the courtyard. Instead, he stood outside the door.","He said to Hu Kaiyin, “I like you.”","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Hu Kaiyin was a little angry at Xie Jiwen for not confessing.","She was thinking that it didn’t make sense for her to continue staying here.","When she wanted to pay her rent, he wouldn’t take it.","And so, Hu Kaiyin decided this morning that she would leave with Xie Jiling and the others.","But unexpectedly, Xie Jiwen confessed his feelings.","“I have liked you for a long time. This is my first time liking someone. I don’t know what I should do. I just wanted to keep seeing you, and I always grasped every chance to be with you. So, I took the opportunity to call you over here when I was exorcising.”","“Actually, you couldn’t really help me with the exorcism, so I just made an excuse to see you.”","“I tried everything I could to bring you back here. I wanted you to see my house and my family. I wanted you to know that I have a good house and a good family. And I wanted you to know that the kind of life that you like exists here in our village.”"]},{"number":3526,"title":"Chapter 3526 Untitled","paragraphs":["3526 Untitled","“You don’t have to work hard to build the kind of life you want. I can offer it to you with both hands.” Xie Jiwen said, pausing after finishing his statement.","He looked at Hu Kaiyin nervously.","And waited for Hu Kaiyin’s response...","But for some reason, Hu Kaiyin didn’t look happy.","!!","Xie Jiwen immediately looked at Hu Kaiyin nervously as he asked, “Do... do you not like me?”","“What do you not like about me? I will change it,” Xie Jiwen said impatiently.","When he said that, Hu Kaiyin kicked him.","“Ouch!” Xie Jiwen covered his lower leg and crouched down, wincing in pain.","“Bang!” Hu Kaiyin then slammed the door shut, making a loud noise.","Xie Jiwen was bewildered. He quickly got up and started pounding on the door and ringing the doorbell while shouting, “Kaiyin! Kaiyin! Open the door! Let me know what’s on your mind!”","“Kaiyin! I won’t leave unless you tell me. I will wait at the door. You will see me whenever you come out.” Xie Jiwen wanted to stand guard at the door.","In any case, the weather was perfect for outdoor activities right now. It was neither too cold nor too hot, just the right temperature to stay outside.","Xie Jiwen called for someone to bring a table, chair, and a sunshade umbrella.","A set of tea utensils for drinking kung fu tea was set up, and a pot of hot water was prepared.","Xie Jiwen didn’t even dare to move one step away.","He was concerned that if he left and Hu Kayin came out while he was gone, he might miss it, which would be horrible.","And so, he could only ask people to deliver to him the things he needed.","When everything that was needed for the time being was ready, Xie Jiwen sat back and relaxed.","Even though it felt cool now, the sun was still quite strong.","But it was not a problem for him as he was sitting under the sunshade umbrella.","Xie Jiwen sipped his tea while waiting for Hu Kaiyin to come out.","If he needed something, he would ask someone to take it for him.","However, as he continued drinking, Xie Jiwen realized that there was an issue.","After drinking a lot of tea, he felt the need to use the bathroom.","Xie Jiwen felt like going to the bathroom now.","After careful consideration, he stood up and went to Hu Kaiyin’s door.","He knocked on the door and rang the doorbell in a repeating sequence.","He would press the doorbell and knock on the door while the doorbell was still ringing.","When the doorbell stopped ringing, he would immediately press it again.","“Kaiyin, open the door and let me use the bathroom. I drank too much tea,” Xie Jiwen said in front of the door.","There was no answer from within the house.","“Kaiyin, open the door! I can’t hold it in anymore!” Xie Jiwen said in a hurry.","“I can’t get to the nearest bathroom! I’m going to wet myself right here on your doorstep!”","There were passersby.","However, Xie Jiwen didn’t care at all.","Xie Jiwen was willing to do whatever it took, even if it meant losing face, to convince Hu Kaiyin to open the door.","Asking people to bring a table, chair, and other things to his location had already attracted the attention of many people.","Many people came to see him.","Eventually, more and more people gathered.","Of course, Xie Jiwen was not entirely coaxing Hu Kaiyin.","He really couldn’t hold it...","“Kaiyin! Open the door!” Xie Jiwen started screaming, “I can’t hold it in anymore!”","“There are so many people watching me make a fool of myself,” Xie Jiwen called out. “I’m under so much pressure!”","Hu Kaiyin kept rolling her eyes in the house.","If you were under so much pressure, then find another bathroom. Why would you wait and block the door?","***","When did Xie Jiwen become so talkative and loud?!","Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling were currently strolling in the village of the Xie Family.","As they walked, Xie Jiling pointed out and explained the different areas they passed through.","As the two walked, they overheard a small child pass by saying, “I heard Uncle Jiwen is at Auntie Kaiyin’s door.”","“He’s been there for the entire morning!”","“And now, he wants to use the bathroom, and he is knocking on Auntie Kaiyin’s door.”","“He’s very loud!”","Some young people were also talking about the situation.","“Let’s go watch the fun. Xie Jiwen looks really funny,” said one of them.","“Can’t he just find another bathroom?”","“What happened between him and Hu Kaiyin? Are they fighting?”","“I suppose. He must be trying to appease her.”","Today, Xie Jiwen became the clown in the village of the Xie Family.","Usually, the members of the Xie Family would exorcize for fun.","However, after a while, it became a boring activity.","It was unusual for Xie Jiwen to cause such a scene, so everyone who had nothing else to do came over to watch.","Han Zhuofeng’s eyes lit up with a gloating smile: “Let’s go see the fun, too, huh?”","Xie Jiling wanted to watch, too. It was truly rare to see Xie Jiwen cause a scene.","“Let’s go.” Xie Jiling grabbed Han Zhuofeng’s hand as she said, “I know where Sis Kaiyin’s courtyard is located.”","And so, Han Zhuofeng hurried along and followed Xie Jiling.","“Let’s both try to stay under the radar,” Han Zhuofeng suggested as they approached the group of spectators, feeling it would be better not to openly offend his future brother-in-law.","And so, the two hid behind the group. They could see Xie Jiwen if they stretched their heads.","“There are more and more people. Kaiyin,” Xie Jiwen called out, unable to see Hu Kaiyin and not knowing how she was reacting to this situation behind closed doors.","Suddenly, she had an idea. Xie Jiwen took her phone and sent Hu Kaiyin a request to video call.","Hu Kaiyin was still thinking if she should answer the phone when she heard Xie Jiwen shouting outside the door, “Kaiyin, pick up the phone! Kaiyin, answer the phone!”","Hu Kaiyin wanted to ask if Xie Jiwen was possessed!","Hu Kaiyin angrily accepted the video call invitation.","Xie Jiwen’s pitiful face appeared on the screen of her phone.","Hu Kaiyin felt speechless.","“Kaiyin, look! I’m not lying to you. So many people are here to watch me make a fool of myself,” Xie Jiwen said, turning the phone camera around to show Hu Kaiyin the crowd surrounding him.","Hu Kaiyin then realized that there were so many people in the village of the Xie Family.","Normally, when she walked around the village for half a day, she would only see a few people.","Everyone was busy.","Some were exorcizing, some had to go to class, while some had to teach. They were all busy with their own things.","So was it really possible for these people to have this much free time?","Xie Jiwen knocked on the door again. “Kaiyin, please let me in.”","He wasn’t actually holding it in, but he was really holding it in this time.","Hu Kaiyin saw an anxious-looking Xie Jiwen. It didn’t seem like he was lying.","Aside from that...","There were so many people crowding at her door. This was unacceptable.","Therefore, Hu Kaiyin opened the door.","When she suddenly opened the door, Xie Jiwen was stunned.","“It opened! It opened! The door opened!”","The crowd watching was abuzz with excitement.","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","How bored were you guys?","How could a trivial matter like this make you all this excited?","“Aren’t you coming inside?!” Hu Kaiyin gnashed her teeth as she said.","“Oh! Oh! Okay!” Xie Jiwen quickly nodded his head. When he stepped inside, he immediately closed the door.","Blocking out the gaze of all those people watching from outside.","As he was closing the door, he took a final look at the crowd.","Even if he couldn’t remember all of them, he wanted to remember some of them.","He would hold them accountable for this later!","Xie Jiwen’s eyes were very obviously filled with resentment."]},{"number":3527,"title":"Chapter 3527 Untitled","paragraphs":["3527 Untitled","There were quite a few spectators.","“Let’s go, let’s go!”","“Hurry, hurry!”","Those whom Xie Jiwen could easily remember ran away.","!!","Han Zhuofeng let out a sigh of relief and said to Xie Jiling, “Luckily, we hid, or we would have been seen by Big Brother.”","Xie Jiling was also scared.","She dragged Han Zhuofeng, saying, “Let’s hurry, don’t let Big Brother see us when he comes out later.”","As such, the two held hands and ran off.","***","When Hu Kaiyin saw that Xie Jiwen even had time to take revenge, her expression darkened. “Aren’t you in a rush to go to the toilet?”","“Oh, right!” said Xie Jiwen as he rushed to the toilet.","Xie Jiwen was very clear about Hu Kaiyin’s arrangement here.","She had always done this usually.","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","He really entered to look for a toilet; it wasn’t just an excuse.","Hu Kaiyin did not even know what to say, so she went to the living room to wait.","After a short while, Xie Jiwen came over.","Knowing that he went to the toilet, she felt that something wasn’t right.","“I washed my hands,” said Xie Jiwen after seeing Hu Kaiyin’s gaze.","Hu Kaiyin was dumbfounded.","Who wanted to know that?!","Xie Jiwen sat next to Hu Kaiyin and asked, “Kaiyin, what do you think of me?”","“If you think that I’m not good, please tell me what parts of me are bad, and I’ll change them. If you still don’t like me, I will try my best to make you like me. If you like someone else...” Xie Jiwen thought of this possibility.","His expression darkened as he said viciously, “I’ll throw a few evil spirits your way.”","Hu Kaiyin didn’t know what to say.","Although it was just hypothetical, the person she liked would be unlucky..","Not only would he get bullied by a ruthless person like her, but he would also be cursed by Xie Jiwen’s evil spirits.","“I don’t like anyone,” said Hu Kaiyin coldly.","Xie Jiwen was happy, but immediately afterward, he looked like he was breaking down.","Hu Kaiyin did not have anyone she liked, didn’t that mean that she didn’t like him?","“Then how about you like me?” Hu Kaiyin didn’t have anyone she liked anyway.","Hu Kaiyin took a deep breath as she looked at this man who was almost in his thirties but was still acting like a spoiled child.","Hu Kaiyin could not describe her feelings.","Her teeth ached. It was because Xie Jiwen was handsome, so even if he was being cheesy, he wasn’t really an unpleasant sight.","“You say that you like me, but why did you only say it now?” Hu Kaiyin sneered. “Did you just realize it?”","“Of course not!” said Xie Jiwen immediately.","“Didn’t I tell you? When I looked for excuses to meet you, it was because I like you and wanted to spend more time with you. My feelings for you aren’t new,” said Xie Jiwen as he looked at Hu Kaiyin with bewildered eyes.","“Then why did you only say it now?” Hu Kaiyin glared at him.","“It’s my fault, I didn’t notice that I was the problem this whole time,” said Xie Jiwen, “I have never confessed to someone before, and I never had someone I liked until you came into my life.”","“I don’t have any experience,” said Xie Jiwen, “I thought that if my actions were obvious enough, we would follow the flow and naturally be together.”","Hu Kaiyin wanted to puke. Who would want to follow the flow with you?","“I really can’t tell.” Hu Kaiyin sneered. “Xie Jiwen, you have the potential to be a player. You haven’t liked anyone before, but the moment you like someone, you’re already displaying signs of being a player.”","Xie Jiwen was dumbfounded. “I’m not a player! I don’t play around!”","He was a pure and honest man!","He had never been in a relationship. He had no experience at all.","He... did not even have the chance to play around.","“Aren’t you a player if you don’t take the initiative to express your feelings?” said Hu Kaiyin angrily.","Xie Jiwen was speechless.","That was considered being a player?","“I will take the initiative to tell you things in the future,” Xie Jiwen immediately said, “Give me a chance?”","Hu Kaiyin felt that if she just agreed so easily, it would be going too easy on him.","However, if she did not, she would feel like she was making a big fuss.","After all, she did like him.","It wasn’t like her to make it difficult for him when she clearly had feelings for him.","“If you don’t say anything, I’ll assume that you agree,” said Xie Jiwen.","Hu Kaiyin was torn between her thoughts, so she wasn’t paying any attention.","Surprised, she raised her head. She was so shocked by Xie Jiwen that she forgot to react.","Who knew that Xie Jiwen would be so brave?","He suddenly inched closer and kissed her lips.","“The deal is sealed. You’re my girlfriend from now on.”","Then, he did not wait for Hu Kaiyin to respond.","However, he was probably more worried that Hu Kaiyin would beat him up.","After kissing, Xie Jiwen ran away. He ran while shouting, “I have a girlfriend now!”","So he wouldn’t be irresponsible after kissing her!","He wasn’t a player!","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Hu Kaiyin’s mind went blank. When she came back to her senses, her first thought was to chase after Xie Jiwen.","She could not let him shout to the whole world.","It wasn’t that she did not want to publicly announce it; she wasn’t a player, after all.","However, it was just so embarrassing to shout like that.","In addition, it seemed that Xie Jiwen was prepared to let the world know about them.","He was taking this chance to put the matter on the table.","Xie Jiwen was afraid that she would regret it.","Nobody expected that Xie Jiwen was capable of hatching such schemes, even Hu Kaiyin didn’t expect it.","She felt strange. If Xie Jiwen was so scheming now, why did he not just confess earlier?","Hu Kaiyin thought about it while chasing after him.","However, she still did not manage to catch up in the end.","When she reached the entrance, Xie Jiwen had already rushed out.","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","It was her first time seeing him run that fast.","When Xie Jiwen met someone on the way, he would say proudly, “I have a girlfriend now!”","The person said, “Didn’t you have one from the start?”","He even brought her back. Everyone already knew.","Xie Jiwen didn’t know what to say.","How could he explain it?","It would be too complicated to explain from the start.","Xie Jiwen gave up on explaining.","And he also couldn’t continue on bragging anymore.","So everyone already thought that Hu Kaiyin was his girlfriend.","He said so!","His actions were so obvious. Everyone understood!","Why could Hu Kaiyin not tell?","As he did not achieve his goal of showing off, Xie Jiwen could only return.","Hu Kaiyin looked at him with her arms folded.","When Xie Jiwen entered, he said, “Kaiyin, where are our parents right now?”","“Whose parents?” Hu Kaiyin couldn’t follow along.","“Our parents,” said Xie Jiwen after seeing that Hu Kaiyin didn’t understand him, “My father-in-law and mother-in-law.”","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Hehe, you didn’t learn other things, but you were pretty quick to pick up Han Zhuofeng’s shamelessness.","“You’re pretty quick to pick up Han Zhuofeng’s shamelessness at the dining table last night,” said Hu Kaiyin, half-smiling.","“Of course. Han Zhuofeng got Jiling with his shamelessness, after all,” said Xie Jiwen."]},{"number":3528,"title":"Chapter 3528 Untitled","paragraphs":["3528 Untitled","“...” Hu Kaiyin sneered. “So you used it to deal with me?”","“That’s not it. How is it dealing with you? I’m pursuing you.” Xie Jiwen felt like the use of terms had to be accurate.","Wives should not be dealt with.","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","The shameless Xie Jiwen was a little hard to deal with.","It was all Han Zhuofeng’s fault for teaching him something bad!","Xie Jiwen held Hu Kaiyin’s hand.","Hu Kaiyin didn’t shake him off, and when he kissed her just now, she did not beat him up as well.","Xie Jiwen was certain that Hu Kaiyin had definitely accepted him.","Xie Jiwen joyfully held Hu Kaiyin’s hand and swung it around. Hu Kaiyin still did not shake his hand off.","Insatiable, Xie Jiwen inched forward.","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","How could this man be a little cute when he was being this greedy?","Was this what was known as love was blind?","Although she tried her best to keep her cool, her face still slowly turned red after being kissed by the person she liked.","Seeing that Xie Jiwen was smiling so sweetly, Hu Kaiyin was also infected by his smile, and she could not help but smile as well.","Xie Jiwen applied some force and pulled Hu Kaiyin into his embrace.","“I’m not a player.” Xie Jiwen could still remember what she said.","“It’s my fault for not telling you as soon as possible,” said Xie Jiwen, “You can be angry at me, but you can’t reject me.”","How could this be reasonable?","“I accept your confession,” said Hu Kaiyin.","She was angry because Xie Jiwen didn’t directly confess to her when he found out that he liked her, but she would not ignore him because she liked him as well.","She wanted to let him feel how it felt like to be kept hanging.","However, Hu Kaiyin realized that she couldn’t do it.","Xie Jiwen looked at her happily, and his eyes were brighter than usual.","After saying so much, he just wanted a definite answer.","After hearing Hu Kaiyin’s reply, Xie Jiwen finally let out a sigh of relief. “I know your feelings now.”","“It has only been a short while, and I’m already so impatient, wanting an answer from you, not to mention how you have been waiting for such a long time,” said Xie Jiwen.","All of a sudden, he felt like he was an asshole.","Hu Kaiyin glared at him. “Who made you wait?!”","“No, no. It’s me who was shamelessly tugging at you,” Xie Jiwen immediately said.","Hu Kaiyin could not help but laugh. “It is indeed you who shamelessly tugged at me.”","If he wasn’t shameless for so long, would she even like him?","“Isn’t it pretty good here? It’s comfortable to stay here, right?” said Xie Jiwen.","Hu Kaiyin nodded her head honestly.","After staying here, she started thinking of retiring.","Xie Jiwen kept holding onto Hu Kaiyin’s hand.","“I think after we get together, I won’t be in the way of your work anymore. However, you have to promise me that when you go to work, you have to be careful and put your own safety first.”","“Because you’re not alone anymore, you have me,” said Xie Jiwen.","“I can’t ask you to give up your job. I just hope that you can return safely every time.”","“But every time I go to work, it will be a few months if it’s short, if it’s long, it may even be a few years,” said Hu Kaiyin, “Have you thought about this? It’s still fine if it’s just a few months, but if we can’t see each other for a few years, can this relationship even work?”","“I know you can’t tell me the mission, but can you tell me the location? I can choose to relocate to a place closer to you. Even if we can’t be together normally, I can look at you from time to time,” said Xie Jiwen.","Seeing how he answered it so quickly, he had to have long thought about this problem.","Hu Kaiyin knew that his feelings for her weren’t formed on the spur of the moment.,","He had even considered her job.","He had also thought about the problems that they would face.","It was just that he did not confess in time, but it could be considered an accident.","It could be seen that Xie Jiwen was very serious about this relationship.","Hu Kaiyin smiled slowly. “Actually, I’m planning on retiring.”","“What?” Xie Jiwen looked at her, surprised.","“My job is indeed pretty dangerous. It’s only because of luck that I’m still unscathed,” said Hu Kaiyin.","“I like this peaceful and even boring life place.”","“Wake up in the morning, water the flowers, do some morning exercise and listen to music when I have nothing to do. In the future, I even want to get a cat and a dog, and then I can feed them every day.”","“Whenever I have nothing to do, I’ll think about how to decorate the courtyard,” said Hu Kaiyin.","“So, I’m planning to submit my decommissioning report. I will step down from the Mount Lan Compound and officially start enjoying my retirement life,” said Hu Kaiyin.","“Really? Great!” Xie Jiwen hugged Hu Kaiyin excitedly. “Then, in the future... you can keep staying here?”","“You can also stay somewhere else if you want to,” Xie Jiwen immediately added, “I’ll follow you!”","“This place is pretty good. The courtyard’s layout is already to my liking.” Hu Kaiyin smiled. “I don’t have a job anymore, you better not dislike me.”","“My money is all yours, it should be enough for you to spend,” Xie Jiwen immediately said, “What breed of cat and dog do you like? Let’s go and choose.”","“We shouldn’t be in a rush. I need to think about it carefully,” said Hu Kaiyin.","Now that they were talking about their future, they relaxed.","“Let’s go, let’s go. Let’s tell the elders of our families,” said Xie Jiwen.","Hu Kaiyin was dragged along by Xie Jiwen as they walked out.","On the way, Xie Jiwen even asked, “You still haven’t told me. Where do my father-in-law and mother-in-law live?”","“They’re in B City.” Now, Hu Kaiyin understood how Xie Tongyun felt.","She became numb to it and was lazy to correct him.","He had not even met them yet, but they already became his father-in-law and mother-in-law.","He was so shameless.","As they were talking, the two soon arrived at the courtyard of Xie Tongyùn and Xu Jialin.","Coincidentally, Xu Jialin was there.","From inside the house, the voices of the two talking could be heard.","Xu Jialin came out immediately and saw that the two came over with their hands held.","Xu Jialin’s face lit up.","Her son suddenly came along. He had finally settled something that he hadn’t dealt with for a long time!","In the morning, she forced Xie Jiwen to learn from Han Zhuofeng.","It seemed like Han Zhuofeng taught him well!","“Come in, come in.” Xu Jialin looked at the two happily.","The more she looked at them, the happier she felt.","Xie Jiwen told Xu Jialin about Hu Kaiyin’s plan to retire from the Mount Lan Compound.","Xu Jialin was happy when she heard that.","Hu Kaiyin’s job was simply too dangerous. She wanted her daughter-in-law to be safe and sound."]},{"number":3529,"title":"Chapter 3529 Untitled","paragraphs":["3529 Untitled","“Coincidentally, Kaiyin’s parents are also staying in B City, so I’m thinking of going with Second Uncle and Second Auntie, as well as with Jiling to B City. There, I’ll go with Kaiyin to meet my father-in-law and mother-in-law,” said Xie Jiwen.","Surprised, Hu Kaiyin looked at him.","He didn’t tell her that on the way!","Xie Jiwen turned his head and smiled at Hu Kaiyin. “We’re now together anyway, I have to hurry and let my parents-in-law see me. I’ll let them know that you have good taste and that you have such a good boyfriend like me. It’s all so they can rest assured to give you to me.”","Even Xu Jialin was dumbfounded.","She had asked him to learn from Han Zhuofeng’s shamelessness.","However, Xie Jiwen picked it up too quickly!","Even she was shocked by his shamelessness.","They hadn’t even met yet, and he was already calling them parents-in-law.","This shamelessness was abnormal.","However, why did he not save this shamelessness to deal with his parents-in-law?","Why would he use it on his own mother?!","At this moment, Xie Tongyùn returned.","Xu Jialin said immediately, “Why did you just come back? Come here; our son finally did something right.”","Xie Jiwen was speechless.","She made it seem as if he had never done anything right.","“Hmm?” Xie Tongyùn also saw Xie Tongyùn and Hu Kaiyin sitting together.","The two had always been together before.","However, there was a strange air between them.","Before this, Hu Kaiyin didn’t seem this natural.","It seemed like this brat Xie Jiwen had finally become smart and coaxed her well.","Xu Jialin said, “Jiwen said that Kaiyin’s parents are also in B City, and he wants to go to B City with Jiling and the others. There, he’s going to visit Kaiyin’s parents.”","Xu Jialin sat down next to Xu Jialin and smiled. “It’s a good thing.”","Xie Tongyùn pondered and said to Xu Jialin, “Should we go together?”","“Hmm?” Xu Jialin didn’t think of that.","Xie Tongyùn said, “Second Younger Brother and Second Younger Sister-in-Law are going anyway, let’s go together as well. When two people are making marriage arrangements, the two families have to meet, right?”","“We live so far from each other, so it will be hard for us to meet often. It’s better to just meet this time, then we can discuss marriage,” suggested Xie Tongyùn.","Hu Kaiyin was dumbfounded.","No...","She had just officially confirmed her relationship with Xie Jiwen, why were they already discussing marriage?","Wasn’t this a bit too fast?","Hu Kaiyin opened her mouth, but she did not dare to refute the elders.","As such, she secretly pinched Xie Jiwen.","Xie Jiwen kept smiling without saying a word.","He allowed Hu Kaiyin to pinch him in any way; he wouldn’t find it painful anyway.","At this moment, whoever opened their mouth would be an idiot.","He wasn’t an idiot.","Xu Jialin nodded. “You’re right. Let’s go together.”","Xu Jialin was an impatient person. After making a decision, she would immediately follow through.","As such, she got up and said, “I’ll look for Yingsu and ask if they have already bought their flight tickets. If not, we will buy it with them.”","She then left.","She left in a flash.","It was as though someone was chasing her.","Hu Kaiyin was really suspicious if Xu Jialin was afraid that she would object.","Xu Jialin was actually afraid that Hu Kaiyin would object.","As such, before Hu Kaiyin could say anything, she quickly ensured that this matter would be set.","Hu Kaiyin asked Xie Jiwen with difficulty, “Isn’t this too much of a rush?”","“It’s not rushed,” said Xie Jiwen, “How long have we been together?”","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","How... how could she refute that?","The two had been together for a long time.","However, was it not unclear back then?","To be precise, their relationship only started today.","“We can’t just let you stay at our house when you’re unclear about anything, right? That’s terrible,” said Xie Jiwen, “So it started from the time you came to the Xie Family. If you count it like that, we have been together for a long time.”","“The parents from both sides have to meet and get to know each other,” said Xie Jiwen, “I can’t let my parents-in-law think that I’m taking advantage of you.”","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Hehe, just looking at her fighting skills, who could take advantage of her?","Her parents weren’t worried about her at all, all right?","“Don’t worry,” said Xie Jiwen, “It’s just a meeting, that’s all.”","“Who’s worried?” No, she wasn’t talking about that.","Xie Jiwen’s actions were just confusing her, that was all.","“Kaiyin, you don’t have to think about anything, just leave it to us,” said Xie Tongyùùn.","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","“I’m just thinking of spending more time with Xie Jiwen,” said Hu Kaiyin.","“That’s good. You guys spend as much time with each other as possible, it’s fine. We will just meet, it won’t get in the way of you guys spending time with each other,” said Xie Tongyùn.","Hu Kaiyin didn’t know what today.","She felt like she had entered a den of thieves.","The Xie Family was even better at confusing people than those from the Mount Lan Compound.","After a while, Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling also arrived.","When Xie Jiling entered, she asked, “Big Brother, you and Sister Kaiyin are already talking about marriage?!”","So quick!","Even Han Zhuofeng and her weren’t that quick.","He had just confessed today, but Xie Jiwen already wanted to get engaged.","That was fast.","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Nope, it wasn’t her idea at all.","Han Zhuofeng’s competitive spirit was ignited.","In front of everyone, he made a phone call to the family home.","“Grandma, it’s me, Zhuofeng,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“No, I’m at the Xie Family. I’m good, don’t worry,” said Han Zhuofeng, “I just want to say—you and Mom should discuss my marriage with Jiling.”","Xie Jiwen was speechless.","Xie Jiling didn’t know what to say.","“You guys are already discussing it?” Han Zhuofeng was surprised. He smiled ear to ear and asked, “Why didn’t I know?”","“What? You guys started discussing when Jiling and I left?” said Han Zhuofeng while proudly looking in Xie Jiwen’s direction.","It was a direct provocation.","Look, this was the speed of our Han Family!","Ordinary people could not compare with us!","Even Xie Tongyùn could not bear it anymore.","Did this brat forget that he had to marry their Xie Family’s lady?","He even dared to provoke the Xie Family.","After talking for a while more, Han Zhuofeng hung up, full of satisfaction.","Old Mrs. Han was so awesome.","“Zhuofeng, why is your family already preparing the marriage when our families haven’t even met yet?” said Xie Tongyùn with a slight smile.","“They’re just talking about it! Anyway, it won’t get in the way of the meeting. After the meeting, the discussion should then be wrapped up. It’s working in parallel!” Han Zhuofeng hurriedly said.","Why did this sound so familiar to Xie Tongyùn?","Hu Kaiyin chuckled. Was this not similar to what Xie Tongyùn had just told her?","Xie Tongyùn’s competitiveness was stirred up by Han Zhuofeng.","He got up and told Xie Jiwen, “I will talk to your mom. When we reach B City, don’t talk about getting engaged, talk about getting married straight away.”"]},{"number":3530,"title":"Chapter 3530 Untitled","paragraphs":["3530 Untitled","Then, Xie Tongyùn walked away, full of energy.","Han Zhuofeng thought angrily. ‘You guys are bullying me here as I don’t have my elders supporting me.’","Sit and watch when we return to B City.","The Han Family would not lose!","!!","The days in the Xie Family passed by really quickly.","It was probably because it was laid back every day,","The Xie Family was like the Xanadu; the stress from work could be forgotten temporarily while in the courtyard.","It was because it was so laid back here that the time passed by so quickly.","In a blink of an eye, the day they had to return to B City arrived.","Han Zhuofeng was always lively whenever he was at home.","He would make Old Mrs. Han extremely happy","In the Xie Family, he was still like a fish in the water.","At first, Gu Yingsu still did not fully open up to Han Zhuofeng.","However, after a few days, she was so amused by Han Zhuofeng that she even felt like more lines appeared around the corner of her eyes.","As such, she decided to hide from Han Zhuofeng. She could not continue laughing anymore.","But she was just hiding; Gu Yingsu’s impression of Han Zhuofeng had become so much better.","When the day to leave for B City arrived, Gu Yingsu had become much closer to Han Zhuofeng.","They had become more comfortable about spending time with each other.","This time, even Xie Tongyun’s and Gu Yingsu’s flight tickets were bought by Han Zhuofeng.","Originally, Xie Tongyùn and Xu Jialin wanted to go together, so Han Zhuofeng wanted to buy both of their tickets as well.","However, Xie Jiwen insisted on not allowing Han Zhuofeng to take the spotlight alone.","As such, he did not let Han Zhuofeng buy it.","He dealt with Hu Kaiyin’s and his parents’ tickets.","Obviously, he bought first-class tickets for the same flight.","On that day, the Xie Family’s chauffeur drove a big car and sent them to the airport.","For the first time, Han Zhuofeng had peace of mind that he had never experienced before.","In their group, other than him and Hu Kaiyin, they were all exorcists.","It could not be any safer!","When they arrived at B City, it was already nine o’clock at night.","Han Zhuofeng, the local, brought them to eat the specialty of B City.","On the second day, Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu met with the Han Family’s parents.","And Xie Tongyùn and Xu Jialin went to meet Hu Kaiyin’s parents.","On Hu Kaiyin’s side, it was smooth beyond imagination.","Hu Kaiyin was too deadly.","Her parents were extremely concerned that with Hu Kaiyin’s skill and temper, she would send you to the hospital so you could experience the hospital’s excellent wifi.","Which man would dare to be with her then?","Hu Kaiyin was beautiful.","However, was beauty as important as one’s own life?","Now that a sucker—no, a good man appeared.","Hu Kaiyin’s parents did not even have time to be happy, how could they not agree?","They were afraid that their daughter would not be able to marry.","Now, not only could she marry, the other party was impatient, almost like he could not wait to get the marriage certificate sorted on the same day.","Hu Kaiyin’s father, Hu Jiazhi said, “Actually, you can get the marriage certificate today as well. Now the Civil Affairs Bureau is very efficient; you don’t really need to queue up.”","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Hu Kaiyin’s mother, Luo Yulin whispered to Hu Kaiyin, “You guys are in such a rush, is it because you’re pregnant?”","As she said this, Luo Yulin’s gaze fell upon Hu Kaiyin’s stomach.","Hu Kaiyin didn’t know what to say.","Frustrated, Hu Kaiyin said, “Mom, what are you thinking? Besides, I’m not in a rush, not at all. It’s Xie Jiwen who’s in a rush, okay?”","It hasn’t even been a few days since they started dating, and Xie Jiwen was already rushing to get married.","He was competing with Han Zhuofeng.","“Have a heart!” Luo Yulin secretly pinched her. “There’s finally someone who’s willing to marry you, why don’t you hurry? What if he regrets it?!”","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","Why did she feel like her mom was treating Xie Jiwen like a sucker?","When Xie Jiwen heard Hu Jiazhi’s words, he was surprised. “Is that possible? If it is, I will go and get the marriage certificate sorted with Kaiyin this afternoon.”","“That’s no problem.” Hu Jiazhi nodded easily.","A dowry did not matter.","It wasn’t like his family did not have money.","They also did not plan to depend on gifts and the wedding for glory.","When Luo Yulin heard that, she ignored Hu Kaiyin and turned her head to ask Xie Jiwen, “After getting married, where do you guys plan to stay?”","“Kaiyin said that she’s planning on retiring from the Mount Lan Compound. My house is a huge manor in Lingnan, Kaiyin has an individual courtyard there, and it has been laid out according to her liking. She even wanted to get a dog and a cat.”","“So after we get married, she can enjoy her retirement life there. Although it’s Lingnan, the geographical location of the Xie Family is special; it’s extremely cool in the summer, and it’s even more comfortable than B City. In the winter, it will only be a little cold.”","“So I’m thinking about buying a house in B City and getting it laid out according to Kaiyin’s liking. Although, we haven’t really talked about it. Anyway, it depends on whether Kaiyin wants to stay in a big flat or a villa.”","“I feel like Kaiyin will like the villa. She can decorate the courtyard herself and plant some flowers.”","It was probably because Hu Kaiyin had experienced too much danger that she liked that kind of peaceful life.","“When the time comes, we will spend the summer at the Xie Family’s house and come back to B City for winter.” Although it would be cold outdoors in B City, the heater would be enough indoors.","Luo Yulin felt that such an arrangement was excellent, so she kept nodding her head.","Xu Jialin said, “What Jiwen said is good. With the Xie Family’s location, summer is really cool there. During summer, you guys can also come to the Xie Family’s manor.”","“Our manor is huge, and there are a lot of empty courtyards. When you guys come, there are plenty of spaces to live in. I can especially save a courtyard for you guys, and it will belong to you guys in the future,” said Xu Jialin, smiling, “You guys can come whenever you want. You can also decorate it in your own ways.”","Xu Jialin was so welcoming that Luo Yulin felt embarrassed.","It felt like she could not ask them not to get their marriage certificate today.","Of course, they were just words.","It was impossible to get their marriage certificate today, and it would be too childish as well.","No matter what, it had to seem more ceremonial.","It was impossible to allow them to get their marriage certificate when they had just started dating.","Although they said that they were worried about Hu Kaiyin not being able to marry, they could not send their daughter away this impatiently.","She was still their dear daughter, after all.","As such, Xie Jiwen’s wish to get the marriage certificate today was still ruined.","***","As for Han Zhuofeng’s side, the progress was pretty good.","He did not manage to marry Xie Jiling immediately.","However, as Old Mrs. Han was too awesome, Gu Yingsu was no match at all.","On one side, there was also pressure from seniority.","No matter what, Gu Yingsu did not dare to refute Old Mrs. Han’s words too much.","Xie Tongyun was also a simple person.","When Han Zhuofeng met Xie Tongyun, he felt that Xie Jiling’s innocence came from Xie Tongyun.","As such, Xie Tongyun was even less of a match to Old Mrs. Han.","For the whole time, the couple was led by the nose by Old Mrs. Han."]},{"number":3531,"title":"Chapter 3531 Untitled","paragraphs":["3531 Untitled","Old Mrs. Han led the conversation. Although they had not decided the day they would get their marriage certificate, the day of their wedding was already decided.","Gu Yingsu felt too embarrassed to ask about what would happen if they broke up before the wedding.","Unexpectedly, it was as though Old Mrs. Han knew what Gu Yingsu was thinking.","“Isn’t there still one year before the wedding?” said Old Mrs. Han, “They can date all they want, it won’t get in the way of our wedding preparations. After dating for a year, our wedding preparations should be done by then. Isn’t it just right?”","!!","“As for breaking up, don’t worry,” said Old Mrs. Han, chuckling, “It’s not that I am sweet talking, but all three grandsons of our family have a special trait. Either they don’t date at all, or if they like someone, they will be certain and head toward marriage. They won’t change.”","“Then, if they bring their partners back to see us, they won’t change anymore,” said Old Mrs. Han, “The other kids will date first, and when they think it’s time, they will bring their partners home. Some even break up before bringing their partners home.”","“Our family is different,” said Old Mrs. Han, “They date to marry.”","“Zhuofeng’s two older brothers are all like that. Let’s not talk about his two older brothers and our eight great families, the children from the other families are like that as well. Among them, Zhuofeng is the youngest. His other brothers all got married early.”","“With them as role models, Zhuofeng also grew up to be this way,” said Old Mrs. Han.","It was also because her three grandsons were awesome that she was able to praise them without giving it much thought.","She was not scared that her exaggerations would be exposed, and she would feel awkward as a result.","The things that Old Mrs. Han said were all real; they weren’t fake at all.","“It’s just... Madam,” said Gu Yingsu with great difficulty, “Our Jiling is still young. She’s only nineteen this year.”","“That’s right. She will be old enough to marry legally next year. It’s perfect!” said Old Mrs. Han.","“No,” said Gu Yingsu, gathering her courage, “She’s still too young, we have to wait for another two years no matter what.”","“We can’t wait,” said Han Zhuofeng anxiously before Old Mrs. Han could say anything, “Jiling is so young, what if she thinks I’m too old by then?”","“So I have to hurry and marry Jiling while I’m still young!” said Han Zhuofeng.","“Let’s count. She’s nineteen now, and I’m twenty-five. When she graduates, she will be twenty-one, and I will be twenty-seven! Their school has so many young men, what if they hit on Jiling?”","“I feel like I should marry Jiling first, so I won’t give others any chances to covet her,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Old Mrs. Han and Lin Liye nodded in agreement.","Han Zhuofeng’s realization was right.","“But Jiling is still young,” said Gu Yingsu.","“We don’t need to have kids first, but I have to marry Jiling first,” said Han Zhuofeng, “It’s just right, we can have more years of living in our own world.”","“After we live in our own world for six or seven years, we can then have kids; how nice,” said Han Zhuofeng, “Speaking of this, I think that it’s really suitable to get married at this age.”","Gu Yingsu didn’t even know what to say.","Why did it feel like Han Family was forcefully snatching Xie Jiling away from her?","“Jiling, what do you think?” Gu Yingsu could only put her hope in her daughter.","“I think it’s pretty good,” said Xie Jiling, “Anyway, it’s a year later, so we’ll see after a year. When I’m twenty, after a year of spending time together, I can then decide on it.”","Gu Yingsu also thought of an issue.","They were together really early.","If they had to wait till Xie Jiling was twenty-three or twenty-four to get married, they had to wait a few more years.","Didn’t that mean that they would have to date for a long time?","That wouldn’t be too good.","Gu Yingsu felt a little conflicted.","However, Xie Jiling was not against getting married early.","There was still one more year anyway, so there was no need to panic right now.","They would look at the situation when it was time.","As such, Gu Yingsu stopped objecting for now.","The Xie Family’s hotel was at Sheng Yue.","Unable to defend against Han Family’s ‘friendliness,’ even the Xie Family’s accommodation was handled by the Han Family."]},{"number":3532,"title":"Chapter 3532 Untitled","paragraphs":["3532 Untitled","The Xie Family had nothing to do here. It wasn’t often that they could come here, so they might as well explore.","Han Zhuofeng spent the whole day with them on the second day.","On the third day, he worked on the movie’s late-stage production and cutting without resting.","While Han Zhuofeng was busy, the Xie Family walked around B City for two days.","!!","Xie Tongyun received a call from the Xie Family’s manor.","When everyone saw Xie Tongyun’s serious expression, they stopped playing around.","When Xie Tongyun hung up, Xie Tongyùn asked, “What happened?”","“Previously, Jiling had come across a few cases where the evil spirits were used by an exorcist,” said Xie Tongyun, “We found clues of that man.”","Xie Jiling and Xie Jiwen also concentrated and paid attention.","Xie Tongyun said, “When the villagers were exorcising, they came across another one. The clue they obtained is more detailed. With the new clues and with your third uncle using the existing clues and the tracker charm, a reverse tracker charm has been set up.”","“By following the reverse tracker charm, we can trace that man,” said Xie Tongyun.","“It’s just nice that we’re all together, we can track him down together,” said Xie Tongyun.","Xie Jiwen frowned and said, “Don’t you guys think it’s too coincidental? While we’re all gathered here, new clues of that man appeared all of a sudden.”","“Indeed,” said Xie Tongyun, “This is something to be considered. However, if we think about it, if we’re all back home and the clues came out, we will still have to send a lot of people after it.”","“On the contrary, there are more people at the Xie Family’s home,” said Xie Tongyun, “And now that we’re out, the Xie Family’s power is weakened. Whether we send people from the Xie Family or we go there ourselves, it’s not as strong as when we’re at the Xie Family’s home, where the Xie Family’s power is complete.”","Xie Tongyun nodded. “If this is really a trap, then he’s not baiting us, but he’s trying to divide our power.”","“We just don’t know whether it’s a trap or not,” said Xie Tongyun with a frown.","“Whether it is or not, we still have to go and take a look,” said Xie Jiling, “Unless the person purposely showed flaws to let Third Uncle track him.”","“However, I trust Third Uncle’s skill. If the person really showed flaws on purpose, he should have noticed it,” said Xie Jiling.","“No matter what, since it’s a clue, we can’t just leave it alone,” said Xie Tongyun.","According to the reverse tracker charm that the Third Uncle had provided, Xie Tongyun drew a new one.","“Let’s head off tomorrow,” said Xie Tongyun, “This time, let’s not bring Zhuofeng and Kaiyin along.”","“Zhuofeng is busy with his work. Although he said that he would follow Jiling to exorcise in the future, there’s no reason to make him give up his own job. Also, Kaiyin and he aren’t exorcists at the end of the day, if they really came, they won’t be able to help, and it will be dangerous for tem.”","“Don’t call them this time,” said Xie Tongyun.","They were worried that after a long time, their children’s partners wouldn’t be able to handle their job.","However, when the time came, Xie Tongyun did not plan to ask Han Zhuofeng and Hu Kaiyin to come along.","Xie Jiwen and Xie Jiling agreed.","The two contacted Han Zhuofeng and Hu Kaiyin.","It was unsure of how Hu Kaiyin agreed.","As for Han Zhuofeng, when he heard that Xie Jiling was not bringing him along this time, he immediately became anxious.","“I don’t how long I will have to track this man. It might be ten days or even half a month,” said Xie Jiling, “You’re busy with the editing of the movie’s late stage, can you even delay it for that long? The longer you delay, the higher the cost.”","Xie Jiling struck Han Zhuofeng in the bull’s eye.","“I know you’re worried about me, but my family has a lot of people. My family is filled with exorcists, if I’m not safe with them, then I’m not safe anywhere else,” said Xie Jiling.","“And for the enemy this time, we don’t know his situation and how powerful he is, so we don’t know if we can even take care of you with us.”","“Of course, if our family makes a move together, no matter how strong the opponent is, I’m confident that we will be able to deal with them,” said Xie Jiling.","“And this time, not only did we not bring you along, we didn’t even bring Sister Kaiyin along,” said Xie Jiling, “Bringing you guys along is too concerning.”","“Okay.” After hearing that Hu Kaiyin wasn’t brought along as well, Han Zhuofeng felt that he was treated fairly.","“Then, I’ll wait for you guys in B City,” said Han Zhuofeng, concerned, “You guys have to be safe. If the situation allows, remember to send me a message to tell me that you’re safe. No matter what time it is, whether it’s day or night, even midnight is fine.”","“As long as you’re free, send me a WeChat message if the situation allows. If the situation doesn’t allow it, then don’t send a message; don’t let it get in the way of your business. If you get in danger because of that, it won’t be good.” Without following them, Han Zhuofeng couldn’t feel at ease no matter what.","It was like Xie Jiling, and the others were going to the tiger’s den.","“Don’t worry,” said Xie Jiling, smiling, “Actually, it’s not as dangerous as you thought. Rest assured, as long as I have a reception, and I’m not actively tracking the person, I will send you messages.”","“When are you guys leaving?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","“Tomorrow. We’re making preparations today, making sure that everything is ready,” said Xie Jiling.","“Then I’ll try to finish work early and visit you guys,” said Han Zhuofeng.","According to their workload, Han Zhuofeng would have to stay in the studio.","He would set tasks for himself everyday.","If he came across areas that he wasn’t happy with, he would pull an all-nighter to fix them.","“Alright.” Xie Jiling nodded.","After hanging up, she went shopping with her family, ensuring that everything was ready.","Xu Jialin and Gu Yingsu weren’t exorcists as well.","Due to that, they also couldn’t tag along.","They could only stay in B City.","Xie Tongyun, Xie Jiwen and Xie Jiling left on the second day.","Han Zhuofeng prepared an SUV for them for the convenience of tracking. It also saved them time since they wouldn’t have to use public transport and wait for flights.","No matter where they were going, they could drive and take control of the whole trip.","SUVs could also be of good use when going through rugged roads.","They went from B City to Shuzhong, then from Shuzhong to Diannan, then from Diannan to Beijiang.","In the end, they realized that they came back to a place that wasn’t that far from B City.","“Why do I feel like the person is leading us in circles?” said Xie Jiwen, frowning.","During the trip, they also came across many evil spirits.","Among them, there were many which were connected to that exorcist.","From them, new clues were obtained.","And this also meant that they were on the right track."]},{"number":3533,"title":"Chapter 3533 Untitled","paragraphs":["3533 Untitled","But they still came back to the same place in the end.","In the end, their destination was a small town near B City.","Following the hints of the reverse tracker charm, they passed by the town and arrived at a village.","“Wait,” Xie Tongyun voiced out suddenly, “This village, did it even exist before?”","!!","“Is... this a village?” said Xie Jiling, feeling uncertain.","“Let’s get out and have a look,” said Xie Tongyun, “Bring your Red String Bracelet along, the smog in front doesn’t seem right.”","The village in front was covered in a faint yellow smog.","Because of environmental issues in recent years, especially in the North, the smog was very severe.","In the thick smog, they could only see a faint image of the village.","However, Xie Jiling felt that something was wrong.","After hearing Xie Tongyun’s words, everyone took out a red string from their bags.","They tied it around their wrists.","This red string was probably like setting a GPS tracker.","After the four of them wore it, they could feel it.","Especially in places where there was no reception, and real GPS couldn’t be used.","This Red String Bracelet would be of use.","Xie Tongyun looked at this smog and felt that it was abnormal.","Perhaps it was not smog. He was just afraid that once they entered, the signal would be blocked.","“Let’s go,” said Xie Tongyun.","The four got out and walked toward the village.","After walking for a while, they felt that they should have long arrived.","But in reality, that village was still a close distance in front of them.","They could not get near it no matter how.","All they could see was always the faint outline of the village in the smog.","So the four stopped in their tracks.","Xie Jiling took out a compass and saw that the needle of the compass was spinning rapidly as if it was broken.","“We’re already in the center of the formation,” said Xie Jiling.","“Area formation is Uncle’s expertise,” said Xie Jiwen.","Xie Tongyun didn’t decline and started performing calculations.","“Follow me.” Xie Tongyun took out four tracker charms and gave each person one, and carried one himself.","“We don’t know when there will be fog between us too. Take this for self-defense, in case you get lost,” said Xie Tongyun.","Everyone kept it and followed behind Xie Tongyin.","They made twists and turns as they followed behind Xie Tongyin.","The land was empty, and there were no obstructions.","It was as though they were going in circles without a destination.","However, the strange thing was no matter how they circled around, the village was always right in front of them.","Logically, if the village was in the East, and they walked toward the East, the village would be in front of them.","But if they walked toward the West, then the village should be behind them.","But unexpectedly, even when they walked in the opposite direction, the village still appeared in front of them.","It was indeed area formation, no doubt.","However, everyone was confident in Xie Tongyun’s skill to break the formation.","Without saying anything, they followed behind Xie Tongyun.","After a while, Xie Tongyun stood in place.","Everyone also stopped.","Xie Tongyun took out the compass from his bag and checked the directions.","“Let’s go,” said Xie Tongyun.","They followed Xie Tongyun step by step.","The scenery around them suddenly became completely different.","They were surrounded by a fog that seemed like a faint yellow smog.","But they could feel that it wasn’t smog","There wasn’t a village in front of them but rocks.","“We’ve already entered. From the outside, it looks like a village, but in reality, it’s not a village. It’s just camouflage set up under area formation for our naked eye,” said Xie Tongyun.","Xie Jiling suddenly tugged on Xie Jiwen, “Elder Brother, tell me, isn’t this like the Ghost Town where we had been before?”","Xie Jiwen nodded and said, “Unfortunately, the strange rocks do not have a pattern, so there’s no way to determine whether it’s the same or not.”","“I’m annoyed right now. Did the area formation teleport us to the Ghost Town straight away, or is this place set up like the Ghost Town?” Xie Jiwen looked at the black, strange rocks.","Even the height was almost the same as the ones in the Ghost Town.","“Perhaps we can look for the Ghost Town’s mushroom farm, then we will know,” said Xie Jiling."]},{"number":3534,"title":"Chapter 3534 Untitled","paragraphs":["3534 Untitled","“Good idea.” Xie Jiwen nodded.","Among the four, only Xie Jiling and Xie Jiwen had been to the Ghost Town.","As such, the two walked in front.","They did not dare to split up here.","Even with the Red String Bracelet, it was better for the four to stick together.","Even the compass could not give any directions here.","The needle of the compass kept spinning without stopping.","As such, everyone decided to just keep the compass away.","They made marks on the way as they looked for the Ghost Town’s mushroom farm.","“There’s also area formation in here. We’ve been walking in a straight line, but we can’t see the end. Not only is there area formation surrounding the peripheral, but there’s also area formation inside here interfering with the compass.”","Xie Tongyun was both knowledgeable and skillful when it came to area formations.","But Xie Jiling and Xie Jiwen were not bad at it as well.","They broke the formation as they looked for the mushroom farm.","In the end, they did not find the Ghost Town’s mushroom farm.","Finally, Xie Jiling and Xie Jiwen could confirm that this was not the Ghost Town.","It was probably built to look like the Ghost Town.","“But looking at this scale, it could not be built in a short time. Where did these rocks come from? Ghost Town was special because of rocks like these; only Ghost Town had them,” said Xie Jiwen.","As they walked, they broke the formation and walked back.","In the end, even the marks that were made on the way disappeared.","It was either removed, or these rocks could move on their own.","“What’s the use of thinking about this? It’s using too much of my brain cells.” As a genius who got into the University of B City, Xie Jiling was unexpectedly lazy to use her brain to analyze this.","“If the rocks move, we have to find the places where we made the marks before,” said Xie Jiling, “It’s so troublesome.”","She was either lazy to use her brain, or she was lazy to move.","“We can just flatten these rocks,” said Xie Jiling, “Since there’s an area formation here, even if we blow these rocks up, people outside the formation will not notice.”","“Besides, this place is remote, there’s nobody here, so nobody will be hurt,” said Xie Jiling.","“Although the area formation could interfere, similarly, whatever we do inside will not affect anything outside. We can blow things up here in whatever way we want,” said Xie Jiling.","“Since it’s something that can be done easily, why should we use our brains?” said Xie Jiling.","Xie Jiwen was speechless.","That made sense.","That was someone who was worthy to be called the genius who got into the University of B City.","All four took out some empty talisman papers from their bags and drew a few explosive talismans.","Then, they buried it under the soil below the rocks.","They did not bury it under all the rocks at the same time.","They did it on a few rocks at a time.","Blasting them a few at a time meant they could ensure their safety as well.","They drew a shield talisman each and held it in front of them.","When the rocks exploded, it would not hurt them.","When the rocks exploded...","In the dark, someone suddenly trembled.","What was going on?!","Then, Xie Jiling and the others started burying talismans under another pile of rocks.","After a while, all the rocks in this place turned into rubbles.","Xie Jiwen scattered a bunch of elimination talismans.","These rock rubbles were then completely cleared up.","“Now there are no obstructions,” said Xie Jiwen, “Let’s just break the formation.”","Xie Jiling nodded. “This formation has been on my nerves since the beginning. It’s nothing much, but it made itself seem like something high-end.”","As such, the four started breaking the formation.","In the dark, there was a sandbox on the table in front of a man.","On the sandbox, there were originally some rocks.","They were laid out in the exact same way as these strange rocks.","The two seemed to have some connections.","When the rocks at Xie Jiling’s side were all blasted, the rocks in this person’s sandbox also turned to dust.","When the rocks at Xie Jiling’s side were cleared up, the rocks in this person’s sandbox also vanished.","The person had a heavy expression. He had met a worthy opponent!","In this sandbox, there was a yellow fog floating above.","But right now, this fog was slowly fading.","Suddenly, an area of fog suddenly disappeared as if a corner had collapsed.","Right after, areas of fog started disappearing.","This man’s expression suddenly changed, and he immediately flashed out.","“What are you doing?!”","Xie Jiling and the others were breaking the formation, so most of the fog had already disappeared.","A man in a black coat suddenly appeared.","“You guys are so daring!” The man in the black coat was furious when he saw the destruction.","He had almost succeeded.","However, these people destroyed all his hard work.","“Although it’s not complete, it’s enough to deal with the few of you! I’ll let you know the consequence of ruining my plan!” growled the man in the black coat.","Xie Jiling rolled her eyes, not even a little nervous.","She turned around and asked Xie Jiwen, “Isn’t it the more he talks, the less skillful he is?”","“The evil spirits that we’ve met before are the same. Those which talked the most, as if they were so powerful, when we took action, they couldn’t even last a hit,” said Xie Jiling.","“This is probably what you call bluffing,” said Xie Jiwen, nodding.","Xie Tongyun said, “It’s also possible that he doesn’t know his own skills.”","That man in the black coat was enraged.","He raised his hand, and the land in front of him suddenly started sinking.","A black, gigantic, man-shaped creature crawled from beneath the ground.","Xie Tongyun said in a deep voice, “He absorbed evil energy and wanted to create a Wraith King.”","“Looking at this progress, he must have fed it pretty well. It has been a while since it was created,” said Xie Tongyun."]},{"number":3535,"title":"Chapter 3535 Untitled","paragraphs":["3535 Untitled","“But it seems like this Wraith King has already lost its own consciousness,” said Xie Tongyùn.","“That’s natural. If it has its own consciousness, he probably won’t dare to feed it. Since it’s basically dead, he’s afraid of being consumed by it.” Xie Tongyun pouted, unhappy with that man in the black coat. “If he has the skill, feed one with its consciousness intact, then it will be even stronger.”","“Looks like his skills aren’t that good,” said Xie Tongyùn, looking down on him.","That man in the black coat was furious.","!!","Not only were these two men not afraid, but they were also even being sarcastic.","They even started looking down on him!","If they had skills, then they should feed a Wraith King with its consciousness intact!","Feeding a Wraith King with its own consciousness intact would only end in one way: the feeder being consumed by the Wraith King.","However, the man in the black coat did not notice something.","Just when Xie Tongyun and Xie Tongyùn were talking to each other and looking down on him.","Xie Jiwen and Xie Jiling had already secretly found something out.","The two each motioned a Lin Character Mantra.","It was their first time facing a Wraith King, so the two did not dare to be careless.","But luckily, the Wraith King did not have its own consciousness.","Although it was strong on its own, its skill was more dependent on the skills of the man in the black coat.","After all, this Wraith King did not have its own consciousness and was completely controlled by the man in the black coat.","Because of this, its skill was reduced drastically.","If it were a Wraith King with its own consciousness, even Xie Tongyun and Xie Tongyùn would not dare to be sarcastic.","Then, Xie Jiwen motioned a Zhe Character Mantra and struck it on the Wraith King’s body.","The Wraith King roared and was trapped for a while.","But not long after, it escaped the Zhe Character Mantra’s bondage and rushed toward Xie Jiwen.","Xie Jiwen used the soul beating whip and lashed out.","The whip continuously extended and wrapped around the Wraith King.","“Quick. This is not the real soul-beating whip, it can’t last long,” said Xie Jiwen.","It was a soul-beating whip that he replicated, so its power could not compare to the real soul-beating whip.","But now, it had already weakened the Wraith King by a lot after wrapping its soul.","Xie Jiling used this chance to motion a Jie Character Mantra and struck it on the Wraith King’s body.","A huge Jie Character was marked on the Wraith King’s body, and then it disappeared.","It seemed like it had seeped into its body.","The soul-beating whip and Jie Character Mantra targeted the soul.","With their combined abilities, the Wraith King roared in pain.","The soul-beating whip suddenly broke into sections.","The Wraith King waved its hand, and a thick, grey fog appeared.","This grey fog wrapped around Xie Jiling and the others.","Suddenly, the surroundings became pitch black.","They could not even see their own hand.","In response, Xie Tongyun motioned a Xing Character Mantra.","In this pitch-black fog, a golden light appeared around the four.","It was slowly forcing the grey fog outward.","While the light shone, they also saw that among the grey fog, souls with hideous faces were rushing toward them.","“This is the vengeful aura that was fed to the Wraith King!” said Xie Tongyùn.","At the same time, Xie Tongyùn sent out a series of Xing Character Mantras and struck them on the vengeful auras.","Upon touching the light that came from the Xing Character Mantra, these vengeful auras were scorched.","Green smoke appeared from them.","At the same time, these vengeful auras gave out a miserable shriek as they disappeared with the smoke.","“Clean!” Xie Tongyun drew something rapidly on his palm and slapped his palm on the ground.","A faint, golden light appeared from the ground and burned upwards.","It burned off all the grey fog.","The beads on Xie Jiling’s wrist flew out directly toward the Wraith King.","The Wraith King opened its mouth and swallowed the beads.","That man in the black coat sneered.","However, Xie Jiling was not anxious at all.","“Xing!” Xie Jiling said aloud.","A line of Jue Character beads came out from a place that the man in the black coat could not see.","It could be said that it came from within the Wraith King’s body.","It was different from the previous times when the golden light came from above.","This time, the pillar of golden light came out from the Wraith King’s body.","The Wraith King’s face collapsed as it gave out a miserable shriek.","That man in the black coat could not believe that the Wraith King that he had worked so hard to feed was so vulnerable under the attacks of these four!","“Big Brother, help!” Xie Jiling felt like she could not handle it by herself.","Xie Jiwen immediately added Mantras.","Xie Tongyun and Xie Tongyùn also motioned a Xing Character Mantra each.","The four Mantras attacked at the same time.","The Wraith King could not take it anymore.","And the Wraith King’s injury was reflected on the body of the man in the black coat.","“Pffft!”","The man in the black coat spat blood out as a result of the backlash.","He looked at the four in front of him, and his face was ferocious.","These four came to ruin his plan!","The man in the black coat spat his blood on the Wraith King’s body.","That being the case, he would go all out!","The Wraith King absorbed the blood of the man in the black coat like a sacrifice."]},{"number":3536,"title":"Chapter 3536 Untitled","paragraphs":["3536 Untitled","But then, that man in the black coat was suddenly not controlled anymore.","There was blood suddenly seeping out from the body of the man in a black coat. The blood floated into the body of the Wraith King.","The man in the black coat was furious. “Stop! Stop it!”","The skin of the man in the black coat was becoming pale with a speed that could be seen with the naked eye.","!!","However, the Wraith King didn’t stop.","Furthermore, after absorbing a lot of blood, it laughed loudly in a smug way.","It sounded as if it had its own consciousness.","The expression of the man in the black coat was filled with fear and shock. “You... you...”","This Wraith King had regained its consciousness.","Perhaps it was not as strong as a Wraith King which had its own consciousness from the beginning.","However, now that it had consciousness, it would be tricky to deal with.","“Interfere it, quickly!” shouted the man in the black coat to Xie Jiling and the others.","With his own power, he could no longer control it.","And he had already connected himself to the Wraith King.","There was no way to cut it off now.","He could only put his hope on Xie Jiling and the rest.","Xie Jiling and the others also knew the severity of this matter.","The four attacked the Wraith King together.","They forcefully interfered with the Wraith King’s absorption.","But that man in the black coat had collapsed on the ground due to excessive loss of blood.","After escaping the man in the black coat’s control, the Wraith King became even stronger.","The Xing Character Mantra inside its body had weakened its body.","The four motioned a series of Xing Character Mantras and struck them on the Wraith King’s body.","The Wraith King also attacked the four with vengeful auras.","Xie Jiwen used a defensive formation to protect the four.","At this time, a black hole suddenly appeared beside them and was slowly increasing in size.","Then, soul reapers appeared one by one.","There was no time to count how many there were.","Originally, with the control of the man in the black coat, there was a stealth formation on the Wraith King’s body.","It was to help the Wraith King avoid supervision.","But now, the man in the black coat had collapsed on the ground and had lost control of the Wraith King.","The stealth formation was no longer functioning.","This Wraith King then appeared on the monitoring stone tablet.","Through the monitoring stone tablet, the soul reapers sensed the location of the Wraith King and came over.","They did not expect to see Xie Jiling and the others.","When the soul reapers saw that it was them, they gave out a sigh of relief.","They were too confident in the Xie Family’s skills.","They felt that it would be fine this time.","With the soul reapers joining, it became a lot easier all of a sudden.","The soul reapers had a soul-trapping formation that only they possessed.","It was especially used to deal with a vengeful ghost like the Wraith King.","With this soul-trapping formation, the Wraith King was trapped in the middle. Its power was reduced drastically, and it could not move anymore.","Using this opportunity, Xie Jiling and the Xie Family struck the Xing Character Mantra on the vengeful ghost’s heart.","Xie Jiling’s bracelet was still inside the body of the vengeful ghost.","Right now, it was at the vengeful ghost’s heart.","It suddenly combined with the Xing Character Mantra.","Suddenly, the vengeful ghost froze and stiffened.","Then, its huge body started to shake vigorously.","Suddenly, rays of light emerged from its body.","The vengeful ghost’s huge body was like a sieve right now.","Thin rays of golden light leaked out from the Wraith King’s body.","Then, those thin rays became thicker and thicker.","Finally, the golden light rays combined and became a body of golden light.","The Wraith King screamed out from within the golden light.","The soul reapers immediately started to chant their spell.","The Wraith King was weak, and under the spell, the vengeful aura that it absorbed was being scattered and sucked into the artifact.","As the vengeful aura reduced, the Wraith King’s huge body also reduced in size.","Finally, it became the size of a normal human being.","It was locked up by the soul reapers’ soul-trapping lock.","“Thank you so much,” said the soul reapers to Xie Jiling and the others.","Xie Tongyun pointed at the man in the black coat. “What about this man?”","One soul reaper walked in front of the man in the black coat.","He reached out his hand and grabbed, and a soul was grabbed out from the body of the man in the black coat.","“He has already died, and we will bring his soul back with us,” said the soul reaper, “He dared to create a Wraith King, he is in trouble.”","This time, the soul reapers did not have time to say much.","After all, they still had a Wraith King with them.","They were afraid that there would be an accident, so they hurriedly brought it away.","Now, they only had to deal with the man in the black coat who had lost his soul. Xie Tongyun contacted the appropriate department.","There had always been a department that specialized in connecting with exorcists.","They were responsible for dealing with the aftermath.","The Xie Family was naturally familiar with this.","After handling the matter of the man in the black coat over to the relevant department, Xie Jiling and the others left for B City.","They had spent quite some time tracking.","However, they did not spend a lot of time actually fighting.","This time was considered pretty successful.","Xie Jiling did not expect to deal with this matter so quickly.","On their way, Xie Jiling sent a WeChat message to Han Zhuofeng.","“We will be back in B City in around three to four hours,” said Xie Jiling.","It was currently ten minutes past one in the afternoon.","If it were quick, they would arrive in B City around four o’clock, if it were slow, it would be around five o’clock.","It would not be dark yet.","It was considered quick.","Han Zhuofeng was overjoyed.","He hadn’t seen Xie Jiling for half a month.","Other than in areas with bad reception, Xie Jiling almost texted him on WeChat every day to report her safety.","However, Han Zhuofeng was still worried without seeing her in person.","“Then I’ll go to the hotel early to wait for you guys,” Han Zhuofeng immediately said.","During the previous half a month, Han Zhuofeng’s work had become a bit easier for him because he made himself busy with the late stages of the production."]},{"number":3537,"title":"Chapter 3537 Untitled","paragraphs":["3537 Untitled","But even so, during work, he would still be distracted from time to time.","He would think about where Xie Jiling was, whether she had met that person and whether she was in danger.","It was only after receiving her text every day that he could be relieved.","But after a while, he would start worrying.","!!","Day after day, Han Zhuofeng wasn’t really exhausted from work, but because he was so worried about Xie Jiling, he became skinny.","Today’s work plan was not completed yet, but Han Zhuofeng decided to return to the studio at night to continue and finish it overnight after meeting Xie Jiling.","As such, he paused his work and went to the hotel early.","Xu Jialin and Gu Yingsu also received messages from Xie Tongyun and Xie Tongyùn.","Knowing that Han Zhuofeng came, they let him come to the room to wait.","At ten minutes past four in the afternoon, Xie Jiling and the others arrived.","The moment he entered, he hurriedly greeted Xie Tongyun and Xie Tongyùn.","Then, he immediately pulled Xie Jiling over. “How is it? Did you get hurt?”","On the way, while Xie Jiling had nothing to do, she had already told Han Zhuofeng roughly about what happened.","She had already said that she wasn’t hurt at all.","However, Han Zhuofeng was afraid that Xie Jiling did not tell him the truth for fear that he would be worried.","Now that he had seen Xie Jiling in person, he had to confirm it.","If the elders weren’t here, Han Zhuofeng would have gotten even more hands-on.","But now, he had to watch out. He wanted to touch her, but he did not dare to.","Hu Kaiyin also came to see Xie Jiwen.","She wasn’t too worried.","Han Zhuofeng did not dare to touch Xie Jiling as he was afraid that the elders would say that he was taking advantage of her.","However, Hu Kaiyin started touching Xie Jiwen on her own. There was no way to say that she was taking advantage of Xie Jiwen.","It was unsure of who was taking advantage of whom.","Hu Kaiyin gave Xie Jiwen’s body a checkup.","She was more experienced than Han Zhuofeng.","Just by looking at Xie Jiwen’s expression, she could tell whether he was hurt. She nodded in satisfaction. “Not bad.”","Xie Jiwen felt like he was a pig getting checked before being slaughtered.","He pulled Hu Kaiyin over and whispered, “Actually, you can come to my room at night to give me a more thorough checkup. Can you check me again like what you just did?”","Hu Kaiyin blushed and glared at Xie Jiwen. “Xie Jiwen, It seems that you’re experienced. I really can’t tell that you haven’t dated before.”","It was in her element to bully people.","“No! You can’t frame me!” said Xie Jiwen immediately, “It’s just toward you, maybe... maybe I’m born this way.”","Hu Kaiyin was speechless.","“I’m really fine,” said Xie Jiling, “If you don’t believe me, ask my brother, my dad, and my uncle.”","“They won’t help me to lie to you together, right?” said Xie Jiling.","Xie Tongyun immediately smiled and said to Han Zhuofeng, “Don’t worry, she’s really not hurt. This is my daughter right here, and with me there, how can I let her get hurt while I’m doing well? If someone has to get hurt, it has to be us first; she can only be the last one to get hurt.”","“That’s right,” said Xie Jiwen, “I’m her elder brother as well. If I’m fine, how can I let her get hurt?”","Han Zhuofeng was finally relieved, and he smiled at Xie Jiling. “I’m assured now.”","“Are you guys tired? How do you want to eat dinner? Do you want to order room service or go out to eat?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","After all, they had been tracking the man for half a month and had been traveling.","After dealing with today’s matter, they rushed back to B City and were exhausted.","“Then let’s order room service,” said Xie Jiwen, “I’m too lazy to move right now. I want to sleep immediately after eating.”","Xie Jiling nodded, saying, “Then let’s order room service.”","As such, Han Zhuofeng went to order room service for them.","After traveling for so long, they had eaten so much dust today.","Before room service came, they quickly returned to their own rooms to take a shower.","Han Zhuofeng wanted to follow Xie Jiling to her room.","Unfortunately, with so many people watching, Xie Tongyun and Gu Yingsu would never allow it.","As such, Han Zhuofeng could only behave and stay.","Meanwhile, Hu Kaiyin was dragged away by Xie Jiwen.","Han Zhuofeng looked at them from behind with envy.","Why did they not care about Xie Jiwen?!","With this thought, Han Zhuofeng secretly poked Xu Jialin and asked, “Sister Kaiyin just dragged away Big Brother like that, is that okay?”","Whose daughter was not delicate?","This reminded Xu Jialin.","When Xie Jiwen dragged Hu Kaiyin to the door, Xu Jialin said, “Kaiyin shouldn’t go, wait here with us. Jiwen, shower up and come back. The hotel will deliver the meals.”","Han Zhuofeng finally felt fair.","Even if they didn’t do anything, they couldn’t just walk away in pairs while leaving him here alone!"]},{"number":3538,"title":"Chapter 3538 Untitled","paragraphs":["3538 Untitled","Xie Jiwen’s hateful eyes glared at Han Zhuofeng.","He saw Han Zhuofeng tell his Mom something secretly.","It resulted in his Mom stopping Hu Kaiyin.","Actually, he did not drag Hu Kaiyin to do anything.","With Hu Kaiyin’s skills, even if he wanted to do anything, he had to make sure that Hu Kaiyin was happy with it.","Otherwise, he would end up in the hospital without being able to touch his girlfriend.","Besides, he had been running around for half a month.","He even battled the Wraith King today.","He did not have any strength to do anything right now.","He just wanted to spend time with Hu Kaiyin alone.","He did not expect Han Zhuofeng to ruin it!","He glared at Han Zhuofeng fiercely before finally returning to his own room in frustration.","Xie Jiling also returned to take a shower.","After changing into comfortable clothes, she returned.","The hotel had not yet delivered their dinner.","When Han Zhuofeng saw that she entered, he talked to her immediately.","Even if he could not spend time with her alone, they could at least sit a little further from the elders.","Anyway, they were all in the same room, so the elders could see what they were doing.","He could only have a simple conversation with Xie Jiling.","However, even if they were just chatting and their conversation was pure, it felt weird being so near to the elders.","As such, Han Zhuofeng pulled Xie Jiling over to sit further away.","It would be more comfortable talking.","“Have you finished your work today?” asked Xie Jiling, seeing that Han Zhuofeng came over so early.","“Not yet. I came over to eat with you first. I haven’t seen you for half a month, and now that you’re finally back, how can I not return to see you?” said Han Zhuofeng.","Luckily, the studio was in the city as well, so it was convenient to travel there.","It wasn’t like when he was with the production crew. Back then, it would take him a long time just to come back to the city.","“After we’re done eating, I will go back to the studio to finish today’s work,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“You only stay in the studio every day?” asked Xie Jiling.","“Yeah,” said Han Zhuofeng, “After the late stages’ cutting is done, I will go to Brother Xiao Cai’s company and handle the late stages’ special effects.”","“Then I’ll go back to the studio with you today,” said Xie Jiling.","Han Zhuofeng was shocked, thinking that her parents would kill him!","Xie Jiling said it in front of her parents; she was clearly putting him in a hard spot!","Han Zhuofeng looked at her with resentment. “Is there a girlfriend who puts her own boyfriend in a hard spot like you?”","Xie Jiling was still a little confused, then she heard Gu Yingsu say, “Jiling, you have been busy outside for so long, and now that you’re finally back, you should rest properly tonight. It’s the same if you go see Zhuofeng in the day tomorrow.”","Gu Yingsu had already approved Han Zhuofeng.","And she also knew that Han Zhuofeng really understood Xie Jiling’s job, it wasn’t just all talk.","Just now, Xie Tongyun told her everything.","On the way back, Xie Jiling told Han Zhuofeng everything in detail.","It could be seen that Han Zhuofeng really understood.","As such, Gu Yingsu could sigh in relief.","Besides, the parents from both sides had already met.","She also understood the Han Family’s attitude.","She could sigh in relief if the two really got married and Xie Jiling married into the Han Family.","With Han Family’s cute elders, Xie Jiling would be fine.","However, even though she accepted them, she could not just watch her own daughter follow Han Zhuofeng at night?","It was not like she did not allow them to date.","It was alright to date in the day.","It was not allowed at night!","“I just feel like we haven’t seen him for such a long time, so I wanted to go and spend time with him,” said Xie Jiling, “And his work schedule is so packed that he has to work the whole night, so how can he care about other things?”","Gu Yingsu was so angry that she laughed. This little girl even knew what she was worried about.","Han Zhuofeng said immediately, “It’s fine. I will pick you up tomorrow morning to go to the studio together.”","“Although there’s a bed there, it’s that kind of small bed which isn’t comfortable to sleep on. Usually, when I work overnight, if I can’t take it anymore, I will nap for a while. I also work until it’s too late, so when I get lazy to go back home, I’ll just sleep there straight away.”","“But it’s just alright to compromise one or two times once in a while. It’s impossible to rest properly there,” said Han Zhuofeng, trying to persuade Xie Jiling, “You’ve been tired for so long. Now that you’re finally back, you should take a good rest.”","“I really want to spend more time with you but I have to let you rest properly,” said Han Zhuofeng, “Rest here tonight to replenish your energy and sleep till you wake up naturally, then call me or text me on WeChat, and I’ll come pick you up.”","“When I come to pick you up, you should be done packing up, then we can eat something. I will bring you to see my studio after that,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling listened to his arrangements and felt that it was acceptable.","She also knew that it was impossible for her to follow Han Zhuofeng today.","As such, Xie Jiling could only accept it obediently.","The elders did not allow her to follow Han Zhuofeng back at night.","However, after the meal, when Han Zhuofeng was leaving, Xie Jiling still sent him off.","The two went outside the hotel together. Han Zhuofeng still had loads of work to do, but he was reluctant to leave so quickly.","“What you told me about exorcising the Wraith King isn’t that detailed. Tell me again. Don’t skip the dangerous parts, I want to listen to all of them,” said Han Zhuofeng."]},{"number":3539,"title":"Chapter 3539 Untitled","paragraphs":["3539 Untitled","“Then it’s gonna be long,” said Xie Jiling, “Won’t it delay your work?”","“It’s fine.” Han Zhuofeng held her hand. “I want to stay with you for a little longer.”","The weather was already slightly cold.","Han Zhuofeng led Xie Jiling to the car first.","!!","There was a heater in the car. After the inside of the car was warmed up, Xie Jiling immediately felt more comfortable.","She also didn’t want Han Zhuofeng to leave just like that.","This was the first time Xie Jiling felt this way.","Back then, she still couldn’t understand her feelings about Han Zhuofeng.","Even after she understood it, she still felt a little unfamiliar with that feeling.","But now that she had gotten together with him, the more time she spent with Han Zhuofeng, the more she liked him.","The more she was reluctant to leave his side.","Han Zhuofeng was busy with the production crew, and now he was busy in the studio.","Xie Jiling realized that she was missing him more and more and that she always wanted to be with him.","No matter how clueless she was about her feelings, Xie Jiling knew that she liked Han Zhuofeng a lot.","As such, she deliberately talked a bit slower.","She also filled in the details as requested by Han Zhuofeng.","However, she still thought about him going back to work, so she did not dare to take up too much of his time.","As such, she did not repeat the things that she had told him in the afternoon.","Otherwise, she would end up wanting to talk to him more.","After telling him, Xie Jiling said, “It’s still not too late, so you should hurry up and head back to the studio and finish today’s work early, so you can still rest for a while.”","Xie Jiling didn’t really feel like Han Zhuofeng would be able to rest for long.","“How much work do you still have?” Xie Jiling asked softly.","“I’ll probably be done after working for six to seven hours,” said Han Zhuofeng.","It was half past seven at night right now.","After six hours, it would be half past one in the morning. If it were seven hours, it would be half past two in the morning.","As such, Xie Jiling immediately rushed him. “Then it’s still alright. Get back to work quickly, so you can sleep for longer.”","“Okay.” Han Zhuofeng smiled and nodded. “Don’t rush yourself tomorrow. Sleep till you wake up naturally. When you’re awake, tell me, then I’ll come to pick you up.”","“Okay.” Xie Jiling nodded. “Actually, you can just let the chauffeur pick me up, but I still want you to pick me up.”","Han Zhuofeng then heard Xie Jiling say, “Then we can spend more time together.”","“When we arrive at the studio, you’ll have to do your work and won’t have time to care about me. Of course, I don’t want you to take care of me. However, if you come to pick me up, at least on the way, you can’t work, so we can still talk,” said Xie Jiling, smiling.","Han Zhuofeng felt a little guilty. “I’m too busy recently. We just started dating and should spend more time together. However, I’m so busy recently that I can’t take out too much time.”","“It’s fine.” Xie Jiling did not mind.","It did not matter how much time they spent together. What was more important was that they deliberately took time out of their busy schedules to see each other, even though it would only be for a brief moment.","Han Zhuofeng had never been in a relationship before, but he knew that love shouldn’t be like this.","It was just that Xie Jiling was a bit dense, so she didn’t mind it.","Han Zhuofeng felt that he was pretty lucky; his little girlfriend did not have any experience, so she did not mind that he did not have that much time to be with her.","If it were someone else, Han Zhuofeng would have had a hard time.","However, the more naive Xie Jiling was, the more Han Zhuofeng felt guilty.","“After I’m done with this, it’ll be fine,” said Han Zhuofeng, “I can definitely finish this within this month. Then, I won’t have anything to do, I’ll just wait to send it for reviewing and wait for it to pass the review. After submitting it for review, I can’t intervene anymore.”","“So after submitting for review, I’ll be free and can spend time with you,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“But I’m busy. I have to go to class, so I can’t always be with you.” Xie Jiling felt pressured.","What if Han Zhuofeng was unhappy because she did not spend enough time with him?","“That’s alright. That’s easy to deal with,” said Han Zhuofeng, “Just like how you accompany me to work in the studio, I can also accompany you to go to class.”","“Anyway, the university’s class would not forbid me from listening,” said Han Zhuofeng, “When that time comes, won’t it be okay if I go to your school to see you?”","Xie Jiling thought about it and felt that it was pretty good, so she agreed happily.","Han Zhuofeng exclaimed once again. This little girl was so easy to please.","She was happy with whatever he said.","“Then I’m going back,” said Xie Jiling.","“Wait.” Han Zhuofeng pulled her wrist. “I haven’t seen you for half a month.”","Xie Jiling also lingered around, not wanting to leave. “I really want to follow you back to the studio.”","“Little girl, it’s the other way round. I should be saying that. I really want to bring you back or something.”"]},{"number":3540,"title":"Chapter 3540 Untitled","paragraphs":["3540 Untitled","Why did Xie Jiling say it first?","Han Zhuofeng felt that he should not let Xie Jiling do everything first. It shouldn’t be like that.","As such, Han Zhuofeng did not hesitate anymore.","He leaned over and kissed her on the lips.","Xie Jiling blushed and touched her own mouth. Her eyes widened, and she looked around in embarrassment.","Han Zhuofeng thought that her reaction was so cute. He tilted his head and kissed her again on her cheek.","Even though it was at night, it could be seen that Xie Jiling’s face was bright red.","“Then I’m... I’m going back,” said Xie Jiling.","“Okay.” Han Zhuofeng nodded. “I’ll only leave after I watch you enter the hotel.”","Xie Jiling turned around and opened the car door, but she suddenly stopped and turned around.","She rapidly found Han Zhuofeng’s lips and landed a kiss on them, then she immediately got out.","“Remember to let me know when you reach the studio!” Xie Jiling ran away before Han Zhuofeng could respond.","Han Zhuofeng sat in the car and rubbed the steering wheel happily with his hands.","How could Xie Jiling be so adorable?!","He watched as Xie Jiling entered the hotel, he even saw Xie Jiling waving to him at the hotel entrance before she turned around to enter the hotel.","Han Zhuofeng rejoiced in the car by himself for a while before driving back to the studio.","After entering the studio, without caring for other things, Han Zhuofeng texted Xie Jiling on WeChat first.","He told her that he had already arrived at the studio safely.","Xie Jiling finally went to sleep in peace after receiving the message.","In the studio, there were still a lot of people, everyone was still busy.","Han Zhuofeng only went to sleep after working until two in the morning.","The next day, at ten in the morning, he received Xie Jiling’s WeChat message.","Then, he immediately went to pick up Xie Jiling.","When he reached the hotel, Xie Jiling had already finished her breakfast and was waiting for him.","She didn’t want to waste his time.","When Gu Yingsu saw Han Zhuofeng, she said, “What time did you work until yesterday? Have you already eaten breakfast today?”","“I only finished at two in the morning and woke up at seven today. The people in our studio ate breakfast together and continued working. It will be okay after we’re done with everything.”","This time, when Han Zhuofeng brought Xie Jiling away, Gu Yingsu did not stop them.","And Han Zhuofeng even promised to send Xie Jiling back after dinner.","She was familiar with everyone in the studio; they had already met in the production crew previously.","As such, when Xie Jiling arrived, everyone greeted her.","Xie Jiling behaved and didn’t disturb their work.","She put on earphones and watched some videos to entertain herself.","At noon, Han Zhuofeng blamed himself and said, “My studio’s pretty boring, right?”","Xie Jiling shook her head. “Didn’t you say that after you’re done with these, you’ll go to class with me? It’ll be just as boring to go to class with me.”","“At least I can still watch videos here. If you go to class with me, you won’t be able to do anything,” said Xie Jiling.","“I’ll watch videos secretly.” Han Zhuofeng wasn’t a good student. “Let’s go eat first.”","The time they spent together was actually no different than when they were with the production crew back then.","After Xie Jiling came back, she canceled her leave and went back to class.","When she had no class, she would come to Han Zhuofeng’s studio.","Finally, the late stages of the movie production were complete, and Han Zhuofeng submitted the movie for review.","When the batch number could be received and when it could be released in the cinema would depend on the results of the review.","However, it was just as what Han Zhuofeng told Xie Jiling.","The genre of his movie was considered a thought-provoking Sci-fi film, there was no violence, nor was there any negative influence.","The whole film received positive results.","As such, passing the review shouldn’t be an issue.","While waiting for the results, Han Zhuofeng became free.","Xie Jiling was also on her winter break. She was supposed to return home for New Year.","However, she recalled that Han Zhuofeng’s film would be released during the Lunar New Year if it passed the review.","As such, she wanted to stay, she wanted to watch it in the cinema with Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling discussed with her parents first before telling Han Zhuofeng.","She was afraid that her parents wouldn’t be happy about it, and she would have to explain their answer to Han Zhuofeng.","As such, she told her parents first, if her parents did not allow it, she would pretend that nothing happened to avoid disappointing Han Zhuofeng.","Coincidentally, Xu Jialin also decided to let Xie Jiwen stay in B City so that he could hurry up and take down Hu Kaiyin’s parents.","After discussing, Xie Tongyun, Gu Yingsu, Xie Tongyùn, and Xu Jialin just decided to come to B City together to spend the New Year there.","That way, they could spend the New Year with their children, and at the same time, the two children would not be torn between going home and staying in B City.","When they came, they still stayed at Sheng Yue.","Gu Yingsu told Xie Tongyun, “I’m thinking, why don’t we buy a house in B City?”","“Hmm?” Xie Tongyun was also interested.","Gu Yingsu said, “Jiling and Zhuofeng are together, and they spend more time in B City. We’re far away in Lingnan, it’s inconvenient.”","“Why don’t we buy a house in B City? We can come over and stay from time to time,” said Gu Yingsu, “Just like this time, if we have a house in B City, we won’t have to stay in the hotel.”","“I think that Jiling will probably stay in B City with Zhuofeng for New Year in the future. Looking at how the Han Family is so impatient, Jiling will get married sooner or later. She might be dragged by Zhuofeng to take their marriage certificate when she turns twenty.”","“After marriage, she will definitely stay in B City with Zhuofeng for New Year. Our house is far, so we’ll have to spend a lot of time on the road every time. They’re usually busy with work, so when they’re finally on break and have to spend a lot of time on the road, they’ll be exhausted.”","“So I’m thinking that we should just come to B City for the New Year every year. If they want to return to Lingnan to stay there, we’ll wait at home. At least that way, they won’t have to suffer every year. They can just visit once every two to three years.”","Once Gu Yingsu had accepted Han Zhuofeng, she started thinking about Han Zhuofeng’s sake.","Xie Jiling wasn’t even married to him yet, but Gu Yingsu didn’t mind that Xie Jiling wanted to stay in B City.","“You’re right,” said Xie Tongyun, “Since we’re here, let’s look at houses in these few days. If we’re not satisfied, we’ll stay here until after the New Year to continue looking.”","Xie Tongyun told Xie Tongyùn and Xu Jialin about this. Unexpectedly, everyone had the same idea.","As such, they decided to buy houses next to each other and be neighbors.","However, they weren’t familiar with this place after all, so Xie Tongyun told Han Zhuofeng about their decision.","Naturally, Han Zhuofeng was very willing to help.","“Dad, Mom, don’t bother yourself with this. I can tell Brother Chengzhi about this. His family deals with properties,” said Han Zhuofeng, “Among the houses in B City, I will ask Brother Chengzhi to choose a batch according to the type and location that you want, then you can choose from there. This method is way better than going through an agent. After all, no agent can profit from the commission of the houses you will buy with this method.”"]},{"number":3541,"title":"Chapter 3541 Untitled","paragraphs":["3541 Untitled","Xie Tongyun and the others thought it was a great idea.","Anyway, the families of Xie Tongyun and Xie Tongyùn planned to stay together, so this matter was dealt with by Han Zhuofeng.","Since Han Zhuofeng requested it, Qi Chengzhi treated the matter with extra care.","He asked his own assistant to handle the matter.","His original assistant Cheng Dongge became his brother-in-law, and his skills were outstanding, so he had been promoted.","Qi Chengzhi’s assistant changed a long time ago.","Qi Chengzhi asked his assistant to contact Xie Tongyun and the others.","He tidied up some of their requests for buying a house, and he chose some villas that matched their requests.","Xie Tongyun did not request to be near the city center.","After all, it was a villa, it was not realistic for it to be in the city center, which had little land and many people.","Even if there was one, it had to have been built a long time ago and would be too old.","As such, it didn’t matter even if the villa was a little far from the city center. The environment just had to be good.","So according to these, the assistant brought some of the material that he had tidied up to discuss with Xie Tongyun.","Following the assistant’s introduction, Xie Tongyun and the others picked the ones that they thought were good.","Then they followed the assistant to have a look.","They were people who truly wanted to help them pick a house that matched all their requests.","And Xie Tongyun and the others were straightforward people who truly wanted to buy a house.","As such, both parties immediately decided on one and immediately went over to the villa to look at it.","From the environment of the area to the butler setup and the various facilities...","The properties Qi Lin developed were all reassuring.","Xie Tongyun and the others were also straightforward people.","They weren’t owners who lacked money.","After landing their eyes on one, they bought it directly because they liked it.","It had always been a troublesome affair to look for a house. One had to compare many houses.","Unexpectedly, so much trouble could be avoided.","If everything went smoothly, they could settle the house before New Year.","Mainly, they had their eyes on the butler setup.","Usually, they wouldn’t stay in B City for a long time.","In a year, they would stay in B City for a maximum of two months.","After a long time without staying, they had to get someone to clean the house.","It would be more convenient with a butler.","They could get the butler to do whatever they needed.","So the two families bought two villas that were next to each other.","The only issue was that although the villas had already been bought, the renovations would still take a long time.","So even if they bought the house, they could only stay in the hotel for now.","On Han Zhuofeng’s side, the movie had also passed the review.","Because of the genre and that the script was edited properly, there was no content that had crossed the line.","As such, the film after the review was exactly the same duration as the film before, nothing was cut at all.","“This is the New Year Season’s movie list the Han Corporation received.”","Amidst the meeting in the family home, Han Zhuoli gave the list to Han Zhuofeng.","“This year’s New Year Season is surprisingly competitive,” said Han Zhuoli.","“To promote domestic films, the New Year Season has always never included international films; it’s the same this year,” said Han Zhuoli.","“However, in the past years, they were all some occasional family comedies. They are occasional films, and their competitiveness at the box office isn’t that great. One is because they are films with low budget, so not a lot of people would want to spend money to watch them.”","“The other reason is that it is difficult for comedies to be good. The humor and load have to be suitable, and the rhythm has to be well-managed. And it also has to make the audience laugh. Awkward humor only irritates the audience, making them think that the movie is boring.”","“So the New Year Season’s movies aren’t actually competitive, but good productions that are done with hard work can stand out from the rest,” said Han Zhuoli, “At first, you choosing the New Year Season to release this film is a good choice. A Sci-fi film, among many low-budget films, is something that will attract many eyes.”","“But now?” asked Han Zhuofeng immediately.","The reason he chose to release it during the New Year Season was because of that.","Among the New Year Season’s comedies and family films, his Sci-fi film would be a really strong candidate.","Especially now, when the country was lacking this kind of sincere production.","If the audience felt that the reputation was good, the box office could explode.","But now, listening to Han Zhuoli, it was clearly not this way.","“Have a look yourself.” Han Zhuoli passed a list to Han Zhuofeng.","Han Zhuofeng glanced at it, and the corner of his eye twitched.","The time’s Summer Season had the action comedy ‘Awkward Spy’ which had two movie emperors as cast.","There was also the family movie ‘New Year’s Eve,’ which had an experienced comedy actor and a few skillful actors.","There was also a pure comedy, ‘Machine City in the Sky,’ in which two famous comedy masters were cast.","These two comedy masters would guarantee a good box office for a comedy film.","As long as one of them was involved, there would be a lot of people buying tickets.","Not to mention two of them were participating in the movie.","“These three movies are predicted to be the strongest competitors in this New Year Season. However, we still have to look at the results after they have been released,” said Han Zhuoling.","“We’re telling you this because wanted to ask you whether you still want to release it as part of the New Year Season? Perhaps you want to avoid the New Year Season? Although the batch number has been released, you don’t need to rush to release the film. It’s the same if you release it after the hype of these three films dies down,”","“The New Year Season is in the middle of the seven-day break of the Lunar New Year. After these seven days, the box office sales will reduce. During the break, the audience who should watch the films would have watched most of the films by then, and the hype will slowly die down. They will also start watching the other films.”","“Of course, because the Lunar New Year break would end by then, everyone will be busy working. Even if it’s the weekend, the box office may not be as good as it is during the break.”","“But this depends on your decision. Anyway, we have our own cinema. We don’t care about how other cinemas are releasing the film, but our own cinema will definitely release your film,” said Han Zhuoli.","Han Zhuofeng thought about it and said, “Then let’s follow the original plan and release it during the New Year Season.”","“I have faith in this film,” said Han Zhuofeng, “I believe that as long as the film is good, it will receive support.”","“Okay.” Han Zhuoli did not say anything more.","Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli had always wanted to leave this matter to Han Zhuofeng.","No matter what decision Han Zhuofeng made, Han Zhuoli and Han Zhuoling would support it, and they wouldn’t have any other opinions.","Anyway, even if he wanted to try and carve his own path during New Year’s Season, they would just release the film.","Even if they made it all Han Zhuofeng’s film.","Their own cinema was that stubborn.","Han Zhuofeng pondered and asked Lu Man, “Sister-in-Law, how do you think we should release the film and do its promotion?”","It was right to ask Lu Man this kind of thing.","It was really convenient to have a public relations professional at home.","Back then, before Lu Man gave birth, she was playing around in the entertainment industry. She was just too impressive."]},{"number":3542,"title":"Chapter 3542 Untitled","paragraphs":["3542 Untitled","“I have already thought of this problem for you,” said Lu Man, smiling, “I knew you would definitely choose to release it during the New Year Season. You aren’t the type to back down without trying.”","If he backed down, that meant that he had no confidence in his own production.","But would Han Zhuofeng not have confidence?","He had invested so much into this movie.","Every cent was utilized.","The salary of the actors and actresses were reduced as much as possible.","It wasn’t like many films, which claimed that they had millions of investment, but those numbers were actually fake.","As a result, the audience would become curious after watching the film.","Where did their budget go?","The special effects that were made with so much money were just at this level?","However, Han Zhuofeng was different. He put all his money into special effects and demanded to shoot a proper movie.","He had invested so much, and now he had to back down?","He would definitely not be willing to do so.","“Looking at the situation now, having Han Family as your background is not considered an advantage for you but a disadvantage,” said Lu Man.","“What do you mean?” asked Han Zhuofeng immediately.","“Everyone knows that you’re the Third Son of the Han Family,” said Lu Man, “Nowadays, people don’t want to provoke too much. Especially through the internet, they want to find fault with everything.”","“As a new director, your first product is a Sci-fi movie with such a high difficulty. Just by looking at this, there will be a lot of people criticizing you. They won’t be optimistic about your first movie.”","“I know. While I was still shooting, there were already many remarks like that on the internet,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“Other than that, the netizens don’t trust our own Sci-fi films. Previously, there are too many films that claimed that they were movies with good special effects, but they disappointed the audience again and again. Now, the audience is disappointed in our special effects film. Subconsciously, they will think that your movie is just a marketing gimmick, and in reality, it is just a movie with cheap special effects.”","“So first of all, your starting point is already more difficult than the other three comedy films, and those other three films are empowered by popular movie emperors with various styles. As for this movie, other than Zhiqing, there’s really no other popular actors.”","“Furthermore, every big cinema will also judge the films based on their own experiences. Through the audience’s expectations, ranking of the watch list on the ticketing app and other factors, they would decide the movies’ showtimes scheduling,” said Lu Man.","“If simply just from these factors, you don’t have an advantage. Furthermore, because of the competition between the Han Corporation and the other cinemas, they are very willing to crush you. Then, they will schedule your film a lot lesser.”","“As for Han Corporation, there are two possibilities. The first one is to give your film a lot of show time, but the audience will feel that the Han Family is conniving with you just because you’re the third son, and they’re suppressing the other movies for your sake.”","“To them, giving those popular movies fewer showtimes than other cinemas will be considered suppressing those movies. If other cinemas give your movie only a little showtime, but the Han Corporation scheduled your movie normally, in comparison, the netizens will still feel the Han Corporation is giving you special treatment.”","“But it’s our own cinema, so what if I get the special treatment? However, we’re scared that the netizens will develop a rebellious mindset. The more we do this, the more they won’t want to watch.”","“However, we can’t just copy how the other cinemas schedule their showtimes since if we showed your movie only a few times, the people will think that your movie is so bad that your family doesn’t even want to support it.”","Han Zhuofeng scratched his head. “Yes. It’s really hard to satisfy the people.”","Han Zhuofeng did not pay attention to the way the other movies did their promotion. Now, after being reminded by Lu Man, he remembered it.","It was indeed like that.","“Then what do i do? Since both extremes aren’t allowed, and I can’t even schedule it normally, what do I do?” Han Zhuofeng was in a dilemma.","“Preview, are you bold enough to do it?” asked Lu Man.","Since she had already thought of this issue, she had also naturally thought of a solution.","“First of all, we should invite a group of movie critics and have them conduct their own reviews about the movie. Then, we’ll conduct a public preview.”","“Before the New Year Season is released officially, the cinemas have not yet scheduled the showtimes for the New Year Season, so let’s do a preview first. We’ll let the ordinary audience see it first, so they can spread through word of mouth.”","“Of course, the condition is that the movie is really good. Then, through word of mouth, if the audience thinks that this movie is good, but the other cinemas only schedule so few showtimes for the movie, those cinemas will find it hard not to receive a backlash.”","“It will be the cinema suppressing you rather than the movie being bad. Even without your complaints, the netizens would shower them with criticisms,” said Lu Man.","“When that time comes, nobody will say anything even if the Han Corporation schedules more showtimes for you,” said Lu Man.","“The three movies with movie emperors are the greatest competitors in the New Year Season. Fortunately, they’re comedies, so they won’t need to do a preview. If they release it during the New Year Season, and there’s a wave of people liking it, it’ll be fine. During the preview period, you shouldn’t have any competitors.”","“However, the risk of doing this is that once you try to increase your popularity, if the audience’s response is not great, then the New Year Season will be none of your business,” said Lu Man, “Once your popularity is crushed, it’s hard to get it back.”","“So do you dare to do a preview?” asked Lu Man.","“I dare,” said Han Zhuofeng in a decisive manner,” Before the movie was submitted for review, our main team has taken a look at it before; we are very confident in this movie.”","“Okay, then let’s start preparing the preview,” said Lu Family, “After the movie critics, there could be attacks toward the movie, so let’s give each other a low mark on purpose. The preview has to be controlled perfectly.”","“What if someone gives bad comments,” asked Han Zhuofeng.","As long it was a competition, there would always be situations like this.","There would always be people who would ask others to deliberately leave a bad review.","As such, if there were too many bad reviews, people wouldn’t watch the movie anymore and would follow the bandwagon.","They wouldn’t watch it because of the bad reviews.","“Leave that to me,” said Lu Man, “If someone dares to invite the keyboard warriors to give bad reviews, I will make sure they return the way where they came from, and they should be prepared to face the consequences of their failure!”","Han Zhuofeng thought about Lu Man’s achievements and suddenly felt worried.","He was worried for his opponents.","His competitors’ teams better not buy keyboard warriors to insult him.","They would still be the unlucky ones in the end.","After making a decision, they started discussing the preview."]},{"number":3543,"title":"Chapter 3543 Untitled","paragraphs":["3543 Untitled","“The timing’s perfect. The students are on vacation, and they have time to watch movies.” Lu Man said, “The target audience for films with such themes are young people, focusing mainly on students and young working adults.”","As such, they decided on a date for the press screening.","The preview was scheduled to happen a week before the release date of the movie, and there would be one screening showing per day.","To prevent people from sending hate comments and giving negative reviews before the test screening, Han Zhuofeng secretly sent out invitations to the major media companies.","There was no public announcement.","In addition to the major media outlets and film critics, he invited some professional translators who frequently translated the subtitles for Hollywood movies.","Those professionals were famous and verified on Weibo.","Although they were just translators, they had watched a lot of movies and could provide a rather authoritative assessment.","These translators were even invited to the test screenings of many popular Hollywood movies.","In the mind of the netizens, these individuals’ film reviews had high reference value.","As such, the press screening for ‘Dimensions’ started secretly.","Although Lu Man only played a cameo role in the film, she still saw how difficult it was to shoot the film.","Because of Shi Xiaoya, Han Zhuoling visited the set everyday and became familiar with the filming process as well.","And so, they had a lot of faith in the movie Han Zhuofeng directed.","When the press screening ended, the result was just as they had expected.","The major media companies, independent content creators, and some verified Weibo users all expressed their thoughts on social media.","Filmmaker Huang: “I was at the press screening for ”Dimensions.’ The movie was shot wonderfully. This film has opened the doors for future sci-fi films in our country. There are some imperfections, but that can definitely be ignored. This film is qualified to compete with Hollywood movies.”","It All Depends On Attitude: “Initially, because ‘Dimensions’ is Director Han Zhuofeng’s first film and because Han Zhuofeng is the third young master of the Han Family, I thought that this would be a child’s play and didn’t have high expectations before I started watching it. In fact, I was even skeptical. However, when I finished the movie, I found myself loving it.”","Translator SuiFeng: “The movie ‘Dimensions’ can be described as a legendary film. Although this film was based on a novel, it managed to convey the suspense and the mentally exhausting parts of the novel. Han Zhuofeng dug out the content in the novel and broke it down into many pieces and studied the novel a little by little. He also added some of his own reasoning and understanding of the work. You can see that he has also done a lot of analysis of the original work and put in a lot of effort.”","Just a Voice Actor: “I give full marks to the special effects in this movie. You can see the sincerity through its special effects. However, this is not a meaningless movie that presents only remarkable special effects. The director has very strong storytelling skills. Not only does this movie has remarkable special effects, but it also presents an awesome plot with very strong logic. It’s hard to imagine that this is Han Zhuofeng’s first movie.”","Incapable Monk: “I will watch this movie again during the official screening. Even though I watched it once, there is still a lot to unpack, and there are a lot of details I missed. This is the kind of movie that you would need to watch twice, thrice, or even four times.”","Moving Cloud and Flowing Water: “The original story is good and the movie itself presented very genuine special effects. These two factors make this a good movie. ‘Dimensions’ is a film that fills the gap in the history of sci-fi films and makes the Chinese film industry feel proud of it.”","The influencers who attended the press screening published their post-viewing reviews as well.","There were a lot of positive reviews.","Lu Man immediately contacted the social media accounts, gossiping accounts, and celebrity news accounts with a good relationship with her.","All those accounts immediately started sharing those positive reviews.","Then, she boosted the post and made the topic trending.","She had never been scared of spending money on publicity.","In addition, the Han Family was rich.","The money used for promoting the movie wasn’t part of Han Zhuofeng’s film budget.","This was a separate budget.","Anyway, the Han Family had personally invested in this movie.","As such, it didn’t matter to them if they spent a little more money to promote the movie.","The family would be the one to profit or lose money.","Since there were more than enough funds for the marketing of this movie, Lu Man felt very relaxed as she promoted the movie.","This was the first time she used money recklessly to promote something. It was simple and violent. Lu Man enjoyed it a lot.","There were three other films doing publicity and promotion before their release dates.","However, those three movie did their publicity by having their main cast members attend events.","They would release previews online.","Such marketing strategies could not be compared with the confident move played by Han Zhuofeng, who hosted a movie screening.","The reviews of ‘Dimensions’ were based on the actual film instead of a teaser.","Pineapple Net started allowing ratings of the film.","And the rating of the film immediately went up to 9.6.","Of course, this was because there weren’t many people rating the movie.","Once more people start reviewing the movie, the rating should drop.","However, there had only been a press screening.","The people who had watched the movie represented the media.","The people who worked for the media gave good reviews.","The others had yet to watch it, so they couldn’t rate the movie.","Even if competitors wanted to hire an army of people to give low ratings, it wouldn’t work.","After all, they released the list of the names of the media representatives who had watched the movie.","If the movie wasn’t publicly released yet, how could they give a bad review when they couldn’t have watched it.","However, there were accounts that gave low ratings on Pineapple Net.","Some gave a score of 1, and some gave a score of 0.","Han Zhuoling asked someone to take note of all the accounts that gave them a low rating.","“This is just the beginning. When the movie is officially released, the number of low ratings will increase,” Lu Man said, “Take note of all the accounts that are giving low ratings right now. Check their other comments and their past comments. You can determine if they are real users by what they are commenting and the total number of comments.”","“If they were hired, take note of their accounts. When there are more of them, we will be able to investigate them and find out who hired them.” Lu Man said.","As such, Han Zhuofeng did just that.","It was just as they had expected. When the public screening started, the number of negative comments increased.","More and more people watched the movie.","Goddess Elder Sister Yo: “The movie is too good! The more you think about the plot, the scarier it feels. When you first started watching, you won’t think much about it. You just know that the story flows well and that’s how you finished the entire movie. But after you finished the movie and you think back to what had happened, you would feel goosebumps. Even without the special effects, this is an excellent film. With remarkable special effects, this movie is a banger!”","The Moon is Sour: “Awesome special effects! Every frame of the movie showed some special effects. I don’t know how much money they spent on this. When I was watching, I even forgot that I was watching a locally-made movie. I thought I was watching a Hollywood CGI movie. This is exceptional! The story is awesome! The CGI is awesome! Promise me that you will watch this movie.”","Dog 22: I will definitely watch it again. I watched it with my boyfriend. I will watch it again with my bestie. After that, I will watch it with my parents. The plot might be too mentally exhausting for them, and they might not be able to understand it, but they will be fine just watching the special effects in this movie. After all, this is an exceptional movie made in our country.”"]},{"number":3544,"title":"Chapter 3544 Untitled","paragraphs":["3544 Untitled","Every day, someone would purchase a ticket to the movie’s early screening.","But there was one bad thing about the movies shown during the advance screening—The screen had a normal 3D display.","When Han Zhuofeng was directing this film, he thought that since he had invested so much, he might as well level up and make the film even better.","And so, the entire movie was filmed with IMAX cameras.","!!","If one wanted to see the best visual effects, one should watch the movie in an IMAX cinema.","However, the advance screening was only shown in Han Corporation’s cinema.","The family members of the Han Family had personally invested in Han Zhuofeng’s movie.","The other cinemas were competitors of the Han Corporation.","They didn’t want the Han Family to earn so much money.","In addition, the corporations that owned many of the other cinemas had invested money in the other three films.","No matter the reason, they all hoped that Han Zhuofeng’s movie ‘Dimensions’ would be a flop.","And so, ‘Dimensions’ was only shown exclusively in cinemas owned by the Han Corporation. Through the viewers’ comments and reviews, everyone knew that Han Zhuofeng’s movie was indeed excellent.","The Han Corporation was very cunning.","For the screening that happened once per day, they only showed it in a standard 3D cinema hall.","If the viewers wanted to watch the maximum-coverage IMAX screen, then they would need to watch the movie again.","Not only would this increase the Han Corporation’s profit, but it would also increase the total gross of the movie ‘Dimensions.’","Han Zhuofeng had scolded his brothers and called them cunning businessmen.","Even though the early screening was merely in a regular 3D cinema auditorium, many people still chose to see the movie because the audience reviews were so positive.","They concluded that the film was good after watching it. And so, many of them made the decision to watch it with their significant other or their family and friends for the second or third time when the movie was formally released.","“Sister-in-Law! You are awesome!” Han Zhuofeng was so happy.","In his opinion, he did a terrific job in producing this movie. However, since he had directed this movie, he thought he could be a little biased.","His studio staff members had contributed to the creation of this movie, so they could also be biased.","Han Zhuofeng was worried that his opinion was biased. And so, he felt really scared before the press screening started.","But when the first press screening ended, the media representatives gave good reviews. As a result, Han Zhuofeng felt at ease.","All that remained were the reviews from the public.","The viewers that watched the premier also gave good reviews.","Han Zhuofeng then felt completely at ease.","He then realized that Lu Man’s strategy had essentially generated free publicity for the movie ‘Dimensions.’","Word-of-mouth marketing was truly the most effective form of advertising.","“You made sure that the cinemas owned by the Han Corporation are making money at the box office without utilizing a lot of the budget for marketing. Your approach enabled moviegoers to recommend the films on their own.” Han Zhuofeng gave Lu Man a thumbs up. “Sister-in-Law, you haven’t been working for a while, but you’re like a good sword that never grows old!”","Lu Man rolled her eyes as she scolded, “What do you mean by a good sword that never grows old? I’m not old.”","“Indeed!” Han Zhuoli, who was standing off to the side, reacted angrily and joined Lu Man.","“Yes, yes, yes.” Han Zhuofeng immediately corrected himself, saying, “I’m wrong.”","As of now, Lu Man was his god!","He had to make Lu Man happy.","In fact, if one thought about it, any films that Lu Man had assisted in promoting...","All of those films had incredibly high gross and had never flopped.","“Pay close attention these days. I think the fake reviewers are coming soon,” Lu Man said.","Han Zhuoli immediately said, “I will ask my men to be on guard.”","It was just as Lu Man had expected.","Their competitor did hire a lot of fake reviewers.","Many viewers pretended as though they had watched the movie and posted negative reviews online.","There were people giving very low ratings on Pineapple Net.","It caused the rating on Pineapple Net te to drop from 9.6 to 8.9.","Han Zhuoli immediately ordered his staff to take note of all these account names and investigate the person who hired those fake reviewers.","“Sister-in-Law, who do you think did this?” Han Zhuofeng asked.","“I’m guessing all three competitors took part in this,” answered Lu Man.","“Are they that ruthless?” Han Zhuofeng gasped and said, “I had a good impression of the directors and cast members for those three films. They don’t seem like people who would do such things.”","Especially considering that some of the cast members had won best actor awards. The directors of those films should be at the same level as well.","They were all people who had the power to boost the box office record.","Whether it was the cast members who had won best actor or the director, any one of them could do such a thing.","The viewers were willing to watch the movie in a cinema merely because they had been the ones who produced the film.","People at their level cherish their reputations even more.","“It might not be them. You mustn’t forget that there are investors. Each of the three movies cast actors who can boost the box office record, but the wage of those actors could be between 70 or 80 million to 100 million.”","“This is a low-budget movie. However, the low budget listed here merely refers to the budget for the production of the movie. The cast members’ salaries aren’t included in the budget. In addition, at least two high-ranking actors appeared in each movie. The compensation plus the production and marketing budgets would make up the overall budget.”","“This is how the Han Corporation makes a profit. You should know this well. The film is shown in the cinema, and the earnings are divided up. The expenses of filmmaking and marketing are deducted. Eventually, the investors’ final profit does not even make up a significant amount of the total revenue.”","“If they really wanted to make a profit, they would have to try to boost the box office earnings.” Lu Man said.","“Of the three movies, ‘Lost Detective’, ‘New Years Eve’, and ‘Sky Mechanical City,’ the movie ‘New Year’s Eve’ used most of its budget for the salary of the cast members. This movie is a comedy for families, so it won’t be difficult to break even at the box office. According to my calculations, they would break even if the gross reaches 500 million and would start turning a profit when the box office gross surpasses 500 million,” Lu Man added.","“As a result, there is a lower likelihood that the movie ‘New Year’s Eve’ will hire fake reviewers. The movie ‘Lost Detective,’ on the other hand, is an action comedy movie and would demand a bigger budget. Aside from the salaries of the cast members, the film production costs are also higher. Most importantly, they have two Oscar-winning actors that received high wages that could take up half of the film’s budget.”","“As for the movie ‘Sky Mechanical City,’ this movie is a fantasy comedy. CGI was heavily utilized. You can already see that there is a lot of CGI by watching the teaser. The investors have big hopes for this film and had invested a lot of money in its marketing.”","“Therefore, they will find it harder to understand that this movie will fail. Additionally, I learned from a few paparazzi that the “Sky Mechanical City” production crew is pretty ambitious and hopes to dominate the new year’s box office and become the highest-grossing movie released during this year’s New Year.”","The paparazzi usually get more information than celebrity news media.","“Initially, before your movie came out, ‘Sky Mechanical City’ viewed the movie ‘Lost Detective’ as their rival. Both of them prepared armies of fake reviewers, and they should have started tarnishing each other’s reputation on the release date,” Lu Man said.","“As for the movie ‘New Year’s Eve,’ it was just a heartwarming movie. Although this movie wouldn’t flop, it wouldn’t be extremely popular as well. So for those two other films, the movie ‘New Year’s Eve’ isn’t a worthy rival. It was fated to be third.”","“But then, your movie suddenly appeared. Initially, they didn’t think much about your film since the public kept roasting your film thanks to your inexperience.”"]},{"number":3545,"title":"Chapter 3545 Untitled","paragraphs":["3545 Untitled","“But since the popularity after the preview is too good, they should start worrying. So I’m leaning more toward these two,” said Lu Man, “Well, let’s wait until we have investigated it properly. We can’t just frame people.”","But before investigating, Lu Man could not just watch ‘Dimensions’ get criticized.","She also did not directly reprimand those ghostwriters.","It was all because such an action would be meaningless.","!!","Lu Man already knew it would happen, so she had already asked people to write her a press release.","Lu Man did not immediately release it everywhere.","She first sent it to those entertainment accounts, which had happily worked with her and had good relationships with her, on Weibo.","There were two types of script.","One type was for entertainment, highlighting the flaws of those ghostwriters.","Even if the boss in the dark was still hidden, these flaws were enough to prove that they were ghostwriters and that they might not have watched the movie.","From the pictures to the funny language.","She exposed those ghostwriters first.","In terms of emotions, she was making the netizens develop a sense of doubt toward those bad comments, which had already appeared or were going to appear.","In addition, there was also the mindset of sympathizing with the weak.","Although Han Zhuofeng was not weak at all, being criticized in such a way still made him look pitiful.","He was just shooting a film, but he actually had to receive such criticism.","If it were a bad film, then it was fine.","However, it was clearly a good film.","As such, the people sympathized with him.","So, even if the netizens hadn’t watched the movie yet, in terms of emotions, they were already on Han Zhuofeng’s side.","Lu Man also controlled the rhythm.","She made these entertainment accounts upload these documents, but they could not upload too many or too quickly.","Doing that would irritate the netizens.","With Lu Man controlling the rhythm, most of the netizens sided with Han Zhuofeng.","Of course, there were also some self-proclaimed intellectuals who felt that these were all Han Zhuofeng’s marketing tactics and insisted on not being fooled.","After confirming the netizens’ support target.","Lu Man released the second wave of documents.","She gave it to different entertainment accounts.","But this time, she added some social media accounts on WeChat.","Especially the social media accounts with the nature of entertainment gossip and movie resources.","She made them post those documents.","Her main goal was to tell people how hard it had been for Han Zhuofeng to shoot the film.","Han Zhuofeng did not get any investors for the film.","There were even no investors who were willing to invest in Han Zhuofeng because of the Han Family.","Han Zhuofeng took out all the money that he could take out.","He even almost sold his car.","Because he sold his car Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli found out about what he was doing..","It was only then that they found out Han Zhuofeng wanted to shoot the film ‘Dimensions’.","It was only then that the Han Family members took out their own money and gave it to Han Zhuofeng to shoot the movie.","They did not touch any money from the Han Corporation.","These were the two types of documents that were posted on the first day.","The result of this was that whoever continued to criticize the film ‘Dimensions’.","The netizens who had watched the movie would reprimand them first.","They even showed their movie tickets. “I watched it, so I praise it. Those who said that ‘Dimensions’ isn’t good, have you guys really watched it? If you watched, show us your tickets.”","“Such a sincere and outstanding production is rare. Some people shouldn’t suppress such an excellent movie for their own benefit. You’re destroying the improvement and development of our domestic films!”","“Doing such a thing for personal benefits is absolutely disgusting!”","“Anyway, I will tell my friends and family around me that this movie is really good and will not let these comments influence them.”","After that, Lu Man went silent.","She did not continue to let those social media accounts post articles related to ‘Dimensions’.","The New Year Season’s movies were all released on the first day of the Lunar New Year.","Han Zhuoli and Han Zhuoling had already investigated the employer of those ghostwriters.","It was really the team behind ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’.","On the night of Lunar New Year’s Eve.","The Han Family members were sitting together for a reunion dinner.","Naturally, they talked about it.","“The movie’s main team has no problem, the problem is the investors behind them. They are our old friends. The ‘Lost Detective’ is produced in collaboration with Music Movement Media, Happy Fortune Media, Zhu Lu Cultures and Ji Zhou Culture.”","“The ‘Sky Mechanical City’ is produced by United Pictures, Zhu Lu Cultures, Tai Yi Films and Qi Cheng Films. Among them, Zhu Lu Cultures invested in both movies,” said Han Zhuoli.","“And with all these companies combined, not only are they the Han Corporation’s competitors but they have also been screwed over by Man Man before. What they have done can be considered settling old grudges. Those grudges have to be involved as well,” said Han Zhuoli with a smile.","“Of course, I’m not saying that we completely dragged you down. Your movie is just too good, so they feel threatened by it.”","Han Zhuoling nodded. “These companies also have their own cinemas under them. They release the films that they have invested in, then collect the profit from their cinemas. Naturally, they hope that those movies will have more showtimes, so the other movies can be suppressed.”","“Originally, the other movies are already not enough as competitors, so even if their showtimes are reduced, nobody will say anything. But you’re different. Your movie has a good reputation. if they want to reduce your showtimes, it will be unreasonable. They needed a proper reason.”","“They have to first worsen your movie’s reputation, then they would have a reason to reduce your movie’s showtimes,” said Han Zhuoling.","“However, they also have to see if we’ll agree. They can’t completely decide on their own.” Lu Man sneered.","Han Zhuofeng clicked his tongue. “They already suffered so much in our hands, why can’t they learn from their mistakes?”","“After all, the Han Family has so many resources, so they also want to take a slice of the pie. Even if they win once, it will already be good for them,” said Han Zhuoli.","At this moment, Lu Man opened a professional box office app.","The app displayed the movies’ pre-sale box office, preview box office, and real-time box office on that day.","There were also every movie’s showtime schedule, attendance rate, and the app’s final prediction for its box office sales according to many data.","The prediction was usually accurate.","There was also the box office sales ranking.","The ranking was sorted annually and at all-time.","Movie enthusiasts and people interested in this area would try to understand the box office of the movies that they were supporting through this app.","Lu Man also liked to look at it when she had nothing to do.","Of course, these data were definitely not as detailed and professional as what the Han Corporation could collect."]},{"number":3546,"title":"Chapter 3546 Untitled","paragraphs":["3546 Untitled","After all, this software was more for the general public and to provide a real-time update.","The data of big corporations like the Han Corporation would not be updated in real-time, but it was more detailed and well-rounded.","Right now, the showtime scheduling of the other cinemas had already been released.","But the Han Corporation had not yet announced their showtime schedules.","!!","“As expected, they scheduled very few showtimes for ‘Dimensions’,” said Lu Man, “That way, even if the audience wants to buy tickets and watch it, with limited theater halls, the box office sales won’t be that high.”","“Besides, they have given good showtimes to “Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’. The showtimes of ‘Dimensions’ are either very early or very late, not to mention a good theater hall,” said Lu Man, sneering.","“They didn’t even give ‘Dimensions’ a single IMAX hall, all of them are just normal 3D halls,” said Lu Man coldly, “However, ‘Lost Detective is just a normal 2D movie, and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ is a fake 3D that was converted in the late stages, there’s no need to use IMAX camera to shoot a full frame movie. It’s such a waste to use all the IMAX halls.”","Old Mr. Han was unhappy when he heard this. “These people actually dared to bully Zhuofeng? Do they really think that our Han Family has nobody?”","Old Mr. Han looked at Han Zhuoli and Han Zhuoling with dissatisfaction. “Both of you, when are you buying these companies?”","Han Zhuoling was speechless. “...”","Han Zhuoli was dumbfounded.","Could they just buy those companies whenever?","“Anyway, I don’t care!” said Old Mr. Han, “They dare to bully our family, it’s not like we don’t have our own cinema! Our cinema will fight all three of them! Schedule all the showtimes for Zhuofeng’s movie, as many as possible! If the netizens want to reprimand us about it, let them do it! What’s wrong with putting out our own child’s movie?”","“Yeah,” said Old Mrs. Han, “Never mind if Zhuofeng shot a bad film, we can’t just forcefully schedule the showtimes for him. However, Zhuofeng clearly shot a good film. Let’s schedule all the showtimes for Zhuofeng, for the rest, just give them one showtime per day as a courtesy.”","Han Zhuoling could not hold back his laughter. He said, “We’ve already arranged the showtime schedule. Naturally, Zhuofeng’s film is the first. It’s just that when there’s a solution to avoid the criticism of the netizens, we can’t go and look for criticisms, right?”","“So, we’re also waiting,” said Han Zhuoling.","“Waiting for what?” asked Old Mrs. Han, confused.","“Waiting for the showtime schedules of the other cinemas,” said Lu Man, smiling.","“Now, we can announce our showtime schedule,” said Lu Man.","Han Zhuoli, the Han Corporation’s CEO, posted on Weibo the showtime schedule of the Han Corporation’s cinemas.","The Han Corporation’s cinema app and the Han Corporation’s ticket channel on various big ticketing websites were all activated at the same time.","On Weibo, Han Zhuofeng was very firm. “How is ‘Dimensions’? The audience who watched it gave clear answers. However, other cinemas still reduced the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’ to such an extent. ‘Dimensions’ was well-made and is the first production of our family’s little brother. No matter what, the Han Corporation has to support it.”","There were two pictures below, one was the showtime schedule of ‘Dimensions’ given by other cinemas.","‘Dimensions’ showtime rate could not even beat the showtime rate of those two animated films for children.","And the other picture was the showtime schedule of the Han Corporation’s cinema...","Since the other cinemas reduced ‘Dimensions’ showtime to such an extent, then the Han Corporation increased ‘Dimensions’ showtime themselves.","As such, ‘Dimensions’ showtimes took eighty-three percent of all showtimes.","The rest were given to other movies.","Those two animated films had the same showtime as the original showtime schedule.","As for ‘New Year’s Eve’, its showtime schedule was similar to other cinemas as well. Other than ‘Dimensions,’ it was the second in rank in terms of showtime.","The rest were divided between ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’.","There was only one percent of showtimes left for those two movies.","Right after this, Han Zhuoling also started sharing posts.","The various actors in the movie also publicized movie articles.","Other than Lu Man and Yan Zhiqing, the other actors were previously worried.","Looking at the internet, they were afraid that ‘Dimensions’ would be suppressed so much that it would fail.","But now, looking at how firm the Han Corporation was when it came to supporting ‘Dimensions,’ everyone felt at ease.","It was easier to do anything with one’s back against a big tree.","The team of ‘New Year’s Eve’ had no objections.","Anyway, they did not lose anything in terms of the showtime schedule.","The netizens also did not think that the Han Corporation did a bad thing.","They even cheered for the Han Corporation.","“666, Han Zhuoli and Han Zhuoling: If you don’t schedule showtimes for my little brother, then we’ll do it ourselves. Don’t even wish to have a name for your movie in the Han Corporation.”","“I went to investigate the investors of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City,’ other than the Han Corporation, the companies behind various big cinemas participated. It’s no wonder that they scheduled so many showtimes for these two movies and reduced the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’.”","“The reputation of ‘Dimensions’ is so good, but those cinemas still didn’t schedule showtimes for it, this is unreasonable. I won’t blame the Han Corporation for directly reducing the showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’. An eye for an eye.”","The investors took a look and saw that not a single netizen thought that the Han Corporation was committing jobbery. Suddenly, they felt uneasy.","Immediately, someone directly contacted Han Zhuoli.","At the dining table, Han Zhuoli picked up in front of everyone.","To let everyone hear it clearly, he even turned on the speaker.","The one who called was CEO Wang of United Pictures.","Lu Man was very familiar with him.","Back then, he was screwed over by Lu Man.","Back then, he also tried to go against Lu Man, but he begged for peace when he couldn’t beat Lu Man.","Who could have thought that CEO Wang would not learn from his mistakes?","He still chose to fight before asking for peace.","“CEO Han,” called CEO Wang.","“CEO Wang, happy new year.” Right now, Han Zhuoli had the initiative.","So Han Zhuoli’s tone was a lot easier.","“Hehe, CEO Han, it’s the new year, what can’t we discuss nicely? Why must we make things so ugly?” said CEO Wang.","“Oh? What thing?” said Han Zhuoli, playing dumb.","CEO Wang could hear that he was playing dumb, so he said, “Isn’t the Han Corporation’s showtime schedule for ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ too little?”","“CEO Wang, you call here representing yourself or representing the production companies?” asked Han Zhuoli without answering.","CEO Wang paused for a while and said, “Obviously, I’m representing the production companies of those two movies. After discussion, it was decided that I would call you as the representative.”","“It’s also to avoid everyone calling you one by one so that your New Year’s Eve can be peaceful,” said CEO Wang, “Although I didn’t invest in ‘Lost Detective,’ since everyone decided to come forward together, if the team of ‘Lost Detective’ sent someone, they will tell you the same thing, so I’ll just represent all of them to save you time.”"]},{"number":3547,"title":"Chapter 3547 Untitled","paragraphs":["3547 Untitled","“That’s true.” It was true that they were considerate of him having a good New Year, so Han Zhuoli agreed with it.","“So what does CEO Wang want to talk about this time?” asked Han Zhuoli.","“CEO Han, your showtime scheduling for ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’, shouldn’t you increase it?” asked CEO Wang.","“Then, will you increase the showtimes of Dimensions, too?” said Han Zhuoli immediately.","!!","CEO Wang chuckled dryly and said, “CEO Wang, there’s no other choice. It’s because the popularity of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ is too high, and the pre-sales were good, that’s why they have so many showtimes.”","“‘Dimensions’ is the number one on the watch list for the New Year Season on the ticketing app, and you’re talking about popularity and pre-sales with me?” Han Zhuoli sneered. “If you want more showtimes for ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City,’ you guys have to show your sincerity as well.”","“For this matter, let’s treat it as a trade. We’ll give ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ the same amount of showtimes you give ‘Dimensions’,” said Han Zhuoli.","CEO Wang wanted to scold someone.","Was that equal?","We did not give ‘Dimensions’ one percent of the showtime!","“I only have this one request, go back and discuss it with the others,” said Han Zhuoli, “I’m hanging up.”","Without waiting for CEO Wang to respond, Han Zhuoli hung up.","Clearly, that group of people did not want to give ‘Dimensions’ a chance.","So after hanging up, CEO Wang did not call again to continue his discussion with Han Zhuoli.","However, it was also because they knew that this was Han Zhuofeng’s movie, so there was no need to fight with Han Zhuoli.","They decided to just compete.","With the two cinemas combined, they had a chance to win against the Han Corporation’s cinema.","Now they had to look at the movies’ individual skills to increase box office sales.","However, Han Zhuoli’s suggestion made it seem like ‘Dimensions’ was at a disadvantage.","If the two cinemas increased the number of showtimes for ‘Dimensions’, the Han Corporation would also increase the number of showtimes for those two movies.","In terms of the proportion of showtimes, those two movies would definitely be higher than ‘Dimensions’.","But in reality, those two movies were not working together.","Those two movies were also competitors with each other.","Due to that, if the showtimes of the two movies were calculated separately, they still could not beat ‘Dimensions’.","This was also why CEO Wang and the others did not accept Han Zhuoli’s suggestion.","Because that way, ‘Dimensions’ would be the movie with the highest proportion of showtimes.","As such, they would rather combine the two cinemas to fight with the Han Corporation’s cinema.","That way, the two movie’s showtimes would be almost the same as the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’.","The Han Corporation was ruthless enough to increase the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’ to such a great extent.","In the Han Corporation. it was almost like the two movies had no showtime.","The showtimes of the two movies in those two cinemas were a lot combined.","However, if they were separated, either one would not be able to compare to ‘Dimensions’.","It was only after the two cinemas were combined that they could be on par with ‘Dimensions’.","It could be seen how the Han Corporation overdid with the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’.","He didn’t hold back when it came to helping his own younger brother, there was not a single bit of hidden jobbery!","***","On the first day of the Lunar New Year, Han Zhuofeng booked an entire cinema.","The Han Family, Xie Family, Wang Juhuai, Xia Qingwei and the Shi Family.","There were also the Yan Family and the Wei Family.","Yan Zhiqing was the main actress, and Wei Wucai did the special effects at a really discounted price.","As such, Han Zhuofeng also invited their two families to watch it together.","Anyway, the IMAX halls were huge, and even if so many families were together, there was still adequate space.","Besides, they were all sitting on gold-class seats.","The few families went to one of the cinemas of the Han Corporation.","Han Zhuofeng booked the IMAX3D hall.","Although Han Zhuofeng had already watched it. The netizens’ evaluation was great as well.","However, it was different since his family would be watching it.","It was like handing in homework,","Han Zhuofeng felt a little nervous.","He cared the most about his family’s opinions of the movie.","Before the movie started, they talked to each other.","Xie Jiling asked Han Zhuofeng, “When you’re walking in public, it’s not that easy to be recognized by someone, right?”","“Nope,” said Han Zhuofeng.","The three brothers often appeared on the news online.","However, everyone only saw photos.","When they saw the real person, they might not be able to match it with the pictures.","“Then let’s find a suitable time to watch it again. Let’s not book the whole hall. We should listen to the audience’s opinions as well,” said Xie Jiling.","“Okay.” He found Xie Jiling’s suggestion to be great.","At this moment, the hall’s lights went off, and the movie officially started.","Everyone stopped talking.","Previously, Xie Jiling went almost every day to Han Zhuofeng’s studio to watch them carry out the late stages of the movie production.","However, watching them work was completely different from watching a fully completed movie.","While they were doing the late stages of the production, they did it frame by frame.","It was choppy and did not look interesting at all.","Due to this, Xie Jiling did her own things most of the time and did not watch them work.","It was to avoid lowering her anticipation for the completed film.","After watching it this time with everyone, Xie Jiling’s mind went blank.","As a genius at B University, she was confused by the intellectually stimulating logic of the film.","Now, Xie Jiling started subconsciously started doing some deductive reasoning.","If it were so, what would happen next, then it would cause this, and the final result would be this.","Xie Jiling’s expression was torn, and Han Zhuofeng could not help but laugh.","He raised his hand and pinched her cheek, and asked, “What are you thinking?”","“I’m doing some deductions,” said Xie Jiling, “It’s so confusing.”","“Setting that aside, what do you think of it?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","As a genius, Xie Jiling’s IQ was definitely high.","“It’s excellent. Both the special effects and the plot. The plot was smooth, and the pace was good. As for whether there were any holes in the reasoning, I could not say for now, I have to go back and smoothen my reasoning first,” said Xie Jiling honestly.","Lu Man smiled and said, “Since Jiling can’t find any plot holes right away, the plot should be great.”","Han Zhuofeng thought that it was right and looked at the others nervously. “What do you guys think?”","Everyone expressed that the movie was great.”","Besides, it was not because they did not dare to hurt him and were sweet-talking him.","Han Zhuofeng looked at Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli.","Han Zhuoli nodded. “It’s really great. I feel a little regretful that the Han Corporation didn’t invest in the movie. It would have been nice to have Han Corporation’s logo on the opening title.”","Han Zhuoling nodded. “It’s excellent, you can rest assured. Have a little more confidence. This movie will definitely go viral.”"]},{"number":3548,"title":"Chapter 3548 Untitled","paragraphs":["3548 Untitled","“But it will be hard after this. You just made a really good movie as your first movie, so the audience will expect a lot from you. They will expect more from your next film, be ready,” reminded Han Zhuoli.","Han Zhuofeng nodded. “I know, after this movie, I will continue training. I won’t rush to choose a new movie.”","“Let’s go. It’s rare for our few families to gather. Let’s go and find a place to eat,” said Old Mrs. Han.","The only issue was that with a few families gathered together, a normal restaurant would not work; there was no place big enough for them.","As such, everyone went to Sheng Yue again.","They booked a small banquet hall in Sheng Yue.","One or two tables would be enough for a family.","While they were waiting for the food, Old Mrs. Han asked, “How do you plan to promote the next movie?”","Old Mrs. Han pouted and said, “Although I know that the main teams for those two movies might not be involved in scheduling the showtime, and they might be innocent, I can’t just let it go.”","Who did not have times when they were overprotective and biased?","“So I am thinking of ensuring that the box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ must be higher than those two movies. It would be a tight slap in the faces of those few companies! They wanted to suppress ‘Dimensions,’ so we’ll use the truth to tell them that their suppression is useless!” said Old Mrs. Han.","Lu Man smiled and said, “Grandma, don’t worry, the promotions of ‘Dimensions’ will not loosen up. Besides, it is a good movie. From the current market, the netizens’ word of mouth is more useful than any other marketing methods.”","“I estimate that from the first day until the third day, even till the seventh day of Lunar New Year, during this whole Lunar New Year holiday, the box office sales of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ won’t be too bad.”","“After all, everyone would watch movies during the holiday. Perhaps they would not watch it a few times, but if they wanted to watch them all at least once, they could only do so during these few days,” said Lu Man.","“It’s only after the holiday that we can see whose stamina is stronger.”","“However, if the two cinemas are not willing to schedule showtimes for ‘Dimensions,’ we can use the netizens’ comments to force them,” said Lu Man.","“Anyway, we’re not scared here. Zhuoli and Big Brother will stand up for their own little brother, it’s very justified.”","“Let’s look at the box office sales of the three movies today,” said Lu Man, “At the golden time at night, I have already told the WeChat official accounts to post a series of promotions of ‘Dimensions’. There won’t be any spoilers. Anyway, this movie is a thinker, people will have to watch it from start to end. Even if they want to spoil something, they won’t know where to start.”","“We can just promote the special effects,” said Lu Man.","At night, the WeChat official accounts posted a special effects promotion for ‘Dimensions’.","The audience who watched the preview previously had already promoted the special effects.","Now, the WeChat official accounts made some GIFs as examples.","There were many people who decided to watch an easy movie like ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ first. After seeing the promotions, they would surely have a good impression of ‘Dimensions’ and would want to watch it later.","Besides, these official WeChat accounts used fun language combined with pictures, so it was very attractive.","At night, Han Zhuofeng did not sleep as he waited for the final results on the ticketing app.","He wanted to see the box office sales on the first day of release.","It wasn’t just Han Zhuofeng. The actors and crew members who participated in the production of ‘Dimensions’ also did not sleep.","Everyone waited for the refresh at midnight.","Finally, the app refreshed at midnight.","On the first day of the Lunar New Year, the movie with the number one box office sales was ‘Dimensions’!","On the first day of release, the box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ was 350 million.","And the box office sales of ‘Sky Mechanical City’, which was in second place was 330 million.","It wasn’t far from ‘Dimensions’.","The box office sales of ‘Lost Detective,’ which was in third place was 290 million. It was some distance away from the first two.","Han Zhuofeng was thinking about whether he should discuss this with Lu Man, but he was afraid that Lu Man was already asleep.","If his elder brother caught him, he would get scolded.","Unexpectedly, while he was still hesitating, he received Lu Man’s text on WeChat.","Lu Man straight away sent him a screenshot of the box office sales.","“Ask your elder brother to get someone to investigate the attendance of ‘Dimensions’ in the other two cinemas tomorrow,” said Lu Family, “The showtimes scheduled for ‘Dimensions’ weren’t too good, and there were areas which the Han Corporation’s cinema couldn’t cover. If there were audiences, who were willing to watch ‘Dimensions’ even at those bad times, then ‘Dimensions’ can definitely defeat the other two movies.”","“Because in Han Corporation’s cinema today, during the showtimes scheduled for those two movies, the attendance wasn’t high,” said Lu Man.","Honestly, Lu Man and Han Zhuofeng weren’t worried anymore.","After the second day and the third day.","The box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ and the other two movies were still pretty good.","However, the box office sales of the other two movies had a little drop.","However, the drop wasn’t obvious, and ‘Dimensions’ was on a steady rise.","With this comparison, the box office sales of the other two movies seemed a bit weaker.","The box office sales of the other two movies dropped on the second day and rose back on the third day.","However, on the fourth day, they dropped again, and on the fifth day, they started dropping continuously.","It seemed like after watching the movies, the audience all went to watch ‘Dimensions,’ and after thinking it was nice, they brought their friends and families to watch it.","Because of this, until the end of the Lunar New Year holidays.","The box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ continued to rise.","However, the box office sales of the other two movies slowly dropped.","During the holiday, the drop wasn’t that obvious because it wasn’t drastic, so the other party remained confident.","But after the holiday finished, everyone went back to work.","The number of people watching the movies peaked at night.","The box office sales decreased drastically.","The box office sales of ‘Lost Detective’ had already dropped to fifty million.","The box office sales of ‘Sky Mechanical City’ had dropped to eighty million.","However, the box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ were still above 200 million.","This made the directors of those two movies anxious.","After all, if the box office sales and the reputation were good, there would be benefits for them.","If they continued to shoot another film, it would be easy to get investors.","Their place in the circle would also become more stable.","The director of ‘Sky Mechanical City’, Liu Hengli, tagged the Han Corporation on Weibo to express his dissatisfaction.","“Even if the Han Corporation wants to help ‘Dimensions’, shouldn’t they give other movies a chance too? Aren’t they crossing the line?”","The director of ‘Lost Detective’, Zhang Youyi, also followed along to express dissatisfaction with the Han Corporation’s scheduling of showtimes.","The Han Corporation’s official Weibo account did not respond.","It was Han Zhuoli who replied, “It’s because the two big cinemas reduced the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’ that the Han Corporation made such a response. We can’t just brush it away when my little brother was bullied. My little brother isn’t just a pushover, you know?”"]},{"number":3549,"title":"Chapter 3549 Untitled","paragraphs":["3549 Untitled","Han Zhuoling said, “The Han Corporation also planned to look at the attitude of those two cinemas. If they were willing to play fair, the Han Corporation would play fair naturally as well. The netizens could check the time; Did the Han Corporation not publicize their showtime scheduling after the other two cinemas did it first?”","Han Zhuoli said, “On the same night, after the Han Corporation publicized their showtime scheduling, CEO Wang of United Pictures called me, requesting the Han Corporation to increase the showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’. I have also made it clear about having a fair trade. If the two cinemas scheduled normal showtimes for ‘Dimensions’, then the Han Corporation would do the same for ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’. However, the two cinemas did not change their showtime scheduling, so they were clearly not accepting my request of having a fair trade, then the Han Corporation have nothing to say.”","Shi Xiaoya said, “Our little brother was bullied, and they won’t allow us to protect him? Besides, if ‘Dimensions’ is a bad film, then never mind, but during the preview, the netizens’ feedback made it clear. However, not only did the two cinemas not give it any showtimes, they even requested to increase the showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’. To be frank, they are just bullying Zhuofeng but still want us Han Family to take it. Do we owe you guys anything?”","Tranquility and Peace said, “666, the Han Family is so dramatic! Young Master Han and Young Master Ling are so cute! They are so overprotective of their brother!”","!!","Poke My Unicorn said, “However, what Xiaoya said makes sense. How dare you guys request them to treat you guys with kindness after you bully them first? What do you think the Han Family is? Are they an easy target?”","It’s this account that said, “Hehe, when the two cinemas were scheduling showtimes, you didn’t say anything. Now, when you saw that your box office sales dropped, you started blaming the Han Corporation for not scheduling showtimes for you guys?”","Kyung said, “The showtimes of ‘Dimensions’ in the two cinemas are so pitiful, and the showtimes are all out of place. They didn’t even complain, what are you two complaining for? Will you guys only be satisfied when everyone compromises with you and give you all the showtimes?”","Flowers in fog for life said, “I felt strange that the showtimes scheduled for ‘New Year’s Eve’ by the Han Corporation were pretty normal, why did they just suppress both your movies? What did you guys do?”","What this netizen said highlighted a key issue.","At this moment, Lu Man also appeared and even posted a few screenshots.","“During the preview of ‘Dimensions’, there were only good comments by netizens in the beginning, then a bunch of keyboard warriors appeared and gave ‘Dimensions’ bad ratings. I immediately asked my friends to investigate this kind of abnormal phenomenon. Then what happened? It was the investors behind ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ who got people to criticize ‘Dimensions’. Do you not have any confidence in the movies that you invested in? If you knew earlier, then shouldn’t you just invest in ‘Dimensions’?”","“Oh, I forgot, back then, you didn’t think that ‘Dimensions’ was promising, so you didn’t invest. So now that ‘Dimensions’ is earning money, don’t be jealous. At the end of the day, when our little brother gets bullied, as his family, we obviously have to back him up.”","“I’m sorry, the Han Family is not good in other areas, but in this area, the cinema is ours, we can schedule the showtimes in whatever way we like!”","The directors of these two movies were stunned.","Back then, when a group of people suddenly criticized ‘Dimensions’, they also knew deep down who did it.","However, that was a matter of the investors, they could not interfere.","Besides, if it were beneficial to them, they would rather just play dumb.","They did not expect Lu Man to find out.","Yuwei said, “Lu Man is still Lu Man.”","Wow lady said, “When Lu Man was giving birth and was in confinement, she did not participate in the entertainment industry. Did you guys forget Lu Man’s skills?”","Vicoju said, “The Han Family is full of love! Each and every one of them is so protective of their little brother!”","Witch YL said, “Hehe, you guys slandered Han Zhuofeng first and also reduced the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’. But now, you won’t even allow the Han Family to spoil their little brother a little? You already slandered someone, but when they made you taste your own medicine, you’re complaining as well? The Han Family is right. Han Family, good job!”","Heart is sour like a lemon 11 said, “Embarrassing! After slandering them, your results are still not as good as theirs, and now you have started to act pitiful. You know how to complain to the Han Corporation about not giving you showtimes, but when the two cinemas did not give ‘Dimensions’ showtimes, why did you guys not say anything?”","Originally, from the perspective of CEO Wang and the others, both sides have issues.","If they really decided to fight, there would definitely be netizens on both sides.","However, they did not expect everyone to stand on the Han Corporation’s side.","There was nobody on their side!","CEO Wang had a toothache. “How did I forget about Lu Man?!”","CEO Yao of Qi Cheng Films frowned and said, “It’s our fault for being too careless. After Lu Man gave birth, she went silent for a long time, and the entertainment industry returned to its old ways. We were manipulating it too well that we forgot about Lu Man.”","Frustrated, CEO Zhu of Zhu Lu Cultures said, “After resting for so long, Lu Man’s skill to stir up trouble has not worsened at all.”","CEO Wang of Tai Yi Films said, “What do we do now? The netizens keep complaining about us. I’m afraid scared they will have conflicting emotions about the two movies. The two movies are pretty good, but we just didn’t expect ‘Dimensions’ to appear. However, if the netizens don’t watch them because of their emotions, then we’ll be in big trouble.”","“Let’s discuss with Han Zhuoli,” said CEO Wang of United Pictures, “Let’s confess and have a fair trade with them. Our two cinemas will increase the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’, and let the Han Corporation also do the same for ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’.”","CEO Yao looked at everyone and said, “Who’s discussing with Han Zhuoli this time?”","CEO Wang of United Pictures said immediately, “Anyway, I’m not going this time! I did it last time, so it has to be someone else this time.”","Anyway, now that he realized Lu Man was also involved, he would not step up no matter what.","He really forgot after not seeing Lu Man stir up the crowd for a long time.","Now, he suddenly remembered how Lu Man did a good promotion last time, and CEO Wang was suddenly feeling burdened.","If he knew early, he would have invested in ‘Dimensions’!","Even if he was not confident in Han Zhuofeng’s directing skills, he should have been confident in Lu Man’s marketing skills!","He even suspected that if ‘Dimensions’ was a bad film, Lu Man could promote it well.","CEO Wang of Tai Yi Films said, “How about we let Old Zhu go? Old Zhu’s Zhu Lu Cultures is the only one that invested in both films. It’s reasonable for you to go and discuss with Han Zhuoli.”","CEO Zhu did not decline.","If he declined, it would only delay this matter.","CEO Zhu immediately called Han Zhuoli.","When the matter was stirred up online, it was at night."]},{"number":3550,"title":"Chapter 3550 Untitled","paragraphs":["3550 Untitled","The directors of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ were also pretty good at finding the right time.","They did this at the peak of the matter online.","They just did not expect that not only did they not get what they wanted, but it would also backfire on them.","Lu Man gave them the checkmate again.","Now, the netizens had a lot of opinions about these two movies.","Those movies were pretty good, but they did not reach their expectations.","It was also possible that the marketing was too good. Those two movies had skillful movie emperors and many fans.","There was also the support of special effects.","And there were even reputable directors.","Before watching the movies, the netizens’ expectations were too high, so they realized when they were watching the movies.","The movies were indeed above average, if their expectations were not that high, they would still be satisfied.","Unfortunately, in the early stages, the two movies had too much promotion, and it raised the audience’s expectations.","After entering the cinema and watching the movies, the audience could not help but feel that it was just average.","On the contrary, in Han Zhuofeng’s case, before the movie’s preview, it was looked down on and doubted.","In the end, during the preview, it gave the audience a huge surprise.","It made them know that even a domestic film could actually be so outstanding.","In comparison, the audience naturally had a better impression of ‘Dimensions’.","Furthermore, it was also revealed that the two directors of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ were playing dirty.","In a flash, Lu Man spilled the beans about their investors paying keyboard warriors to criticize ‘Dimensions’.","The audience’s impression of those two movies dropped to the bottom of the valley.","The netizens did not care about whether the main teams of the two movies knew about this matter or whether they were innocent.","Anyway, they saw them and the investors as a whole.","If the investors behind you did such a disgusting thing, the netizens would not have a good impression of those two movies.","Every netizen spoke out to support ‘Dimensions’.","Originally, they actually thought that ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ weren’t that bad.","However, due to this, they started to go against ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’, and started to ruthlessly complain about these two movies.","“Cutie Zhuofeng, don’t be scared! I’ll definitely watch ‘Dimensions’ three times, at least three times.”","“I have already watched ‘Dimensions’ once, but I feel like I have to at least watch it four times. I have also watched the original work before, but the imagery of ‘Dimensions’, after all, it’s different from the original work, which is only filled with words. It’s more vivid and more thought-provoking. I feel like I have to watch at least four times to understand the reasoning more. If I really want to fully understand it, I have to watch it a few more times. However, no matter what, I will watch it a few times to support it.”","“‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ are just normal commercial films, but ‘Dimensions’ is divine! Han Zhuofeng is a wonder! He is indeed a talent for directing! He shot such a big movie as his first production and could still manage it so well.”","“Whether it’s about the good quality that Han Zhuofeng achieved with his first time as a director or the movie’s meaning, ‘Dimensions’ is worth watching a few times. Support ‘Dimensions’!”","“For their own benefit, they tried to crush such a good or even a milestone-worthy movie. It’s so frustrating. Just because of this, let’s not talk about ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ being average, no matter how good they are, I won’t go and watch them.”","“A good movie can withstand tests. Even when ‘Dimensions’ was given a low rating intentionally by people, it’s still good, we won’t be influenced by those low ratings. If someone gives it a low rating, we will give it a high rating! We can drag the score up.”","“If someone gives ‘Dimensions’ a low rating again, then we will go and give low ratings for ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’. Anyway, no matter who instigated it, we’ll blame it on the two movies.”","‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ did not treat these words of the netizens as a joke.","They could really do it!","If they continued to let the netizens talk, the teams of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’, including the investors, would become criminals of domestic film development.","CEO Zhu quickly contacted Han Zhuoli.","“CEO Han,” said CEO Zhu, “I am Old Zhu from Zhu Lu Cultures.”","This time, CEO Zhu humbled his attitude.","Han Zhuoli was playing with the twins.","Now, he had to stop, sit at the side and watch the twins play with each other.","“CEO Zhu,” Han Zhuoli called out faintly.","“CEO Han, I am here to apologize to you. It was our bad for making people give ‘Dimensions’ low ratings. If I tell you that I was not involved, you will definitely not believe me, thinking that I am shirking. However, I really did not participate in this,” said CEO Zhu.","“They did not even discuss it with me before making the decision. When I found out, I couldn’t stop. After all, my authority as an individual is limited, and I can’t control so many companies.”","“However, I won’t shirk. They also know that they’re too shameful, so they asked me to contact you. Other than that, I invested in both ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’, so I can also be a representative for these two movies to talk to you.”","“This time, I have already told them that if we have anything next time, we have to discuss it with everyone and cannot make a rash decision anymore.”","“They also promised me never to slander ‘Dimensions’. The final box office sales of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ will depend on their own capability,” said CEO Zhu.","“Shouldn’t it be like this from the start?” asked Han Zhuoli.","CEO Zhu said it as though this kind of behavior was such a rare thing.","But in reality, this was what should be done.","When did things that should be done become rare and needed praise?","CEO Zhu paused for a few seconds in awkward silence and continued, “CEO Han, other than apologizing, I also want to talk to you about the issue of showtime scheduling.”","“Previously, you said that as long as we increase the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’, the Han Corporation will also increase the showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’,” said CEO Zhu, “We have discussed it and decided to increase the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’ to the highest.”","“CEO Han, looking at it this way, can the Han Corporation also increase the showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’?”","The showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ were limited by the Han Corporation, preventing the box office sales from increasing.","If the Han Corporation increased the showtimes of those two movies.","Their box office sales would be better.","Unexpectedly, Han Zhuoli said, “This deal is invalid.”","CEO Zhu was shocked. “Why is it invalid? Didn’t we make it clear?”"]},{"number":3551,"title":"Chapter 3551 Untitled","paragraphs":["3551 Untitled","Han Zhuoli rolled his eyes and said bluntly, “Who made it clear to you?”","“We already discussed it back before the movie was officially released and when the showtimes schedule had just come out. I gave you guys a chance. We could have made a deal if you guys increased ‘Dimensions’ showtimes back then.”","“However, you clearly declined the offer. Since you already declined the offer, then why should I continue on with the deal?” said Han Zhuoli bluntly, “You guys are really bold to take a deal whenever you want to and decline one by your whims.”","“CEO Zhu, it has been a long time since we joined this business, so we can’t be so naive, thinking that everything can be done according to our own will,” said Han Zhuoli mockingly.","“Before the movie was released, although I had the confidence that ‘Dimensions’ would definitely have a good result, I couldn’t predict the box office sales of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’.”","“During that time, I offered you a deal. The deal was for all three parties to take a step back and schedule the showtimes normally. But now that the momentum of ‘Dimensions’ is clearly getting stronger. The people are supporting ‘Dimensions,’ so you’re getting worried about it.”","“After all, the box office sales of the other two movies keep getting lower and lower. However, why should I waste the Han Corporation’s cinema halls by giving them to those two movies? On the contrary, the people are supporting ‘Dimensions’, and according to your showtime schedule, as long as they can choose, the audience won’t go to your cinemas to watch ‘Dimensions’.”","“The audience doesn’t want to watch ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ nor do they watch ‘Dimensions’. Your cinemas have to earn a profit, too, right? There are too many showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’, but it’s not enough to attract enough audience. There are only a few people in one session, especially in big cinema halls like IMAX halls. The cost of your cinemas will increase, but the profit will be lesser and lesser. I believe you don’t need me to remind you of this.”","“And to crush ‘Dimensions’, you guys didn’t give any IMAX sessions to ‘Dimensions’. This forced the audience to choose the IMAX sessions of other cinemas.”","Han Zhuofeng put in a lot of money to use IMAX machines to shoot the film.","Without IMAX-capable screens, many scenes wouldn’t feel right.","“The showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ should naturally decrease over time, since they can no longer keep up with ‘Dimensions’. Since that’s the case, why should I waste cinema halls for those two movies?”","“On the contrary, as you guys had to give these two movies a lot of showtimes, your profits will surely decrease. If you want the cinemas to have better revenue, you have to increase the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’. In the end, you still have to put profit first.”","“That way, even if we don’t make a deal, you guys still have to increase the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’ one way or another. In that case, why should I make a deal with you guys?” Han Zhuoli sneered.","“CEO Zhu, some opportunities cannot be gained back once they’re lost,” said Han Zhuoli.","CEO Zhu looked disheveled. He couldn’t help but think that Han Zhuoli was a true businessman. After all, he knew how to calculate things clearly..","Indeed, the authority and advantage all belonged to Han Zhuoli right now.","The box office sales of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ would only get lower.","And ‘Dimensions’ had the support of the netizens, with ‘Dimensions’ being a sincere and pioneering work, they had to push the box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ to the top.","CEO Zhu pondered and felt that this routine felt so familiar.","However, he was still on the phone with Han Zhuoli, so he could not afford to think more about it.","Han Zhuoli also did not give him the chance to speak more.","“CEO Zhu, let’s leave it at that, then,” said Han Zhuoli, “The Han Corporation will definitely not increase the showtimes of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’. As for whether you want to increase the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’, it’s up to you.”","Unless they did not want to earn money, they should increase it.","As such, Han Zhuoli wasn’t under any pressure at all.","Han Zhuofeng had lived up to his expectations.","It was because the movie was so good that he could have this confidence.","He was verbally attacking CEO Zhu, and the latter could not even refute his words.","“Then let’s talk next time?” At that, he hung up.","Lu Man walked over and saw that the twins were already sitting next to each other.","It seemed like the two were comparing whose legs were longer.","Han Linzhe suddenly shook his legs and extended them straight, pointing at his own legs as if showing them off to Han Linxun.","Similarly, Han Linxun also shook her legs, and after extending them, she even inched forward a little.","Her toes were a tiny bit longer than Han Linzhe’s.","Then, she also pointed at her own legs, babbling, and looked at Han Linzhe.","Han Linzhe did not give up. He knew that Han Linxun had moved forward just now.","As such, Han Linzhe also moved forward.","These two balls of cuteness babbled as they moved forward.","Unconsciously, they had already moved quite a distance.","Lu Man also did not care about them.","Anyway, no matter how much they moved, they would not be able to move out of the carpet.","The corners of the surrounding furniture had been covered with soft corners by Han Zhuoli.","Even if they really knocked into the corners, it would not be painful, and they would not get hurt.","Lu Man and Han Zhuoli talked about CEO Zhu’s call just now.","Just like this, a week of work passed, with overtime added.","There were six days of work this week, and they could only rest on Sunday.","Most of the working people used the time on Sunday to watch ‘Dimensions’ again.","On normal working days, the box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ was above 200 million.","As for the other films, their sales became lesser and lesser as time went on.","Naturally, this included ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’.","On Sunday, everyone took a rest.","And the box office sales reached another peak.","The box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ went up to 400 million in a day. Just another twenty million and it would have reached 500 million.","This made Lu Man feel a little regretful.","At this moment, Lu Man felt like the hype was about to reach its climax.","As such, she made various social media accounts post some promotions.","This time, the promotions did not talk about the special effects of ‘Dimensions’.","Those things had already been talked about.","And many people had watched the movie already; even those who had not watched the movie yet knew that the special effects were superb.","This time, Lu Man focused the promotion on Han Zhuofeng’s shooting process.","She talked about the difficulties during the shoot and the suffering that the actors had gone through.","The difficulty of shooting at different places was also talked about.","During the shoot, there were also videographers shooting them from the side.","They had to record the shooting process.","Movies with director’s cuts would record the shooting process.","They also included how Han Zhuofeng saved money for the sake of state-of-the-art special effects.","Back then, to shoot the movie, Han Zhuofeng almost sold his car.","These were all made known to the netizens. Although Han Zhuofeng was the third son of the Han Family, the effort he put into his work was not lesser than others."]},{"number":3552,"title":"Chapter 3552 Untitled","paragraphs":["3552 Untitled","He didn’t get pampered at all and was willing to suffer to save some money.","To save money on the cast members’ wages...","He shamelessly persuaded Yan Zhiqing and Lu Man to join the crew.","There were too many stories of Han Zhuofeng working hard on filming.","Therefore, Lu Man did not allow the entire footage to be released at once.","One part was released by a group of content creators, and the other part was released by another group of content creators.","Every promotion advertised something new.","It prevented the netizens from feeling annoyed by repeatedly seeing the same thing.","And as a result, the netizens were moved by Han Zhuofeng’s sincerity and effort, resulting in them showing another round of support by watching the movie again at the cinema.","CEO Wang and others could tell that there was not much hope for the movies ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City.’","However, it wasn’t over.","Until now, the box office sales were already pretty good.","The return on investment had already been achieved, and they even had a good profit.","However, they were scared to be compared with Dimensions.","They would be useless if they were compared to something better, right?","They were compared with the results of ‘Dimensions’.","At other times, the results of ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’, which were considered to be good, would be nothing worth looking at.","Besides, the box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ did not seem to have the intention of dropping.","They became envious.","They could not keep on kowtowing, right?","Just as Han Zhuoli said, they did not need to make a deal.","As long as these two cinemas wanted to earn money, they did not need to make a deal; they had to take the initiative to increase the showtimes of ‘Dimensions’.","As expected, the two cinemas could not bear it anymore.","They took the initiative to give ‘Dimensions’ the most showtimes.","With his own first production, Han Zhuofeng had gotten his place in the industry.","This was invested by the Han Family members with their own names, including Han Zhuofeng.","So when the profits were shared later, every one of them would earn a huge sum.","Old Mrs. Han was overjoyed. “Zhuofeng helped me earn a good sum of money.”","Although the two elders did not lack any money, it was money their grandson made for them, after all.","As such, they were proud!","“This movie is successful domestically, and with the special effects and depth of ‘Dimensions’, even if you release it to Hollywood, it can stand its ground,” said Han Zhuoli.","“So, Big Brother and I decided to send this film overseas and play it in a few countries that are big-ticket warehouses. The cost of translation and marketing in the countries will be covered by the Han Corporation,” said Han Zhuoli.","Many countries weren’t used to looking at subtitles, so they could not watch the movie with the original audio.","They would not be able to watch if the local audience were made to listen to the original audio while looking at the subtitle translation.","As such, dubbing was necessary.","However, it would be expensive.","They also needed to release it in local cinemas, and they would also have to apply for the local movie rating.","Those things would be expensive.","Besides, the risk was that a lot of money had to be invested in the early stages.","When it was released locally, it might succeed due to cultural differences.","A movie that exploded domestically might not be popular overseas.","And movies with ordinary box office sales might be popular overseas.","This kind of situation was very common in Hollywood.","There were also many Hollywood movies that had box office sales that weren’t that good locally..","However, when they were released here, they were liked by the audience.","However, some movies that were popular overseas were just average when released in this country.","As such, there was a certain amount of risk when it came to releasing ‘Dimensions’ overseas.","There could be too many movies of the same kind in Hollywood, so the audience there might not even buy tickets.","Han Zhuofeng also had the same concern.","Even the two elders felt that if they released the film overseas, it wouldn’t earn much.","There was a high probability of making a loss.","Han Zhuoling said, “We have also considered this, and we’re prepared to make a loss. However, there’s a lot of profit this time, so even if we make a loss, we can use part of the profit, and in the end, we’ll still be in the green.”","“The main goal this time is not to earn a lot of money and profit but to let the world see our movie,” said Han Zhuoling.","“We want to let the world see that we can also shoot a movie with such advanced fantasy awareness. And it also had detailed reasoning and a thought-provoking plot. With the special effects and plot, it can actually beat many special effects movies in Hollywood.”","“I want to let the world see what we can do,” said Han Zhuoling.","“Yes,” said Old Mr. Han, immediately agreeing, “We should do this.”","“Let’s follow what you said!” said Old Mr. Han, “When you mentioned these, did the directors of the company oppose it?”","“They did oppose, but they did not have confidence,” said Han Zhuoli, “It’s mainly because they already made a mistake. Although Zhuofeng did not look for companies to invest in ‘Dimensions’, they knew what Zhuofeng was doing. However, nobody mentioned it because actually, they did not think that it was promising.”","“So that’s why we invested in our own names. But now that the box office sales of ‘Dimensions’ are so good, they finally realized their mistake. They can only watch in the face of such a huge profit,” said Han Zhuoli, “So when we mentioned releasing ‘Dimensions’ overseas, they also think that there’s a low possibility of earning money, and we might even make a loss.”","“However, because of what happened previously, they’re also scared that they will make a mistake again. So although they opposed it, they did not stand their ground and eventually agreed to the idea.”","Of course, in the process, Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli had to have endured a lot of pressure.","Old Mr. Han pondered and said, “If there are losses, you two will be under scrutiny.”","“So what? The company is managed by our family, even if they’re not happy, they can’t do anything.” Han Zhuoling did not mind it.","The Han Corporation had a board of directors.","However, most of the shares still belonged to the Han Family.","The Han Family had adequate authority.","“However, Zhuoli and I also promised them that if we make a loss, the two of us will pay,” said Han Zhuoling.","“That’s what I meant,” said Old Mr. Han.","“We invested in ‘Dimensions’ personally, and the movie made a profit, so we made a profit. But now that we are releasing the movie overseas in the Han Corporation’s name, if we make a loss, the board of directors will definitely not be happy.”","When it made a profit, it would be theirs, but when it made a loss, it would be the company’s loss.","Naturally, everyone wouldn’t be happy about that.","“So we’ll also bear the loss; we’ll definitely not let the two of you bear the whole cost. You guys suggested this as you wanted to make everyone what our domestic films can do overseas. In deeper words, this is all to spread our culture overseas rather than for profit.”","Everyone knew the Han Corporation’s place in the domestic entertainment industry.","And the Han Corporation had almost monopolized the domestic entertainment industry.","Most movies that they invested in had made a lot of money.","If it were someone else, they would definitely think of ways to continue earning money."]},{"number":3553,"title":"Chapter 3553 Untitled","paragraphs":["3553 Untitled","However, Han Zhuoli and Han Zhuoling always had a goal, and that was to release domestic movies overseas and show the world the meaning of true Chinese culture and energy.","It was not like the old movies. The so-called big productions and ancient-style films looked good from the outside, but after releasing them overseas, not a lot of money would be put into marketing them.","And the essence of the plot was not good; it had a decent rating domestically, but overseas, it was only average.","The locals couldn’t understand them.","And most movies with international awards were niche literature films.","Honestly, the influence wasn’t that great.","As such, Han Zhuoli and Han Zhuoling had always wanted to release a proper commercial film overseas.","They wanted to shock the world.","Now, the chance was here, and the two did not want to miss it.","Perhaps the effect might not be excellent after releasing it overseas, but it was worth a try.","If ‘Dimensions’ could not do it, then in the coming years, it would be rare to have another chance like this.","At first, Han Zhuofeng was passionate, but after thinking about the risks, he suddenly felt a lot of pressure.","“Elder brother, if it really makes a loss, I won’t know what to do,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“What do you mean?” said Han Zhuoling, “It should be us who should be stressed. We’re the ones who insisted on releasing this movie overseas, so it has nothing to do with you.”","“Anyway, if we really make a loss, then we’ll be responsible together.” Han Zhuofeng wouldn’t just hide and let his elder brothers bear the burden for him.","“Why are you joining in on the fun?” Han Zhuoli laughed.","“How is it joining in on the fun? I’m serious,” said Han Zhuofeng, “Just like in the beginning, I wanted to shoot this movie, but in my heart, I didn’t know if I could do it well. Honestly, back then, I shot the film with the mindset of making a loss.”","“You guys definitely know that I wanted to produce a popular movie despite being a greenhorn. Before the results came out and when I just started shooting, even I thought that it was a far-fetched idea, not to mention you guys.”","“However, you guys still invested in me without hesitating. Honestly, back then, you guys also invested with the mindset of making a loss, right? But you guys still invested in me...”","“Now, it’s a good thing that you guys want to release ‘Dimensions’ overseas. If it succeeds, I’ll benefit the most. However, I can’t just take all the benefits when there are benefits but escape when there are losses, right?”","“We’re family, so I can’t do that,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Han Zhuoling said, “Then, have you thought about how many people will start mocking you when you let them know that you’re going to release the movie overseas?”","“It may even be more than when they had just found out you’re filming ‘Dimensions’. That’s considered light; if your movie fails overseas, then you’ll definitely be mocked by the whole internet. Not just the netizens, even the movie teams, directors, actors, production teams, investors, and people from all over the place will take the chance to step on you.”","This time, ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ were crushed by ‘Dimensions’.","Not only did the investors suffer, but the directors and actors suffered as well.","Those two movies were deemed promising by the outside world, and everyone praised their strong front and good actors.","But in the end, they became nothing but jokes.","All parties involved in both movies were embarrassed.","As such, they would definitely not hesitate to take the chance to step on Han Zhuofeng when the opportunity arrived.","“The stress that you’re facing is already enough, you don’t need to be responsible for the financial stress,” said Han Zhuoling.","“I can’t do that. Although I will be stressed, you guys who made such a decision will also bear the same stress. Anyway, we’re brothers, let’s bear it together,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Seeing that he had made up his mind, Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli stopped convincing him otherwise.","“Okay, then let’s treat it as the worst decision we can make,” said Han Zhuoli, “Of course, we’re not sure of the results yet.”","This matter was given to Han Zhuoli and Han Zhuoling to handle.","Of course, it needed a lot of time.","Han Zhuofeng had to use the following time to do some roadshows.","Due to the success of ‘Dimensions’, the production team’s popularity went up drastically.","Previously, Wei Wucai’s special effects company had already been in the spotlight once due to his relationship with Yan Zhiqing.","Now, after the huge success of ‘Dimensions’, movie fans started to focus on the production behind the scenes.","Then, from the credits scene, they found Wei Wucai’s company.","Ledepic More.","They found out that the special effects of ‘Dimensions’ were completely done by Ledepic More alone.","They already knew how good Ledepic More was, but through Wu Mosen’s ‘Left Right’, they still could not see the skills of Wei Wucai’s company.","This time, through ‘Dimensions’, the audience had truly seen the skills of Wei Wucai’s company.","It did not lose to those big, international special effects companies.","Instantly, the netizens praised Ledepic More heavily and began to have hope for domestic special effects.","“So our country has a special effects company that can take up the mantle, it actually isn’t like we can’t produce proper special effects.”","“What does this mean? In the past, how did movies, which cost a few hundred million, make those special effects that people could not stand to see? What did they spend their money on?”","“There are also those movies which were handled by so-called international, big special effects companies. Their special effects are so much worse than ‘Dimensions’. Is it because the price overseas is too high, so the cost of a few hundred million yuan could only afford to pay for special effects of that level or did those movies deceive us?”","The success of ‘Dimensions’ and the showcase of Ledepic More’s skill level stirred up the hornet’s nest.","Some netizens even believed that the high costs of a few hundred million yuan movies were all fake.","Did they fake the expense report, or did they not use the huge amount of investments they had received?","Otherwise, where did the money go?","Some netizens even found the production cost of ‘Dimensions’.","In total, the entire movie cost 800 million, similar to the production cost of a few big, domestic commercial films.","However, the difference was huge.","At this time, articles about the difficult shooting process of the ‘Dimensions’ team, which Lu Man made people post, became useful.","The netizens all expressed their admiration and respect.","With that, the roadshows of ‘Dimensions’ were about to go underway.","Due to the actors’ schedules, they could not gather all the main actors every time.","Yan Zhiqing was pretty free recently, so she followed Han Zhuofeng to a few cities.","Wei Wucai and Xie Jiling naturally followed along.","There were many people especially interested in the special effects and production of the movie.","During the roadshows, it was Wei Wucai who spoke the most on stage.","Some movies, which were so-called big production movies but had garbage special effects, were brought up by the netizens."]},{"number":3554,"title":"Chapter 3554 Untitled","paragraphs":["3554 Untitled","The directors and the investors obviously thought of Han Zhuofeng’s existence as repugnant.","However, Han Zhuofeng’s background was too powerful.","If he had been someone else, they would have worked together and torn him apart.","However, they didn’t dare to do that to Han Zhuofeng.","!!","Even though they were fuming and even though they had become the objects of juxtaposition and stepping stones for Han Zhuofeng’s success...","They didn’t dare to voice their dissatisfaction.","They all remained subdued.","Even Lu Man’s old rival Zhang Lun behaved himself.","CEO Wang and the others had been momentarily careless and had underestimated the intimidating presence of Lu Man.","The series of marketing strategies implemented by Lu Man this time reminded the people in the entertainment industry.","Therefore, regardless of their level of anger, they had to restrain their rage.","After all, Han Zhuofeng’s brother and sister-in-law were so strong!","It was no wonder that Han Zhuofeng could remain carefree, naive, and sincere.","***","Xie Jiling stayed with Han Zhuofeng until her winter break came to an end.","Xie Jiling would never request so many vacation days.","She still had to go to class.","As a result, Han Zhuofeng traveled to another city to meet and greet the movie’s fans.","Xie Jiling went back to school for classes.","When they were apart, they could only communicate with each other through WeChat or video calls.","As time passed, the classes had been in session for almost half a month.","Xie Jiling, Ren Linna, and the others arrived in the larger classroom for class.","This type of large classroom, which was spacious with many students, was almost like a movie theater.","In order to facilitate the smooth flow of traffic during class changes, the front and rear doors are both kept open.","Xie Jiling and Ren Linna selected a seat in the middle of the classroom, not too close to the front or the back.","They had always preferred this type of seating position that was in between the front and the back.","It wasn’t as tiring as sitting in the back rows.","And it wasn’t like sitting in the front rows where the attention of the teacher would be more concentrated.","This class was held in two consecutive sessions.","There was a 15-minute break between the two sessions of the class.","At the end of the first session, during the break, Xie Jiling continued to take notes and used the time to process and comprehend the content that had just been covered in the prior session.","She also worked on solving and answering some questions found in the back of her book.","Even during the break, there were few people laughing and chatting or playing games by themselves.","The majority of students were doing the same thing as Xie Jiling.","Ren Linna and the other two were also organizing their notes.","At this moment, someone quietly took the seat beside Xie Jiling.","All students who attend class have their own set of classmates and friends.","Most of them attended the class together.","Thus, very few individuals would occupy an empty seat that was alone.","It just so happened that there was an empty seat next to Xie Jiling that was on the side of the aisle.","As Xie Jiling worked on her questions, she sensed that someone had taken a seat next to her.","However, she didn’t pay any attention to it.","She thought it was someone who had missed a class and decided to take this seat after noticing the empty seat.","After Han Zhuofeng sat down, he noticed that Xie Jiling did not react at all.","He didn’t say anything to her and looked around the classroom instead.","He looked around to see if there was anything unique about the classroom of B University.","But it didn’t appear to be any different from other classrooms he had seen.","Han Zhuofeng studied directing in school, which was completely different from Xie Jiling.","It was a new and interesting sight for Han Zhuofeng to see everyone studying diligently.","In fact, it hadn’t been long since he graduated.","But it felt like a long time has passed.","He missed the campus.","But even though he had been sitting there for a while, Xie Jiling still hadn’t noticed him.","Han Zhuofeng felt a little bored.","After all, the other students had already noticed his presence.","And Han Zhuofeng was more famous now.","Not only because he was the third young master of the Han Family...","But also because he was the director of ‘Dimensions.’","It wasn’t an exaggeration to say that there was no one in the classroom who hadn’t watched ‘Dimensions.’","In fact, many students had seen it at least twice.","Now, when they saw Han Zhuofeng, their first thoughts were not of him as the third young master of the Han Family...","But as the director of ‘Dimensions.’","Han Zhuofeng could be considered successful.","Currently, Han Zhuofeng was in his prime. His fame was on par with that of a top-tier star.","Everyone was really excited when they saw him.","Someone even mustered the courage and wanted to ask to take a photo with him.","Han Zhuofeng gestured for everyone to be quiet by putting his index finger to his lips and indicating for them not to approach.","Everyone’s attention shifted from Han Zhuofeng to Xie Jiling.","But Xie Jiling still hadn’t noticed Han Zhuofeng’s presence.","Han Zhuofeng smiled slightly. Although he felt slightly bored, he anticipated the joy he would feel when she noticed his presence.","Han Zhuofeng laid down on the table at an angle where the side of his face rested on his arm, allowing him to comfortably stare at Xie Jiling’s side profile.","The side profile of his little Jiling was indeed beautiful.","She looked really pretty when she was working on the questions.","Han Zhuofeng couldn’t help but smiled while looking at Xie Jiling’s side profile.","Because of the angle, some students couldn’t see Han Zhuofeng’s expression.","But some saw his expression clearly.","And they were amazed by what they had seen.","Does Han Zhuofeng really like Xie Jiling that much?","At this moment, a girl walked over and stopped at the table Han Zhuofeng was lying on. Han Zhuofeng didn’t see her as he had his back facing her.","“Director Han, can I get a picture with you?” The girl’s voice sounded soft and timid. The tone of her voice made it difficult for people to reject her.","Han Zhuofeng immediately showed a cold expression and frowned.","He had reminded these students to be quiet and keep his presence here a secret.","But this girl refused to listen and still approached.","What did she want to do?","Xie Jiling heard the girl and turned her head in surprise.","She then realized that Han Zhuofeng was sitting beside her.","She didn’t even realize it.","This was not the main point.","The main point was: “Why... why are you here?”","She thought he would still be traveling around.","“When we talked over video call last night, you were still in Hong Kong, right?” Xie Jiling couldn’t believe her eyes as she stared at Han Zhuofeng. She didn’t dare to look away.","She was scared that he would disappear if she didn’t focus.","Han Zhuofeng was looking grumpy when the person disturbed him.","However, the moment Xie Jiling looked over, Han Zhuofeng grinned.","His facial expression changed so quickly that the students were shocked.","Their understanding of Han Zhuofeng reached a new level.","“The roadshow ended this morning, and I flew back right away.” Han Zhuofeng said, “Hongkong was the last stop. Since the roadshow has already ended, I can rest and stay with you.”","“When I came back, you were the first person I wanted to see. And so, I came here.” Han Zhuofeng had noted down Xie Jiling’s class schedule.","Therefore, he knew that she was attending class here.","“How are you in the mood to ask me so many questions?” Han Zhuofeng said in a disappointing tone, “Aren’t you happy to see me?”","The moment he said that, Xie Jiling pounced forward and hugged him.","“I’m happy to see you! I just didn’t expect that you would be here!” Xie Jiling was overjoyed.","She even rubbed her face on his face a couple of times.","She had no idea she could be this happy with a visit."]},{"number":3555,"title":"Chapter 3555 Untitled","paragraphs":["3555 Untitled","“Are you going to stay here and attend class with me?” Xie Jiling asked.","“Of course.” Han Zhuofeng caressed her hair, wondering how she could ask such a dumb question.","“Aren’t you done with classes after this class? I can attend class with you, and we can go home together when this class ends.” Han Zhuofeng said.","Ren Linna and the other two had never seen Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling’s interaction from such a close distance.","!!","They thought their interaction was very sweet.","Kuang Xiaorou looked up, left and right.","Feng Yaqing asked, “What are you looking for?”","“I am checking to see if there are lemon trees above our heads. Perhaps I became a tree spirit?” Kuang Xiaorou said in a puzzling tone.","Feng Yaqing and Ren Linna laughed so much that they had to lean on the table.","Xie Jiling and Han Zhuofeng heard their conversation.","Xie Jiling blushed as she moved away from Han Zhuofeng’s embrace. Then, she made an ugly face at Ren Linna and the other two.","Han Zhuofeng then smiled and said, “When you all traveled to Ta Town with us, Jiling and I were still not in a relationship. I think this is the first time we are seeing each other since we started dating, right?”","“Actually, that’s not true.” Feng Yaqing said.","As expected of a group of friends living in the same dorm, they knew exactly what each other was thinking.","When Han Zhuofeng appeared confused, Ren Linna explained, “We saw you and Jiling downstairs from the dormitory window when you sent her back to campus.","“That doesn’t count.” Han Zhuofeng said with a smile. “I didn’t know about that.”","“Jiling told me previously that she wanted to buy you guys a meal and introduce me to you guys as her boyfriend,” Han Zhuofeng said.","“However, I haven’t had the chance until now. Now that I am finally free, should we grab some food after class?” Han Zhuofeng suggested, “If you all don’t have any other plans, of course.”","“We don’t have any plans,” Feng Yaqing said. “But I know you and Jiling haven’t seen each other in a while. From what Jiling told me, you’ve been traveling to different cities and busy promoting the film. You haven’t had a chance to rest. Now that you’re finally back, I know you want to treat us to food, but there’s no need to rush.”","It was difficult for Xie Jiling and Han Zhuofeng to say these words.","The invited guests were the only ones who could say such words.","“Yes.” Kuang Xiaorou said, “And you need some time to spend with Jiling, right? A short separation is better than a long engagement!”","Han Zhuofeng thought about it and agreed.","Initially, he thought that since Xie Jiling’s roommates were here...","He obviously needed to invite them.","Otherwise, it would be horrible.","However, Han Zhuofeng was indeed exhausted. He hadn’t seen Xie Jiling for half a month, and he wanted to spend time with Xie Jiling.","And so, when Feng Yaqing and the others said that, Han Zhuofeng went along and agreed happily.","They had said so much, but no one even looked at the person who wanted to get a picture with Han Zhuofeng.","Kuang Xiaorou showed a mocking expression.","There was nothing wrong with wanting to get a picture together.","But the girl obviously had ulterior motives.","As a girl, she could obviously tell that this was a hypocrite who was trying to present herself as virtuous and pure.","This girl obviously has eyes on Han Zhuofeng.","She even dared to seduce Han Zhuofeng in front of Xie Jiling.","Did she really believe that she was an extraordinary beauty to seduce Han Zhuofeng with just a glance in front of his girlfriend?","Since this girl was shameless, they obviously couldn’t give her any respect.","And so, they pretended as though she was invisible.","Han Zhuofeng had the same intention as well.","They naturally wouldn’t remind Han Zhuofeng that someone was standing next to Han Zhuofeng.","At this moment, the class bell sounded.","Xie Jiling then reminded Han Zhuofeng, “Sit properly, or else you’ll draw the teacher’s attention.”","Han Zhuofeng quickly sat properly.","At this moment, Han Zhuofeng pretended as though he just noticed the girl.","“Eh? You are still here?” Han Zhuofeng said in surprise, “Class is starting soon. Don’t you need to go back to your seat and sit down?”","The girl showed an awkward expression. With an awkward expression, she went back to her seat silently.","When she had been beside Han Zhuofeng’s table, she had been ignored for a long time.","And now, she went back to her seat. She felt really embarrassed of herself.","Thankfully, the teacher didn’t care about this new student in the class.","He continued teaching the class.","Han Zhuofeng felt really confused as he listened to the lecture. He couldn’t understand at all.","And so, he secretly lowered his head and checked his phone.","He looked up ‘Dimensions’ to check the movie’s reputation and read audience reviews.","He looked at the jokes and analysis of the details of the movie ‘Dimensions’ made by netizens.","Soon, a class session passed by.","Han Zhuofeng decided that he would grab food with Ren Linna and the others tomorrow.","When the teacher left, many students started crowding over.","If there were very few people, Han Zhuofeng would have agreed to take a picture together.","But there were too many people. Even if he wanted to take pictures, he couldn’t do it.","“Thank you all for your support. How about this, let’s take a group photo?” Han Zhuofeng said, “There are just too many people here, if we take pictures one by one, it will take a long time.”","The crowd thought that the suggestion was good.","Xie Jiling wouldn’t need to be in this group photo.","Ren Linna and the other two didn’t care.","They could eat privately with Han Zhuofeng. Why would they care about this group photo?","If they wanted to, they could take as many as they wanted tomorrow.","And so, the three didn’t join.","Xie Jiling then stood at the frontmost area of the classroom and took a group photo for everyone.","She used a classmate’s phone.","Then, she asked them to send the photos to each other.","Han Zhuofeng could finally leave and quickly led Xie Jiling out of the classroom.","“I didn’t expect these smart students to show such enthusiasm,” Han Zhuofeng said.","“Ever since school started, ‘Dimensions’ has been the most talked-about topic among students. Even the members of my class group were discussing it and sharing with each other how many times they’ve watched this movie during the break.”","“The Han Corporation will be officially releasing an announcement in the news that ‘Dimensions’ will be showing in theaters overseas,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“Has the overseas promotion, rating, cinema film schedule, and dubbing all been taken care of?” Xie Jiling asked.","Xie Jiling had spent a lot of time with the Han Family members. She knew about these things because they often talk about them during conversations.","“It’s all been taken care of. We will announce this in the local news tomorrow and officially start showing the movie overseas the day after tomorrow,” Han Zhuofeng said. “It’s making me feel as nervous like when they released ‘Dimensions’ locally.”","If the movie didn’t perform well, it wouldn’t be because the movie was not made well, it would be because it didn’t appeal to the taste of the overseas audience.","However, in Han Zhuofeng’s opinion, since the audience in this country could accept Hollywood movies...","It wouldn’t make sense that this movie would not appeal to the taste of the overseas audience.","There could only be one reason—It wasn’t good enough.","At this moment, Lu Man contacted Shana. Shana had been in the same competition as Lu Man back then.","Shana was a popular actress with a strong influence in Hollywood.","She had a lot of young fans."]},{"number":3556,"title":"Chapter 3556 Untitled","paragraphs":["3556 Untitled","Shana didn’t expect that Lu Man would contact her.","They had been participants in an ordinary competition.","When Lu Man moved back home, the two rarely contacted each other.","But thankfully, the two had added each other as friends on this chatting app that Shana used often.","!!","When the time was right, considering Shana’s time zone, Lu Man contacted Shana.","Instead of beating around the bush, Lu Man was straight to the point as she asked, “Shana, can you help me promote a movie?”","Shana replied, “...Do I know you well?”","Lu Man smiled and replied, “What do you mean we don’t know each other well? We were classmates, and we were in the same competition.”","Shana replied, “...”","She didn’t expect Lu Man to be even more shameless than she had been in the past.","“What movie?” Shana felt puzzled as she asked, “Are you asking me to promote it for your husband’s company?”","Initially, Shana thought Lu Man has no relation to any Hollywood movie.","However, she thought about it and realized that the Han Corporation, the company owned by Lu Man’s husband, had some influence in Hollywood.","Han Corporation had been participating in many movies that did pretty well.","As Shana thought about this, she didn’t think it was weird anymore.","She thought there would be a new Hollywood movie made by the Han Corporation that would soon be released.","Shana never really paid any attention to the movies made by any companies.","She had just filmed a season of the TV show and was enjoying her vacation.","There were more and more movie actors and actresses filming TV shows.","It was the same with Shana.","Of course, she was making movies as well.","When she wasn’t working, she would go on vacation and travel around with her friends.","At this moment, Lu Man replied, “It’s my brother. He just made a new movie. Have you heard of the movie ‘Dimensions?’","“I don’t know.” Shana hadn’t even figured out the plot of the movie she was filming. Obviously, she had no idea what movie Lu Man was talking about.","Lu Man immediately replied, “Let me tell you. My little brother—”","“Wait. Isn’t your brother still really young? Has he even completed kindergarten yet? Can he make movies?” Shana complained, “Do you think I am dumb?”","It wasn’t that she paid any attention to Lu Man.","Wang Juhuai was famous all over the world.","The announcement of Wang Juhuai’s marriage was reported in every country’s news.","When his son was born, it was also reported in every country’s news.","Therefore, Shana knew that Lu Man’s little brother was very young.","Lu Man explained, “It is my husband’s younger brother.”","Shana replied, “Oh.”","“He directed a sci-fi film that received great reviews and did well at the box office here. Just based on its domestic box office, it should be able to enter the global top 100 box office rankings,” said Lu Man.","Shana had never seen the movie before, so she held back her opinion.","After all, there was a significant difference in the level of films between the two countries.","Movies that did well at the box office in Lu Man’s country might not do well in Hollywood.","Lu Man then said, “We want to release ‘Dimensions’ overseas and show it in various countries. I was then reminded of you, my old friend in Hollywood.”","“Who’s your old friend?!” Shana replied in an annoyed tone.","When did she become Lu Man’s old friend? She didn’t even know!","“You’re so cunning.” Shana said, “You just want me to help you promote the movie. That’s why you are so nice to me now.”","“Am I that kind of person?” Lu Man said, “Do I need to be? With Han Corporation’s current influence in Hollywood and with a strong promotion, it’s hard to say whether ‘Dimension’ will be a huge success or not, but it won’t be a failure either!”","When Shana heard that, she thought it was reasonable.","But then, Shana felt alert.","She almost got brainwashed by Lu Man again.","Be wise and stay away from Lu Man!","“But with the endorsement of an idol, the promotion will definitely be better,” Lu Man said.","It meant that movie was approved by an idol. An idol had reviewed the movie and said it was good.","Shana’s fans would definitely watch it, too.","“When is it being released?” Shana asked.","“The releasing schedule will start the midnight on Friday there,” Lu Man said.","“This film is really good. Let me tell you. I’m not biased because this movie was made by my little brother. I reviewed the movie objectively. I truly believe that even if ‘Dimension’ were to be released in the land of Hollywood movies, it would be able to stand out.”","“Just help mention it on social media. It won’t ruin your reputation.” Lu Man said.","Shana was at a loss with Lu Man. She said, “I can promote it, but I have to watch it first.”","“I have to make sure that it is good before I promote it for you.” Shana added, “I will promote it as a friend. But if the movie isn’t good, I won’t be promoting it. No matter what you say, I won’t promote it. I can’t lie to my fans, after all.”","Lu Man smiled and said, “Of course! If you do think it’s good after you have watched it, then post a normal review.”","“I have faith in the movie ‘Dimensions.’ Lu Man said with confidence, “In my country, many people have watched it multiple times. They understood the entire plot and the logic of the movie.”","“Although this film’s story logic has some flaws, I haven’t found any flaws yet with my level of intelligence.”","“The audience has to watch it multiple times to understand the meaning,” Lu Man said.","“Although you say so, I haven’t watched the movie yet, so I won’t make a decision quickly.” Shana said, “In addition, the audiences might have watched the movie many times because they support locally made movies.”","“It was rare to see a high-quality movie made locally. Of course, they would show more support and encouragement to the director and the cast members.” Shana said.","Lu Man nodded in agreement. “Your points are valid. Anyway, just watch it.”","“I got it.” Shana finally agreed.","Lu Man was extremely happy. “Aiyo, Shana! I knew it! You might act arrogantly, but you are such a sweetheart.”","Shana felt grossed out at the compliment.","“If you continue saying such disgusting things, I won’t help you out anymore!” Shana said angrily.","Lu Man couldn’t see the other end of the phone, but Shana had actually blushed.","Who was Lu Man calling a sweetheart?!","***","Han Zhuofeng took Xie Jiling home.","Of course, they didn’t go back to the family home. They went back to the house in the city area that Han Zhuoling had given to Han Zhuofeng.","After leaving with Han Zhuofeng, Xie Jiling didn’t go back to campus that night.","She was like a sheep that had entered the wolf’s den.","Ren Linna and the other two waited until the dormitory building was locked up. Still, Xie Jiling was nowhere to be seen.","They then knew that Xie Jiling would not return tonight.","She wouldn’t return tonight. In fact, she could be eaten up tonight.","Even her bones might not be spared.","The three discussed in the dorm room. Eventually, Kuang Xiaorou suggested. “We can send her a message in the group chat.”"]},{"number":3557,"title":"Chapter 3557 Untitled","paragraphs":["3557 Untitled","“If she replies immediately or very soon, it means that the two are still pure. After all, it’s already eleven o’clock, if they wanted to do anything, they should be doing it right now,” Kuang Xiaorou analyzed.","“If she does not reply to us and only replies tomorrow, then we can be certain of it,” said Kuang Xiaorou, blinking a few times.","Ren Linna and Feng Yaqing thought that Kuang Xiaorou’s analysis was reasonable.","As such, the three called Xie Jiling in their group chat.","!!","As expected, Xie Jiling did not reply for a whole night.","They were also not worried that Xie Jiling got into an accident.","Han Zhuofeng was there, he would not let that happen.","They only received Xie Jiling’s reply the next day.","Xie Jiling asked, “What happened?”","Ren Linna said, “Nothing, you just woke up?”","...","It was almost noon.","Feng Yaqing said, “Must be tired, right? Are you still coming to class in the afternoon? Do you need us to take your attendance?”","Kuang Xiaorou said, “This afternoon’s class is actually not important. It’s not a professional knowledge class, so it’s okay if you don’t attend.”","Xie Jiling was currently eating breakfast Han Zhuofeng had just ordered.","Although it was noon, Han Zhuofeng still ordered breakfast food.","Xie Jiling ate while looking at the texts Ren Linna and the others sent.","She looked at Han Zhuofeng blankly. “I think that they know something.”","Xie Jiling really wanted to skip the class in the afternoon.","After all, it was inconvenient for her to move now.","Han Zhuofeng was a coward when facing vengeful ghosts.","However, he was pretty good at this.","...","“What did they say?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","Xie Jiling showed her phone to Han Zhuofeng straight away.","There were always topics that would cause opposite genders to have intense discussions.","For example, whether one should let their other half look at their phone.","Some people thought that this would be invading their privacy due to distrust.","Some thought that there was no reason not to show their other half if they had nothing to hide in their phone.","For Xie Jiling, it seemed like she had not even thought of this problem; she directly gave the phone to Han Zhuofeng.","Han Zhuofeng smiled as he took it, but he did not look at Xie Jiling’s phone immediately.","He asked her, “You don’t mind me looking at your phone?”","“I don’t mind. Why can’t you see? Doesn’t my phone just have those things?” Xie Jiling did not understand why he could not look at it.","“Photo album and the chat history in your WeChat, what if I look at them?” asked Han Zhuofeng.","...","“Then look.” Xie Jiling took a sip of the porridge. “I don’t have photos in my album, and there are just chats with family and classmates in my WeChat. Whether it’s my family or classmates, you know them already.”","Han Zhuofeng smiled. It seemed like Xie Jiling was the type that did not care about her other half looking at her phone.","“Then, in the future, you can look at my phone too,” said Han Zhuofeng.","“Oh, right.” Han Zhuofeng took out his phone and went to the face ID settings.","He added a new face ID and passed it to Xie Jiling. “Scan your face, then in the future, you can look at my phone whenever you want.”","“Why do I want to look at your phone?” Xie Jiling was confused.","She was not interested, and there was nothing worth looking at on Han Zhuofeng’s phone.","Han Zhuofeng smiled, thinking that he could simply look at Xie Jiling’s phone, but she did not want to look at his phone.","What was going on inside the mind of this little girl?","Han Zhuofeng said, “It doesn’t matter just scan your face first. What if you want to look at it one day? Then you can look at it anytime.”","Xie Jiling scanned her face obediently.","...","Han Zhuofeng also added his face ID to Xie Jiling’s phone.","Then, he checked Xie Jiling’s WeChat.","Seeing what the three of them said, Han Zhuofeng smiled. “Yeah, your dormmates have already guessed it.”","“Oh my!” Xie Jiling blushed.","It was embarrassing to be found out.","“Then I’ll reply to them for you?” said Han Zhuofeng.","“What do you want to reply?” asked Xie Jiling.","“To help you take attendance and tell them about treating them to dinner at night.” Han Zhuofeng looked at Xie Jiling. “Can you walk at night?”","“Of course, I can.” It was not like she was injured, she would be well-rested by nighttime.","Han Zhuofeng nodded. “Then I’ll help you reply?”","“Yeah, reply,” Xie Jiling said.","...","Han Zhuofeng took Xie Jiling’s phone and replied, “I am Han Zhuofeng, please help Xie Jiling take attendance for this afternoon’s class.”","“Do you guys have time tonight? I’ll treat you guys to a meal,” said Han Zhuofeng.","The three looked at the reply in the group chat and suddenly felt like they got shown up.","However, the three did not have anything at night, so they set a time with Han Zhuofeng.","Then at night, Han Zhuofeng officially reintroduced himself as Xie Jiling’s boyfriend to Xie Jiling’s dormmates.","As ‘Dimensions’ was going to be released overseas, Han Zhuoli planned to go to one of the company branches in Hollywood.","After Han Zhuofeng heard this, he suggested, “Elder brother, can I go with you? I’ll also buy a movie ticket and hear the audience’s opinions in the cinema.”","“The values of the West and East are different, and the movie suits the views of our country, so they might not agree with them. In the future, my movies are still going to be targeted at our country’s people, and I won’t compromise to the audience overseas.”","“But I still think it’s good to hear their opinions,” said Han Zhuofeng.","Han Zhuoli nodded. “I was planning on asking you to do some promotions with the actors if the results overseas are good. It’ll be more convenient if you go together.”","“Then I’ll ask Jiling if she wants to go as well,” said Han Zhuofeng immediately.","...","Other than being reluctant to separate from Xie Jiling, he also thought that it was safer to bring Xie Jiling along.","What if they met a vengeful ghost overseas?","Although the type of vengeful ghosts overseas could be different, Xie Jiling should be able to handle all of them, right?","There were no boundaries when it came to exorcising!","“Then I am going, too,” said Lu Man, “I can also visit the friends there. Hayer, Robert, and Shana. I even asked Shana to help promote it if she thinks that the movie is good.”","“I also told Hayer and Robert. However, the two of them were mainly good in the industry, but they’re not well-known among the audience.”","“However, if the industry sees their recommendation and goes to have a look, it will still have a decent effect,” said Lu Man, “If we’re lucky, and the professionals in the industry also think that it’s good, they will also recommend it. Then, it will surely be marketed even more.”","“I will also catch up with friends this time,” said Lu Man.","“Okay.” Han Zhuoli wanted to bring Lu Man anyway."]},{"number":3558,"title":"Chapter 3558 Untitled","paragraphs":["3558 Untitled","The twins were crawling around on the floor.","The two cute balls could already walk a few steps now.","However, they couldn’t walk that far.","They stood up shakily and would fall down after walking two steps, then they would continue doing that.","It was probably because twins had each other, so their competitiveness with each other was also really strong.","Little Linxun would stand up first to walk two steps.","After little Linzhe saw this, he would not admit defeat.","After less than two days, he could also stand up and walk two steps.","Lu Man bought the two little ones’ baby walkers.","Then, the house became like a battlefield every day.","The two were treating the baby walkers like bumper cars.","In the baby walkers, they walked while bumping into each other.","At home, Lu Man could hear the sounds of bumping every day.","When they came to the family home today, they did not bring the baby walkers.","After having the two little ones, the floor of the family home’s living room had been covered with soft carpet.","Especially now was the time when the two little balls would fall down often, people would feel more at ease if they walked on this thick, soft carpet.","Even if they fell, it would not hurt.","Besides, these two little fellows were falling down on purpose.","Every time they fell, it would be soft and fun for them.","So, the two would fall down and sit down for a while after walking two to three steps. Then, they would continue walking two to three steps before falling down again.","After falling, they would even smile at each other.","When Lu Man said that she wanted to go with Han Zhuoli, the two little balls used their hands and feet to crawl to Lu Man’s legs.","They hugged Lu Man’s legs, one leg each.","They were babbling as if they wanted to follow along.","“What are you two doing?” Lu Man had a guess in her heart, but she did not say it out loud.","She watched as the two little balls started panicking, but they could not speak, so they could only babble anxiously.","“You two want to follow along too?” Lu Man stopped teasing them and asked.","The two little fellows immediately nodded.","“Then let’s bring Butler Xiao Wang and Auntie He along, then the two little fellows will be looked after,” said Han Zhuoli.","Hearing that he meant to bring both of them...","The twins immediately let go of Lu Man’s legs joyfully and turned to hug Han Zhuoli’s legs.","These two little fellows really knew whose legs to hug.","The two elders would not follow this time.","After all, they were old, and it would be exhausting to sit in the plane for so long.","And Han Zhuoling had to stay to keep watch of the Han Corporation, so Shi Xiaoya and he was not going as well.","So this time, it was a much smaller group than last time.","Only Han Zhuoli, Lu Man, the twins, Butler Xiao Wang, Auntie He, Han Zhuofeng, and Xie Jiling were going.","Xie Jiling’s visa was still valid.","When Xie Tongyun went for exchanges in the past, he brought Xie Jiling along.","Because of this, Xie Jiling also applied for a ten year-visa which enabled her to travel in and out of the country.","When Han Zhuoli and the rest were going to Mi Country.","Jiang Yujie, who had left B City for more than a year, finally returned.","In the past, she promised Jiang Huaizhou to return after a year.","Even now, she actually did not want to face it, but no matter what, she had to end it.","Besides, Mrs. Jiang was already old, she could not just stay outside forever.","Jiang Yujie arrived downstairs. This was still the house that she rented before she left.","Standing downstairs, Jiang Yujie looked up for a while.","Today was Wednesday, a working day.","She purposely picked a red-eye flight.","She left at midnight and arrived at B City’s airport before the sky was bright.","She ate a simple breakfast at a fast food restaurant at the airport, then she laid down on the table to nap for a while.","At eight something, she took the subway from the airport.","She calculated the time intentionally.","Because this time, Jiang Huaizhou should be at work and would not be home.","...","Although one year had passed, she was not mentally prepared to see Jiang Huaizhou.","So she intentionally picked this time to come back.","Jiang Yujie took a deep breath and finally entered the building.","At the door, Jiang Yujie raised her hand and put it down a few times.","Finally, she closed her eyes and pressed the doorbell.","“Coming.” Jiang Yujie heard Mrs. Jiang’s voice from inside.","Her heart was shaking.","When she was outside, she would call or video call Mrs. Jiang often, but she felt different hearing it now.","Finally, the door was opened.","Mrs. Jiang appeared at the door, and upon seeing Jiang Yujie, Mrs. Jiang froze.","“Mom,” Jiang Yujie called out.","...","Mrs. Jiang’s eyes were already red, and she pulled Jiang Yujie inside.","“Why are you only back now?! Only back now?!” Mrs. Jiang cried as she hugged Jiang Yujie. “I didn’t dare to rush you as I was scared that the more I rush you, the more you wouldn’t come back!”","“I am back,” said Jiang Yujie, choking on sobs, “Sorry, Mom, sorry that I just came back. I’m sorry that I was away for so long.”","“As long as you’re back, it’s fine.” Mrs. Jiang let go of Jiang Yujie and looked at her face. “Let me have a look.”","Although the two called each other often through video calls, the videos were always blurry.","“You’re skinny, did you suffer a lot outside?” If she did not suffer, why did she become so skinny?","“I didn’t suffer,” said Jiang Yujie, “It’s just that when I first went out, I had diarrhea. And it was fine to eat the local food for a short time, but the food wasn’t really appetizing at all.”","“And it’s really hot there, I don’t have an appetite when it’s hot, so I became skinny naturally.”","Of course, she had too much in her heart, so she did not have the mood to eat.","If she kept it in her heart, how could she have an appetite?","She ate less, so naturally, she became skinnier.","“But I really did not suffer,” said Jiang Yujie, “The cost of living is low there, and my elder brother... he is good at making money.”","Upon mentioning Jiang Huaizhou, Jiang Yujie felt a little bitter.","“The money that I gave him previously, he earned it all back. He treated it as me buying his shares, he would transfer money to me from time to time.”","Actually, Jiang Huaizhou had also thought of not giving her after he earned money.","He would save it for her, and when she came back, he would give it to her all at once.","Because he was afraid that if Jiang Yujie had money, she would not come back and would be free and easy outside.","But in the end, he could not let her suffer.","He was afraid that if she had no money, she would have to work outside. Aside from the support, there was no love for her.","As such, he transferred her some money every month.","However, Jiang Huaizhou used the money properly.","He did not give all the earnings to her.","He only gave her enough every month.","Otherwise, he was really afraid that if she had a lot of money, she would become wild outside and not return.","Mrs. Jiang let out a sigh of relief. After hearing what Jiang Huaizhou did, she was relieved.","Jiang Huaizhou did not tell her about this too.","“Oh yeah, where’s Dad? He’s not at home?” asked Jiang Yujie."]},{"number":3559,"title":"Chapter 3559 Untitled","paragraphs":["3559 Untitled","Mrs. Jiang froze and said, “We divorced.”","“How?” Jiang Yujie was shocked. “Why did you guys divorce?”","It had only been a year.","She only left for a year.","Why did they divorce?","Although when she left, Mrs. Jiang and Mr. Jiang argued that it was because of her.","The two of them did not have any personal conflicts.","Jiang Yujie’s face became pale. “Is it because of me?”","Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Jiang always had a decent relationship.","They were a couple married halfway through life, and it could not be considered love.","Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Jiang were both pragmatic people.","The combination of the two was more for the company and supporting each other.","Frankly, it was just two people thinking that they were suitable for each other to spend their days together.","However, even so, the two had supported each other for so long.","They would not divorce because of any conflict.","They were already this old, what kind of conflict could cause them not to forgive and tolerate each other?","If they had some conflict that would cause a divorce, they would have done it earlier, they would not wait until now.","Mrs. Jiang smiled relaxingly. She was really relaxed and not acting. “Yujie, you’re smart, I can’t hide anything from you.”","“if I tell you that it has nothing to do with you, you won’t believe it, too.” Mrs. Jiang brought Jiang Yujie to the living room to sit down.","“Actually, there are a lot of reasons for the divorce. Not just because of you, it’s also because of Huaizhou,” said Mrs. Jiang.","“My elder brother...” Jiang Yujie subconsciously continued.","“He’s not your elder brother anymore,” said Mrs. Jiang.","“You left because you wanted to bid farewell to your past experiences,” said Mrs. Jiang.","“You’re also afraid that there would be acquaintances around who would talk behind your back. It was more so because of Jiang Gaoyi’s attitude towards you.” Jiang Gaoyi was Mr. Jiang.","“It’s you who sacrificed yourself to save Huaizhou. But in turn, he thanked you while defending you.”","“I’m not asking them to repay the favor, but you helped their family, this is a fact that we can’t ignore. You saved Huaizhou and his whole life. Not only that, to ensure that Huaizhou could have a fresh start, you gave him all your assets.”","“Yes, he gives you money that he earns on time, but did you even know that he would earn money in the first place? You gave him money not because he could earn money but because you wanted to help him.”","“Nobody could give up so much for Huaizhou, even Jiang Gaoyi couldn’t,” said Mrs. Jiang, “But his son benefited from you, what right does he have to look at you with that strange gaze?”","“What difference does this have with an ingrate? Luckily, Huaizhou is not an ingrate, he has been waiting for you for so long. Other than working every day, he waited for you.” Upon mentioning Jiang Huaizhou, Mrs. Jiang’s expression improved a lot.","“You’re my daughter, and I am someone who shields shortcomings,” said Mrs. Jiang.","“Furthermore, there’s also the matter of you and Huaizhou. It’s just a matter of time before we have to deal with it,” said Mrs. Jiang, “You sacrificed so much for him, and you like him as well. In addition, he clearly likes you, too. He did not hold grudges because of what happened in the past.”","“Then why won’t I complete you guys?” said Mrs. Jiang, “Nothing is more important to me than my children’s happiness.”","“Anyway, Jiang Gaoyi and I are just spending our days together. I have always thought that even though he isn’t that great as a breadwinner, he was an honest person. In this life, I don’t pray for riches as long as I’m safe, I will be fine. Even if I’m not rich, there’s a way to spend your days without being rich.”","“But I couldn’t believe that for his own dignity, he did not even care about his children’s matter. There’s a kinship between us, but it’s not like we can’t live on our own after the divorce.”","“Yujie, you suffered too much,” said Mrs. Jiang, “I just hope that you can follow your own heart. You can get what you want and be happy. You like Huaizhou, and Huaizhou likes you too.”","“I am already so old, I’ve already missed the chance to love. But you do, you’re still young and still have a lot of time ahead of you. You can make such a huge decision and sacrifice so much, and that means your feelings for Huaizhou run deep. It’s not that easy to change.”","“If that’s so, why don’t I complete you guys?” said Mrs. Jiang.","Jiang Yujie wanted to talk a few times, but she was stopped by Mrs. Jiang.","“I don’t think I have any regrets about divorcing Jiang Gaoyi. I discussed this with Huaizhou before. If Jiang Gaoyi and I divorce, you two will be perfectly justifiable.”","“If Huaizhou didn’t agree, I would think that he didn’t have a sense of responsibility, wanting to bring you along a difficult road full of obstacles.”","“Luckily, Huaizhou agreed. I have already made up my mind, and Jiang Gaoyi couldn’t stop it either. And he did not really stop it, he should have known about it long ago.”","“Besides, when you left back then, Jiang Gaoyi also felt guilty.” Mrs. Jiang smiled. “Luckily, he still had some conscience, and he knew to be guilty and remembered that it was you who saved Huaizhou.”","“So after knowing my decision, he also decided to make you guys complete,” said Mrs. Jiang.","“So we divorced,” said Mrs. Jiang, “Don’t worry, this was discussed.”","“Huaizhou bought this house as I’m already familiar with this place, so I continued staying here. He bought another house for Jiang Gaoyi. He’s renting a house for himself.”","Jiang Huaizhou’s business was going well.","Before Jiang Yujie left, his business was already on the right track and had decent earnings.","In the one year that Jiang Yujie was away, Jiang Huaizhou’s business became better.","It had to be mentioned that Jiang Huaizhou was talented.","If it weren’t for what happened before, Jiang Huaizhou’s success would have been more successful by now.","Although Jiang Huaizhou’s business was getting better and better, it hadn’t been that long since he started.","It was already not easy to buy Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Jiang two houses with the money he earned in such a short time.","However, if he were to buy a third house, Jiang Huaizhou would find it hard to fund it.","So after making his parents settled, he rented a house to stay in.","...","He also did not choose to stay with Mr. Jiang.","Jiang Huaizhou was thinking even further ahead.","Even if Mr. Jiang was not against him and Jiang Yujie getting together.","But if they were to meet, it would be awkward.","Jiang Huaizhou would rather move out, so when Jiang Yujie came back to meet him at home, she would not have to see Mr. Jiang.","Jiang Huaizhou was being thoughtful, which made Mrs. Jiang even more supportive of them.","For better or worse, Jiang Huaizhou and Jiang Yujie were childhood friends, so he knew Jiang Yujie very well.","No matter what, he owed Jiang Yujie for her kindness.","He was more dependable than other men.","If it were another man, would he not mind after knowing Jiang Yujie’s past?","Should Jiang Yujie be honest or hide it from them?","..."]},{"number":3560,"title":"Chapter 3560 Untitled","paragraphs":["3560 Untitled","After being honest, could the two still stay together?","But if she hid it, it would be too burdensome for Jiang Yujie.","To save Jiang Huaizhou, Jiang Yujie almost forced herself toward a dead end.","After pondering, Mrs. Jiang also thought that Jiang Huaizhou was the most suitable.","Jiang Huaizhou knew about Jiang Yujie’s past.","Jiang Yujie would not feel pressured as she needed to hide it.","But if Jiang Huaizhou still disliked Jiang Yujie.","Then Jiang Huaizhou would not be a thing.","“When you’re outside, I didn’t tell you what time it was whenever we video called as I was afraid that you would be worried outside,” said Mrs. Jiang.","“Although I wanted you to come back earlier, I didn’t want you to come back because of this. You went out to clear your mind and get rid of those frustrations inside. I didn’t want you to quit halfway because of this.”","“I wanted you to return with a light heart after releasing everything,” said Mrs. Jiang.","“Besides, this is actually not a big deal. We’re just not staying together, but we’re still family,” said Mrs. Jiang, “After so many years, we’ve already become family.”","“Huaizhou also visits me often. He even wanted to get me a maid, but I rejected his offer,” said Mrs. Jiang, “I am still capable, and my energy level is good, I can do everything myself.”","“The big indoor market is just fifteen minutes walk away. I also can’t eat a lot at home alone. I’ll be full after one or two dishes. I will do some fat-burning dances with the neighbors when I have nothing to do.”","“I also signed up for a travel buddy group to travel around,” said Mrs. Jiang, smiling, “My life is easy and free. It’s more comfortable than living with another person. Huaizhou even comes to see me often.”","“When my legs don’t work, and I don’t have the strength to cook anymore, it won’t be too late to get a maid by then.”","“Oh, now that you’re back early, I didn’t even have time to go to the market,” said Mrs. Jiang, “What do you want to eat for lunch? I will go and buy it for you.”","“Didn’t you say that the things outside didn’t suit your appetite? I will cook lunch for you,” said Mrs. Jiang happily.","“I’ll go with you,” said Jiang Yujie, “Anyway, I have nothing to do at home.”","“Don’t you need to rest? You traveled overnight, right?” Mrs. Jiang calculated the time.","“I won’t be able to sleep,” said Jiang Yujie.","After hearing such a huge matter upon coming back, how could Jiang Yujie still sleep?","To be frank, the reason Mrs. Jiang divorced was still to lay out a path for her.","Everything was because of her.","How could Jiang Yujie feel calm?","Even if she stayed at home, she could not fall asleep.","So Mrs. Jiang brought Jiang Yujie to the market.","Mrs. Jiang was used to buying groceries from a particular stall, so she had long become a patron of that stall.","Her vegetable stall, fruit stall, meat stall, and seafood stall were all fixed.","So after a long time, Mrs. Jiang also became familiar with these owners.","Seeing that she brought Jiang Yujie today, one owner asked, “Yo, this is...”","“My daughter. She was working overseas, and she just came back to see me this time,” explained Mrs. Jiang, smiling.","“Aiyo, that’s really nice,” said the owner immediately.","He even complimented Jiang Yujie’s beauty.","Anyway, it was the same routine as those used to praise people.","Jiang Yujie walked with Mrs. Jiang for another round, and she was praised for another round.","In the end, they carried the groceries they bought home.","There were only two of them but thinking that Jiang Yujie was skinnier, Mrs. Jiang decided to cook a lot for lunch.","She wanted to fill Jiang Yujie back up with one meal.","Luckily, Mrs. Jiang had a hunch that she would buy a lot.","So she specially brought a little trolley for carrying groceries.","Even if she bought a lot, it would not be hard for Jiang Yujie to drag it.","On the way, Mrs. Jiang asked, “Now that you’re back, you don’t plan to leave anymore, right?”","“Mhmm,” said Jiang Yujie, “I’m not leaving anymore.”","No matter what would happen to her and Jiang Huaizhou, now that Mrs. Jiang was alone, she could not just leave Mrs. Jiang alone.","Mrs. Jiang was also unwilling to go to an unfamiliar place. She was still a local.","So Jiang Yujie also did not plan to leave.","She would stay to be with Mrs. Jiang.","“About Huaizhou,” said Mrs. Jiang, “When do you plan to see him?”","Jiang Yujie paused and asked, “Will he come within these few days?”","“He’s busy with work, so he usually visits during the weekends, but it’s not a must that he will come every weekend,” explained Mrs. Jiang.","This made Jiang Yujie relieved.","That meant that at least before this weekend, as long as she was not ready, there would not be the risk of seeing Jiang Huaizhou.","“I’m not ready yet,” said Jiang Yujie, “Mom, I want to rest a few days at home first before seeing him.”","...","“That’s true, you just came back and haven’t rested enough yet. You should rest a lot. Besides, your mental condition isn’t very good, we have to let it recover,” said Mrs. Jiang, smiling.","“However, you’re already back, but you still plan to hide it from Huaizhou? If he knows that I’m helping you hide it from him...”","“Today is already Wednesday,” said Jiang Yujie, “I’ll stay here until Monday, if he doesn’t come back this weekend, then... I will go see him on Monday.”","Mrs. Jiang thought about it. It was still fine to hide it from Jiang Huaizhou for these few days.","As such, she nodded.","***","While Jiang Yujie was mentally preparing herself at home, Lu Man and the rest had already reached Mi Country.","Right now, Shana had already graduated.","The Han Corporation spent a lot of money on the promotion of ‘Dimensions’ this time.","They started a premiere in Hollywood.","They invited celebrities, media, and movie critics.","...","Even if the media was not too interested in ‘Dimensions’.","However, the Han Corporation had invited so many celebrities from Hollywood that the media had to come, even if it would only be for a few red-carpet pictures.","Yan Zhiqing had to attend a brand event in the country.","So she only arrived yesterday.","There were other actors from the movie with her.","It was rare to walk on Hollywood’s red carpet. Even actors who only had a few scenes also attended using their own money as they did not receive the Han Corporation’s reimbursement","And Xie Jiling was forced by Han Zhuofeng to walk on the red carpet.","Xie Jiling wanted to enter the cinema hall and wait on her own seat.","She was going to leave the red carpet to the public figures.","However, Han Zhuofeng said that since Xie Jiling was his fiancée, she also had to walk on the red carpet with him as his fiancée.","Xie Jiling even asked strangely about when she became his fiancée.","Han Zhuofeng said confidently, “Our parents have already met each other, and the wedding date has already been decided, so of course, you’re now my fiancée.”","Xie Jiling felt that what he said was reasonable.","She could not refute it at all.","As such, Xie Jiling was dragged by Han Zhuofeng to buy a dress.","Han Zhuofeng was moved when he saw Xie Jiling in a dress."]},{"number":3561,"title":"Chapter 3561 Untitled","paragraphs":["3561 Untitled","At that moment, Xie Jiling was trying it out with the help of the shop assistant, and Han Zhuofeng was suddenly touched.","Xie Jiling was shocked. “What happened to you?”","“You look gorgeous in a dress,” said Han Zhuofeng, touched, “If you already look so beautiful in a dress, how good will you look in a wedding dress?”","Han Zhuofeng wanted to bring Xie Jiling to a wedding dress shop right now to make her try on a wedding dress.","!!","Xie Jiling did not even dare to roast him after seeing him like that.","Now, Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling were standing at the entrance of the red carpet.","Behind them were Yan Zhiqing and the others.","Next to Yan Zhiqing was the main male character of ‘Dimensions’, Gu Zhilin, and the second main male character, Yu Xianrao.","Xiao Fengqing also wanted to come despite what happened previously.","However, some of her scenes had already been shot.","And Han Zhuofeng was spending his money sparingly.","If he fired Xiao Fengqing and invited a new actress.","He would have to spend more money.","Han Zhuofeng was reluctant to spend this money.","Anyway, back then, Xiao Fengqing was already behaving.","So Han Zhuofeng did not fire her.","He still let her act in it.","But after all, the thing still happened.","Han Zhuoling and Han Zhuoli did not plan to just let it go.","At least now, they did not give Xiao Fengqing the chance to walk on the red carpet.","The flight tickets and the accommodation of the main actors were all covered by the Han Corporation.","The side characters who did not have a lot of screen time could also come if they were willing to bear the cost themselves; the Han Corporation would be willing to let them walk on the red carpet.","However, Xiao Fengqing was a different case.","Even if she came with her own money, the Han Corporation would not accept it.","As such, Xiao Fengqing was absent.","Gu Zhilin was a new young actor. He had never attended any major events domestically, not to mention overseas.","To manage the cost of salary, Han Zhuofeng did not find a popular male main character.","When Gu Zhilin came for the audition, Han Zhuofeng felt that although Gu Zhilin’s acting skills had room for improvement, he had something natural inside.","It was just like when Sun Yiwu saw Lu Man for the first time and felt that her acting skills were natural.","Obviously, Gu Zhilin could not be compared to Lu Man yet, but there was a hint of that.","As such, Han Zhuofeng chose him.","Before that, Gu Zhilin was always a side character in some TV shows.","He could not imagine that he could become the main character in such a huge production.","Besides, this huge production exploded in popularity.","At least domestically, the netizens all knew about him now.","It made Gu Zhilin famous.","There were a lot of scriptwriters looking for him.","However, as he had just become famous, he had not experienced a big event before.","So it was normal for Gu Zhilin to be nervous here.","Gu Zhilin was so nervous that his palms were sweaty, and he even kept taking deep breaths.","He felt weak.","“Brother Yu, are you nervous?” Gu Zhilin could only talk to divide his attention.","Yan Zhiqing was used to this kind of scene, so she was not nervous at all.","She was talking to Wei Wucai.","As for Wei Wucai, he was even less nervous.","He had seen even bigger scenes.","This event today was a small scene for him.","As for Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling, there was no need to worry about them.","Although it was Han Zhuofeng’s first time walking on the red carpet, he was born into the Han Family, what kind of scenes had he not seen before?","He was not afraid at all.","Although Xie Jiling had not walked on the red carpet before, she became fearless from exorcising throughout the years.","After hearing Gu Zhilin’s words, Yu Xianrao said, “No shit, how can I not be nervous? It’s also my first time experiencing this kind of scene.”","“Even now, there’s my idol walking on the red carpet.” Yu Xianrao extended his neck and looked toward the center of the red carpet.","Gu Zhilin said, “...I think your mindset is pretty good.”","...","He was already so nervous, but he still had the mood to be a fan.","“Hey! I’m just forcing myself to relax,” said Yu Xianrao, “Later, let’s support each other while walking on the red carpet.”","“Okay.” Gu Zhilin immediately nodded, agreeing.","Anyway, Yan Zhiqing was walking with Wei Wucai.","Lu Man and Han Zhuoli were walking together.","They were all pairs.","In this team, there was no such chemistry as the two male and female main characters walking together and the two male and female second main characters walking together.","Everyone was a big boss and could not be messed with.","It was just right that Gu Zhilin and Yu Xianrao could support each other.","“Oh right, as the male main character, there would be a lot of reporters interviewing you later. Have you thought of what to say?” asked Yu Xianrao.","Gu Zhilin’s English was ordinary, so he should be able to manage daily conversations.","...","He could not do anything more than that.","“My manager even got an English teacher to give me classes, and he also simulated some questions that the reporters might ask.”","After all, it was about the movie, so they were usually those questions.","“The teacher made me memorize it, especially some keywords. If I hear those keywords, I will know what kind of question it is, then I just have to recite the translated answers.” Gu Zhilin was finding it difficult.","Yu Xianrao gave him a thumbs up. “You’re pretty smart.”","Gu Zhilin was popular with the production crew.","He was young, pure and kind.","He was humble and did not like to be in the spotlight.","He just kept doing his part diligently.","He was also very courteous to his seniors.","Even if he was the main character, he was just as courteous to the actors who only had a few lines.","Because of this, Yu Xianrao really liked Gu Zhilin.","Their production crew was making an entrance in the finale.","Han Zhuofeng and Xie Jiling walked in the front, leading the production crew to walk on the red carpet.","The Han Corporation did such a huge promotion this time.","Because of this, there were many cameras.","The reporters kept focusing their cameras on the main production team of ‘Dimensions’, without putting them down a single time.","There were some reporters who interviewed Han Zhuofeng.","After talking about the movie itself, they put their attention on Xie Jiling.","“Mr. Han, is this your girlfriend?” asked the reporter.","“No,” said Han Zhuofeng.","The reporters were shocked.","However, without waiting for the reporters to return from their shock, Han Zhuofeng said proudly, “She’s my fiancée.”","“Then congratulations,” said the reporters, smiling.","They congratulated Han Zhuofeng again.","On the other side, there were also reporters interviewing Yan Zhiqing and others.","Yan Zhiqing was too experienced. Her English was fluent, and she was quite popular internationally.","As such, there were a lot of reporters around her.","“At first, I agreed to act in this movie as I’m the director’s good friend, and his serious devotion to this movie really touched me. I also wanted to make a contribution to our domestic movies, so I agreed.”","“I heard that you accepted a very low salary?”","“Yes, not only me, but Lu Man as well, as the director’s sister-in-law, she also acted because of friendship and did not even want a salary,” said Yan Zhiqing, smiling, “And my fiancé, as Ledepic More’s boss, also agreed to handle the movie’s special effects with a loss.”"]},{"number":3562,"title":"Chapter 3562 Untitled","paragraphs":["3562 Untitled","“This is your fiancé? He’s Ledepic More’s boss? I can’t believe he’s so young. He’s so successful at a young age,” the reporter immediately praised.","They were obviously familiar with Ledepic More.","To be honest, Ledepic More was pretty famous.","They were especially famous among a few huge productions. They contacted Ledepic More t contract their services.","And Ledepic More also used their own skills to prove that they could really do it.","The relationship between Yan Zhiqing and Wei Wucai was in the spotlight domestically.","However, the overseas media did not know much about it.","Although Yan Zhiqing had a certain popularity internationally, she was not a local artist, so she would not get that much attention from the media here.","The overseas media also could not follow up, so naturally, they did not know about it.","Suddenly, they heard that Yan Zhiqing even had a fiancé.","At that moment, they could not care to ask about things related to the movie. They started to ask Yan Zhiqing about her relationship.","Wei Wucai did not speak; he stood there at the side and let Yan Zhiqing answer.","When he was mentioned, Wei Wucai would smile to express his presence.","“I haven’t watched the movie. I am very excited to see the special effects of the movie,” said the reporter, smiling.","Over there, the main male character Gu Zhilin was also being interviewed.","Luckily, he crammed previously and had memorized a lot.","During the interview, he remembered most of the keywords, so he answered the questions pretty smoothly.","Lu Man was not an important character in the movie this time, so the reporters did not interview her.","However, as she walked on the red carpet with Han Zhuoli, when Han Zhuoli was interviewed, Lu Man followed along.","Because of this, there was not much time being delayed on the red carpet.","As she did not attend the Exchange Competition previously, she showed her face here.","However, it was still some time apart.","Even if she left a huge impression, people would forget after a long time.","Furthermore, there were enough artists here. There were all kinds of news usually. As such, nobody would really care about a flash in the pan like Lu Man.","After Han Zhuoli answered some questions, he brought Lu Man in.","Many artists who were invited did not enter the cinema but stayed outside chatting. They gathered together after meeting people they knew.","Even the interior of the cinema had a red carpet.","There was a buffet of drinks and desserts.","They could stop, eat and continue talking anytime they wanted.","No matter where they stopped, they would have something to do.","Due to this, everyone was not in a rush to enter the cinema hall.","Lu Man and Han Zhuoli entered together and started looking.","After a while, they saw Robert and Hayer, then she immediately brought Han Zhuoli to greet them.","“It’s very regretful not to be able to see your performance this time. I heard that you don’t have many scenes in the movie,” said Robert.","“There’s no choice. When this movie started shooting, I just gave birth. I could not handle more scenes, so I picked a role that did not have a lot of scenes,” explained Lu Man.","“Oh right, did you guys bring your kids this time?” asked Hayer.","After the two cute balls were born, Robert and Hayer even sent the two kids a gift.","“We did,” said Lu Man, “We left them in the hotel today.”","“How long can you two stay this time?” asked Lu Man, smiling.","The main job of the two was still on Broadway.","“Knowing that you would come, we decided to stay here for three days,” said Robert.","“That’s great,” said Lu Man, smiling.","“The Han Corporation booked the same hotel for us, so we’ll be together. When we return tonight, the kids are still there, so it won’t be convenient for us to go to you guys. We’ll go visit you tomorrow,” said Hayer, “Most importantly, we have to see the two babies.”","The red carpet event started at four in the afternoon.","The movie started at six sharp.","After the movie, there was still the interview of the director and the main team.","Especially if the feedback of the movie was good, the time might be much longer.","When all this ended, there was the banquet after the premiere.","This banquet was actually a celebration party.","The Han Corporation even prepared for this; it could be seen how confident they were.","Otherwise, who would have the mood to organize a party if the reviews were bad?","“It seems you guys are really confident this time,” said Hayer.","After all, it was the premiere of ‘Dimensions’, nobody knew what the effect would be.","The Han Corporation booked the whole hall for the premiere.","...","Only those movies that had a fanbase would make it so big.","The Han Corporation dared to do this without knowing the results of ‘Dimensions’ over here.","Either they did not lack money and did not care even if they made a loss.","Or they could also be really confident.","Han Zhuoli smiled and said, “Honestly, we think that this is a good movie and are very confident in the movie’s quality. However, we are actually not confident in the results of the movie being released here.”","“Due to the differences in culture, you guys may not be able to accept the core of our plot. If you guys aren’t able to accept it, the ratings of the movie will drop a lot, so to be honest, I am not confident in the results and reputation of the movie after the release here.”","“However, it’s a good movie. Perhaps, there are different views toward it due to cultural differences, but we’re very confident that it’s a good movie.”","“Since it’s a good movie, it deserves to be treated like this,” said Han Zhuoli.","“We’re even more excited after hearing that from you,” said Robert, smiling.","At this moment, Lu Man found Shana.","Shana entered before them, but she was stopped by people she knew for a conversation.","...","After many people arrived, Shana was blocked.","Now, Lu Man finally saw Shana and waved her hand.","Shana saw it and walked over.","“Lu Man, I didn’t think that I could see you here,” said Shana arrogantly.","“Enough. Don’t act in front of me. You’re clearly a cutie!” Lu Man did not care about Shana’s arrogant attitude.","Shana was enraged by Lu Man.","She did not have the imposing manner anymore!","This woman was too annoying!","“Didn’t I promise you to let you watch the movie and give an honest rating? It’s just nice. After watching the movie today, just tell me your honest rating,” Lu Man smiled and said.","“Of course, I will be honest,” said Shana, as she looked at Lu Man uncomfortably, “But I really did not expect you to look for me.”","“We’re friends, after all!” Lu Man smiled sweetly at Shana."]},{"number":3563,"title":"Chapter 3563 Untitled","paragraphs":["3563 Untitled","Shana immediately said angrily, “I am not a good friend of yours! We didn’t even talk much”","Han Zhuoli was at the side and smiled as he watched Lu Man tricking Shana.","However, based on how well he knew Lu Man, he knew that this was happening because Lu Man liked Shana as a person.","If not, Lu Man wouldn’t even bother to trick Shana.","Lu Man had once told him that Shana was quite similar to Zhang Xiaoying.","When they were against you, they would be stubborn fighters.","However, they weren’t really bad people.","They wouldn’t use any tricks and were very righteous.","Lu Man didn’t think this was an issue.","When it was a competition, one should indeed treat people seriously and compete fairly.","“This means that we are a good match.” Lu Man said, “Even though we haven’t spent much time together, we are still able to be good friends. This is very much meant to be.”","Shana replied, “...”","She really couldn’t win any argument with Lu Man.","Shana gnashed her teeth and said, “Even though you said so, I am still not going to promote the movie if I don’t think the movie is good.”","“Of course.” Lu Man placed her arm on Shana’s shoulder in a carefree manner. “I can’t just let you lie.”","Han Zhuoli narrowed his eyes and moved Lu Man’s arm down. “If you want to talk, just use your mouth. You don’t have to put your arm on her shoulder.”","Han Zhuoli immediately added, “You can only touch me.”","He even said it in English, just in case Shana didn’t understand.","Shana: “...”","She couldn’t help but roll her eyes.","Shana looked up at the sky. Han Zhuoli and Lu Man were married for many years now, but they are still such a loving couple.","This was torture.","Lu Man smiled and held Han Zhuoli’s arm, immediately appearing more well-behaved.","The group entered the cinema hall together.","Names were stuck on the back of the seats, allowing people to take their assigned seats.","Lu Man’s team was arranged to sit in the front row.","Because it would be more convenient for them to go on the stage after the movie ended.","Honestly, it would be really scary to sit in the front row when you were watching movies.","You would have to look up the entire time. Because the screen was really near and it was a 3D movie as well, you could get dizzy quite easily.","There were a couple of times Lu Man gave in and closed her eyes for a little while. She relaxed her eyes and didn’t watch the movie.","The movie finally ended.","When the credit scene started rolling, loud rounds of applause started sounding in the entire hall.","“Nice. It is very good.”","“I didn’t expect this movie to be made so well.”","“I am very interested in the author of the book. Is there a translated version? If it is as remarkable as the movie, I would like to see the book. If possible, I would like to buy the rights to the book.”","“This is a movie suitable for every culture.”","“There are flaws, but no movie is filmed perfectly. Even movies made by famous directors have some flaws.”","“Yes. There are flaws, but this movie is amazing.”","When the credit scene ended, the lights in the cinema hall were turned on. The emcee then invited Han Zhuofeng and the other main cast actors onto the stage.","They shared lots of behind-the-scenes stories.","“I even specially came to Hollywood to ask a director to teach me.”","“We didn’t have a lot of funds, so we were trying to do a good job with the special effects while reducing the costs as much as possible.”","“To reduce the cost of the CGI, we shot a lot of the scenes in those exact places shown in the background. I appreciate my country for having so many magnificent sceneries.”","“In the movie, there are many scenes that showed the actors visiting different planets. For those scenes, the movie was shot on location, and no CGI was used. We only did editing work in the end.”","“This is my first time directing such a huge production. I was really worried that I might not be able to find the right balance, and I was worried that the rhythm wouldn’t be right or that I wouldn’t do a good job at storytelling. I was scared of these things, but I was never scared of one thing—bad CGI work. And this is because we partnered with a very excellent CGI company, Ledepic More.”","“My family members provided all the funds to make this movie. Because I am just a newbie, investors didn’t trust that I would do a good job at directing this film. No one had faith that the movie I directed would have a good box office return.”","“In fact, I didn’t believe in myself. But my family believed in me. The funds to make this movie came from my pocket as well as from my family members. All four of them gave me the money from their personal accounts.”","“I am very grateful for their trust and support. If they never believed in me and never supported me, this movie would have never been made. We wouldn’t be showing this movie to all you film professionals today.”","Whether this movie eventually turns out successful or not, we have given blood, sweat, and tears to this movie. My team and my family are proud of this movie.”","“Initially, I only planned to show it in my country. I was only confident enough to show it in my country.”","“However, my two elder brothers disagreed. I was worried that this movie wouldn’t be suitable to be shown in a place with a different culture from ours. However, my elder brothers were willing to bear the risk and insisted on releasing this movie overseas.”","“This movie has received so much support from my family. My eldest sister-in-law is the makeup artist for the movie, and she didn’t charge a dime. My second elder sister-in-law Lu Man started filming not long after she had given birth, and she didn’t charge me a dime as well. My good friend Yan Zhiqing, who is just like an elder sister-in-law since she had started dating Elder Brother Xiao Cai, joined the team as the female lead, and she didn’t charge me a dime, too.”","“My elder brother Xiao Cai’s company was in charge of the CGI. Of course, we had to pay, haha.”","At that, everyone sitting in the hall laughed.","...","They thought that the CGI work was done for free as well.","But at the same time, the wealth that Zhuofeng’s family possessed shocked everyone.","Of course, they didn’t think it was weird. After all, it was the Han Corporation.","If it were someone else, they wouldn’t have been able to do what Han Zhuofeng had done.","Whose family would have members capable of investing because someone ran out of money to make the movie?","A movie cost hundreds of millions to create.","Han Zhuofeng would be the only one.","There would be no one else in the world with such a family.","Even if it were someone whose family was rich enough to invest, would they even trust their child?","Spend hundreds of millions to make a movie that could flop?","They would never trust their child. However, when the Han Family gave the money, they didn’t even think about the movie becoming a failure.","...","Subconsciously, everyone felt a little admiration.","Admiration for the Han Family’s unity...","It wasn’t just an investment. Every member of the family that could help joined the crew without charging anything.","“Elder Brother Xiao Cai’s CGI work is expensive. I can’t let him lose money just to help me. And so, I paid only for the cost of the CGI work.” Han Zhuofeng smiled and said, “It’s basically free.”","Everyone in the audience’s sitting area laughed.","“I have said everything about this movie. If you have any questions, please go ahead,” Han Zhuofeng said.","Unexpectedly, the reporters bombarded them with questions.","As for issues encountered while filming the movie, Han Zhuofeng had many things to say about them. The reporters had questions about many things to say as well.","There were even film connoisseurs asking questions about the things in the movie that confused them."]},{"number":3564,"title":"Chapter 3564 Untitled","paragraphs":["3564 Untitled","They could already imagine how the netizens would post their own takes about the plot after the release of the movie.","However, they still needed Director Han Zhuofeng to answer some questions regarding some plotholes and some things that the netizens couldn’t figure out even after discussing them.","They wanted to take this opportunity and ask every question.","However, there was a time limit.","Initially, Han Zhuofeng didn’t expect there to be so many questions.","But based on what was happening, it was obvious that there wouldn’t be enough time for questions.","Unfortunately, nothing could be done.","Considering the current situation, there wouldn’t be enough time even if they gave more time for questions.","Dimensions received such a good response that it surprised Han Zhuofeng.","He had a dinner party to attend after the question time, so he couldn’t drag this on for too long.","Even so, when they went back to the hotel, it was already almost 12 o’clock.","“I am looking forward to what the media and film critics will say tomorrow,” Lu Man said.","“Some film review columns will write in a more gentle tone while some will be stricter and even pick on the tiniest flaws,” Han Zhuofeng said, “I’m ready to accept both the good and bad reviews.”","Han Zhuoli smiled and said, “Just keep faking it. The movie was a big success tonight. Even if there are negative reviews, you don’t have to care about them.”","“However, your first movie being this successful is beneficial and stressful to your future career development. You won’t be lacking any funds when you make the second movie. The companies will seek you out with a checkbook without you asking for it.”","“However, there will be a higher expectation regarding your second film. Even if your second film turned out to be above the standard, they wouldn’t think it’s good if it doesn’t live up to their expectation. Take ‘Lost Detective’ and ‘Sky Mechanical City’ as examples.”","“Those two films were made well. If it weren’t for your movie, their box office record for them would have been much higher,” Han Zhuoli said.","Han Zhuofeng nodded in a serious manner. “I know. I will be well prepared for the next movie. I won’t start filming until everything is ready.”","The premier was a success. Han Zhuofeng immediately shared the good news with the elders of the family.","It was quite troublesome to message every single individual.","And so, he sent a message to the Han Family’s group chat.","The following day, Robert, Hayer, and even Shana paid Lu Man a visit.","“I heard you brought your kids here as well. Let me see them,” Shana said proudly.","“Sure.” Lu Man hurriedly invited them inside. “Talk to them in English. If they were exposed to English early, they might learn English faster when they are older.","“Are you dumb?” Shana said, “They are so young. They can’t even talk. How can you expect them to learn English? They should learn how to speak Chinese first.”","“My kids are smart. If they were taught now, they would definitely remember it in the future.” Lu Man argued.","Shana thought to herself. ‘A doting mother really knows how to lie.’","Then, she took out the gifts for the two babies and said, “There you go. Gifts for meeting the kids for the first time.”","“Yo. You’re acting just like an elder!” Lu Man smiled as she took the gifts. She then pushed the two babies to Shana while instructing, “Say thank you to auntie.”","Shana immediately complained, “I’m a sister, not an auntie.”","“I can’t mess up the hierarchy. We are of the same generation. Of course, you are their auntie,” Lu Man said.","The two babies were able to crawl to Shana’s feet. And each one of them smoothly held onto one leg.","It was obvious that the babies did this often.","The corner of Shana’s mouth twitched as she said, “They’re pretty good at this.”","“They like you. If they don’t like you, they wouldn’t have hugged your leg,” Lu Man said with a smile.","“By the way, did you post the promotion post? Don’t tell me that you think ‘Dimensions’ isn’t good?” Lu Man urged once again.","Shana glared and said, “I’m seriously suspecting that we’re only friends because of Dimensions.’","“Why would you think that?” Lu Man tilted her head toward Han Zhuoli and said, “My husband is the CEO of the Han Corporation. Do you really think I would need to be your friend just for a promotion?”","“Even if a friendship was needed, you should be one begging to be my friend. After all, my friends would be prioritized when there’s a selection of cast members for a new script,” Lu Man said.","Lu Man lifted her chin as she said, “You didn’t even think about how you should flatter me. Instead, you thought that I’m friendly because I have ulterior motives? Honestly, what can I get from you?”","Shana replied, “...”","That made sense.","She could not refute it at all.","“So just be a good friend of mine!” Lu Man said with a smile.","Shana replied, “...”","Although it made sense, she felt somewhat aggrieved.","Hayer and Robert were laughing so hard at the side.","The two babies stuck closely to Shana, refusing to acknowledge their presence.","Hayer then asked Lu Man, “Do these babies part of the good-looks club?”","Robert then realized as well. “That’s true. We came here first, but they didn’t hug us.”","Little Linzhe seemed to have understood what they said. He tilted his head and stared at Hayer. Then, he suddenly let go of Shana’s leg and started crawling toward Hayer.","Anyway, Shana wouldn’t give little Linzhe any attention.","He would rather find someone who would give him some attention.","“Aiyo!” Hayer was surprised. “He doesn’t understand English, does he?”","...","“He doesn’t.” Lu Man said, “However, he obviously knows that you like him more than Shana.”","Shana immediately refuted, “Who told you I didn’t like him?”","“But you didn’t hold them,” Lu Man said.","Shana was just about to hold little Linxun...","But suddenly, little Linxun let go of her leg and started crawling toward Robert.","Lu Man then started provoking Shana by saying, “Look at this. When they wanted you, you didn’t hold onto the opportunity. And now, they are not giving you the chance to hold them. That’s why they say that you should cherish it when you have the opportunity to do so.”","“Yaaa!” Although little Linxun didn’t understand what Lu Man was saying, she still cooperated with Lu Man and commented in gibberish, and she stopped when she was halfway toward Robert.","After she had said her gibberish, she continued crawling to Robert.","Shana was surprised. “When your daughter grows up, she will be an exact copy of you.”","Shana decided to tremble in advance for all of Han Linxun’s enemies.","Lu Man was brilliant!","...","And the kids made with her powerful genes and Han Zhuoli’s powerful genes...","They would be incredibly powerful.","Lu Man, being supported by Han Zhuoli, could already stir a tempest every day.","Han Linxun would be supported by the Han Family as well as the other families in the eight great families. In addition, Wang Juhuai was her grandfather.","Shana trembled. She could already imagine how omnipotent Han Linxun would be.","Shana didn’t expect that her prediction would be accurate.","Han Linxun would grow up to be extremely brilliant.","A grown-up Han Linxun would definitely make her opponents wish they were dead.","With the Han Family being such a supportive family, Han Linxun would always be the ultimate winner."]},{"number":3565,"title":"Chapter 3565 Untitled","paragraphs":["3565 Untitled","Robert and Hayer each held a baby in their arms. They felt really content.","They also thought that Lu Man was a talented woman. She gave birth to two, allowing each of them to have a baby in their arms and preventing a fight for the baby.","Shana logged onto her social media account while she chatted with everyone else. Then, she started pondering.","She pondered for a while and wrote an honest review of ‘Dimensions.’","Of course, she was very careful not to write any spoilers.","The premier here was slightly late.","But the audience wouldn’t know how to read Chinese.","Therefore, to the people here, this was the official premiere.","Shana deleted some of the spoilers in her review. She checked the review before she posted it.","Robert and Hayer commented on the CGI and the rhythm of the film. They tried not to write any spoilers. They even praised the actors’ and actresses’ skills and the director’s control over the performance of the cast and the details of the film.","It was hard to imagine that this film was directed by such a young director.","Many film review columns started releasing their film review.","Some film reviews were full of praise.","Some were very strict and stated that this film did well in China because there were no other locally made movies on par with this film and that the film wouldn’t stand out in Hollywood.","Some film critics pointed out the flaws of the film.","However, Lu Man thought that even though there were imperfections, this movie was not as bad as those strict film reviews had stated.","Some reviews were just posted for the sake of criticizing this movie.","It was as though a film review wouldn’t be professional without any criticism.","However, Lu Man ignored those comments.","After all, they were newbies here.","They didn’t know this place well, and it wouldn’t be easy for them to achieve anything.","In addition, ‘Dimensions’ was getting so much more praise than negative criticisms.","Robert, Hayer, Shana, and many other celebrities who had attended the premier recommended the movie.","Their fans would choose to watch the movie as well.","Most people saw their recommendations. However, some of them had doubts about whether the movie was really good or not.","Some of the celebrities who reviewed the movie always had a good reputation.","Take Robert and Hayer as an example.","Both were known to be very honest people. Most people who watched movies recommended by them gave good reviews as well.","Of course, such preference was subjective.","Therefore, not everyone would like such movies.","Some people wouldn’t like such movies.","But most people share similar preferences with the general public.","Some netizens even felt disdain.","They didn’t think China is capable of making a good CGI film.","In addition, they had seen so many good films.","Why would this film stun them?","Many people agreed with one of the reviews of this film.","Perhaps this movie seemed remarkable because it had been compared to other local movies, which resulted in lower expectations.","However, the claim that this movie would stand out here...","They would never believe it.","And so, these curious people with such a mindset also bought movie tickets.","Regardless of the reason as to why people stepped into the cinema hall...","Because of these various reasons, the box office record shot past the roof on the day of the premiere.","“Sister-in-law, did you predict this?” Han Zhuofeng chuckled happily as he watched the box office record on premiere day.","He hastily asked someone to make a poster. Then, the poster was posted on China Weibo to congratulate the film.","“I didn’t predict this. I just thought that most people would feel curious. The reason could be the desire to watch what on earth had been produced by the China film industry or the urge to make fun of this film.”","“Some people just have the intention of picking out the imperfections and joining the fun.” Lu Man smiled and said, “However, regardless of the reason, as long as they step into the cinema hall, it means profit for us.”","“Some people would still be stubborn. Even though this movie turned out well, they would stubbornly refuse to change their opinion. Still, some people would change their minds. As long as some people change their minds, it’s a good thing.”","“Yes!” Han Zhuofeng nodded and said, “This is just the beginning. This is our first step. It will get better in the future.”","The netizens in the country saw the poster posted by the official Weibo account of the movie ‘Dimensions.’","Everyone started congratulating Han Zhuofeng.","“It has been so many years. We finally made a hit film in Hollywood. They achieved something difficult!”","“The previous movie that did well overseas was a martial arts film. In the past, all our movies were about past stories. It’s rare to see stories about the future world. And we finally have one now! Awesome!”","“No more talking. I am going to read the foreign netizens’ comments.”","The netizens in the country were not the only ones. Han Zhuoli and the others were also reading the reviews left by the general audience.","“Amazing. Local. Filmed very well. The plot is intellectually stimulating, and it is very logical. There aren’t any big flaws. As for plotholes, I haven’t found any since I only watched this once. This movie is intellectually stimulating, I have to watch it a few more times to find plotholes.”","“The film review that claimed that this movie wouldn’t stand out was lying. Compared to the other movies here, this movie is honestly remarkable.”","There were good comments and obviously bad comments.","The bad reviews shared more about their psychological views.","They said their movie had been held to a higher standard.","There were people who intentionally left bad reviews.","Obviously, there were people who genuinely did not like his movie.","However, such reviews were small in number.","One could say that the premiere of ‘Dimensions’ abroad started on the right foot.","There were good reviews everywhere.","The netizens were very proud. “This meant that we weren’t exaggerating when we praised ‘Dimensions.’","And the box office sales of Dimensions officially started soaring and climbing higher in the worldwide box office ranking.","This happened while Han Zhuofeng and the others were still overseas.","Time passed by unknowingly, and it was soon Monday.","Jiang Yujie rested at the house for five days.","Jiang Huaizhou didn’t visit Mrs. Jiang this weekend.","Instead, he visited Mr. Jiang.","After all, Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Jiang lived in different places.","Actually, Mrs. Jiang should be referred to as Ms. Dong.","Because they had divorced, Ms. Dong thought that it would be better if Jiang Yujie took her surname. It would be more convenient for Yujie in the future.","And so, Ms. Dong dragged Jiang Yujie and made her change her surname.","And now, the name on her identification card and household register became Dong Yujie. The surname was her biological father’s surname.","Jiang Huaizhou had to visit two different places. He also had to work. He couldn’t visit both Mr. Jiang and Ms. Dong’s houses too often.","Therefore, if he didn’t need to work overtime or go on business trips, he would visit them once a week.","This week, he visited Mr. Jiang’s house. And he would then visit Ms. Dong’s house next week.","Thankfully, Jiang Huaizhou had not given Mr. Dong a phone call these past few days.","As a result, Ms. Dong felt a sense of relief.","Otherwise, Ms. Dong wouldn’t even know what to tell Jiang Huaizhou.","Dong Yujie was here, but she refused to tell Jiang Huaizhou. This was basically lying.","Mrs. Dong didn’t want to lie to Jiang Huaizhou.","Jiang Huaizhou’s life had never been easy."]},{"number":3566,"title":"Chapter 3566 Untitled","paragraphs":["3566 Untitled","In the morning, Mrs. Dong was eating breakfast with Dong Yujie.","Mrs. Dong was hesitant about asking Dong Yujie if she wanted to see Jiang Huaizhou today.","However, she did not dare to ask.","She was afraid that Dong Yujie would be annoyed.","She was finally back, and now she had to be pressured and rushed by Mrs. Dong.","Jiang Huaizhou was a person with filial piety.","However, if she had to choose between Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie, Mrs. Dong would definitely choose Dong Yujie without a question.","So now Mrs. Dong really wanted to ask, but she was holding it back in.","She felt that even her breakfast was not delicious anymore.","After seeing Mrs. Dong’s conflicted expression, Dong Yujie knew what she was thinking.","So she took the initiative to say, “Mom, I will go see elder brother after this meal.”","“Really?” After Mrs. Dong heard that, she let out a sigh of relief.","Seeing that Dong Yujie looked over, Mrs. Dong explained awkwardly, “I am not rushing you to see him, I just feel that no matter what, it should be settled sooner rather than later.”","“Yeah, I also think so, so don’t worry about it,” said Dong Yujie.","Although Dong Yujie said so, she still felt burdened.","While she lowered her head to eat her porridge, her smile faded, and it was as though her heart was being crushed by a boulder.","She lost her energy and found it difficult to breathe.","After breakfast, Mrs. Dong was looking at the time.","Although she was not rushing her, Mrs. Dong could not help but look at the time.","Dong Yujie tidied up and said to Mrs. Dong, “Mom, I’m going to Brother’s office.”","“Why don’t you wait a bit more? It’s peak time right now, the subway is packed, and the traffic jam is terrible,” said Mrs. Dong.","Dong Yujie smiled.","Mrs. Dong was the impatient one here, but she was asking her to wait at the same time.","After pondering for a bit, Dong Yujie said, “Fine, I will leave at half past nine.”","“I forgot how things worked here after a year of absence,” added Dong Yujie.","Dong Yujie only left at half past nine.","She did not get a taxi but chose to use the subway.","She arrived at Jiang Huaizhou’s office.","Jiang Huaizhou’s office was a famous office building in B City’s CBD.","Dong Yujie still remembered that many companies, which were famous in their own industries, were all located here.","The fact that Jiang Huaizhou could have an office here meant that his business was really successful.","Dong Yujie took a deep breath and entered the office building.","But she was stopped by the security officer.","As there were too many offices in the office building, people entering and exiting needed to register.","Dong Yujie signed her name on the registration form, and the security officer gave her a temporary access card.","Dong Yujie took the card and could only pass through the machine with the card.","She took the lift to the floor where Jiang Huaizhou’s office was on.","After going through the security officer, she still had to go through the front desk.","After passing through all these levels, Dong Yujie did not feel that nervous anymore.","She really had to thank these levels.","Dong Yujie came to the front desk and said to the front desk receptionist, “Hello, I’m here to see Jiang Huaizhou.”","The receptionist said, “May I ask if you have a reservation?”","“No.” Dong Yujie felt that she had been rash.","She should have called Jiang Huaizhou first.","It was not really good to suddenly come to his office.","Dong Yujie sighed.","She stayed in an ancient city in the South for so long that she even forgot the ways of the world.","Dong Yujie had gone to another ancient city afterward, which was not a popular tourist spot.","Although there were many tourists, it was not as industrialized as cities like Li Jiang.","Other than the peak tourist season, which lasted for a few months, the ancient city was really quiet.","Even during the peak season, there were no open shops, like pubs, which could disturb the residents.","It was either quiet cafes or restaurants and souvenir shops.","Dong Yujie rented an inn in the ancient city.","The inn’s price for short-term stays was cheap, and long-term stays had even more discounts.","With Jiang Huaizhou transferring her money on time, Dong Yujie really did not have to worry about money.","She spent her days relaxing in the ancient city.","When she woke up, she would smell the fragrance of the plants and mud.","It was humid in the South, so this kind of smell in the morning was more pungent.","When she opened her window, she would see the wet stone path outside.","It was a small breakfast shop opposite, and smoke was already coming out of it early in the morning.","Life in the ancient city was really peaceful, and the pace was slow as well.","Most people didn’t have a lot of requirements for a great life.","Most people would be satisfied with being able to eat and chat outside their houses every day.","Most young people were out working.","However, most young people nowadays were people like her, looking after their peace and satisfaction outside.","The rest of the people were elderly people.","The elderly moved slowly and did things slowly.","As such, even young people became slow.","Dong Yujie spent her days in that kind of environment. She did not have to worry about her career. She could even take a trip to the mountains when she had nothing to do; it was relaxing.","Perhaps it was the life that many people wanted.","But after living like that for too long, Dong Yujie didn’t get used to city life after returning to the city.","She even forgot to call Jiang Huaizhou in advance.","“Sorry, I should have called before coming here. I will come another day,” said Dong Yujie. She turned around and walked out.","At this moment, a gorgeous lady with long hair walked towards her.","She wore high heels, and as she walked, the sound of her high heels could be heard.","This woman’s body was covered in luxury brands.","Although Dong Yujie was absent for a year, she could still recognize those brands.","Dong Yujie slowed down subconsciously.","She did not know why, it was probably a hunch.","“Miss Qu.” The front desk receptionist was clearly familiar with the woman because she immediately called out her name.","Dong Yujie stopped at the door.","She heard Miss Qu ask, “Who is she?”","It was soft, but Dong Yujie still heard it.","Dong Yujie thought that she had to be talking about her.","Because there were no other people right now.","The front desk receptionist said softly, “She came to find the boss, but she did not have a reservation, so she did not get to see him. She said that she should have called before coming here. I’m not sure whether she’s the boss’ acquaintance. She left before I had the chance to ask.”","Qu Mengyu turned around, and seeing that Dong Yujie hadn’t left yet, she called her out, “Wait up.”","Dong Yujie turned around. “You’re calling me?”","“Yeah.” Qu Mengyu walked over.","She wore high heels, while Dong Yujie was wearing a pair of ordinary white shoes.","The two should have the same height.","But because of their shoes, Dong Yujie was an inch shorter than Qu Mengyu.","“Can I help you?” Dong Yujie looked at Qu Mengyu.","Subconsciously, she did not really like Qu Mengyu.","It was probably the intuition of the two women...","Because even Qu Mengyu did not like Dong Yujie the moment they met.","She tensed up and unconsciously saw Dong Yujie as an enemy.","Of course, perhaps Qu Mengyu saw every pretty woman as her rival for Jiang Huaizhou."]},{"number":3567,"title":"Chapter 3567 Untitled","paragraphs":["3567 Untitled","Qu Mengyu walked over and stopped in front of Dong Yujie due to the height difference.","Qu Mengyu seemed like she was occupying the high ground.","“Why are you here?” asked Qu Mengyu.","As she was so impolite, Dong Yujie also did not have a good attitude toward her.","!!","“May I ask who you are?” Dong Yujie smiled slightly.","Who was she?","Did Dong Yujie have to explain to her what she came to do?","Qu Mengyu had a cold expression and said, “I heard that you’re here to see Huaizhou?”","Dong Yujie frowned.","This woman called Huaizhou as though she was very close to him.","“I’m here to see him.” Dong Yujie pondered for a while and said, “I am his younger sister.”","“Hah!” said Qu Mengyu, “You should make up a better lie.”","Qu Mengyu sneered. “Huaizhou doesn’t have a younger sister.”","Dong Yujie was a little surprised. Did Jiang Huaizhou not accept her?","After a year of no contact, had his mind changed?","Did what he said previously not count anymore?","This year, although Jiang Huaizhou transferred the company’s profits to her on time, the two didn’t really talk other than that.","After all, Dong Yujie herself told Jiang Huaizhou not to contact her.","Jiang Huaizhou made sure to keep that promise.","But now she was suddenly a little curious about why Jiang Huaizhou did not contact her.","Could it be that he had a change of heart and decided not to contact her?","At first, she wanted to leave and contact Jiang Huaizhou.","But now, it seemed like she could not just leave.","She had already experienced a lot of painful things, so her heart had long become steadfast.","Even if Jiang Huaizhou had a change of heart, it was better to hear it from him.","That way, she did not need to keep him on her mind and could just give up.","This idea was firm.","However, Dong Yujie still found it painful.","It was as though someone was pinching her heart.","If... if Jiang Huaizhou really had a change of heart.","Actually, she could not blame him, too.","But she would probably be single for the rest of her life.","She would not trust anyone, and she wouldn’t like anyone.","She had given Jiang Huaizhou her heart and did not plan to give it to anyone else.","She could not give her heart out anymore.","If even Jiang Huaizhou could not keep his promise, then Dong Yujie would not expect others to do so.","Besides, her heart was already exhausted. She put her last hope of love on Jiang Huaizhou.","If even this love vanished, she would not be able to love again.","Dong Yujie thought bitterly in her heart while having a cold expression. “Then who are you?”","“I’m his girlfriend,” said Qu Mengyu.","Behind Qu Mengyu, the front desk receptionist was hesitating to talk.","“So that’s how it is.” Dong Yujie’s expression was getting colder.","Without saying another word, she took out his phone and called Jiang Huaizhou.","She had not called this number for over a year.","Dong Yujie was also not sure if she could even reach Jiang Huaizhou with it.","However, Dong Yujie was expecting Jiang Huaizhou’s number to be the same.","While Dong Yujie was wondering, unexpectedly, the phone only rang for one second because Jiang Huaizhou had picked it up.","He picked up in a flash.","“Yujie!” Jiang Huaizhou picked up excitedly.","He did not think that Yujie would finally take the initiative to contact him.","In this one year, he had always wanted to call her, but he remembered the promise he had made to her.","He did not dare to call her.","If he did not take the initiative to call, obviously, Yujie would not take the initiative to contact him either.","This was the first time he received her call in this one year.","...","Jiang Huaizhou was so excited that even his voice was a little shaky.","Dong Yujie had been wavering, but deep inside, she had always trusted Jiang Huaizhou.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have called him on the spot","“Jiang Huaizhou,” she called his full name unkindly.","Jiang Huaizhou smiled.","Her voice sounded soft and delicate whenever she called him ‘brother’.","But now, he did not want her to call him that.","They were no longer siblings.","He wanted her to call his name directly.","If she could get rid of his surname and sound more intimate, it would be for the best.","“Yujie, you...” Jiang Huaizhou hesitated and asked carefully, “When are you coming back?”","...","Rather than answering him, Dong Yujie asked, “You have a girlfriend?”","Jiang Huaizhou froze. “No, I’m waiting for you to return to be my girlfriend.”","Upon hearing that, Dong Yujie blushed and stuttered, “Who... who said I would...”","However, she suddenly remembered Qu Mengyu was standing in front of her.","As such, she sneered and said, “Jiang Huaizhou, I didn’t think that you would become more skillful after not meeting for a year! You clearly have a girlfriend, but you still dared to tell me that!”","Jiang Huaizhou frowned. “When did I have a girlfriend? Who did you hear that from?”","Jiang Huaizhou was confused but also happy.","He was confused about where Dong Yujie heard it from because he really did not have a girlfriend.","He was happy that even when Dong Yujie was so far away, she still cared if he had a girlfriend.","It could be seen that she really liked him and that was why she cared so much about it!","“Your girlfriend told me herself.” Since Dong Yujie had already called him, she wasn’t planning on hiding the fact that she was here.","“There’s a Miss Qu here. She’s in front of me, and she told me that she’s your girlfriend.” Dong Yujie sneered.","Qu Mengyu’s expression changed. She got a bit nervous now.","She really called Jiang Huaizhou?","They... they really knew each other?","Moreover, it seemed like her relationship with Jiang Huaizhou was not simple.","It even.... sounded like she was condemning him.","It was like a real girlfriend catching her boyfriend cheating.","Qu Mengyu’s expression changed.","Could it be that she was Jiang Huaizhou’s girlfriend?","Jiang Huaizhou’s expression changed. “She went to see you? She actually went so far to see you?”","Wait, how would Qu Mengyu know about her existence?","Ever since knowing Qu Mengyu’s feelings, Jiang Huaizhou had told Qu Mengyu that he had someone he liked and had been waiting for that person.","However, Qu Mengyu did not give up.","And Jiang Huaizhou was too lazy to talk to her.","Qu Mengyu kept on pestering him. Jiang Huaizhou could only not give her the chance to pester her and just ignored her.","However, he could not make Qu Mengyu disappear.","After hearing what Dong Yujie said, Jiang Huaizhou’s first thought was about how Qu Mengyu knew about Dong Yujie’s existence.","Did she fly to the ancient city in the South to see her?","She even lied to Dong Yujie, causing Dong Yujie to misunderstand.","Jiang Huaizhou quickly explained, “Yujie, I don’t have a girlfriend. I don’t have any relationship with her. I have never acknowledged her, believe me. My girlfriend will only be you.”","“I have been waiting for you to return.” Jiang Huaizhou felt that he was wronged, and his voice sounded like he was hurt. “I have been waiting for you this whole time. I don’t like anyone else. You can’t just accuse me like that.”"]},{"number":3568,"title":"Chapter 3568 Untitled","paragraphs":["3568 Untitled","“You haven’t been back, and I don’t dare to go and see you nor call you. I don’t even know what’s going on over there.” Jiang Huaizhou was hurt.","“Yujie, you promised to come back after a year,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","Dong Yujie smiled. She already believed in Jiang Huaizhou.","However, she still said, “Then what’s with this, Miss Qu? If it’s not you, who gave her the confidence to stand in front of me to tell me that she’s your girlfriend? She even questioned who I am.”","Jiang Huaizhou finally realized that something was wrong.","At first, when he received Dong Yujie’s call, he was too excited.","And subconsciously, he did not think that Dong Yujie would return suddenly.","So, he thought that Dong Yujie was still far away.","But now, the more he heard Dong Yujie speak, the more Jiang Huaizhou felt like it was not right.","It did not sound like Dong Yujie was far away.","“Yujie, where are you right now?” asked Jiang Huaizhou suddenly.","Since she was here, there was no need to hide.","Dong Yujie said, “In front of your office.”","“What?” Jiang Huaizhou jumped up. Even his chair fell.","Dong Yujie even heard the knocking sound through the phone.","“You... wait for me! Don’t leave!” Jiang Huaizhou instructed immediately.","Dong Yujie had already returned, even if she left now.","As long as she was still in B City, Jiang Huaizhou would be able to see her.","After all, Mrs. Dong was still here, so it was impossible for Dong Yujie not to visit Mrs. Dong.","Besides, Mrs. Dong would also tell him where Dong Yujie was.","But now, Jiang Huaizhou could not think too much.","He knew that Dong Yujie was in front of his office’s entrance.","As such, he had to rush out to see her.","He was scared that if he were too slow, Dong Yujie would escape again.","“Don’t leave!” said Jiang Huaizhou. He was in such a rush that he hit the cabinet at the entrance.","A loud ‘bang’ sounded. Dong Yujie felt pain from hearing that.","“I am not leaving, slow down,” said Dong Yujie, feeling sorry.","Even if she promised, Jiang Huaizhou could not be relieved without seeing her with his own eyes and holding her with his hand.","The front desk receptionist behind was starting to be worried.","She thought back if she had been rude to Dong Yujie.","Even if she did not let Dong Yujie enter the office, she was just being professional and did not do anything wrong.","Besides, she did not know the relationship between Dong Yujie and her boss.","Could it be that she was really the boss’ younger sister?","However, she really hadn’t heard her boss mention it before.","Furthermore, the boss even told the public that he was the only son, then where did his younger sister come from?","Although Qu Mengyu was a little arrogant, she was not wrong about the boss having no younger sister.","In the blink of an eye, Dong Yujie heard running steps from the corridor.","From the sound, it could be heard how anxious the person was.","She knew who it was without even thinking about it.","As expected, Jiang Huaizhou appeared at the entrance of the office.","Jiang Huaizhou needed to rest for a while after taking a sharp turn.","Seeing that Dong Yujie was really standing there, Jiang Huaizhou stopped immediately.","That was really Dong Yujie standing there.","But now, it seemed like a hallucination.","Jiang Huaizhou took a deep breath and walked toward Dong Yujie.","He stared at Dong Yujie without blinking even once.","He was afraid that if he blinked or did not stare at her, Dong Yujie would escape.","Jiang Huaizhou quickly ran to Dong Yujie, and after confirming that she wasn’t leaving, he was slightly relieved.","However, he did not dare to be relaxed.","He directly grabbed Dong Yujie’s wrist, that way, Dong Yujie could not escape even if she wanted to.","Seeing Jiang Huaizhou, it was like he wished he could be handcuffed with her together.","Only Dong Yujie was in Jiang Huaizhou’s eyes, so naturally, he could not see Qu Mengyu.","Even if he felt like Qu Mengyu was in his way.","As he rushed over, he mercilessly pushed Qu Mengyu to the side.","...","He didn’t even spare Qu Mengyu a glance.","He focused his gaze all on Dong Yujie.","After Qu Mengyu was pushed away mercilessly by Jiang Huaizhou, she was immediately thrown to the side.","Qu Mengyu staggered because she was wearing high heels.","She almost fell down.","Panicking, she extended her arm and luckily, she managed to hold on to the door frame to stabilize herself.","Even then, Jiang Huaizhou still did not look at her.","It was as though she did not exist.","“Come with me.” Jiang Huaizhou held Dong Yujie’s wrist and was going to bring her back to the office.","Dong Yujie did not resist and was about to follow Jiang Huaizhou.","“Stop it!” called Qu Mengyu furiously, “Jiang Huaizhou!”","...","Qu Mengyu had finally recovered her balance.","She marched toward Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie.","Then, she extended her arms to stop them from going away.","Jiang Huaizhou wanted to ignore her, but now, he had no choice but to stop.","“Miss Qu, what do you want? You even talked nonsense in front of Yujie, saying you’re my girlfriend,” said Jiang Huaizhou with a cold expression.","“What is the relationship between you two?” Qu Mengyu did not answer Jiang Huaizhou.","Suddenly, she remembered what Dong Yujie said just now and said, “She said that she’s your younger sister.”","Qu Mengyu regained her hope. “So you guys are siblings?”","Without waiting for Jiang Huaizhou to say anything, Qu Mengyu said, “I’m sorry, I misunderstood.”","“It’s because Huaizhou said that he’s the only son, so I didn’t believe you when you said that you’re his younger sister.” Qu Mengyu smiled softly. “Actually, I just realized that I misunderstood. Are you from his father’s side or mother’s side?”","Dong Yujie raised her eyebrows and turned to look at Jiang Huaizhou. She gave a half smile and raised her eyebrows, saying, “Huaizhou?”","Clearly, Dong Yujie was teasing him.","She was teasing him about how Qu Mengyu addressed Jiang Huaizhou just now.","However, Jiang Huaizhou’s heart still softened from what Dong Yujie said.","Hearing Dong Yujie call him that way, even if it was sarcastic, Jiang Huaizhou still found that it sounded beautiful.","He did not care why Dong Yujie called him that way.","As long as she called her that...","Just about anyone could say such words, but it was different when Dong Yujie said them.","The more Qu Mengyu looked at the interaction between the two, the more she found it strange.","She was hoping. Did Dong Yujie not say that she was Jiang Huaizhou’s younger sister?","Even if she was not, could she be his cousin?","She could only put her hope in that.","Qu Mengyu looked at Jiang Huaizhou, full of hope.","But she saw Jiang Huaizhou smile.","At first, he was holding Yujie’s wrist, but now, he went to hold her hand.","Qu Mengyu’s expression changed.","Would siblings do this?","It was fine if they were still young, but they were already adults, this would be crossing the line if they were siblings."]},{"number":3569,"title":"Chapter 3569 Untitled","paragraphs":["3569 Untitled","At this moment, Jiang Huaizhou said, “You didn’t misunderstand, she’s not my younger sister.”","“However, you also misunderstood. She’s not my cousin. We just call each other brother and sister.”","“She’s my girlfriend,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","Dong Yujie tried to pull her arm out, but she could not move it away.","!!","Jiang Huaizhou held it tightly.","Dong Yujie wanted to say that she hadn’t agreed to it yet.","How did she become his girlfriend the moment she returned?","Qu Mengyu’s expression became terrible. She was still unwilling to accept it.","“But you clearly didn’t have a girlfriend!” said Qu Mengyu.","“I said that I have a girlfriend, but you didn’t believe me,” said Jiang Huaizhou immediately after seeing that Dong Yujie’s expression was not right, and she was looking at him sarcastically.","She was scared that Dong Yujie would not believe it, so he didn’t really care about what he would tell Qu Mengyu now just so he could convince Dong Yujie.","He turned around and told Dong Yujie, “Really, I kept saying that I have a girlfriend, but you’re not in B City. Still, you’re my girlfriend.”","It was doubtful if Dong Yujie believed it.","Jiang Huaizhou told Qu Mengyu impatiently, “I told you since the beginning that I have a girlfriend, and she would come back after a year.”","“No, you just said that out of politeness.” It was the reason why Qu Mengyu didn’t believe it at first.","She kept thinking that Jiang Huaizhou had just made up an excuse because he didn’t want to be in a relationship with anyone right now.","After all, he said that he had a girlfriend, but his girlfriend was not around.","It did not make sense.","As such, Qu Mengyu believed that Jiang Huaizhou simply made an excuse to say that his girlfriend was out of town.","That way, he would avoid the pursuit of others.","Qu Mengyu had always felt that way.","Even if it were otherwise, she still wanted to pursue Jiang Huaizhou.","Qu Mengyu’s family company was Jiang Huaizhou’s client.","Her father thought that Jiang Huaizhou was good and was successful at a young age.","Although he did not have a strong background, Jiang Huaizhou was very capable.","Now, although his company was not big, he started with nothing, and he managed to obtain such results after just a short period of time.","So Mr. Qu wanted to introduce Jiang Huaizhou to Qu Mengyu.","The Qu Family was obviously stronger than Jiang Huaizhou’s family.","If he got together with Qu Mengyu, the Qu Family would also be of big help to Jiang Huaizhou.","It was something that was very beneficial to Jiang Huaizhou.","Because of this, Mr. Qu used the excuse of having a meal together to invite Qu Mengyu, too.","He wanted to let Qu Mengyu have a look.","Jiang Huaizhou was handsome and successful at a young age.","His family background was not as good as the Qu Family.","Still, there were many areas in which he could use the help of the Qu Family.","In the future, if he encountered anything, it would be easier to manage.","It was such a coincidence that Qu Mengyu really liked Jiang Huaizhou.","Jiang Huaizhou was different from the other businessmen and sons of the rich.","Businessmen were mostly money-grubbers.","And the sons of the rich were arrogant and contemptuous, but they were different from Jiang Huaizhou.","Jiang Huaizhou had a scholarly spirit that they did not have.","If she did not know that he was a businessman, she would think that he was a scholar working in something related to culture, just through his first impression.","He did not stink of money, and he wasn’t arrogant as well.","So Qu Mengyu’s impression of Jiang Huaizhou was excellent.","She liked him the moment she saw him.","But who could have known that Jiang Huaizhou would say that he had a girlfriend?","However, Qu Mengyu did not believe it at all.","She attended a few meals for business and even came to Jiang Huaizhou’s office before.","After investigating and interacting a few times, she never saw Jiang Huaizhou’s girlfriend.","As she was the client’s daughter, Jiang Huaizhou could only distance himself from her but could not be impolite to her.","However, Jiang Huaizhou also prepared himself.","If Qu Mengyu really continued to pester him, even if it would cause this business deal, he would still get angry at her.","As a girl, she still had to respect herself, right?","He had clearly shown that he had a girlfriend. Even if he did not have one, he still did not really like her.","...","Why was Qu Mengyu still pestering him?","She was even disturbing his work.","Even the female employees in his company felt that he would end up with Qu Mengyu one day.","Qu Mengyu felt that Jiang Huaizhou was lying to her, so she opened up and asked Jiang Huaizhou.","If you had a girlfriend, then where was she?","Back then, Jiang Huaizhou told her that it was because his girlfriend was working out of town and would only come back after a year.","However, Qu Mengyu did not believe it, thinking that Jiang Huaizhou was just delaying things.","The girlfriend that was out of town and would come back after a year was all a lie.","Jiang Huaizhou said impatiently, “Previously, you thought that I was being half-hearted, but now that my girlfriend is right here, you can see that I’m not lying, right?”","“Miss Qu, I have a girlfriend, please do not come to me anymore. It’s purely business between your father and me, and you have nothing to do with my business. You will just disturb the employees and me if you still come to my office.”","“Besides, you even made my girlfriend misunderstand. My girlfriend misunderstood because of your nonsense just now,” said Jiang Huaizhou unhappily.","...","Dong Yujie looked at Jiang Huaizhou and decided to cooperate with him.","She said to Qu Mengyu, “Miss Qu, right? Listening to your tone, your family background must be good.”","Dong Yujie sized her up. “Rich second-generation heir, right?”","Qu Mengyu pursed her lips and also sized Dong Yujie up.","Dong Yujie was wearing ordinary clothes, which were all bought from Moubao.","Anyway, she did not chase after all these.","But Qu Mengyu said clearly, “You don’t need to tell me, you’re just an ordinary person.”","Dong Yujie was not angry after hearing that, and she said calmly, “Miss Qu, with your conditions, you don’t have to try so hard, right? With your social circle, it shouldn’t be hard to meet outstanding men. Why can’t you let go of someone else’s boyfriend?”","Dong Yujie pouted mockingly. “Other people’s food always smells better?”","Dong Yujie said it calmly, her tone was not considered polite, but it was not that rude either.","Then, Dong Yujie suddenly changed her tone, “Then why don’t you beg for food? Since the food of others smells better, won’t the leftovers of others smell even better?”","The front desk receptionist was speechless. “...”","The boss’ girlfriend was so good at talking!","Those words pissed Qu Mengyu off.","Even Jiang Huaizhou was shocked.","However, he felt happy immediately, thinking that Dong Yujie was sassy.","Excellent.","At least he would not be at loss.","And did she not say that because of him?","He was the food in her bowl!","Jiang Huaizhou was happy.","It was good to be protected by Dong Yujie.","However, Qu Mengyu was furious.","“How dare you scold others?!” said Qu Mengyu angrily.","“You dared to snatch my boyfriend, if I don’t scold you now, should I wait until next year?” Dong Yujie sneered. “You’re so funny.”","“Should I give my boyfriend away just because you like him?”"]},{"number":3570,"title":"Chapter 3570 Untitled","paragraphs":["3570 Untitled","“How shameless are you?” Dong Yujie sneered. “Besides, what’s your relationship with me that I have to yield to you? I have to give up my boyfriend to you just because you like my boyfriend?”","“Besides, even without me, you know he has to like you as well, right? And why do we have to indulge you?”","“Your family is not at that level yet, right? You’re acting bigger than even the eight great families,” said Dong Yujie, “Among so many families, I haven’t heard of one that has the surname of Qu. Your family’s company is not big, right? Otherwise, I would have heard of it.”","Qu Mengyu was enraged.","!!","Dong Yujie looked poor, but she still talked about the eight great families with her.","Her family’s company was just ordinary, or else they would not do business with Jiang Huaizhou.","However, they were still stronger than Jiang Huaizhou, not to mention Dong Yujie!","“You talk big!” Qu Mengyu sneered. “The eight great families? Have you seen them before? You talk about the eight great families the moment you open your mouth. You know them, but they don’t know you, so don’t use the eight great families for comparison.”","She had not seen the world yet, and she dared to talk about the eight great families the moment she opened her mouth.","Did Dong Yujie know how big of a force the eight great families represent?","She dared to bring up the eight great families.","Dong Yujie did not want to argue with her. She didn’t plan to bring Lu Man up to borrow her prestige.","“I just know that you’re not at the level where you lack men, right? If you really love yourself, then you shouldn’t keep holding onto someone else’s boyfriend,” said Dong Yujie coldly.","Qu Mengyu stopped talking to Dong Yujie but looked at Jiang Huaizhou.","When facing Dong Yujie, her expression was angry, but when she turned to Jiang Huaizhou, she looked wronged and aggrieved.","“Huaizhou...”","Dong Yujie humphed.","Jiang Huaizhou felt a shiver down his spine when he heard Dong Yujie’s snort. He immediately told Qu Mengyu, “Miss Qu, we’re not close, don’t call me that way.”","Jiang Huaizhou explained, “You have never called me that before, and now that my girlfriend is here, you’re making my girlfriend misunderstand by calling me that. I don’t like that.”","Qu Mengyu didn’t answer him but said, “She’s being so harsh, don’t you care at all? You think it’s fine?”","“With your skills, you will definitely grow your business and attend all kinds of occasions, which will expand your network more and more. To do that, you will need a partner to bring along.”","“When that time comes, you’re going to bring her? She’s such a rude and arrogant person. I’m sure you’ll lose a lot of deals if you bring her along with you.”","“She’s from an ordinary family and hasn’t seen the world. Can you really bring her out with you?”","“Jiang Huaizhou, you’re smart, I am sure you understand my dad’s intentions. Your company is small, but if you marry me, my family will be of huge help.”","Dong Yujie rolled her eyes.","Nowadays, people with a bit of money were really daring enough to say such words.","Jiang Huaizhou turned to Dong Yujie, saying, “Don’t even say that you’re going to let me go, even if you do, I still won’t be with her.”","As he said this, he squeezed her hand.","Then he smiled coldly at Qu Mengyu, “I think you’ve mistaken something.”","“The money used to start my business was given to me by Yujie. Without her, I wouldn’t even be able to start this company. I still owe Yujie a huge sum of money. To be frank, I’m a freeloader here.”","Dong Yujie was dumbfounded. Jiang Huaizhou even said that he was a freeloader.","But in reality, in this one year, the money that Jiang Huaizhou transferred to her had already exceeded the amount that she had given Jiang Huaizhou back then.","“Besides, Yujie will never embarrass me. She knows her boundaries, and she says and does everything right. She will never be wrong,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","The front desk receptionist tried her best to hide.","Under the front desk, only her eyes popped up, watching her boss’ love-hate relationship.","“You...” Qu Mengyu looked at Jiang Huaizhou in shock with a gaze that said that he could not distinguish between right and wrong.","“Besides, what Yujie said about you was right.” Jiang Huaizhou smiled faintly.","“I am the food in her bowl, why do you keep staring at me,” said Jiang Huaizhou, smiling.","“You!” Qu Mengyu was furious. “How dare you insult me like that! She said such terrible things about me, not only did you not reprimand her, you even encouraged her!”","Qu Mengyu was even more furious.","Under her increasing anger, she still didn’t dare to let Jiang Huaizhou go.","Instead, she became even more competitive and wanted to snatch Jiang Huaizhou even more.","Jiang Huaizhou was so protective of Dong Yujie, making Dong Yujie so happy.","If she snatched Jiang Huaizhou away and Jiang Huaizhou dumped her, Dong Yujie would be in pain.","“Because she’s right. I’m not protecting her, I’m just supporting and agreeing with her opinion,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “Plus, she’s my girlfriend, if I don’t support her, should I support you?”","The front desk receptionist thought that it seemed like the boss and Dong Yujie were such a match.","Even the tones they used to insult others were similar!","“Jiang Huaizhou, you better answer after thinking carefully,” said Qu Mengyu, “Your deal with our family hasn’t been set yet. The contract hasn’t been signed.”","“If you’re so impolite to me, my family won’t allow you guys to insult me like that! If you still want this business deal, make her apologize to me,” said Qu Mengyu, “Otherwise, don’t even think of getting our family’s business deal!”","Dong Yujie raised her head to look at Jiang Huaizhou.","“Then, I’ll let that go,” said Jiang Huaizhou without hesitating, “Miss Qu, to be honest, I have had enough of you. I had always been tolerating you because of your father and the deal I have with your family.”","“You had always been annoying me, and I’m really irritated,” said Jiang Huaizhou without holding back, “Honestly, before Yujie came back, I had actually made a decision.”","“If you keep annoying me, then I will rather not do business with your family. I had always been planning on drawing the line between us. I won’t give you another chance to annoy me.”","“Now that my girlfriend is back, you’re still pestering me, even if she knows that I have no feelings for you, this is not good for our relationship. So in front of her, I am making it clear to you.”","...","“I won’t give you the chance to destroy our relationship. I am making it clear today that the business between our two companies is done. I would rather not make money and have this deal than make my girlfriend misunderstand. I am not willing to tolerate you anymore.”","To be frank, he was so irritated that he did not even want the money anymore.","Qu Mengyu was that annoying."]},{"number":3571,"title":"Chapter 3571 Untitled","paragraphs":["3571 Untitled","Qu Mengyu’s looked horrible.","She was mortified, but she was willing to admit defeat as well.","However, many negative emotions were surging in her.","If it were just her and Jiang Huaizhou present, it would have been fine.","!!","But Dong Yujie was watching, which mortified her.","Dong Yujie was still Jiang Huaizhou’s official girlfriend.","Qu Mengyu then realized that the receptionist was also watching her. At that, Qu Mengyu was even more mortified.","She started regretting being impulsive.","She should have gone to Jiang Huaizhou’s office before confronting them. That way, no one would have seen her embarrass herself.","But now, even the lowly receptionist witnessed how she embarrassed herself.","Unfortunately, it had already happened, and time couldn’t be turned back.","Qu Mengyu, trying to save face, warned Jiang Huaizhou with a stern expression. “Jiang Huaizhou, I hope you won’t regret doing this.”","“You should be aware that your company is a new company. If there’s any possibility of bringing in business for your company, you should fight for it. Even if there is only a small chance, you should never let that chance slip away.” Qu Mengyu knew it well.","The foundation of Jiang Huaizhou’s company was still weak. It hadn’t been long since the company was founded.","The company was like a newborn baby that could die at any time.","Therefore, Jiang Huaizhou had to seize every opportunity.","She knew it well because her father was a client whom Jiang Huaizhou was currently trying to win over.","“Our family should have been your most stable business partner,” Qu Mengyu said, “We could have collaborated. Your company would have made stable profits for the next two years. You wouldn’t have to tire yourself out for a small opportunity.”","“You have worked so hard for a very long time for nothing. All your effort has gone to waste,” Qu Mengyu said.","She looked at Dong Yujie and said, “Do you know that if he loses the chance to collaborate with my family, all of his efforts in the past year will have been for nothing? No one will know the future of the company by then.”","“He has to work with my family, or his company’s prosperity will be akin to a bubble that can burst easily with just a poke, and he would be left with nothing,” Qu Mengyu said to Dong Yujie.","“Aren’t you feeling guilty? You’re the reason why he will suffer,” Qu Mengyu said, “If his business fails and he is left with nothing, will you still like him? Are you sure he won’t hate you?”","Jiang Huaizhou was really annoyed. “This is between us. You shouldn’t be talking nonsense if you don’t know anything.","“These possibilities you have mentioned will not happen.” Jiang Huaizhou said in an annoyed tone, “I don’t want to work with your family. Your family can offer their money to whoever wants it.”","“Even if Mr. Qu wants to work with me, I will not do it,” Jiang Huaizhou said, “It’s difficult to get rid of you, so I won’t work with Mr. Qu because you will have more reason to annoy me if we do so.”","“I’m sorry. I can’t do anything to you, but I can hide from you,” Jiang Huaizhou said, “Stop talking about my company. Even if my company goes bankrupt and the business fails, as long as I can get rid of you, I would be happy.”","“It has been such a long time. I have had enough of you annoying me.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “I’m begging you. Please let me go.”","The receptionist covered her mouth as she couldn’t help but snicker.","Jiang Huaizhou sounded pitiful and helpless.","What did Qu Mengyu do to make Jiang Huaizhou react in this way?","To make Jiang Huaizhou beg her to let him go.","He couldn’t deal with her, but did that mean he couldn’t hide from her?","Qu Mengyu felt really embarrassed.","She said grudgingly to Jiang Huaizhou. “Okay. Jiang Huaizhou. You said it yourself. Don’t regret it! You better not come looking for me later on!”","Jiang Huaizhou didn’t reply. He just rolled his eyes.","Then, he dragged Dong Yujie and left.","Qu Mengyu took multiple deep breaths. Still, she couldn’t calm herself down.","She gnashed her teeth. Her expression hardened.","She walked out with a stony expression on her face and caught sight of the receptionist peeking out from under her desk. She immediately snapped, “What are you looking at!”","With that, Qu Mengyu left.","Jiang Huaizhou walked out with Dong Yujie. He held her hand and made sure that all the employees of the company had seen them.","He led Dong Yujie into the office. Then, he closed the door and the blinds.","The employees in the office all looked into Jiang Huaizhou’s office curiously.","“What happened? Who is that girl?”","“I thought Qu Mengyu would win Jiang Huaizhou over.”","“That’s what I thought. I thought that our boss would eventually be trapped by Qu Mengyu and admit defeat.”","Qu Mengyu’s high-profile pursuit of Jiang Huaizhou was actually a carefully calculated move.","She wanted other people to know that she had her eyes on Jiang Huaizhou and that she was courting Jiang Huaizhou.","As for those who had other thoughts toward Jiang Huaizhou, she wanted them to give up.","Qu Mengyu wasn’t scared of competition.","After all, Jiang Huaizhou’s family background was a major flaw.","As for the wealthy second-generation heiresses she knew, they could play around with Jiang Huaizhou, but they would never see him as a marriage partner.","Therefore, Qu Mengyu felt that only ordinary girls could become her rival.","In the eyes of ordinary girls, Jiang Huaizhou would definitely be very attractive.","...","He was young and established. He had a successful business as well.","He was the CEO of a company. To those ordinary girls, Jiang Huaizhou would be rich enough.","Those ordinary girls were the people whom Qu Mengyu had to be wary against.","By pursuing Jiang Huaizhou so publicly, Qu Mengyu wanted to show those girls that they had no chance against her.","As such, they would give up.","Qu Mengyu’s move was not entirely ineffective.","In Jiang Huaizhou’s company, there were girls who harbored such thoughts toward Jiang Huaizhou,","Most of the employees in Jiang Huaizhou’s new company were young.","It was especially difficult for young female employees not to be charmed when facing such a young, charming, capable, and charismatic boss.","However, when they found out that Qu Mengyu was pursuing Jiang Huaizhou, they all gave up.","Everything went according to Qu Mengyu’s plan.","...","All those girls thought they were no match against Qu Mengyu.","Qu Mengyu was a privileged individual.","She was pretty. Her family was rich. She was the second generation of a rich family, and her family was doing business with Jiang Huaizhou.","They were well aware that the depth of romance could not be measured with a person’s status.","However, one had to face reality.","Most people would marry others of the same status as them.","If it weren’t for many people nitpicking the marriage of others, there would have been many cinderellas successfully marrying into wealthy families.","However, the reality was that the exception wasn’t the rule.","Take a few famous couples as examples...","Shi Xiaoya’s family was not simple.","Lu Man initially seemed like a cinderella. However, she was very capable, and her step-father was Wang Juhuai.","Unfortunately, they couldn’t even begin to compare with Lu Man. They had nothing to stand out from the crowd."]},{"number":3572,"title":"Chapter 3572 Untitled","paragraphs":["3572 Untitled","Not to mention Yan Zhiqing and Wei Wucai. They were the unification of two powerful families.","As for Xie Jiling and Han Zhuofeng, Xie Jiling was known to be from a family who always kept a low profile. Still, her family was as powerful as the eight great families.","Everyone discovered those things from gossip news.","These news reports were written without the intention of emphasizing anyone’s status.","!!","However, everyone read the report from a different point of view.","It seemed that based on the information they had gathered, the couple was like a match made in heaven.","Therefore, when they saw Qu Mengyu pursuing Jiang Huaizhou, they all gave up.","They thought there was no hope for them.","However, even though they had given up, it didn’t mean that they stopped paying attention to the progress of Qu Mengyu and Jiang Huaizhou’s relationship.","They watched as Qu Mengyu pursued Jiang Huaizhou for so long, yet she still ended up failing.","Everyone felt great respect for Qu Mengyu’s persistence.","All employees, including female employees, had given up any hope of pursuing Jiang Huaizhou.","Everyone simply held the attitude of gossiping, hoping to see when Jiang Huaizhou would be taken down.","If Jiang Huaizhou was determined not to accept Qu Mengyu, how much longer could Qu Mengyu keep this up?","Would Qu Mengyu give up? When would she give up?","There were so many questions. As a result, everyone felt even happier and more enthusiastic to continue gossiping.","But before Qu Mengyu succeeded, another girl appeared today.","They had never seen Jiang Huaizhou so nervous.","Jiang Huaizhou stormed out of the office earlier, stumbling along the way.","Everyone thought this was weird.","What on earth happened that Jiang Huaizhou was in such a hurry?","He didn’t even care about his image anymore.","He was running around clumsily in the company.","When Jiang Huaizhou ran out of his office, the employees present thought that something bad had happened to the company.","Otherwise, what could have caused Jiang Huaizhou to be so flustered and worried?","After a while, Jiang Huaizhou was seen coming back with a girl.","Jiang Huaizhou had always been very respectful of the boundaries between different genders.","He would never hold another girl’s hand.","But at this moment, Jiang Huaizhou was in the office with Dong Yujie.","Everyone started discussing in the WeChat group chat. “What’s the situation between our boss and that girl? Is she his girlfriend?”","“I heard him say that he has a girlfriend. However, his girlfriend had never appeared, so everyone thought that the boss was just lying to Qu Mengyu, using that as an excuse to avoid her pursuit.”","“I didn’t expect there to actually be one?”","“Hey! You guys are just guessing. Don’t be stupid. Just ask Xiaolin,” Someone said.","Xiaolin was the female receptionist earlier.","She definitely had first-hand information. “The boss just rushed out, right? Xiaolin might know what he did.”","But after a long time, they still couldn’t see Xiaolin in the chat.","They guessed that Xiaolin wasn’t reading the chat.","And so, they started tagging Xiaolin.","Xiaolin couldn’t bother to read the group messages.","To prevent too many notification sounds from the many messages from the group chat, Xiaolin would usually mute the group chat.","Now, her phone was incessantly ringing. Xiaolin had nothing to do, so she clicked into the group chat.","She then saw everyone asking questions. Xiaolin then told her coworkers every detail of what she had seen earlier.","“Damn! Our boss actually has a girlfriend. He wasn’t lying!”","“Qu Mengyu has been bothering our boss for such a long time. In the end, she still lost. Tsk. Tsk. Poor girl.”","“Our boss’s girlfriend has been gone for a whole year. Now that she’s back, she won’t leave anymore, right?”","Xiaolin replied, “I don’t know. But based on the interaction between our boss and his girlfriend, I don’t think she is leaving anymore.”","“No wonder our CEO ran out in such a hurry. His girlfriend finally came back. Our boss has been enduring for a whole year. At the same time, he had to have been greatly disturbed by Qu Mengyu’s pursuit. Poor guy.”","“Hahahaha. Why do I feel so happy? Regardless of who our CEO’s girlfriend is, as long as Qu Mengyu fails, it’s a good thing.”","“Yeah, I’ve also been tired of her for a long time. Always acting like a big shot. The boss clearly thinks she is annoying. But she still comes here every day to disturb us, treating us like her employees.”","“Yes. She was acting as if the company belonged to her and that she was the wife of the CEO when the reality was that she had yet to successfully court our CEO.”","Of course, these complaints were not just from female employees.","Even the male employees held grudges against Qu Mengyu.","It was obvious how annoying Qu Mengyu was.","Xiaolin replied, “Don’t worry. Our CEO and his wife just roasted Qu Mengyu. Our CEO’s wife is so eloquent. It’s such a pity I didn’t get to record earlier. Otherwise, you all would have gotten the chance to hear the fierceness of our CEO’s wife.”","...","“She wasn’t acting like a woman scolding loudly on the street. She was speaking at a normal volume, but every example she gave was enraging as hell. Qu Mengyu’s expression looked so horrible earlier.”","Whenever Qu Mengyu didn’t manage to win Jiang Huaizhou’s attention, Qu Mengyu would unleash her anger on Xiaolin.","Xiaolin could still remember those times.","“Even if Qu Mengyu refuses to give up and continues to bother our CEO, she will suffer as long as our CEO’s wife remains present. Qu Mengyu looks down on the boss’s wife and thinks that she is a knock-off with no skills. But I disagree. I think our CEO’s wife is definitely a capable person.”","“You are already calling her the CEO’s wife?” A coworker asked.","“Did you not see how fast our boss rushed out of his office? Isn’t that enough proof?” Xiaolin answered.","Everyone thought about it and agreed.","“Plus, our CEO said that he would rather give up on doing business with the Qu Family if it can get Qu Mengyu to stop bothering him,” Xiaolin said.","“Our CEO actually said that?”","“Of course.” Xiaolin answered, “And the boss said himself that his wife was the one who provided the initial funding for his business.”","“No wonder our boss is so loyal to his wife.”","...","“Our boss is someone of good character. If he were a shitty guy, he wouldn’t care about the person who had given him the start-up capital. He would change his mind and heart for the sake of money and prospect. He would ditch his first wife if necessary. Such things happen often, don’t they?”","“It’s not uncommon for scholars from ancient times to marry a daughter from an official family. There are plenty of cases in books. It happened even recently. Take Lu Qiyuan as an example. Isn’t it the same case for him?”","“Xia Qingwei accompanied him to establish the business with him when things were most difficult. But when he became rich, he ditched Xia Qingwei. He could have married anyone. But he married Xia Qingwei’s little sister. Think about how shitty of a guy he is.”"]},{"number":3573,"title":"Chapter 3573 Untitled","paragraphs":["3573 Untitled","“Yeah, Xia Qingwei was lucky to meet Wang Juhuai, or else she would be miserable.”","“Yeah, that means that our boss is still very dependable.”","No matter what these employees said.","In the office, Jiang Huaizhou did not want to let go of Dong Yujie’s hand. Worried, he asked, “Yujie, now that you’re back, you don’t have to leave, right?”","!!","“I’m not leaving,” said Dong Yujie, “I just found out that Dad and Mom divorced when I came back.”","Jiang Huaizhou said anxiously, “When Mom brought this up to me, I didn’t oppose it, I even supported it.”","“It’s selfish of me to make Dad and Mom go through such misfortune when they’re already at this age, but I want to be selfish this time,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “Because I know that if I do this, things will get better for both of us.”","How could she blame him?","Dong Yujie was grateful to her parents in her heart.","Grateful for their help.","How could she blame Jiang Huaizhou?","After saying this, Dong Yujie was going to get even with him.","“Why did you say that you’re an only son, you didn’t even mention me.” said Dong Yujie, “Did you forget about your younger sister?”","“You’re not my younger sister,” Jiang Huaizhou smiled after saying this.","“Although everyone knows that I’m an only son, I still mentioned you,” Jiang Huaizhou smiled and said.","Seeing that Dong Yujie looked over, Jiang Huaizhou smiled and explained, “I told the others that I have a girlfriend but she’s out of town and would return after a year.”","Dong Yujie also realized that Jiang Huaizhou told Qu Mengyu the same thing just now.","“You....” Dong Yujie tried to pull her hand away but failed.","It seemed like Jiang Huaizhou would not let go without getting a definite answer from her.","Dong Yujie took a deep breath. Her face was starting to get pale. “You know about my past, right?”","Jiang Huaizhou tightened his grip and said, “I know.”","He didn’t say what it was because he was afraid that Dong Yujie would not be comfortable.","The reason she went away for a year was to throw her past away completely.","Jiang Huaizhou was afraid that if he brought it up, it would hurt Dong Yujie, causing her to hide away again.","“But I have never minded,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “That’s just a short period of your past. If it was someone else who was in different situations from you, who hasn’t had a few relationships before?”","“Others don’t even mind their girlfriends’ past relationships, then why should I mind yours?” said Jiang Huaizhou.","Furthermore, who did Dong Yujie do all that for?","It was all because of him!","If he disliked her because of this, then what was he?","But he did not dare to say that.","He was afraid that if he said it, Dong Yujie would misunderstand and think that he did it as he owed her a favor.","Jiang Huaizhou thought about it carefully.","But if he did not say, it did not mean that Dong Yujie would not ask.","Dong Yujie was suspicious. “To be honest, do you not even feel a little bit guilty because of what I did for you, so you persist and want to be together with me.”","“You say that you like me but in reality, it’s because of guilt and gratitude, that’s why you want to take care of me. You’re scared that I won’t accept you if that’s the case, that’s why you’re telling me that you like me,” Dong Yujie fidgeted as she looked at Jiang Huaizhou.","She liked Jiang Huaizhou, and she was sure that Jiang Huaizhou liked her.","However, she was afraid that there was a thorn in their feelings.","At first, the thorn in their feelings was not obvious, and they could tolerate that slight pain.","But after a long time, it would hurt more and would be unbearable.","It would be a matter of time before conflicts arose.","And she was afraid of this.","Jiang Huaizhou liked her but at the same time, he felt guilt and gratitude.","This kind of feeling contained too many uncertain factors.","Jiang Huaizhou put on a serious expression and said, “I won’t make an irresponsible decision like this just because of guilt and gratitude.”","“Yujie, I like you. I’ve liked you since we were young. I just couldn’t say it back then, and could only bury my feelings deep in my heart. I couldn’t ruin you. Besides, you were still young back then.”","“When I was still in school, I liked you. I was conflicted, knowing that I couldn’t like you back then. So, even if someone pursued you, I had no right to stop him. However, I still didn’t like others pursuing you.”","“I still couldn’t control myself. When I found out there were boys who had feelings for you, I would stop them. Even after graduating, my friend liked you, and I was furious.”","“I could only keep these thoughts in my heart. I didn’t dare to tell you, and I became even more certain that I shouldn’t tell you after I got into trouble. After all, how could I let you be with someone who has a criminal record?”","“But unexpectedly, you’re still so dumb and save me no matter what the consequences are.” Jiang Huaizhou’s eyes turned red. “You said that I feel guilty and grateful to you. I admit that.”","“However, that emotions are different from what I’m feeling for you. I am sure that I like you not because of gratitude or guilt. I am sure that I will not regret this decision in the future, saying that I mistook my guilt and gratitude as my feelings for you.”","“If I just feel grateful and guilty towards you, I can still take care of you as an older brother. Even if I take care of you for your whole life as your older brother, that won’t be a problem, right?” said Jiang Huaizhou.","“I understand my own feelings. I know it so well that if I have even a little bit of uncertainty or hesitation in my feelings for you, I will choose not to tell you that I like you and hurt you.”","“Let’s not talk about other things. You’re my savior. If I said I like you to return the favor, it’s not returning the favor, it’s returning your kindness with unkindness. There are many ways to return a favor. If I am uncertain about my own feelings, then I can take care of you as my younger sister. One day, I will surely know whether my feelings for you are enough to make me ignore those things completely.”","“If you’re still suspicious about my feelings, I’m telling you that I will just like you. Won’t I be just playing with your heart if I tell you that I like you when I’m not sure about my feelings and hurt you?”","...","“If I dare to tell you, that’s because I’m sure that I like you. I know that I won’t mind your past at all.”","“Yujie, if you like me, can you give me a chance and accept me?” said Jiang Huaizhou earnestly.","Dong Yujie thought that what Jiang Huaizhou said was reasonable.","If it was purely out of gratitude and guilt, he could still take her as his younger sister, even if it was for a lifetime.","He did not need to say that he liked her.","He would also not risk confessing to her if he was unsure of his feelings for her"]},{"number":3574,"title":"Chapter 3574 Untitled","paragraphs":["3574 Untitled","“Yujie, even Mom believed and accepted me. Is your trust in me less than that of Mom’s?” Jiang Huaizhou asked her.","“I believe you,” said Dong Yujie finally, “If you don’t really mind...”","“I don’t mind!” said Jiang Huaizhou eagerly without waiting for Dong Yujie to finish.","He finally let go of Dong Yujie’s hands, but he placed his hands on her shoulders.","He could not stop smiling as he stared at Dong Yujie.","Dong Yujie was not used to the sudden change in their relationship. Right now, she was going crazy just by his gaze.","Suddenly, she was pulled into his arms.","“You won’t regret this,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “I won’t let you regret this.”","“With this, my promise will come true, true to my words,” said Jiang Huaizhou quickly, “I will never let you regret your decision today.”","“Okay,” Dong Yujie finally said, “I believe in you.”","“Really?” Jiang Huaizhou lowered his head and looked at Dong Yujie. “Are you really agreeing to be my girlfriend?”","Jiang Huaizhou still felt uncertainty in his heart. “Are you sure you’re not saying this because you find me annoying?”","After Jiang Huaizhou voiced his doubts, he was even more uncertain now.","He suddenly looked at Dong Yujie in doubt. “You’re not just doing this half-heartedly and will leave after walking out of the office, right?”","Jiang Huaizhou was very insecure now.","Dong Yujie was speechless.","“You dealt with Qu Mengyu in such a casual way and you think I’ll be the same?” Dong Yujie said angrily.","Jiang Huaizhou said immediately, “Our conversation is going so well, why are you bringing up Qu Mengyu? It ruins the mood. She has nothing to do with us.”","Jiang Huaizhou became terrified. What if Dong Yujie punished him because of Qu Mengyu?","“Then why are you still doubting me? Didn’t you ask me to believe you? Now that I believe you, you’re doubting me,” said Dong Yujie.","“I... I am just scared that you’ll leave,” said Jiang Huaizhou weakly.","Jiang Huaizhou was really afraid.","After all, he was someone with a criminal record.","Dong Yujie said angrily, “If I really want to leave, can you even stop me?”","Jiang Huaizhou was speechless.","He really did not have the courage to stop her.","“And, why do you think I’ll deal with you in such a troublesome way? I can leave straight away if I want to, I don’t need to beat around the bush,” said Dong Yujie.","“...” Jiang Huaizhou pondered and said dryly, “That makes sense.”","The authority was all in Dong Yujie’s hands.","Dong Yujie could not help but laugh.","It was her first smile after arriving here.","Jiang Huaizhou was relieved after seeing her smile.","Then he started smiling as well.","“Yujie, you’re my girlfriend now, right?” asked Jiang Huaizhou.","Dong Yujie nodded and said, “This is the last time. You can’t do this anymore.”","“Do what?” Jiang Huaizhou raised his eyebrows in confusion.","“Like... acting pitiful, as if I’m bullying you,” said Dong Yujie.","Before, Jiang Huaizhou still had the dignity of an older brother.","But now, although he still had that same dignity, as soon as Dong Yujie opened her mouth, Jiang Huaizhou would always prioritize fulfilling her requests.","As soon as Dong Yujie said something, Jiang Huaizhou would never say no.","Although he also spoiled her in the past, he still had the dignity of an older brother.","Now it was all gone.","“Before, as your older brother, I had to keep some of my dignity,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “But now, as your man, what’s the use of that dignity? Of course, I have to keep you happy and spoil you.”","Dong Yujie blushed at his words.","Especially the phrase ‘your man’, it made Dong Yujie’s heart tremble.","According to what Jiang Huaizhou said, how could being Jiang Huaizhou’s girlfriend not make her feel happier than being his younger sister?","Dong Yujie immediately asked, “Then, what if you found another girlfriend when you were still my older brother, wouldn’t you treat her better than me?”","“That’s silly.” Jiang Huaizhou tapped on Dong Yujie’s forehead lightly.","“First of all, the one I like is you, not anybody else, how can I have another girlfriend? But even if that is the case, won’t I still treat you the best?”","“Now that you’re my girlfriend, then the more I have to treat you the best of the best. In the end, it’s still you alone,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","This little girl turned dumb the moment she started dating.","Dong Yujie also realized this and lowered her head in embarrassment.","In the end, she was the only one.","“Then... I’m leaving first, I won’t disturb your work anymore,” said Dong Yujie.","...","“Wait!” How could Jiang Huaizhou let her leave? “Don’t leave.”","“You have no conscience. We just got together and you already wanted to abandon me?” Jiang Huaizhou thought about why this little girl was not reluctant at all.","“I’m worried about disturbing your work,” said Dong Yujie, “It’s not like I won’t come back to see you.”","“That won’t do.” Jiang Huaizhou did not plan to let Dong Yujie leave, “You’re finally back and today is our first official day together. We haven’t even caught up with each other, so you can’t leave.”","“Am I not a nuisance here?” Dong Yujie asked shyly.","“How can you be a nuisance?” Jiang Huaizhou pulled her to the couch to sit down.","“I do not have much work in the morning. Anyway, I don’t have anything else to do,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","“In the past year, you didn’t call me nor allow me to contact you. I don’t know anything about your life outside and what you have experienced there,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","“Previously, as I was in jail, I have missed out on a lot of your life. Now that I’ve missed out another year, it felt like I keep having gaps in your life again and again.”","“It’s like a recorded video that pauses here and there due to technical issues,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","“So, I really want to fill these gaps,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","...","“When you’re not here, I asked Mom to help me fill up the gaps created when I was in prison.”","Dong Yujie froze.","Jiang Huaizhou raised his hand and rubbed her cheek. “As long as it’s related to you, I want to know about it. I don’t want to miss anything.”","“To me, as long as it’s about you, nothing’s bad about it. Everything about you is important to me,” said Jiang Huaizhou softly.","Dong Yujie slowly relaxed.","Jiang Huaizhou knew that she had not gotten over it completely, she still needed some time.","How could a short year make her forget about those terrible things completely?","Especially if it was related to him, Dong Yujie would always feel more nervous.","Jiang Huaizhou looked at her. His heart was filled with tenderness, it felt sore and warm at the same time.","Originally, she should have had a happier life and would not need to face the stress of the day."]},{"number":3575,"title":"Chapter 3575 Untitled","paragraphs":["3575 Untitled","Dong Yujie did not expect Jiang Huaizhou to stop working.","“Wait for me,” said Jiang Huaizhou, as he stood up to open the office door.","All the employees outside looked over subconsciously.","However, they looked away in guilt. They knew that they could not let Jiang Huaizhou know that they were gossiping around.","Jiang Huaizhou obviously knew that they were gossiping around, but he did not care.","“If there’s nothing big that will cause the company to go out of business this morning, don’t look for me,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","Everyone understood that they should not go to him if there was nothing important.","After Jiang Huaizhou finished, he returned to the office and pulled Dong Yujie up.","“Where are we going?” asked Dong Yujie, curious.","She thought they would talk in the office.","“We have to find a more quiet place,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “There are too many people watching here.”","Even if there were walls and windows and the employees outside could not see nor hear anything from the inside, Jiang Huaizhou still felt that this was a bad place for them to talk.","Dong Yujie also realized this and suddenly felt that it was uncomfortable staying there.","She felt stressed just by the thought that her every moved would be watched by a lot of people","Jiang Huaizhou also knew that she forgot about this.","But once she became aware of this, she would definitely regret chatting with him in the office.","That was why Jiang Huaizhou brought it up first.","In the end, Jiang Huaizhou brought Dong Yujie to a cafe nearby.","This cafe had private rooms which were good for at least two people to talk without being disturbed.","Both of them ordered their coffee.","When the coffee came, the whole room was filled with the aroma of the coffee.","Their mood was calmed by its smell.","“I actually lived every day simply and quietly. I would go out for walks, drink tea when I had nothing to do, and sunbathe,” said Dong Yujie, “There’s nothing special.”","“It’s fine, I want to listen to those too. If you can remember what you ate for all three meals, tell me, I want to listen,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","Dong Yujie was surprised. “How can I still remember these? Besides, even if I remember, how long do I have to talk?”","“Take your time. Anyway, it’s not like we only have this morning’s time. We still have a lot of time in the future.” Jiang Huaizhou smiled at Dong Yujie.","“Whatever that we can’t finish this morning, we can talk about it next time,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","Dong Yujie obviously could not tell Jiang Huaizhou what she ate for her three meals every day.","She really could not remember.","But, what she could remember was what she ate two days ago. She could also remember what she ate one day ago.","Other than that, she could not remember anymore what she ate past that period.","Dong Yujie told Jiang Huaizhou about every interesting event that she could remember.","She also talked about some knowledge, the local culture, and the friends and elders that she encountered while she was living in the ancient city.","The little things that happened every day.","At first, Dong Yujie was worried that she would forget many things.","But now that she was talking about it, she realized that she could remember a lot of little details.","Thinking about it now, the time spent in the ancient city was a rare, very good time for her.","It was probably the best time she had after Jiang Huaizhou entered jail.","“If I don’t bring it up, I won’t even know how clearly I remember living in the ancient city.” Dong Yujie smiled faintly.","“Do you like your life there?” asked Jiang Huaizhou.","“Dong Yujie nodded. “Life there is carefree and slow-paced. Every morning, I will eat breakfast after waking up. Then I’ll drink tea and chat with the people around. Subconsciously, the time went by quickly.”","“In the ancient city, other than the young people who opened stores like cafes, many handicrafts and local specialty shops are all opened by middle-aged people. The rest are just the old people and kids that haven’t started school.”","“I watched the elderly sit in front of their doors every day, holding a fan in the summer while drinking tea and chatting. Or they would do some house chores while chatting. As for the kids, they would run around and make noises.”","“They could have a lot of fun with toys that are unremarkable, like sandbags.” As Dong Yujie talked and talked, her gaze seemed to be looking far away.","“They don’t have a lot of desire for physical things, but they are still happy everyday,” said Dong Yujie smiling, “I do like that kind of life.”","Jiang Huaizhou pondered and analyzed. “I am in the midst of starting a business. Even if my business is stable in the future, I can’t keep staying in the ancient city, so I am afraid I can’t stay in the ancient city with you.”","Surprised, Dong Yujie looked at Jiang Huaizhou.","How could he think of bringing her to the ancient city to live together?","Jiang Huaizhou explained, “I see that you like living in the ancient city. Even talking about it now, your eyes are filled with memories and reluctance.”","Because of him, not only could he not satisfy Dong Yujie, he had to make her give up her preferred life to stay with him.","Jiang Huaizhou felt sorry.","He could not even fulfill her preferences, how could he talk about treating her well?","Jiang Huaizhou blamed himself, feeling like he was useless. He said to Dong Yujie, “But if there are holidays, I will bring you there. Other places too, we’ll go wherever you want to go.”","“I will try to get more holidays, then we can stay at a place you like for some time,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “In the future, we don’t need to wait till we retire.”","...","“When we’re forty or fifty years old and our kids can take over, I will retire and give the company to them.” As for whether the company could last until then, Jiang Huaizhou had never doubted it.","He had never thought that he would fail.","“When that time comes, we’ll go wherever you want to go,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","Dong Yujie thought that she had just mustered up the courage to get together with him.","And now he was already thinking of kids?","However, this also made Dong Yujie’s restless heart calm down.","Jiang Huaizhou had already planned so far into the future. He even made a plan for when his children took over the company.","With long-term considerations like that, he really wanted to be with her for the rest of his life.","Dong Yujie could finally calm down.","Her shoulders relaxed and naturally dropped down.","“We’ll talk about it when the time comes. Actually, I don’t want to go back now,” said Dong Yujie.","...","“Although it’s good and quiet there, it’s not my home. My family is not there,” said Dong Yujie, “When I was out alone, I would still feel lonely and miss you guys sometimes.”","When Jiang Huaizhou heard this, he felt both sorry and happy.","He was sorry that she had to be alone outside.","But he was happy that she said that she missed them.","She included him.","She also missed him.","“It doesn’t matter where, as long as I’m next to my family,” said Dong Yujie.","“Actually, I came back this time and made a decision. Even if we didn’t get together, I won’t leave.”","“While I was out of town, I didn’t even know that Mom divorced, and left her alone for so long.”"]},{"number":3576,"title":"Chapter 3576 Untitled","paragraphs":["3576 Untitled","“I have also decided to stay to be with her,” said Dong Yujie.","“Therefore you don’t have to feel bad, thinking that you can’t give me the life that I wanted,” said Dong Yujie.","“I don’t have any specific aim when it comes to my living environment. As long as I’m together with family.” Dong Yujie smiled.","“So as long as I’m with you, it doesn’t matter where I live. You don’t have to feel bad,” said Dong Yujie, “I don’t think that it’s bad.”","“Although it’s good outside, it’s not as good as home,” said Dong Yujie after pondering, “However, if you’re free in the future and have holidays, then I don’t mind if we go on a vacation.”","“Of course, it doesn’t have to be long. A few days will be enough,” said Dong Yujie.","After all, he was in the middle of his own start-up business and it was bound to be busy.","It was already rare to have holidays, she could not ask him to have a long vacation.","An average working-class employee also had holidays based on the law and it was rare to have a few days of holiday a year.","Everyone was the same. She could not ask more from Jiang Huaizhou.","Jiang Huaizhou looked at Dong Yujie with warmth in his eyes. “Yujie, you’re so nice.”","Dong Yujie thought that he was good to her because he did not want her to dislike him.","Both of them spend the whole morning talking. At noon, they left the cafe to have a meal together.","In the afternoon, Dong Yujie wanted to go home.","But unexpectedly, she was stopped by Jiang Huaizhou, again.","Jiang Huaizhou made her accompany him to the office.","“When I get off work, let’s go to Mom’s house together,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","“The thing that is bothering Mom’s mind is probably about us. Let’s go back tonight and tell Mom that we are officially together,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","Dong Yujie thought about it and wanted to bring up going back just to tell Mrs. Dong about this matter.","But she did not expect that Jiang Huaizhou was also thinking about this.","“But, it’s inconvenient for me to stay in your office. It’s not good to let your employees see us together. After all, it’s your workplace,” said Dong Yujie.","“What’s the big deal? Besides, we’re not doing anything wrong anyway. Just stay with me,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","“It’s been such a long since I’ve seen you. Before, I’d finally gotten out but I hadn’t even spent much time with you, you left. Now that you’re finally back, this is my first time seeing you after a year,” said Jiang Huaizhou, full of pity.","“Let me look at you for a while more,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “Let me spend more time with you.”","However, Dong Yujie guessed in her heart.","Perhaps Jiang Huaizhou was insecure. He could not feel a sense of security.","Even if she had promised to stay, and even though she promised to be with him, he was still afraid.","He was traumatized by the thought of her leaving.","Dong Yujie was moved.","While she was feeling restless, he also did not have that much confidence.","Both of them had things that they were worried about.","Although the two of them were worried about two different things, they still had the same intention.","Because they cared about each other.","Facing Jiang Huaizhou like this, Dong Yujie could not reject him.","So she agreed.","Then, when lunch break was almost over.","The company employees saw Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie return with their hands holding each other.","Jiang Huaizhou stopped in front of the office.","“Cough.” Jiang Huaizhou cleared his throat. “Um... let me introduce you guys.”","Jiang Huaizhou smiled at Dong Yujie and said to everyone, “This is your lady boss.”","Everyone did not expect that. This morning, Xiao Lin kept on calling her lady boss.","In the afternoon, the boss introduced her as the lady boss.","Everyone was smart and immediately greeted, “Hello lady boss!”","Dong Yujie did not expect them to be so quick to call her that.","Why were they so quick to acknowledge her new position?","Jiang Huaizhou nodded in agreement, thinking that it was good to have young employees.","They were quick to accept new things.","“Okay, continue,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “In the afternoon, your lady boss will be with me. Don’t be surprised when you see her in the office.”","Dong Yujie was speechless.","Jiang Huaizhou’s words were very easily misinterpreted.","When Dong Yujie saw the employees’ expressions, she knew that they had misunderstood.","Dong Yujie secretly pulled his shirt. Jiang Huaizhou then looked over at Dong Yujie innocently.","“What’s wrong?” Jiang Huaizhou asked.","Dong Yujie was speechless.","...","Jiang Huaizhou suddenly acted as though he had a moment of realization. “Are you tired? You must have gotten used to taking naps. Why don’t you go to my office and take a nap on the sofa?”","Dong Yujie was angry and poked him secretly.","She hasn’t seen Jiang Huaizhou for a long time. When did he become so shameless!","Jiang Huaizhou’s words obviously caused the employees to misunderstand even more.","Dong Yujie was worried that if she had stayed even longer, Jiang Huaizhou might say something even more surprising.","To prevent any further misunderstandings, Dong Yujie hurriedly dragged Jiang Huaizhou back into the office and said, “Start working now! You haven’t been working for the entire morning. There must be a bunch of accumulated tasks to do.”","Jiang Huaizhou allowed Dong Yujie to drag him. He did not even try to resist.","He secretly made eye contact with the employees after turning around.","The employees were shocked.","When Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie entered the office and when the door closed, the employees started discussing.","“The moment the boss’s wife returned, our boss seems like a completely different person.”","...","“True. It’s my first time seeing our boss appearing so bubbly.”","In the office, the Venetian blinds were closed when they left and it was still closed even though there were people inside now.","The employees outside couldn’t see the inside of the room.","Dong Yujie then asked, “You did this intentionally, didn’t you?”","“What?” Jiang Huaizhou acted dumb.","Dong Yujie burst out in laughter and said, “I had no idea you became cunning after starting your own business.”","“What?” Jiang Huaizhou continued acting dumb.","Dong Yujie realized that Jiang Huaizhou’s personality was completely different now.","Before he was framed, Jiang Huaizhou wasn’t exactly a serious person but he was someone who followed the rules. When saying things and doing things and he only said things that were confirmed.","Obviously, he wasn’t happy after he was framed.","Whenever Dong Yujie would visit him, he would pretend as though he was doing well so that Dong Yujie wouldn’t worry.","He would appear relaxed and carefree.","However, Dong Yujie wasn’t blind. She could tell that Jiang Huaizhou was just forcing a smile.","Because he didn’t want her to worry.","When Jiang Huaizhou came out of jail, he was busy working every day.","Because he had taken her money, he gave himself a lot of stress.","He was worried that he might not do this well and that he might lose all the money that Dong Yujie had worked hard to save.","He was stressed at the time and it was hard for him to see her once every day.","He obviously wouldn’t act shameless like what he was currently doing.","Then, Dong Yujie left for over a year.","Whenever Dong Yujie would contact Mrs. Dong, Mrs. Dong would try not to talk about Jiang Huaizhou.","So that Dong Yujie wouldn’t feel emotionally disturbed.","After all, she had left to calm herself down."]},{"number":3577,"title":"Chapter 3577 Untitled","paragraphs":["3577 Untitled","This was because Dong Yujie had no idea what happened to Jiang Huaizhou during this past year.","She didn’t have a single clue.","Did Jiang Huaizhou become a totally different person during this time?","Of course, Dong Yujie didn’t think that Jiang Huaizhou’s changes were bad.","!!","Jiang Huaizhou’s current state of being was quite good. He seemed very energetic and happy.","He seemed to have forgotten his past trauma.","Actually, Dong Yujie didn’t know that Jiang Huaizhou remembered well of his past trauma.","Obviously, he would remember those major events for the rest of his life.","How could he forget?","He was the same as Dong Yujie. He could only pretend not to care about those things. He couldn’t actually forget about those things.","During this past year, Jiang Huaizhou had to force himself to become a civilized person for the sake of his business.","Not only did he have to be sleek, but he also needed to be shameless.","If not, he wouldn’t have been able to attract any business opportunities for his company.","However, because of this, he had to interact with different kinds of people.","Jiang Huaizhou had indeed become more cheerful.","He had become smarter and more cunning.","With Dong Yujie’s knowledge and skills, she was no match against Jiang Huaizhou.","“It’s nothing. It’s good to see you like this.” Dong Yujie said with a smile.","She sat on the sofa and said, “Just do your work. You don’t have to worry about me. I will just play with my phone.”","“If I insist that you stay, am I being selfish?” Jiang Huaizhou said, “You have nothing to do here and you can’t rest well here.”","“Should I leave then?” Dong Yujie asked.","Jiang Huaizhou responded, “...I would rather you stay.”","Dong Yujie smiled and said, “However, I did develop the habit of taking a nap in the afternoon. Can I rest for a while on your sofa?”","“Sure. Not a problem.” Jiang Huaizhou said immediately.","Dong Yujie sent Mrs. Dong a WeChat and told her that she was officially in a relationship with Jiang Huaizhou.","Obviously, Mrs. Dong was happy.","Dong Yujie just felt hesitant to tell Mr. Jiang.","After all, Mr. Jiang had always objected to her and Jiang Huaizhou’s relationship.","Actually, the matter involving Lu Qiyuan was not the only reason why Dong Yujie had left.","The other reason was that Mr. Jiang was always on guard against her.","Since she returned, she was thinking about whether she should visit Mr. Jiang.","And now that this relationship with Jiang Huaizhou happened, it made it even more difficult for her to see Mr. Jiang.","Jiang Huaizhou saw that Dong Yujie looked like in a dilemma. She seemed to have something to say but couldn’t say anything. Jiang Huaizhou then asked, “What’s wrong? What’s troubling you?”","“Am I disturbing you from work?” Dong Yujie immediately asked.","“Of course not.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “I just wanted to look at you from time to time.”","“What’s wrong? Tell me?” Jiang Huaizhou asked, “You have been struggling by yourself for a while now. Look, I have free time now.”","“Plus, even if I am busy, I do have the time to listen to your problems.”","“I am just struggling to decide if I should visit dad.” Dong Yujie said.","Jiang Huaizhou thought that it was right for Dong Yujie to refer to Mr. Jiang as his dad.","Even if Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Dong had gotten a divorce...","Dong Yujie would still be calling Mr. Jiang ‘dad’ the moment she got married to Jiang Huaizhou.","And so, she wouldn’t need to change this term of address. This was good.","“He was always against us being in a relationship. If I visit him, we can’t keep our relationship a secret, right?” Dong Yujie said.","“I don’t know how to face him or even how to tell him...” Dong Yujie lowered her head. Her heart felt heavy. It felt as though a huge rock was on her shoulder.","“Let’s go back and eat with mom today.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“We will visit dad tomorrow.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “I will give him a call tomorrow and let him know beforehand.”","“Dad shouldn’t find our relationship repulsive, but I am not sure if he will support this. At least he feels bad for what he had done to you. He didn’t say no when mom wanted a divorce and he agreed right away.”","“He did not say anything but he knew what this divorce signified. This divorce made way for our relationship. If they did not get a divorce, we wouldn’t be able to be in a relationship. He knew that and chose to get a divorce. I think he secretly supports our relationship.”","“If not, he could insist on not getting the divorce.”","“While you were gone and living by yourself this past year, dad felt bad. He thought that you had left because of him. He thought that it was his attitude that had forced you away.”","“I know that you didn’t like us being appreciative of you.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “But I think it’s better if dad feels thankful to you.”","“You saved me. He felt bad about this. He felt grateful as well. In addition, you left because of him.”","“I didn’t leave because of him.” Dong Yujie paused and immediately corrected herself, “At least this was not the main reason.”","“I know.” Jiang Huaizhou smiled and said, “However, dad is stubborn. You know that. He would rather take responsibility for everything. He preferred taking the responsibility regardless of what had happened.”","...","“And so, even if you told him, he won’t believe you.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“I don’t think you need to explain to him. Just let it be. You can give him a hint. Even if he doesn’t feel happy about it, he won’t dare to say anything.”","“Actually, I am not praying that he would support us sincerely. As long as he doesn’t object to our relationship, it’s fine.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“In addition to that, he might not be against us being together.” Jiang Huaizhou smiled and said, “Just go home with me tomorrow and let me handle this.”","Anyway, they needed to face this eventually.","Dong Yujie nodded and said, “Alright.”","However, after this dilemma was solved, Dong Yujie started feeling nervous about meeting Mr. Jiang.","During this past year in the ancient city, she didn’t have much to worry about. She felt emotionally and physically happy.","But the moment she came back, she had a few additional things to worry about.","Jiang Huaizhou was busy this afternoon.","However, all of the employees felt embarrassed to enter the office because they knew that Dong Yujie was there.","...","If they needed Jiang Huaizhou for something, they just contacted him through the messaging app.","This solved the issue.","When Dong Yujie saw that no one was coming into the office, she took a nap.","Finally, Jiang Huaizhou was done with work and went home with Dong Yujie.","Jiang Huaizhou drove while Dong Yujie sat in the passenger seat.","Jiang Huaizhou was very satisfied with this. He would occasionally turn and look over at Dong Yujie.","As a result, Dong Yujie couldn’t help but ask, “What are you looking at?”","“I am looking at the person in my passenger seat.” Jiang Huaizhou smiled and said, “The seat has been emptied for over a year. The master of this seat has finally returned.”","He was basically hinting that no one has sat in this passenger seat.","Dong Yujie raised her brow and asked, “Qu Mengyu never sat in this seat before?”","Honestly, Dong Yujie was surprised.","If Jiang Huaizhou had refused to let anyone take this seat, it’s possible that no one had sat there for the past year.","However, Qu Mengyu wouldn’t stop pursuing Jiang Huaizhou. Even if Jiang Huaizhou said no, would she listen to him?","“She has never sat there before.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “Although her father is my client, I have never allowed her to sit in my car.”"]},{"number":3578,"title":"Chapter 3578 Untitled","paragraphs":["3578 Untitled","“Of course, she’s not happy about it. However, although she’s my potential client, I don’t have to spoil her either. I mean it when I said I won’t let her sit.”","“Today is not the first day she used her family business as a threat. I can compromise for other things, but if it’s related to you, there’s no discussion,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","“I already said back then that I would rather abandon this business deal than obey her,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “In the end, she still won’t be able to do anything to me.”","“Then what about this time? Is she just bluffing again?” Dong Yujie had a hint of hope.","!!","“I’m afraid this time it’s real.” Jiang Huaizhou smiled. “Besides, I brought it up this time. Their family wants to save face, so they definitely won’t come and beg me, right?”","“Since I brought it up, they will let me see,” guessed Jiang Huaizhou.","“Besides, I wasn’t really lying. As long as Qu Mengyu stops pestering me, I will still profit even if I lost this business deal.”","“Then... losing the Qu Family’s business deal has a big effect on the company, right?” At least, that was what Qu Mengyu said.","Regarding this, Dong Yujie chose to believe Qu Mengyu’s words.","“It has a certain effect, but it’s still alright.” Jiang Huaizhou held her hand. “After all, I even managed to use the money you gave me to start a company from nothing in a short year. I won’t fall down with just that.”","“The business deal with the Qu Family is still being discussed with both sides negotiating terms. I can’t accept the conditions that Qu Xiangqian mentioned. To me, if we partner up based on his conditions, it will do more harm than good to me.”","“But he didn’t accept my conditions,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “He didn’t accept even after I had compromised.”","“To him, I probably have a weak foundation. He’s definitely underestimating me. He has already planned to take my company for the Qu Family.”","“So I’ve had enough of the Qu Family. The matter with Qu Mengyu just sped up my decision.”","“I was just thinking about whether I should partner up with them or not. Fortunately, Qu Mengyu helped me make a decision.”","“Without the Qu Family, I can just find others to collaborate with. It’s not like there’s only the Qu Family. After getting rid of the Qu Family, I will be happy as if I had just sealed an incredibly expensive business deal,” said Jiang Huaizhou, smiling.","The two talked the whole way back to Mrs. Dong’s residence.","Dong Yujie had the key in her hand.","When she unlocked the door, Mrs. Dong heard the sound and quickly went over to the entrance.","Without waiting for Dong Yujie to push the door open, Mrs. Dong opened the door first.","She saw Dong Yujie and Jiang Huaizhou standing at the entrance.","They looked like a golden couple, a match made in heaven.","Mrs. Dong truly felt that the two were more suitable as a couple!","“Come in!” Mrs. Dong smiled and hurried the two to enter.","“You said that you would come back with Huaizhou, so I’ve already prepared. I went to get more groceries from the market. The ingredients are all ready, all that’s left is to cook them. It won’t be long, so wait for a bit.” After Mrs. Dong said that, she immediately went to the kitchen.","Then she shouted to Dong Yujie, “Yujie, I’ve boiled the water, make some tea for Huaizhou.”","“Take it easy, we’re about to eat.” Jiang Huaizhou stopped Dong Yujie.","Mrs. Dong raised her eyebrows and said to Jiang Huaizhou, “D-do you feel sorry for her?”","Jiang Huaizhou didn’t know what to say.","If he said that he was sorry, it would be like he was unhappy that Mrs. Dong asked Dong Yujie to do work.","However, if he said that he was not sorry, this would mean that he did not care about Dong Yujie.","It was a dead-end.","He did not know that Mrs. Dong was this terrifying.","Today was the first time he came as Dong Yujie’s boyfriend, and he was already met with such a difficult question.","Jiang Huaizhou, who had never felt terrified in the business world, had encountered the biggest danger in his life.","“Drinking some tea will clear your stomach, so your appetite will be better later,” said Dong Yujie.","Mrs. Dong gave Jiang Huaizhou a glance and continue to cook dinner.","Jiang Huaizhou finally let out a sigh of relief, then whispered to Dong Yujie, “It’s okay, go and sit down. It’s too cramped for three people to stand in the kitchen.”","As she talked, she pulled Jiang Huaizhou to the living room to sit down.","Dong Yujie came back to the kitchen to make tea.","Mrs. Dong said, “I didn’t expect Huaizhou to be so capable. He convinced you in one day.”","Embarrassed, Dong Yujie smiled and said, “I already like him, too. I just didn’t dare to make the decision. His words made me determined.”","Dong Yujie looked at Mrs. Dong. “I believe him.”","“I believe him too,” said Mrs. Dong, smiling, “I won’t be rest assured if you get together with anyone else. It’s only if you’re together with Huaizhou that my heart will feel safe.”","Dong Yujie understood what Mrs. Dong meant.","“Mom, I will come back to help you after sending the tea over,” said Dong Yujie.","“It’s fine, go and spend time with him,” said Mrs. Dong, smiling, “It’s not a huge load of work here. I just need to fry the ingredients accordingly.”","Dong Yujie carried the tray and walked over.","“Should I go help Mom?” said Jiang Huaizhou when she came.","“Mom won’t let us add to the mess,” said Dong Yujie, “Don’t even think about it.”","This was a place that Jiang Huaizhou had lived in for a while. Even after Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Dong divorced, he still came here often.","But now, because Dong Yujie was here, Jiang Huaizhou felt like the home had changed.","It had become more refreshing.","“Do you still live in the same room as last time?” asked Jiang Huaizhou.","...","“Yeah, the things in my room are all ready, so I don’t have to tidy up again.” Dong Yujie nodded.","“Should I go take a look?” Jiang Huaizhou looked at Dong Yujie anxiously.","“What’s there to look at in my room? It’s simple, a little boring even,” said Dong Yujie, “Besides, haven’t you entered my room before?”","“We were still young back then, so it doesn’t count,” said Jiang Huaizhou, “Since I came out, we two had to avoid suspicion.”","Especially with Mr. Jiang watching.","There was no need to talk about it after Jiang Huaizhou came out.","Even when the two reached puberty, Mr. Jiang started watching.","So from then on, the two avoided entering each other’s rooms.","It must be said that the pressure given by Mr. Jiang was a little too much.","“So I haven’t looked at your room in detail before,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","And now he did not live here anymore, so Jiang Huaizhou lost this privilege.","...","“Fine.” Dong Yujie smiled as she nodded. “Follow me.”","The house was not big, so there was no need to follow Dong Yujie. Jiang Huaizhou also knew where her room was located.","The two came to the door of Dong Yujie’s room.","The door was closed by Mrs. Dong when she was cleaning the house during the day.","Dong Yujie opened the door. When Jiang Huaizhou entered, he was immediately hit with the unique smell of girls."]},{"number":3579,"title":"Chapter 3579 Untitled","paragraphs":["3579 Untitled","Dong Yujie’s room looked very simple and clean.","There weren’t many changes, even when compared to a year ago.","However, it was probably because Dong Yujie didn’t have a sense of belonging to this place.","In addition, if she wanted to spend the time and effort to decorate this room, she needed to be in the mood to do so.","!!","Dong Yujie had experienced so many changes in her life. She didn’t have the time everyday to decorate her room.","And so, Dong Yujie’s room satisfied her basic need, which was sleep.","This time, there was an additional laptop on the small round table in her room.","She had brought this back herself.","Aside from the laptop, there wasn’t any other changes.","In the past few days since Dong Yujie came back, she felt that she had enough and did not purchase anything else.","Jiang Huaizhou had moved out, but Mrs. Dong never touched his room. She had kept the room for him.","“I remember when I first moved in, you gave the biggest master bedroom to my parents and the second biggest room to me. I’m not staying here anymore, so why don’t you move into my room?” Jiang Huaizhou asked.","“I just got used to it,” Dong Yujie said, “Besides, in the more than a year that I was gone, Mom didn’t change anything in your room as well.”","In addition, how could she feel peace if she had stayed in his room?","She wouldn’t feel comfortable.","Jiang Huaizhou observed Dong Yujie’s room for a while.","Honestly, Dong Yujie’s room didn’t look good.","One could easily see all the decorations with just a glance at the entire room. One didn’t need to take a closer look to see more details.","Jiang Huaizhou then said, “When we live together in the future, you aren’t allowed to be perfunctory. You will need to decorate our bedroom nicely.”","Dong Yujie felt her face burning slightly.","In the morning, Jiang Huaizhou discussed about letting their children take over the company in the future and retiring early.","And he had just asked her to decorate their room.","“Why don’t you stop by my place during the weekend?” Jiang Huaizhou said.","Jiang Huaizhou then added, “I have no other intention, it’s just that you have to at least get to know the place. Know where I live and know what my home looks like. You can also register your fingerprint while you are visiting.”","“The house uses a fingerprint lock. You can just scan your fingerprint when you visit again.” Jiang Huaizhou said as he planned.","“Familiarize yourself with the house first, then let’s go to the mall and see if there’s anything we need to buy. In your free time, you can also browse online shops for small decorations and buy what you like.” Jiang Huaizhou spoke with more excitement. The picture he had imagined was appearing more and more beautiful.","Even just discussing about it made him feel happy.","“Actually, I live alone and my house is exactly like your bedroom. It’s simple. There aren’t a lot of things.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“Your bedroom is considered good. This is the only room that looks simple. Mom has done a good job decorating the other rooms.”","“But I live alone in that house. I am normally busy, and I am usually not home, so I was never in the mood to decorate. That place was just a place to live in. However, I will definitely rush home after work every day because you will be at home. And that’s why we should make our home look cozy and comfortable.” Just the thought of this made Jiang Huaizhou feel happy.","“Wait! How did this conversation turn into me living with you? I thought we were just talking about decorating this place,” Dong Yujie said.","“Are you saying that you’re going to decorate this place to your liking and not actually live here?” Jiang Huaizhou chuckled and replied, “If you’re going to decorate it to your taste, you have to stay here.”","Dong Yujie was speechless.","“Sigh. No. I rented this place,” Jiang Huaizhou said, “Since I rented it, it still belongs to someone else. It’s not my house, and there isn’t a sense of belonging.”","As such, even though Jiang Huaizhou was often busy with work and rarely came home, he had never felt homesick.","As a result, he lacked the motivation to decorate things.","After all, he knew that this wouldn’t be his permanent house.","When the lease end, he would have to move away.","If he bought a lot of things, moving would become troublesome. He might as well keep things simple.","Because Jiang Huaizhou was too excited thinking about the future, he forgot about this important information.","“Why don’t we start looking for houses?” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“You’re still building up your business, and your company is still unstable. Buying a house now would be very stressful,” Dong Yujie reminded him, still remembering the loss of business with the Qu Family.","She didn’t want Jiang Huaizhou to bear even more stress because of this.","“I am just saying that if we do live together in the future.” Dong Yujie said.","“There’s no ‘if’ involved. We must live together, and we will get married,” Jiang Huaizhou stated firmly, indicating his dislike for any conditional statements.","The word ‘if’ represented uncertainty.","Jiang Huaizhou had been through a lot with Dong Yujie, and he didn’t want any more uncertainty in their relationship. He didn’t want any more ‘ifs’ to arise.","Jiang Huaizhou stopped smiling as he said these words to Dong Yujie with such seriousness.","Dong Yujie froze. However, she still nodded and said, “Alright. I won’t say that anymore. There’s no ‘if’ in our future.”","“I will have to buy a house in the future anyway.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “I can’t let you live in a rental when we get married, right?”","“No matter what, we must have a house first.” Even though Jiang Huaizhou’s company was doing well, it was still a bit difficult for him to buy a house in full because he had already bought Mr. Jiang’s and Mrs. Dong’s houses.","“It will be a little difficult to pay in full or buy a bigger house. However, I can buy one that is about the same size as this one, and I can afford the down payment as well. I can easily pay the monthly mortgage, too,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“Yeah, you do have to purchase a house,” Dong Yujie said, “But it is true that we don’t need to buy a big house. We just need a house big enough for us.”","“No matter what, it has to have three rooms, right? One master bedroom for us. One as the office and the last one for our child. But if we end up having two kids, it would be better for us to have a house with four rooms.” Jiang Huaizhou said as he pondered.","...","“But a house this zie is big enough for us now. When the company stabilizes in the future, we’ll change to a better place.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","As Dong Yujie listened to Jiang Huaizhou’s plans, she felt very safe.","Jiang Huaizhou has planned their future.","He has included her and their kids in the plan.","“Erm...” Mrs. Dong stood at the door and called out.","“Dinner is ready.” Mrs. Dong said.","The two weren’t doing anything. They were just chatting. And so, the three of them didn’t feel awkward as they came out of the room.","After sitting down, Dong’s mother said, “When I just went to call you guys, I heard you talking about buying a house?”","Dong Yujie then said, “Yes. My bro...”","“You’re still referring to him as your elder brother?” Mrs. Dong interrupted and corrected her. “You shouldn’t call him that anymore.”","..."]},{"number":3580,"title":"Chapter 3580 Untitled","paragraphs":["3580 Untitled","Jiang Huaizhou felt grateful to Mrs. Dong for her role in advancing his relationship.","Jiang Huaizhou then quickly said, “How about you just call me Huaizhou?”","Dong Yujie felt embarrassed as she glanced over at Mrs. Dong.","She felt too embarrassed to call him that in front of Mrs. Dong.","!!","Mrs. Dong smiled and encouraged, “Just try calling him that. You will have to get used to it eventually. You can’t refer to him as your brother. People will misunderstand.”","Since Mrs. Dong said so, Dong Yujie had no choice but to try calling.","She took a deep breath, but the words were on the tip of her tongue, and her tongue didn’t want to move. No matter what, she couldn’t call him “Huaizhou.”","However, Jiang Huaizhou was staring at her intensely, refusing to give Dong Yujie any chance to regret and delay this.","Dong Yujie chose not to look at him. With the back of her head facing him, she forced herself to say, “Huai... Huaizhou...”","Dong Yujie started beating rapidly. She felt as if she had just ridden a roller coaster.","Although she had called him that in the morning...","However, that was because she heard Qu Mengyu calling him by his name.","Dong Yujie had done it merely to roast Qu Mengyu. She wasn’t really serious when she said it.","She only said it in a sarcastic way.","Obviously, when he called his name this time, it felt different.","Upon hearing Dong Yujie call him by his name, Jiang Huaizhou felt as though he could eat three bowls of rice with ease.","“That’s right!” Mrs. Dong said happily. “That’s how a couple should behave.”","“Mom is right.” Jiang Huaizhou said as well.","Dong Yujie couldn’t help but laugh.","Mrs. Dong said, “By the way, you two were talking about buying a house. Have you guys already decided to buy a house?”","“Mhm,” getting back to the main topic, Dong Yujie said, “Huaizhou said that once we get married, it will not feel very stable living in a rented place. So, he wants to take a loan to buy a house.”","“Why does it have to be this troublesome? We can just trade houses.” Mrs. Dong said, “This house is big. It’s a waste for me to stay here by myself. You two can stay here, and I can stay in the smaller house.”","“Is Huaizhou’s rental a two-bedroom?” Mrs. Dong asked.","“Mhmm.” Jiang Huaizhou nodded.","“That sounds good. If the lease on Huaizhou’s current place hasn’t ended by the time you two get married, I’ll move over there, and you two can stay here,” said Mrs. Dong.","“How can I let that happen?” Jiang Huaizhou immediately said, “How can I let you stay in a rental?”","“Why not? Besides, your company is at a crucial stage right now. I already felt bad when you bought two houses all at once.” Mrs. Dong said.","“Why not just buy a small apartment, either a one or two-bedroom? Mom can live by herself. This way you won’t have to spend too much money. Your company is still in an upward phase and not yet stable. Don’t let buying a house weigh you down.” Dong Yujie said, “Mom is right, your company is in an ascending period, it hasn’t stabilized yet. Don’t be weighed down by a house.”","This house was indeed a little too big for Mrs. Dong to live alone.","Mrs. Dong lived here by herself, so two rooms would be left unused.","If Dong Yujie and Jiang Huaizhou move into this house, it would be just right in line with Jiang Huaizhou’s original plan.","And if he bought a house with one or two bedrooms, it would be less stressful for him.","“Good. The lease for my rental is ending in half a year. I’ll go check out the houses available at the real estate agency. If I find a suitable one, I’ll buy it, ” said JiangHuaizhou. After all, it’s hard to find a new housing development in the city center of City B these days.","There wasn’t enough land.","If they wanted to live in the city, they would have to choose to buy a second-hand house.","Even so, second-hand houses were at sky-high prices.","“If I buy this house, I would need to renovate it, which will take at least half a year.” Jiang Huaizhou started planning.","His lease would end at around that time.","Mrs. Dong nodded and said, “That’s what we will do then.”","After dinner, Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie helped Mrs. Dong tidy up the table. They refused to let Mrs. Dong do anything.","“Mom, you already worked hard preparing the dinner. Just don’t bother doing the other things.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","However, there was already a dishwasher in the house.","As such, they didn’t need to handwash the dishes.","However, they still had to wipe the table.","After they had cleaned up everything, Jiang Huaizhou appeared to be stalling and refusing to leave.","Mrs. Dong then asked with a smile, “Huaizhou, do you want to sleep here tonight?”","Jiang Huaizhou then looked over, brimming with joy. Mrs. Dong then said, “Your room is ready. I clean your room every day. But because you don’t live here, I was afraid that the pillows would get dusty outside, so I put them away.”","“If you want to stay, I can bring them out for you. They’re clean,” Mrs. Dong said.","Jiang Huaizhou obviously wanted to stay. “Then I will stay.”","He didn’t even hesitate.","Mrs. Dong then smiled and said, “Sure. I will tidy up your room for you.”","Dong Yujie knew that her relationship with Jiang Huaizhou was rather different from the relationship of other couples.","After all, they had lived together since young. This wasn’t something unfamiliar.","Even though their relationship had changed, Jiang Huaizhou staying the night here didn’t make Dong Yujie feel uncomfortable.","...","Jiang Huaizhou still left a lot of his clothes here.","His pajamas were left here as well.","It was very convenient for Jiang Huaizhou to stay here.","Jiang Huaizhou thought about it and said, “Why don’t I just move back here?”","Mrs. Dong had just tidied up the room when she came back and heard this.","She then said, “Sure. It will be very exciting if you live here, but your dad will be living by himself, and he will be very lonely. Will your dad be happy if he found out that you came to live with us?”","“If I were your dad, I would feel sad. It’s like a gathering of a family, but I am excluded and abandoned. Is that even appropriate?” Mrs. Dong said.","Jiang Huaizhou pondered and said, “I didn’t think it through.”","“You can stay here occasionally, but you can’t stay here all the time.” Mrs. Dong said, “I am not saying this because you are not welcomed here.”","“I know.” Jiang Huaizhou said with a smile.","Mrs. Dong had considered reasonable things.","...","If all three of them were here having fun together and Mr. Jiang was at home by himself...","No matter how you think about this, it’s sad.","This was why Jiang Huaizhou decided to move out and live alone.","The first reason was that it was more convenient for him to do work if he was living by himself.","The other reason was to prevent one person from feeling lonely if he were to accompany the other.","And so, he decided to live by himself.","He would alternate and visit one house per week. Thus, it would be very fair.","Jiang Huaizhou suddenly said seriously, “Mom and Yujie, I have something to say.”","“Say it.” Mrs. Dong stared at Jiang Huaizhou with a smile as she wondered why Jiang Huaizhou suddenly started behaving seriously.","Dong Yujie looked at Jianghuai puzzledly.","Why was he suddenly so serious?","Jiang Huaizhou cleared his throat and said, “Mom, I want to marry Yujie.”","Mrs. Dong froze.","Before Mrs. Dong even reacted, Jiang Huaizhou said to Dong Yujie, “Yujie, will you marry me?”","Dong Yujie froze.","They just started dating today. And now, they were already getting married?","Mrs. Dong then asked, “I’m not against that. I’m just surprised. I thought you two just started dating today?”"]},{"number":3581,"title":"Chapter 3581 Untitled","paragraphs":["3581 Untitled","This was what Dong Yujie meant.","They had just gotten together today.","Dong Yujie had thought about marriage before.","However, she simply didn’t expect that Jiang Huaizhou would suggest it so soon.","!!","Mrs. Dong then said, “I’m ready for your marriage. I thought that you two would definitely get married. I didn’t even think otherwise.”","At that, Jiang Huaizhou smiled.","“I just didn’t expect this to happen on the first day,” Mrs. Dong said.","“It’s not the first day.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“Why?” Mrs. Dong was stunned when she heard that.","Jiang Huaizhou said, “When it comes to dating, it should start from the beginning of the relationship. Before the relationship, we had a mutual liking but not much understanding. Most of it is based on the likes of certain traits displayed on the surface.”","Jiang Huaizhou said, “When people talk about dating, it actually starts from the beginning of the relationship. Before that, there is mutual affection but not a deep understanding. It is mostly due to some attractive qualities that are revealed on the surface. Only during the gradual process of getting to know each other can you better understand a person and make the decision to marry them. Dating and marriage are not the same. When dating, you always show your best side to the other person.”","“Only after a gradual process of dating can one truly understand another person and make the decision to marry them. Love and marriage are different. When in love, one always shows their best side to the other person. However, when living together after marriage, differences in habits, beliefs, and even conflicts will eventually surface.”","“So many people choose to live together during the dating period, not only because they don’t want to be apart, but also to have a deeper understanding of each other.”","“That’s why I have no worries about these things with Yujie. We have lived together since we were young and we understand each other very well. I even know when Yujie had her first period. I know her habits and quirks, what she likes and dislikes. I know which celebrities she has liked since she was a child and whom she used to dream of marrying when she was young.”","“Why are you bringing up such things all of a sudden?” Dong Yujie blushed.","All those silly thoughts from childhood were dark history.","However, Jiang Huaizhou knew about all these things.","Dong Yujie covered her forehead in frustration.","It was embarrassing.","She did a lot of stupid things when she was young.","Since she was young, she always had a crush on older brothers who looked handsome.","As a child, she would watch celebrities on TV, and because there were many good-looking ones, she would change who she liked every other day.","Whenever she encountered a popular idol drama, she would obsessed with it along with the girls in her class.","And they would also buy posters together and put them in their rooms.","During holidays at home, she would watch some ancient martial arts dramas and mythological dramas.","She sees the female lead in the drama, dressed in white and floating, looking very good and graceful.","She wrapped herself in the bed sheets.","Jiang Huai Zhou has seen all these silly things.","As she grew up, Dong Yujie forgot some of the silly things she did as a child.","Dong Yujie was so embarrassed because all the silly things she had done when she was still young had all been brought up by Jiang Huaizhou.","“Don’t be angry.” Jiang Huaizhou hastily held Dong Yujie’s hand. “I just wanted to say that other couples didn’t dare to get married so early because they still don’t know each other that well.”","“However, I have spent time with you for over twenty years. We know each other very well, and we lived together for a very long time. If we get married, we wouldn’t have any conflicts due to different living habits.”","Jiang Huaizhou then looked over at Mrs. Dong, “Mom, that’s why I think we shouldn’t delay this any further. We don’t need more time to get to know each other. I want to marry Yujie.”","“I want to ask you for your permission.” Jiang Huaizhou asked Dong Yujie, “Yujie, will you? Will you marry me?”","Indeed. They already knew each other well. They didn’t need to rely on dating to get to know each other.","Getting married doesn’t change the way they used to get along, it will be the same as before.","They could also just register their marriage and continue dating.","Since both of them have decided on each other, why waste time anymore?","Dong Yujie looked over at Mrs. Dong.","Mrs. Dong smiled and said, “Why are you looking at me? You decide it yourself.”","“It’s up to you, do what you think is best.” Mrs. Dong said with a smile.","Dong Yujie then said to Jiang Huaizhou, “Don’t you regret it?”","“Actually, during our dating period, it was also a buffer time for you. You can take the time to consider our relationship. If you somehow regret things after we get married, then we can separate amicably,” added Dong Yujie.","“Even if we broke up, I won’t blame you.” Dong Yujie said.","“I haven’t felt any regret this past year, and I don’t think I will,” Jiang Huaizhou said, “I just want to marry you as soon as possible. I don’t want to be separated from you. I want to always be with you.”","“I’m worried that if I don’t marry you as soon as possible, you might run away,” said Jiang Huaizhou.","“Alright. But you have to know that if you regret it after we get married, I won’t bother you. But our relationship won’t be like how it was in the past,” Dong Yujie said.","“I’m marrying you because I believe in your promise. I absolutely believe in you. I am willing to entrust half of my life to you. If you regret it in the future, things will not end on good terms.”","“At least we won’t be getting along until I die. If I am stubborn, I will try every method to ruin you. I will sacrifice everything to do this, just like how I sacrificed everything to save you.”","“As long as I have such beliefs, I will do anything to achieve that.” Dong Yujie said, “Considering our relationship, we won’t even be able to remain brother and sister.”","“I will hate you, and I will be in pain.” Dong Yujie took a deep breath and said, “Are you prepared for this version of me?”","“You said that we know each other well, but we have both changed a lot during this past year. Have you thought of these things?”","Jiang Huaizhou smiled as he looked at Dong Yujie with determination.","“I thought about these things. I am saying these things after I have thought it through. I knew I could do it. That’s why I said it.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","...","“These things that you mentioned would never happen.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “Yujie, are you willing to bet once? Try marrying me? This way, you will know that I will do everything I have promised you.”","“I will not let you down. I will not let you fall into that state.” Jiang Huaizhou said as he took out a small box from his pocket.","When she saw this, she knew that this was a ring box.","As expected, Jiang Huaizhou stood up. With his back facing Mrs. Dong, he knelt on one knee towards Dong Yujie.","Dong Yujie then opened the ring box in front of Dong Yujie.","There was a diamond ring inside.","This diamond ring was not small.","Dong Yujie was surprised as she asked, “When did you... prepare this?”","“When you left a year ago, I chased after you. Even though I didn’t see you then, you promised me that it would just be a year.” Jiang Huaizhou explained. “You promised me that you would return after a year.”"]},{"number":3582,"title":"Chapter 3582 Untitled","paragraphs":["3582 Untitled","“Therefore, the moment I came back to B City and got off the plane, I went to a jewelry store and bought this ring,” Jiang Huaizhou said, “At that time, I decided that if you came back and agreed to be in a relationship with me, I would ask you to marry me.”","“What if I didn’t agree?” Dong Yujie couldn’t help but ask.","“If you didn’t agree to be with me, I will try to convince you first. And then, I will ask you to marry me once you’re convinced,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“You were certain that I would agree to be your girlfriend? You knew that I like you, right?” The corner of Dong Yujie’s mouth curved up uncontrollably.","!!","Mrs. Dong, who was watching from the side, was feeling worried.","This kid should have allowed Jiang Huaizhou to get up first. Jiang Huaizhou shouldn’t be kneeling.","Jiang Huaizhou had his back facing Mrs. Dong, so he couldn’t see her facial expression.","Mrs. Dong stood behind Jiang Huaizhou, and she kept giving Dong Yujie a look.","She was urging Dong Yujie to give an answer.","Mrs. Dong had raised Jiang Huaizhou as her son for many years.","She felt bad for him.","Dong Yujie had completely forgotten about this.","And after being reminded by Mrs. Dong, Dong Yujie quickly said, “I.. I do.”","She let out a sigh of relief and said, “Let’s get married.”","Jiang Huaizhou laughed out loud and quickly took out the ring and wore it on Dong Yujie’s finger.","“How is it a perfect fit?” Dong Yujie asked in surprise.","“I already told you that we know each other very well,” Jiang Huaizhou said, “What else do I not know about you?”","Mrs. Dong didn’t expect Jiang Huaizhou to do things in such an efficient manner.","Dong Yujie had just returned, but Jiang Huaizhou immediately asked Dong Yujie to marry him.","“When do you two plan to register your marriage certificate?” Mrs. Dong asked.","Since Dong Yujie was already wearing the ring and they had both decided to get married, the registration of their marriage should happen soon.","“I discussed this with Yujie. We will visit dad.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “No matter what, I have to tell Dad.”","“In addition, Dad felt guilty when Yujie left. He will feel more at ease if he sees Yujie,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“Actually, Dad isn’t bothered by our relationship anymore.”","“I know.” Mrs. Dong nodded and said, “Since he had agreed to get a divorce, I knew that he didn’t care if you two got together. If not, he wouldn’t have agreed so quickly.”","“Your dad is just old-fashioned. He’s a good guy. When Yujie left, he regretted it. And he felt bad about it. He is now trying to make amends in his own way.”","Mrs. Dong could tell that Dong Yujie was feeling nervous about the visitation. She then said, “You don’t have to feel nervous when you see him tomorrow. He regrets what happened back then, and he won’t stop you two.”","“But it is going to be hard for Dad not to care about his reputation, so he could still appear angry when he sees you guys, but don’t take it to heart,” Mrs. Dong said.","“I think he will just be quiet. As long as he doesn’t say anything against it, it will be fine.” Mrs. Dong said, “Just take it slow.”","Dong Yujie nodded and said, “I know.”","“It’s not early anymore. I’m going to sleep. You two should sleep early. It shouldn’t matter for Yujie. But Huaizhou, don’t you have to go to work tomorrow?” Mrs. Dong said.","“I will sleep after I’m done talking to Yujie,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","Mrs. Dong didn’t respond. She didn’t say that she was going to stay and watch them just in case they would do something over the line.","They were already adults. What lines could there be?","They could do whatever they want.","However, Mrs. Dong believed that nothing would happen between Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie.","They were kids who knew boundaries. Even if they couldn’t help it, they wouldn’t do it while she was still at home.","And so, Mrs. Dong felt reassured as she went back to her room.","Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie had no plans of doing anything. They just wanted to chat.","To the both of them, a day of spending time together wasn’t enough.","Jiang Huaizhou wanted to listen to Dong Yujie talk about the many things that had happened in the past year.","Dong Yujie was also curious about how Jiang Huaizhou managed to establish a successful business.","The two continued talking, and time passed by unknowingly.","When they came back to their senses, it was already 12 am.","“Go sleep. You still need to work tomorrow.” Dong Yujie urged.","After losing the business deal with the Qu Family, Jiang Huaizhou had to deal with a lot of things.","The Qu Family would also make things difficult for him.","Qu Mengyu was clearly a petty person.","The two went back to their own rooms, which were opposite each other.","The two stood in front of each other’s bedrooms.","Dong Yujie lifted her hand and waved at Jiang Huaizhou while saying, “Goodnight.”","Jiang Huaizhou stared at Dong Yujie, who was right in front of him. Suddenly, he made a step forward.","Then, he stepped right before her.","Dong Yujie felt her heart in her mouth as she subconsciously held her breath.","...","Jiang Huaizhou lowered his head and gave her a kiss on the lips.","“Goodnight.”","He finally got to kiss the person he had spent days and nights thinking about.","Jiang Huaizhou finally felt reassured.","“This feels real to me now. We are finally together,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","At this moment, his heart was beating really fast.","He endured again and again in the past. He didn’t dare to cross the line.","However, he still had to suffer.","And now, he no longer had to endure. Jiang Huaizhou felt like his life was complete.","Dong Yujie felt her heart beating really fast.","So this was how it felt to be with someone you liked.","...","When he came closer, she felt so nervous that she felt like she wasn’t herself.","She couldn’t even form a complete sentence.","The moment he touched her, she felt happy, nervous, excited, and scared.","When these emotions mixed together, they became so complicated.","“Let me watch you go into your room.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","Dong Yujie felt even more reluctant to be away from him.","But she forced herself to say, “Okay.”","With this, she opened the door slowly.","Then, she stepped into her room without closing the door.","She grabbed the edges of the door with both of her hands and said, “I want to see you go inside your room, too.”","The two became rather childish. However, they didn’t know about it, and they thought it was quite sweet.","Jiang Huaizhou couldn’t help but smile. He looked at her intensely, reluctant to look away.","“Alright.” Jiang Huaizhou looked at her and moved backward.","He touched the door behind him. Then, he moved his hand behind and found the door handle, opening the door.","Dong Yujie blushed. Jiang Huaizhou’s reaction made her feel so embarrassed of herself, and her face burned as a result.","Jiang Huaizhou did what Dong Yujie was doing. He stepped into his room but kept the door open.","The two kept the door open and looked at each other from afar.","“Why don’t...” Jiang Huaizhou thought about it and said, “Why don’t we just keep our doors opened?”","“Eh?” Dong Yujie said in surprise.","“We would be able to see each other in our bedrooms through the door.”","“It’s late now, but during an earlier time in the future...” Jiang Huaizhou pointed behind him.","In the room, there was a small round table facing the doorway."]},{"number":3583,"title":"Chapter 3583 Untitled","paragraphs":["3583 Untitled","“We don’t have to go to each other’s rooms. If we sit in this location, we will be able to see inside each other’s room.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","Dong Yujie could see the picture in her mind.","He would be sitting there reading while she would be playing with her computer in her room.","If she looked up, she would see him on the opposite side.","!!","Even if they were in two rooms, it would feel like they were together.","Dong Yujie felt a little embarrassed. She touched the patch of hair at the temples and said, “I’m not tired yet. I’m going back to my room to play with the computer.”","Dong Yujie’s room had a small table facing the door.","Jiang Huaizhou showed an expression conveying that he got the message. He then said, “Then I will read for a while.”","“Stop.” Dong Yujie quickly stopped him. “I don’t have to work. I can sleep late because I can wake up late during the day. But you have to work. You can’t stay up.”","“But I want to look at you,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","Jiang Huaizhou was so sweet Dong Yujie had to smile. She thought to herself that Jiang Huaizhou was actually capable of being such a romantic person.","“That won’t do.” Dong Yujie looked to the side and said, “I am thinking. You can sleep, and I can watch you in your room. Anyway, I know you’re in the room.”","“I know you’re there. And so, even if I can’t see you, I will be mentally aware of your presence. It’s like seeing you, and that makes me happy,” Dong Yujie said.","Jiang Huaizhou thought about it and said, “Why don’t I move the bed here? I can then see you even if I am on the bed.”","Dong Yujie thought this suggestion sounded weird.","It had a weird loving vibe.","“There’s no need for that.” Dong Yujie quickly said, “It’s already really late. Don’t bother.”","“I won’t play with my laptop anymore. I will sleep as well, then.” Dong Yujie said.","If not, Jiang Huaizhou would continue to be busy.","Why did she never realize that he was such a bustling person?","Jiang Huaizhou then felt satisfied and nodded.","Both of them have yet to wash up.","When they went back to their own rooms, Dong Yujie quickly took a shower and brushed her teeth.","She came out of the bathroom with her hair wrapped up in a dry towel.","The bathroom in the room was near the door.","She would be in the doorway if she came out of the bathroom.","If the door remained open, she would have to pass by the door whenever she needed to use the bathroom.","When Dong Yujie came out of the bathroom, Jiang Huaizhou coincidentally came out of his bathroom as well.","She saw out of the corner of her eye that Jiang Huaizhou had just stepped out of the bathroom as well.","The two turned and looked at each other at the same time.","They couldn’t help but smile as they stared at each other.","“I’m going to do my skincare, dry my hair, then sleep,” Dong Yujie said.","Jiang Huaizhou’s eyes curved up. “What a coincidence! I have everything in my room but skincare.”","Jiang Huaizhou was usually not home, so he couldn’t keep such common consumables in the house.","Such things would expire after a while, after all.","Therefore, whenever Jiang Huaizhou moved to another place, he would take his skincare with him.","As for the toothpaste and toothbrush, there would always be extras at home for replacement.","One would never have to worry about toothbrushes expiring.","And so, there were such items in Jiang Huaizhou’s room.","Dong Yujie froze.","Then, Jiang Huaizhou said, “Can you let me use yours?”","Dong Yujie obviously said yes.","She was just about to walk to Jiang Huaizhou’s room to give the skincare products to him. After all, her bedroom was one step away from Jiang Huaizhou’s bedroom.","But then, Jiang Huaizhou said, “Should I come and get it from you?”","In Dong Yujie’s opinion, Jiang Huaizhou seemed to be looking for new excuses to see her.","After all, there aren’t many boys with such exquisite taste.","Many boys wouldn’t apply any skincare products, and they would never experience any skin breakouts.","Dong Yujie remembered that Jiang Huaizhou never bothered with these things in the past.","He even thought it was troublesome to apply a moisturizer.","When he was in jail, he didn’t have such a privilege.","Unless Jiang Huaizhou had gone through a huge transformation in this past year.","However, Dong Yujie didn’t expose him.","She nodded and said, “Sure.”","Jiang Huaizhou immediately came over.","...","Because the room was too close, it only took him a step to move into her room.","Dong Yujie then realized that their rooms were really too close to each other.","Dong Yujie’s skincare products were all on the dressing table beside her bed.","Jiang Huaizhou then followed her there.","He observed Dong Yujie squeezing a small amount of liquid into her palm before dabbing it on her face. Jiang Huaizhou then did the same and dabbed the liquid on his face.","Actually, all he needed was some moisturizer.","But he wanted to find more opportunities to stay with Dong Yujie.","Therefore, he applied whatever Dong Yujie applied.","It took a whole hour for Dong Yujie to finish her skincare routine.","Jiang Huaizhou naturally finished applying skincare on his face.","Dong Yujie then smiled and said to Jiang Huaizhou, “Goodnight, then.”","...","Jiang Huaizhou showed a helpless smile and nodded as he said, “Goodnight.”","They had said goodnight to each other many times tonight.","However, none of their goodnight greetings to one another were successful.","Dong Yujie walked Jiang Huaizhou to his room. Jiang Huaizhou looked back and suddenly kissed her on the lips before he quickly stepped into his room.","Dong Yujie touched her lips and felt dumbfounded.","She thought to herself. They were already dating. If he wanted to kiss her, he could do it openly. He didn’t have to make himself seem like a thief.","Dong Yujie turned and went back to the bathroom to dry her hair.","When she came out of the bathroom, she subconsciously turned and looked over at Jiang Huaizhou’s room.","She then saw Jiang Huaizhou leaning on the door, waiting for her to come out of the bathroom.","He leaned on the door in a carefree and lazy manner. He looked really handsome.","Dong Yujie knew that he was waiting.","And so, she waved at Jiang Huaizhou and said, “Goodnight.”","Jiang Huaizhou smiled and responded, “Goodnight.”","Dong Yujie then quickly climbed onto the bed and lay down.","She grabbed her blanket and smiled as she thought about how her room was opposite Jiang Huaizhou’s room and how convenient this setting was.","However, she couldn’t sleep.","She couldn’t help but wonder if Jiang Huaizhou was asleep.","Is he leaning on the door and looking at her?","Dong Yujie kept thinking about this. She then stealthily got out of bed and walked barefoot to the door.","However, she didn’t know that Jiang Huaizhou was indeed leaning on the door and standing there.","He almost wanted to walk to the doorway of Dong Yujie’s room and watch Dong Yujie sleep while standing at the door.","Jiang Huaizhou knew that it was creepy, but he couldn’t control himself.","Even though Dong Yujie’s room’s lights were off, light still entered through the window.","The light was shining in through the window. When Dong Yujie stood up, Jiang Huaizhou could see her shadow on the wall.","He knew that he had gotten out of bed and thought that she needed to use the washroom.","He was worried that Dong Yujie would notice him, so he dashed back to his bed and hid there.","Dong Yujie walked to the door. The room opposite her room was quiet. She didn’t see Jiang Huaizhou as well.","And so, she thought he had fallen asleep.","Dong Yujie, feeling at ease, returned to her room and lay on her bed again."]},{"number":3584,"title":"Chapter 3584 Untitled","paragraphs":["3584 Untitled","Jiang Huaizhou subconsciously held his breath. He didn’t dare to exhale.","However, he gave up on looking at Jiang Yujie secretly.","He stopped messing around.","Because Dong Yujie hasn’t been working for a long time, she has gotten used to waking up late.","Jiang Huaizhou was worried that Dong Yujie would be disturbed by the sound of him washing up in the morning, so he shut the door to his room.","He opened the door after he was prepared.","Mrs. Dong had already made breakfast for him.","When Jiang Huaizhou came out of his room, Mrs. Dong asked, “Both of you have your doors opened. What game are you two playing?”","When Mrs. Dong noticed that both doors were open, she assumed that the two children were showing affection in a way that an elderly person like her could not comprehend.","Jiang Huaizhou, feeling embarrassed, responded, “Both of us have our doors opened so that we would be able to see each other even if we were in our own rooms. It felt great.”","“You guys are quite good at having fun.” Mrs. Dong said with a smile and was no longer interested in what Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie were doing.","She didn’t close Dong Yujie’s door.","But she started speaking softly as she was worried that she might wake Dong Yujie up.","Jiang Huaizhou finished breakfast. Before he left, he came to Dong Yujie’s room.","When he was at the door, Dong Yujie’s phone rang.","Dong Yujie didn’t pick it up. Instead, she turned off the sound and looked at her phone.","Then Jiang Huaizhou realized that it was Dong Yujie’s alarm going off.","Dong Yujie was just about to get up when she saw Jiang Huaizhou at the door.","Dong Yujie froze. She quickly pulled the blanket and covered her face, revealing only her eyes.","“I was just checking on you before I leave to work.” Jiang Huaizhou didn’t expect Dong Yujie to set an alarm.","Jiang Huaizhou glanced over at Dong Yujie’s phone and asked, “Did you set an alarm because you wanted to see me off?”","Dong Yujie hid half of her face in her blanket as she nodded. She then asked, “Are you leaving?”","“Yes.” Jiang Huaizhou said with a smile, “Go back to sleep. Look at how tired you are.”","He had no idea what time she slept last night.","“I’m leaving. If you get bored at home, you can come to visit me at the office. If not, I will come to pick you up after work.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","Despite saying that, Jiang Huaizhou didn’t think that Dong Yujie would visit him at the office.","“Alright.” Dong Yujie agreed in a well-behaved manner. i","Seeing this, Jiang Huaizhou had this urge to just step into Dong Yujie’s room and kiss her.","However, because Mrs. Dong was present, Jiang Huaizhou could only endure.","“I am off to work.” Go back to sleep.” Jiang Huaizhou cast a gentle glance at Dong Yujie.","He felt like staying.","He would feel so happy if he could just stay here with her.","After Jiang Huaizhou left, Dong Yujie slept for a while.","Obviously, she wasn’t going to visit Jiang Huaizhou at his office.","She went out shopping and bought some gifts for Mr. Jiang.","She was different from Jiang Huaizhou.","She had been gone for over a year. Jiang Huaizhou had been the one taking care of Mrs. Dong.","Jiang Huaizhou bought the house for Mrs. Dong. Jiang Huaizhou was also the one who paid for every daily used item in the house.","He also occasionally visited Mrs. Dong.","Jiang Huaizhou visited home often, and it wouldn’t be his first time visiting the elders.","Obviously, Jiang Huaizhou wouldn’t need to buy any special gifts, and he didn’t need to treat this visitation so seriously.","However, Dong Yujie had not been back for a long time.","And such a big change happened to the family.","In her opinion, she should bring some gifts.","She didn’t buy something expensive. She just bought some food and supplies that youngsters would buy when they visit their older relatives.","When Jiang Huaizhou got off work at night, he saw the gift that Dong Yujie had prepared. Immediately, he reflected on his wrongdoings and said, “I didn’t buy mom any gifts when I came here yesterday.”","When Mrs. Dong heard this, she laughed and said, “You already spent a lot of money on me! There’s no need for gifts!”","“True.” Dong Yujie said, “I haven’t been back for a long time. I should buy some things.”","Mrs. Dong then urged the two to leave the house as soon as possible.","When they were on the way, Dong Yujie asked nervously, “Did you tell Dad that we are coming to visit him tonight?”","“I told him.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“What... what was Dad’s attitude? Did you tell him that we... got together?” Dong Yujie asked again.","Jiang Huaizhou could tell that she was feeling so nervous that she was going out of breath. He proceeded to free his hand to hold her hand.","“I already told him that we are dating. Dad said okay.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","...","“I told him that we are going to visit him tonight, and he responded okay,” said Jiang Huaizhou","“You know Dad’s temper. He cares about his reputation, so he can only change his attitude slowly,” Jiang Huaizhou said, “He said okay. He didn’t tell us not to visit him, and he didn’t show an attitude. This means he approves of us.”","“If we show us an attitude when we got there, don’t take it to heart,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“We’re living our own lives. You don’t have to take his attitude into consideration. If he doesn’t change his attitude towards you and he still appears indifferent, you don’t have to force yourself to visit him, and you don’t have to try and change his attitude.”","“You don’t have to worry about Dad.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “Of course, if Dad has a change of attitude, that would be the best scenario. Just go with the flow.”","“Yes.” Dong Yujie let out a sigh of relief.","The two then arrived at Mr. Jiang’s house.","To save Mrs. Dong the trouble of moving, Jiang Huaizhou bought the place.","On the other hand, Mr. Jiang stayed in a two-bedroom house.","However, Mr. Jiang didn’t think it was bad.","Dong Yujie had been the one who paid for and rented the place where they used to stay.","...","Back then, Jiang Huaizhou was still broke without any businesses.","The three-bedroom house was in a good location with a community that was considered upper middle class. And so, the rent wasn’t cheap.","And so, Mr. Jiang was okay with Jiang Huaizhou buying the house for Mrs. Dong.","In addition, he felt bad for Dong Yujie.","As a result, the size of the house would never cause a conflict between him and Mrs. Dong.","A two-bedroom house was big enough for him anyway.","This house was in a good location with convenient transportation.","Mr. Jiang didn’t know how to drive. He had gotten used to taking the subway and thought that this mode of transportation was quicker than driving.","It would only take an additional ten minutes to walk to the subway station from the neighborhood area. And so, it was convenient to travel anywhere.","When Jiang Huaizhou would visit him during the weekends and if Jiang Huaizhou didn’t have to work overtime, he could stay the night in this house. There were enough rooms.","If the house were too big, Mr. Jiang would feel lonely.","Dong Yujie followed Jiang Huaizhou and arrived at Mr. Jiang’s door.","Although Jiang Huaizhou had the keys to this house, he still rang the doorbell.","Mr. Jiang couldn’t get used to the new technologies.","He couldn’t handle fingerprint locks, which were so convenient.","He had been accustomed to using keys.","Based on what Mr. Jiang said, if the fingerprint lock broke, he would go crazy.","When Mr. Jiang heard the doorbell, he knew that Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie had returned.","Dong Yujie was not the only one feeling nervous.","Mr. Jiang was also feeling nervous."]},{"number":3585,"title":"Chapter 3585 Untitled","paragraphs":["3585 Untitled","Ever since Jiang Huaizhou told Mr. Jiang that he would be bringing Dong Yujie home, Mr. Jiang had been feeling nervous for the entire day.","He cleaned the house first.","Actually, Mr. Jiang was very diligent. He had always cleaned the house every day. However, he had a higher standard for cleanliness today.","He also went to buy some vegetables at the market. He remembered what Dong Yujie liked to eat in the past.","He was hoping that Dong Yujie’s taste remained the same.","It took him an entire afternoon to prepare the ingredients. He then started thinking about the time of Jiang Huaizhou’s arrival, which Jiang Huaizhou had told him.","Mr. Jiang then started making dinner half an hour before the time Jiang Huaizhou said they would arrive.","He didn’t dare to start too early as he was worried about the food turning cold even before Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie entered the house.","The hood in the kitchen was on and was making a humming sound. Coupled with the sound of the spatula stirfrying the food, Mr. Jiang could barely hear the other sounds.","And so, he had to occasionally stop and listen to the noise at the door.","He heard the doorbell ring, but he thought he was hearing things because he was too nervous.","However, when the doorbell kept ringing, Mr. Jiang turned the fire off, placed the spatula down, and opened the door.","When Mr. Jiang saw Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie standing together, he felt so nervous that his reaction became slower.","“You... you’re back,” Mr. Jiang said nervously.","He anxiously wiped his hands on the apron. He then realized something and quickly said, “Quick. Come in.”","“Dad.” Dong Yujie nervously greeted.","Jiang Huaizhou was carrying everything that Dong Yujie had bought.","He saw how awkward it was between Mr. Jiang and Dong Yujie.","Jiang Huaizhou then said, “Dad, Yujie bought these gifts for you. Should I put them in the living room for now?”","“Ah. Alright.” Mr. Jiang nodded.","Jiang Huaizhou then carried everything into the living room.","Mr. Jiang didn’t dare to look at Dong Yujie.","He felt sorry for Dong Yujie.","“Was there..a traffic jam?” Mr. Jiang asked.","“Yes. There was a traffic jam, so we’re late,” Dong Yujie said.","“That’s alright. That’s alright. I expected that there would be a traffic jam, so I didn’t start cooking too early., Mr. Jiang said, “That’s how it is in B City. The traffic jam is getting worse. Even the limited number of license plates and the code-plate lottery system for car registration couldn’t solve this problem.”","“Quick, take a seat. Dinner will be ready soon.” Mr. Jiang said.","“Let me help.” Dong Yujie said.","“There’s no need.” Mr. Jiang quickly responded, “I am almost done. Just go sit down with Huaizhou.”","With this, Mr. Jiang went back to the kitchen.","Dong Yujie went to the living room to see Jiang Huaizhou. Jiang Huaizhou smiled and said, “How was it? Dad’s attitude was not bad, right?”","Dong Yujie let out a sigh of relief and whispered, “Dad doesn’t care anymore. At least he won’t stop us from dating.”","Jiang Huaizhou nodded and smiled.","Mr. Jiang soon came out with a dish of food and placed the dish on the dinner table.","Dong Yujie and Jiang Huaizhou hurriedly went to help.","Mr. Jiang wouldn’t let them help initially. However, he eventually succumbed.","The three placed the dishes on the table before they took their seats.","“You’re still going to drive tonight, so I’m not going to let you drink,” Mr. Jiang said.","“Okay.” Jiang Huaizhou nodded, smiling.","“That...” Mr. Jiang lifted his wine glass.","Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie were not drinking, but they had juice.","“Let’s celebrate Yujie’s return tonight. Congratulations to you two for becoming a couple.” Mr. Jiang said.","Dong Yujie looked over at Mr. Jiang in surprise.","But she still clinked her glass with Jiang Huaizhou and Mr. Jiang’s glasses.","“Try the food.” Mr. Jiang said, “My culinary skills have become much better than before.”","Mrs. Dong had been the one cooking in the past.","Since the two separated, Mr. Jiang had to take care of himself.","He practiced slowly. Although his culinary skills weren’t the best, they were good enough.","“Yujie.” After a while, Mr. Jiang said, “I... I know it was because of me that you”","“Not at all.” Dong Yujie quickly responded, “I just wanted to travel and get some fresh air. It has nothing to do with you.”","“I must be one of the reasons.” When Dong Yujie disagreed, Mr. Jiang said, “Don’t disagree so quickly. I was very much aware.”","“I regretted it after you left.” Mr. Jiang said, “After you left, I spent every day thinking about how great it would be if I hadn’t stopped you two back then.”","“Although I didn’t sense it back then, my attitude must have hurt you. I was unaware of my attitude and the way I looked at you.”","“Back then, I was thinking that I would agree to anything to get you back. No matter the difficulty, I would agree to it.” Mr. Jiang took a sip of the liquor as he spoke.","...","He sighed and said, “Your mom wanted to get a divorce later on to make way for you two. I knew about it. I agreed because I wished that you could come back sooner and that there would be no regrets between you two.”","“Dad.” Dong Yujie called out.","Mr. Jiang then smiled and said, “You should call me Dad. That’s good. You don’t have to change this term of address.”","Dong Yujie felt guilty as she stared at Mr. Jiang.","Mr. Jiang then said, “Don’t stare at me with that guilty look. You don’t owe me anything. In fact, it was me who had wronged you.”","“I had been the useless one, and I valued my reputation more than anything.” Mr. Jiang took another big sip of the liquor.","With the help of alcohol, Mr. Jiang said everything that he normally wouldn’t have been able to say. “Now that you are back, you two should live a good life together.”","“I am not going to be involved in anything. Everything that I tried to control had a bad ending. I had been messing around and causing trouble.” Mr. Jiang said, “You two should just live a good life.”","Dong Yujie didn’t expect to hear these words from Mr. Jiang today.","Even though Mr. Jiang no longer expressed any disapproval of them, she had assumed that he would still hold that opinion.","And she would have to wait for him to process this on his own time.","...","But she didn’t expect Mr. Jiang to accept this completely.","As a result, Dong Yujie no longer felt any stress during this meal.","“Dad, thank you.” Dong Yujie said.","Mr. Jiang smiled and said, “We should schedule a time to get a meal together with the entire family.”","“Dad, I haven’t told you this yet, but...” Jiang Huaizhou said, “I already asked Yujie to marry me.”","Mr. Jiang froze.","He had no objections.","He shared the same opinion as Dong Yujie and Mrs. Dong. He didn’t expect Jiang Huaizhou to ask Yujie to marry him when they had just gotten together.","“My situation is different from Yujie’s. We have known each other for many years. We were not a couple back then, but we know each other even better than an ordinary couple,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“Therefore, we don’t need the time to get to know each other before marriage.” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“What was Yujie’s response?” Mr. Jiang looked at Dong Yujie with a smile.","“I said yes.” Dong Yujie said, “I agreed. With our current situation, there’s no need to further delay marriage.”","“Plus, we have experienced so much.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “And now, we are finally together. I just want to marry her. I won’t feel secure until then. If not, I wouldn’t be able to sleep because I would constantly be afraid of things suddenly changing.”"]},{"number":3586,"title":"Chapter 3586 Untitled","paragraphs":["3586 Untitled","Dong Yujie thought that Jiang Huaizhou was exaggerating when he said that he wouldn’t even sleep well.","However, Dong Yujie realized that their relationship would only be secured if they registered their marriage.","“That’s good. When you register your marriage, we, including your mom, can all get a meal together.” Mr. Jiang said.","Ever since the divorce, the four have not had a meal together.","He became in-laws with Mrs. Dong.","Mr. Jiang had mixed feelings about this.","“Since you two have already decided. You should register your marriage as soon as possible. Long delays might cause many hitches,” Mr. Jiang said.","And so, they started deciding on the date to register their marriage.","“Why don’t you do it tomorrow?” Mr. Jiang said, “You two can register your marriage, and everyone will feel secure.”","“That’s good. Tomorrow is Mother’s Day. We can also celebrate Mother’s Day.” Mr. Jiang said.","“Alright.” Jiang Huaizhou nodded and asked Dong Yujie, “What do you think?”","“I think tomorrow would be a good day. It’s the 10th of May tomorrow, so it’s a good date.” They wouldn’t have to worry about forgetting this date.","The 10th of May in Chinese sounded like ‘I want you’ as well.","“When we have kids, this date will mean more than just our anniversary,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","Dong Yujie thought about it and agreed that it was a good date.","The two then decided to register their marriage. They left Mr. Jiang’s place tonight and went back to Mrs. Dong’s house.","After all, the registration of marriage was a major event that they would have to tell Mrs. Dong beforehand.","After going back to Mrs. Dong’s place, they told Mrs. Dong about it. Naturally, Mrs. Dong was happy for them.","“Mom, Dad said that we should get a meal together after Dong Yujie and I register our marriage.” Jiang Huaizhou said, “It will also be Mother’s Day tomorrow, so we will register our marriage and celebrate Mother’s Day. It would be double the happiness.”","“Alright.” Mrs. Dong agreed.","Jiang Huaizhou then said, “Should we register our marriage early tomorrow morning?","Mrs. Dong and Dong Yujie agreed without thinking.","“Erm...” Jiang Huaizhou said, “Since we will be leaving early tomorrow, should I stay here today?”","“It will be more convenient to leave with Yujie tomorrow,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","Mrs. Dong and Dong Yujie knew that he was just finding another way to spend the night here.","Mrs. Dong laughed and said, “Sure.”","And so, Jiang Huaizhou stayed overnight again.","The next morning, the two left early to register their marriage.","It was only when the two held their marriage certificates in their hands...","It was only then that the two felt secure.","Today was Mother’s Day and the day that they registered their marriage. And so, Jiang Huaizhou booked a room at Sheng Yue.","He agreed on a time with Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Dong before he went to pick them up.","The four arrived at Sheng Yue. They parked the car and entered the building.","They stepped into the restaurant at Sheng Yue. Jiang Huaizhou had booked a room.","As such, they had to walk along the hallway to the private room.","While they were walking in the hallway, they heard someone calling, “Jiang Huaizhou!”","The voice sounded very familiar.","Dong Yujie also found the voice familiar as well.","Yes.","The person who called Jiang Huaizhou was Qu Mengyu.","Dong Yujie didn’t expect Qu Mengyu to be so determined.","Mrs. Dong and Mr. Jiang stopped and looked over puzzledly.","They then saw Qu Mengyu approaching with her parents in tow.","It was likely that Qu Mengyu and her family came to celebrate mother’s day.","When Qu Mengyu’s parents saw Jiang Huaizhou, they looked really angry.","They obviously found out about Jiang Huaizhou rejecting Qu Mengyu.","Qu Mengyu walked in front and cast a quick glance at Dong Yujie.","She showed a repulsive look.","Jiang Huaizhou frowned, and Mrs. Dong subconsciously pulled Dong Yujie behind her.","But would Dong Yujie hide behind Mrs. Dong? Instead, she tried to protect Mrs. Dong behind her.","Qu Mengyu approached and cast a disdainful look at Dong Yujie.","Jiang Huaizhou could no longer suppress his anger and was just about to say something.","But then, Qu Mengyu asked, “Jiang Huaizhou, did you say that she is your girlfriend?”","“Not anymore.” Jiang Huaizhou said coldly.","...","Qu Mengyu was stunned. She turned and looked at Dong Yujie.","Were they here to talk about their breakup today?","Who would bring their family along when they were breaking up with their partner?","Are they going to talk about the breakup fees?","Qu Mengyu smiled coldly and said, “No wonder. She used to be with Lu Qiyuan. She would date an old man for money. Why? Is she here today to talk about the breakup fees?”","The expression on Dong Yujie’s face immediately froze. Her face then turned pale.","Mr. Jiang moved forward and protected Dong Yujie behind his back.","Jiang Huaizhou pursed his lips and said, “Stop saying nonsense, or I will sue you for defamation! Firstly, you got the wrong person. Secondly, we didn’t break up. I told you that she is not my girlfriend because we are now husband and wife. She is obviously no longer my girlfriend.”","Qu Mengyu’s expression changed drastically. “That’s impossible!”","“Why is that impossible? I have dated her for many years. Because of work, she was away for a whole year. Now that she’s back, she will not be leaving anymore. Since we have been dating for such a long time, it’s only natural for us to get married,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","“Miss Qu, don’t slander my wife because you were rejected. I am truly mindblown by the type of person you are,” Jiang Huaizhou said.","...","Jiang Huaizhou didn’t try to hide his expression of happiness.","Even though he didn’t say it out loud, Qu Mengyu could tell through his expression that he was happy that he didn’t accept her.","“Nonsense! I hired someone to investigate her! She used to date Lu Qiyuan!” Qu Mengyu shrieked.","“She hid this from you, and you actually married her. You’re definitely going to regret that decision!” Qu Mengyu screamed.","Even while they were in the hallway, Qu Mengyu didn’t try to soften her voice.","She obviously wanted people to hear her clearly, which was such a toxic thing to do.","Jiang Huaizhou’s face darkened. He no longer paid Qu Mengyu any attention. Instead, he sneered at Qu Mengyu’s parents.","“CEO Qu, we aren’t business partners anymore. Are you going to destroy the remaining cordiality between us? Are you going to allow your daughter to slander my wife in such a toxic manner? The Qu Family’s ways have truly opened my eyes.”","“I am even more thankful that I had not accepted those conditions you offered.” Jiang Huaizhou suddenly looked as though he had a moment of realization as he said, “No wonder. Even though the Qu Family is a family with good wealth and status, they are willing to take in a poor boy like me. It’s most likely that you are not daring enough to let your daughter marry another family of equal wealth and status. If you had done that, your family could end up becoming enemies with that family, so you chose to bully me instead. Am I right?”","The expression on Qu Xiangqian’s face appeared very gloomy.","When Qu Mengyu told Qu Xiangqian what had happened, he believed her.","However, he didn’t expect Jiang Huaizhou to play the blame game!"]},{"number":3587,"title":"Chapter 3587 Untitled","paragraphs":["3587 Untitled","“Jiang Huaizhou, are you dumb?” said Qu Mengyu, “I am telling you, she’s someone’s mistress, and that person was an old man!”","Qu Mengyu pointed at Dong Yujie and told Jiang Huaizhou, “Didn’t Lu Qiyuan go to jail? He’s easy to find. Go visit the prison and ask him!”","What are you talking about?” Suddenly, a gentle but cold voice of a woman sounded.","As her parents were in the way, Qu Mengyu could not see who it was.","However, when Dong Yujie heard the voice, she knew that it was Lu Man!","It was such a coincidence to meet her here.","Lu Man had a cold expression as she walked over with Han Zhuoli.","There was a gathering for their family today.","As it was Mother’s Day, Old Mrs. Han suggested inviting Xia Qingwei and Shi Xiaoya’s mother together with their families to celebrate it together.","As for Xie Jiling’s parents, they had already returned to the Xie Family’s manor. They were currently not in B City, or else they would have come along.","Everyone came from their own homes, so now Lu Man and Han Zhuoli came alone.","The whole family was meeting in the private room.","Unexpectedly, when she was going to the private room, she heard someone mentioning Lu Qiyuan.","The female voice sounded extremely arrogant and harsh.","When she used the word ‘mistress’, the first thing that Lu Man thought of was Dong Yujie.","When she walked over, she heard what Qu Mengyu said.","Lu Man also heard Jiang Huaizhou say that he was married to Dong Yujie.","Lu Man knew that the matter between the two was finally settled.","Dong Yujie had made such a huge sacrifice, and Jiang Huaizhou was not someone to forget one’s kindness.","This was pretty good.","When she walked over, Qu Xiangqian and Madam Qu also turned their heads to see who it was.","When the two turned around, Qu Mengyu also saw Lu Man.","Dong Yujie and the others also saw.","Lu Man was different from the young famous ladies of the other families. As an actress, her exposure was huge.","So when people met her, they would immediately recognize her.","Knowing her meant that they knew Han Zhuoli, too, knowing that she was Mrs. Han.","The expressions of Qu Xiangqian and the others changed.","However, Lu Man heard them talking about Lu Qiyuan.","Lu Man smiled coldly. “I heard someone mentioning my biological father, what’s going on?”","Qu Mengyu also remembered the relationship between Lu Qiyuan and Lu Man.","And she remembered that Lu Man and Lu Qiyuan were like water and fire, just like enemies.","Then Lu Man would definitely not go easy on Lu Qiyuan’s mistress.","Qu Mengyu pondered in her heart and said to Lu Man, “Madam Han, you’re not unfamiliar with this person, right?”","Qu Mengyu backed off to let Lu Man see Dong Yujie clearly.","“Of course I am.” Lu Man smiled and walked up to Dong Yujie. She suddenly smiled sincerely. “When did you come back? Why didn’t you tell me?”","Qu Mengyu was stunned.","Looking at Lu Man’s reaction, they looked like they had bad blood between each otherDong Yujie.","And it seemed like they were close as well.","“I just came back a few days ago,” said Dong Yujie, embarrassed.","She did not expect to be still treated as a friend by Lu Man after meeting Lu Man again.","Lu Man’s attitude toward her had not changed a single bit.","“Oh, right, I got married,” said Dong Yujie, smiling at Lu Man, “We just got our marriage certificates today.”","Lu Man glanced at Jiang Huaizhou and realized it. “You came to celebrate tonight?”","“Mhmm. We came here to eat with Mom and Dad, then celebrate Mother’s Day together,” explained Dong Yujie.","“We also came to celebrate it,” said Lu Man, “Can’t talk too much now, I’ll visit you another day, then we can talk more.”","“Okay.” Dong Yujie nodded. “You’re busy with business, but you still have time to take care of kids. I’m still very free, so come and visit me any time when you’re free.”","“Okay. Oh, right, do you plan to be a housewife, or do you still want to look for a job?” asked Lu Man.","“I still want to work,” said Dong Yujie, then she turned around to look at Jiang Huaizhou.","Jiang Huaizhou smiled and said, “Why are you looking at me? Just do what you want. If you want to be a housewife, I will take care of you. You can have fun and spend money in whatever way you want. If you want to find a job, then go find a job, as long as you like it.”","“I don’t want to be disconnected from society, so I still want to do something,” said Dong Yujie to Lu Man.","“Then it’s just nice. I want to set up my own studio, if you’re interested, come help me,” said Lu Man, smiling, “You don’t need to rush to give me an answer. Go back and think about it. There are a few positions that suit you there, I’ll let you have a look later. If you think it’s alright, then let’s discuss it in detail.”","“Of course, if you don’t want to work in my studio, it’s fine too. Decline all you want,” Lu Man added with a smile.","“Okay, then tell me the positions that suit me later. I will think about whether I am capable of doing them or not. I know you trust me, but I can’t let you make a loss,” said Dong Yujie.","Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Dong were also very surprised. They did not expect Dong Yujie to be this close to Lu Man.","...","Lu Man and her chatted as though there was nobody around; they did not care about Qu Mengyu at all.","After talking quite a bit with Dong Yujie, she turned around and remembered that Qu Mengyu was still here.","Lu Man stopped smiling and said coldly, “I think you misunderstood. Yujie is my friend.”","“Everyone knows about my terrible relationship with my biological father. Would I be friends with my biological father’s mistress?”","“You’re just accusing people like this, but your parents didn’t even stop you.” Lu Man took a glance at Qu Xiangqian and his wife. “Very interesting.”","Qu Xiangqian shivered.","Their family did not have any possibility to do business with the Han Corporation.","After all, their fields were different.","However, it was possible with the other families of the eight great families.","Of course, the eight great families would not even care about the Qu Family because of their small size.","Their business partners had the skills to do business with the eight great families.","...","A small company like theirs could not even catch the opportunity, even if there was one.","However, it did not stop Qu Xiangqian from being greedy. He did not care if he could catch it.","He had to try if there was an opportunity.","He did not feel like he was daydreaming at all.","Now, Lu Man clearly had a bad opinion of their family. How could Qu Xiangqian not be anxious?","Then, Lu Man continued, “This is related to a woman’s reputation. You recklessly destroyed a person’s reputation like this. Your heart is evil.”","Lu Man asked Jiang Huaizhou, “What’s wrong with her?”","Without saying anything, Lu Man could guess that it was a problem caused by Jiang Huaizhou.","“Not his fault,” said Dong Yujie immediately.","She roughly explained the situation.","Lu Man heard that Jiang Huaizhou even abandoned the business deal to get rid of Qu Mengyu."]},{"number":3588,"title":"Chapter 3588 The End","paragraphs":["3588 The End","She immediately felt relieved.","Dong Yujie’s sacrifice hadn’t been a waste.","Jiang Huaizhou did not disappoint Dong Yujie.","Lu Man seemed to have realized something as she said. “So it’s because of jealousy that she spread false rumors. If this went out, how much impact would it have on Yujie?”","!!","“You’re enjoying talking so much,” said Lu Man coldly.","Qu Xiangqian said immediately, “My daughter is immature. I promise not to spread any false rumors related to Miss Dong, oh no, it’s Miss Jiang.”","As he talked, Qu Xiangqian pulled Qu Mengyu back, not allowing her to get close to Jiang Huaizhou and Dong Yujie.","Lu Man said impolitely, “Yujie is my friend. If I hear that there are rumors like this accusing her, I won’t go easy on you!”","“No, of course not,” said Qu Xiangqian immediately.","Qu Mengyu did not expect Dong Yujie to be good friends with Lu Man.","Even if Dong Yujie really had a relationship with Lu Qiyuan, with Lu Man standing up and speaking for her, nobody would believe it.","After all, who would help the mistress of the biological father, who was treated as an enemy?","Besides, even without all these, Qu Mengyu also did not dare to offend Lu Man.","As such, she did not dare to say anything.","Because of Qu Mengyu, the atmosphere was stiff.","Even if Qu Xiangqian had the heart, it was not the right time to introduce himself to Han Zhuoli to build connections.","If they continued staying here, Qu Xiangqian was worried that not only would he not build any connections, he might let Han Zhuoli remember a bad side of him.","If that happened, then it would be impossible to collaborate in the future.","Right now, he could still dream about it.","As such, Qu Xiangqian said, “We won’t disturb you guys anymore.”","After saying this, he immediately dragged Qu Mengyu away and left.","Qu Mengyu also did not dare to be arrogant anymore.","She followed obediently as Qu Xiangqian dragged her away.","Qu Mengyu had always been someone who bullied the weak but feared the strong.","When the Qu Family left, Lu Man greeted Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Dong.","“I apologize for not greeting uncle and auntie because of that scene just now,” said Lu Man courteously.","Mr. Jiang and Mrs. Dong were very nervous. After all, it was their first time seeing someone so famous.","To them, Lu Man’s popularity was even greater than Han Zhuoli’s.","The two shook hands with her nervously, saying that it was fine.","“You chased them away. Thank you. Otherwise, we won’t even know what they’re going to say,” said Mrs. Dong, full of gratitude.","“It’s nothing. Besides, Yujie and I are friends, of course, I have to say something for her,” said Lu Man, “They shouldn’t dare to speak nonsense anymore, but just in case, if they still speak nonsense, tell me.”","“My biological father hasn’t done a single good thing, but he finally has some use this time. As his daughter, the others naturally trust my words more. If I come out to explain, nobody will believe Qu Mengyu,” said Lu Man.","Mrs. Dong quickly thanked her.","Lu Man then left with Han Zhuoli.","Han Zhuoli and her two little balls had already been sent to the family home to play with the two elders.","Lu Man and Han Zhuoli were also happy to have their alone time.","The two little balls would be brought here by the two elders tonight.","When they entered the private room, the Han Family and a few relatives had already arrived.","Although there were a lot of people, this room was huge.","The massive round table could seat forty people. The Han Family, the Shi Family, Wang Juhuai and his wife were only seventeen people combined.","There was a lot of space even after sitting down.","As for Han Zhuoli’s two little balls and Wang Yijun would not take too much space.","A high chair was arranged for every little one.","Wang Yijun could sit steadily now.","Han Linxun and Han Linzhe could sit and eat on their own.","The three were well-behaved.","Lu Man brought some food that the two little balls could eat.","The two ate obediently without making a noise.","The rotating tray on the table rotated automatically, a little like those restaurants with conveyor belts.","When the dishes were rotated to someone’s side, they would take some to eat.","The two elders were the oldest ones there.","As such, everyone asked the two elders to make a toast to start the party.","Old Mrs. Han felt that she was not good at making a toast, so she made Old Mr. Han do it.","Old Mr. Han did not decline.","...","He raised his glass and said, “Our three families, everyone is already big and strong. The Han Family has daughters-in-law coming in to be our daughters. You two families also have sons-in-law going over to be your sons.”","“Actually, in the past, I was the most concerned about Zhuoling. He’s too indifferent. Other than work, he did not care about anything else. I was afraid that he would live his whole life without any emotions. Luckily, he met Xiaoya. Thanks to the Shi Family for having such a good girl like Xiaoya to save our Zhuoling.”","Shi Xiaoya’s parents shook their heads. “It’s also Xiaoya’s blessing to have a husband like Zhuoling.”","“And Lu Man,” said Old Mr. Han, “This child Man Man is very capable and good-tempered. She’s also the matchmaker of Zhuoling and Xiaoya. Even Zhuofeng and Jiling met because of Man Man. Man Man saved our family’s three single boys in a flash!”","Han Zhuoling was speechless. “...”","Han Zhuofeng didn’t know what to say. “...”","Han Zhuoli raised his chin proudly.","His wife was outstanding!","“Hahahaha, Man Man is our family’s lucky star,” said Old Mr. Han as he himself felt that Lu Man was amazing, not to mention that she gave birth to twins on her first try.","The twins would be enough for the elders in the coming years.","Xia Qingwei could not help but laugh.","...","It seemed like Old Mr. Han was overjoyed.","“As for Zhuofeng, he succeeded the first time he shot a movie. This is what we didn’t expect. This child did not ruin the prestige of our Han Family!”","“It’s also because of your support,” said Old Mr. Han, “As for Juhuai, he’s finally together with Qingwei. I’ve been worried about him having no sons for so long. But now it’s good now, he has a wife, he has a son and a daughter, he has everything.”","“Qingwei has suffered a lot in the past, but that’s all in the past now. Now, Qingwei has her own business and a beautiful family.”","Xia Qingwei smiled at Wang Juhuai.","These were all given to her by Lu Man and Wang Juhuai.","In her life, she met a player like Lu Qiyuan.","However, she was lucky to have such a good daughter like Lu Man and to reunite with Wang Juhuai.","Then, her life became better and better as time went on.","Her life was not a loss, it was all worth it.","“These few years, we are living better and better!” Old Mr. Han raised his glass. “Today is Mother’s Day.”","“Among those who are present, my wife, Xiaoya’s mom, Man Man’s mom and Man Man herself are the main characters today. Happy Mother’s Day to you!” said Old Mr. Han.","Everyone raised their glasses.","Everyone had red wine except for Shi Xiaoya, who poured a glass of mineral water for herself.","However, nobody asked her to drink alcohol. During gatherings, they all drank beverages they were used to drinking.","Those who could not drink alcohol could drink water or juice. Nobody would force anyone to drink alcohol.","Everyone took a sip.","Everyone stopped being courteous and started talking and eating.","When the fish soup was rotated, Han Zhuoling scooped a bowl for Shi Xiaoya.","Shi Xiaoya was about to drink, but the fishy smell was too strong for her to endure.","She retched, and her face went pale.","“What happened?” Du Yiqin was the first to notice Shi Xiaoya’s unwellness.","Shi Xiaoya immediately put the fish soup down. Her face was still pale, but she did not stop smiling.","Han Zhuoling cleared his throat and said, “There’s good news today. I wanted to announce it tonight while we’re celebrating and when everyone’s here.”","Everyone looked over, and they had a hunch in their hearts.","They looked at Han Zhuoling and Shi Xiaoya in excitement.","Especially Lin Liye and Old Mrs. Han; they were almost at Shi Xiaoya’s face.","Han Zhuoling said, “This afternoon, Xiaoya and I went for a checkup in the hospital. Xiaoya is pregnant, it’s already been a month.”","“Yes! Yes!” Lin Liye cried a little.","She felt that she would ruin the mood if she cried, so she held it in.","However, she could not help but feel excited. After all, Han Zhuoling was already old.","Now, he would finally have his own kid. It was great!","The two elders were smiling so wide that they could not close their mouths.","“Good news, good news! Zhuoli has a son and a daughter, and Zhuoling will soon have a child. Now, we just have to wait for Zhuofeng and Jiling to get married!” Old Mrs. Han was overjoyed.","The family was getting bigger and bigger. It was becoming more and more complete as well, along with so much good news as time went on.","Han Zhuoli raised his glass and said, “Let’s raise a glass for Big Brother and Sister-in-law.”","Everyone raised their glasses.","“In the future, the Han Family will only have nothing but good news!” Old Mr. Han laughed out loud.","The room was filled with everyone’s laughter."]}]);
